#. Occurrence 1DOT5_3:443:1350: voice_id=C50_1DOT5_3_0009; voice_prefix=C50; voice_category=0; scene=1DOT5_3
#: 1DOT5_3:443
msgctxt "text_id=1350 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  SHIFTING PERCEPTION RANGE FROM SUBJECTIVE TO OBJECTIVE..."
