msgid " Anyway, a sandshoe for your offer,^ but I'm going to 'ave to decline!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2106:20455: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2106
msgctxt "text_id=20455 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  ...Looks like the movie's over."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2106:20456: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2106
msgctxt "text_id=20456 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Few theaters show films and plays at^  the same time these days."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2137:20457: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2137
msgctxt "text_id=20457 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  I wanted to end this by introducing my third Ploy,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2137:20458: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2137
msgctxt "text_id=20458 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  but I'll have to save that for next time."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2197:20459: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2197
msgctxt "text_id=20459 | speaker=alice"
msgid "          To all of you who stuck with us through"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2197:20460: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2197
msgctxt "text_id=20460 | speaker=alice"
msgid "          the lengthy main story, and the side story that"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2197:20461: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2197
msgctxt "text_id=20461 | speaker=alice"
msgid "          could either end quickly or take forever..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2223:20462: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2223
msgctxt "text_id=20462 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  This marks the end of Witch on the Holy Night."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2223:20463: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2223
msgctxt "text_id=20463 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Let us continue the tale someday, someplace,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2223:20464: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2223
msgctxt "text_id=20464 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  when a bright, roaming star drops from the sky into your lap."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2249:20465: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2249
msgctxt "text_id=20465 | speaker=alice"
msgid "          From the bottom of our hearts,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence NZ6:2249:20466: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_NZ6_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=NZ6
#: NZ6:2249
msgctxt "text_id=20466 | speaker=alice"
msgid "          thank you for sharing this long journey with us."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:41:20467: scene=SP1
#: SP1:41
msgctxt "text_id=20467 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It had been one year since he'd moved into the city from his remote village."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:46:20468: scene=SP1
#: SP1:46
msgctxt "text_id=20468 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  One thing he realized during that time was that likes and dislikes were the main difference between human and beast."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:97:20469: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:97
msgctxt "text_id=20469 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"So this is the new hideout, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:103:20470: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:103
msgctxt "text_id=20470 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Not bad, I guess. It's a bit shabby, but I like how there are no people around.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:128:20471: scene=SP1
#: SP1:128
msgctxt "text_id=20471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The figure dressed in a white coat danced to and fro down the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:133:20472: scene=SP1
#: SP1:133
msgctxt "text_id=20472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was like a young woman in an old film, enjoying herself window shopping."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:138:20473: scene=SP1
#: SP1:138
msgctxt "text_id=20473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was actually enjoying the atrocious sight of the school building in ruins."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:170:20474: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:170
msgctxt "text_id=20474 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Settle down. This place is falling apart. It was built over sixty years ago, you know."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:176:20475: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:176
msgctxt "text_id=20475 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  The floor could fall out from underneath you at any moment...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:182:20476: scene=SP1
#: SP1:182
msgctxt "text_id=20476 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  His mouth shut before he could even say to let him have his fun."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:213:20477: scene=SP1
#: SP1:213
msgctxt "text_id=20477 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Only one set of footsteps echoed through the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:218:20478: scene=SP1
#: SP1:218
msgctxt "text_id=20478 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Not a single feather's worth of his seventy-pound body was exerting any force on the floor beneath him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:223:20479: scene=SP1
#: SP1:223
msgctxt "text_id=20479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It wasn't clear whether he was paying reverence to the hallway or simply excited by it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:259:20480: scene=SP1
#: SP1:259
msgctxt "text_id=20480 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It's said that even walking through a grassy field, a beast is careful not to harm a single blade of grass."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:264:20481: scene=SP1
#: SP1:264
msgctxt "text_id=20481 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Apparently, this creature wrapped in a coat was no different."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:269:20482: scene=SP1
#: SP1:269
msgctxt "text_id=20482 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was more a part of the environment itself than a settler of it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:274:20483: scene=SP1
#: SP1:274
msgctxt "text_id=20483 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He held no regard for beasts greater or lesser than him, but when it came to his comrades, he at least displayed human-like--or rather, wolf-like clemency."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:311:20484: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:311
msgctxt "text_id=20484 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Well, I'm glad you at least like the place."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:322:20485: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:322
msgctxt "text_id=20485 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I'm going into town. Do you need anything? Comics? Books?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:335:20486: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0002_0; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:335
msgctxt "text_id=20486 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Hmm, nothing especially."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:348:20487: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0002_1; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:348
msgctxt "text_id=20487 | speaker=beo"
msgid " Oh! If you could pick me up a hamburger on your way back, that'd be great! The one with the fluffy bun and thick patty!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:374:20488: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:374
msgctxt "text_id=20488 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Still thinking with your stomach, huh? We'll need to figure out a reliable source of food if we want to survive here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:380:20489: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:380
msgctxt "text_id=20489 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  ...I wonder if this was a mistake? A hotel with room service might actually leave less evidence behind.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:400:20490: scene=SP1
#: SP1:400
msgctxt "text_id=20490 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko let out a defeated sigh."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:405:20491: scene=SP1
#: SP1:405
msgctxt "text_id=20491 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With her glasses on, she was restricted to her original way of speaking and gesturing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:439:20492: scene=SP1
#: SP1:439
msgctxt "text_id=20492 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was the beginning of December."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:444:20493: scene=SP1
#: SP1:444
msgctxt "text_id=20493 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Exactly one month had passed since they came to Misaki City."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:449:20494: scene=SP1
#: SP1:449
msgctxt "text_id=20494 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Until now, Touko had been attacking Misaki from a nearby neighborhood. Deciding it was time to get serious, she had moved her base of operations to this old school building."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:478:20495: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:478
msgctxt "text_id=20495 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Hm? You think a hotel would've been better?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:495:20496: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:495
msgctxt "text_id=20496 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"That would be easier, for sure. Hotels are nice to live in, especially if they're decent quality.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:501:20497: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:501
msgctxt "text_id=20497 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"But I know you, Touko. You're really into these kinds of ruins, aren't you?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:507:20498: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:507
msgctxt "text_id=20498 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Eh? Really?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:513:20499: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0005; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:513
msgctxt "text_id=20499 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Yeah! Especially ones like this."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:519:20500: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0006; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:519
msgctxt "text_id=20500 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Whenever you get interested in something, you don't want anyone to be around you or like the same things you're into. Even though you have so many interests!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:556:20501: scene=SP1
#: SP1:556
msgctxt "text_id=20501 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko couldn't deny that observation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:561:20502: scene=SP1
#: SP1:561
msgctxt "text_id=20502 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She had been under contract with him for two years, but it had only been about a year since he became her full-time bodyguard."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:566:20503: scene=SP1
#: SP1:566
msgctxt "text_id=20503 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He seemed to be able to see right through to the root of all the problems that plagued Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:601:20504: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:601
msgctxt "text_id=20504 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I don't particularly hate crowds, though. An abandoned building or factory, or even that old amusement park would've been okay too."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:607:20505: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:607
msgctxt "text_id=20505 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  It's just that, here in the countryside, simply having you around is enough to get the rumor mill churning. My only option was to set up operations out here in the mountains.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:634:20506: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:634
msgctxt "text_id=20506 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Aww, but I'm in human form!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:634:20507: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:634
msgctxt "text_id=20507 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  I don't think I stick out that much.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:645:20508: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:645
msgctxt "text_id=20508 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"It's a matter of fitting in. Even if you can't look Asian, we could probably get by if your hair was at least black.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:678:20509: scene=SP1
#: SP1:678
msgctxt "text_id=20509 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Unfortunately, that wouldn't be happening."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:683:20510: scene=SP1
#: SP1:683
msgctxt "text_id=20510 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Simply being in human form at all was stressful for him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:688:20511: scene=SP1
#: SP1:688
msgctxt "text_id=20511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  When he had to be human, his only condition was that he could look however he wanted."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:693:20512: scene=SP1
#: SP1:693
msgctxt "text_id=20512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was currently only in this form because they had to move from the town to the old school building. Once he found a classroom to sleep in, he'd be back to a wolf."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:732:20513: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0011; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:732
msgctxt "text_id=20513 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Why do you hate being in human form so much anyway? It's not particularly difficult to stay like that, is it? Aren't you originally an astral body?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:738:20514: scene=SP1
#: SP1:738
msgctxt "text_id=20514 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Being an extremely versatile lifeform which required no body to remain stable"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:743:20515: scene=SP1
#: SP1:743
msgctxt "text_id=20515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  in the physical world, his body could change according to the situation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:748:20516: scene=SP1
#: SP1:748
msgctxt "text_id=20516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Magecraft would have defined him as a higher-dimensional lifeform with a materialized soul."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:783:20517: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:783
msgctxt "text_id=20517 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"It's not hard or dangerous. Just annoying."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:789:20518: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:789
msgctxt "text_id=20518 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Humans don't like doing things they don't have to, right?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:789:20519: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:789
msgctxt "text_id=20519 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Well, it's the same for me. There's no practical reason for me to ever be in human form.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:813:20520: scene=SP1
#: SP1:813
msgctxt "text_id=20520 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Apparently, he saw no value at all in his human form."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:818:20521: scene=SP1
#: SP1:818
msgctxt "text_id=20521 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That was exactly why Touko insisted he make his appearance blend in more. But the boy argued that if he had to be in an unnatural state, he'd at least make himself comfortable."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:863:20522: scene=SP1
#: SP1:863
msgctxt "text_id=20522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  To him, this was the only fun way to be a human, and he wasn't going to accept it any other way."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:868:20523: scene=SP1
#: SP1:868
msgctxt "text_id=20523 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And so, this was why he had taken on the appearance of a foreign aristocrat in a provincial Japanese city."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:873:20524: scene=SP1
#: SP1:873
msgctxt "text_id=20524 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even his posh coat had been hand-picked by Touko to satisfy one of his many demands."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:916:20525: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0012; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:916
msgctxt "text_id=20525 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Keep an eye on the place while I'm out, Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:922:20526: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:922
msgctxt "text_id=20526 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I don't think anyone will stumble upon us, but if they do, be sure to hold them until I get back."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:922:20527: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:922
msgctxt "text_id=20527 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  You can rough them up a bit if you need to, but no more than one leg.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:934:20528: scene=SP1
#: SP1:934
msgctxt "text_id=20528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And with that statement, Touko headed off into the city."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:963:20529: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:963
msgctxt "text_id=20529 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Okay, you got it!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:969:20530: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0011; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:969
msgctxt "text_id=20530 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Don't worry, I don't like how humans taste anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:975:20531: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0012; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:975
msgctxt "text_id=20531 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  I'll be fine here, just don't forget to bring me back something yummy!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1023:20532: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1023
msgctxt "text_id=20532 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo plopped down onto a desk after he saw his employer off."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1028:20533: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1028
msgctxt "text_id=20533 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He morphed back into his wolf form."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1049:20534: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1049
msgctxt "text_id=20534 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Sooo bored. How did I end up out here in this country town after traveling around the world?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1068:20535: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1068
msgctxt "text_id=20535 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It had been two years since Beo met Touko Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1073:20536: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1073
msgctxt "text_id=20536 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After some deliberation with the werewolves, the mage was left in charge of Beo's education."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1093:20537: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1093
msgctxt "text_id=20537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Of course, his village had no real control over him. He didn't have to go with her. He decided to go simply because she seemed interesting."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1098:20538: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1098
msgctxt "text_id=20538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko stood before him in the cave where he slept and asked,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1126:20539: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0014; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1126
msgctxt "text_id=20539 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Wait, you want to know the meaning of life?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1132:20540: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1132
msgctxt "text_id=20540 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Is that really why you agreed to this?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1138:20541: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1138
msgctxt "text_id=20541 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She smiled and cut off her long locks of hair to seal their pact."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1170:20542: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1170
msgctxt "text_id=20542 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"To know freedom, you must also know restraint."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1176:20543: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0017; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1176
msgctxt "text_id=20543 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Similarly, if you want to know the meaning of life, then you must have a reason not to die."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1182:20544: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0018; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1182
msgctxt "text_id=20544 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  ...For example, if you harbor a hatred so strong that you yourself can't fathom dying before you kill that person.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1202:20545: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1202
msgctxt "text_id=20545 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That hair was twenty years' worth of Touko's life."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1207:20546: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1207
msgctxt "text_id=20546 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In a way, her hair was a part of herself, but she parted with it easily."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1212:20547: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1212
msgctxt "text_id=20547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She was sure that Beo was worth the twenty years it had taken her to grow that hair."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1246:20548: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1246
msgctxt "text_id=20548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo, too, sensed that Touko was a creature of rare value."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1251:20549: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1251
msgctxt "text_id=20549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was happy to have been selected by someone of her unusual talents and, though she preached learning restraint, he observed that she was a truly free woman."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1285:20550: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1285
msgctxt "text_id=20550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And then..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1290:20551: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1290
msgctxt "text_id=20551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo accepted the terms of her contract, and left his village."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1295:20552: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1295
msgctxt "text_id=20552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He took his first steps into the outside world."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1345:20553: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1345
msgctxt "text_id=20553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The first year was spent at Touko's workshop in England, learning basic knowledge."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1350:20554: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1350
msgctxt "text_id=20554 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Namely, it was at a college of the Mage's Association, called the Clock Tower."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1356:20555: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1356
msgctxt "text_id=20555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At the time, Touko had her own dedicated familiar."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1361:20556: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1361
msgctxt "text_id=20556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Formally speaking, this familiar was Beo's senior,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1366:20557: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1366
msgctxt "text_id=20557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  but in that year's time, Beo proved himself superior and earned the right to travel the world with Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1397:20558: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1397
msgctxt "text_id=20558 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They rode on a train that collected Mystic Eyes, known as the Rail Zeppelin."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1402:20559: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1402
msgctxt "text_id=20559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They saw the Murkrake, an ancient, giant octopus living in the North Sea."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1407:20560: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1407
msgctxt "text_id=20560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They explored the Bermuda Triangle, a place of no return, connected to other realms."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1412:20561: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1412
msgctxt "text_id=20561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They met the remains of a mage of the Elder Title, a league of ancients, deep in western Europe."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1432:20562: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1432
msgctxt "text_id=20562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  All of their exploits were odd and exciting enough to hold his interest,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1437:20563: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1437
msgctxt "text_id=20563 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  and throughout them all, Beo felt that he'd been right to join Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1442:20564: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1442
msgctxt "text_id=20564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This was certainly less boring than sleeping in his cave."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1484:20565: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1484
msgctxt "text_id=20565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But sweet honey makes one crave even sweeter poison;"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1489:20566: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1489
msgctxt "text_id=20566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  having developed a taste for adventure, he now demanded even greater thrills."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1494:20567: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1494
msgctxt "text_id=20567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was only natural that such an innocent creature would start to look forward to its next prey."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1499:20568: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1499
msgctxt "text_id=20568 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The pinnacle of that desire rested on Touko's final goal:"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1504:20569: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1504
msgctxt "text_id=20569 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For all her liberty and aplomb, there was one prey she would not stop chasing until she caught it once and for all."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1539:20570: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1539
msgctxt "text_id=20570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With every new adventure, Beo would ask,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1549:20571: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0014; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1549
msgctxt "text_id=20571 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"So, is this the person you want to kill, Touko?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1555:20572: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1555
msgctxt "text_id=20572 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  However, the mage would always smile wryly and shake her head in response."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1560:20573: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1560
msgctxt "text_id=20573 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even this puppet master of extraordinary talent claimed that it was no easy task."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1601:20574: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1601
msgctxt "text_id=20574 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Her target was in a realm far beyond anyone they'd dealt with so far--"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1601:20575: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1601
msgctxt "text_id=20575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  beyond human knowledge. Perhaps, beyond even Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1606:20576: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1606
msgctxt "text_id=20576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But who could this mysterious person be? And how could they be so powerful?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1611:20577: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1611
msgctxt "text_id=20577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo couldn't help but be curious."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1616:20578: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1616
msgctxt "text_id=20578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Discovering that he was hired for \"Magical\" reasons,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1621:20579: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1621
msgctxt "text_id=20579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  he mustered a rare bit of fighting spirit, thinking he'd found a worthy foe. But..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1656:20580: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1656
msgctxt "text_id=20580 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"You know, I think it's kind of childish for the real thing to take on an impostor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1656:20581: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1656
msgctxt "text_id=20581 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  At the end of the day, this so-called 'Magic' is just another thing that humans made.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1700:20582: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1700
msgctxt "text_id=20582 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Clearly, it was still only interested in itself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1706:20583: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1706
msgctxt "text_id=20583 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It knew nothing of life or freedom. Its only pleasure was found in food."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1712:20584: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1712
msgctxt "text_id=20584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo didn't necessarily feel dissatisfied, but it was becoming harder to stave off his boredom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1717:20585: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1717
msgctxt "text_id=20585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Also, since accompanying Touko on her adventures, his feelings toward her had become a bit confused."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1754:20586: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1754
msgctxt "text_id=20586 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Touko, I just think you're obsessed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1760:20587: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0017; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1760
msgctxt "text_id=20587 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  You can literally do anything you want, just like me, and yet that's what you focus your energy on?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1779:20588: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1779
msgctxt "text_id=20588 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He slumped his shoulders exaggeratedly and closed his eyes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1784:20589: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1784
msgctxt "text_id=20589 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The golden wolf drifted off to sleep, not realizing that his feelings were in fact those of jealousy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1845:20590: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0019; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1845
msgctxt "text_id=20590 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"This place sure has changed in the last four years."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1851:20591: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0020; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1851
msgctxt "text_id=20591 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Did they really need to tear down and rebuild the entire front of the station? And... ah, yep. That smoke shop on the corner is gone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1857:20592: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0021; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1857
msgctxt "text_id=20592 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Oh, well. Guess I'll have to get used to the idea of buying cigarettes from a vending machine.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1891:20593: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1891
msgctxt "text_id=20593 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko walked through her hometown for the first time in four years, grumbling to herself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1896:20594: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1896
msgctxt "text_id=20594 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She was on an aimless and careless stroll."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1901:20595: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1901
msgctxt "text_id=20595 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  No familiar escorted her,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1906:20596: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1906
msgctxt "text_id=20596 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  and she'd even left her self-defense 'bag' back at the hideout."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1911:20597: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1911
msgctxt "text_id=20597 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Today, she was in full tourist mode, not nervous about a thing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1944:20598: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0022; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1944
msgctxt "text_id=20598 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"This place was no bigger than a footpath before, and now it's an actual street."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1953:20599: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0023; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:1953
msgctxt "text_id=20599 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  It's odd. I know I'm home, but it feels like going back to that town overseas.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1988:20600: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1988
msgctxt "text_id=20600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This was Touko's second time going back home."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1993:20601: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1993
msgctxt "text_id=20601 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After leaving the Aozaki home four years ago, she'd secretly returned to Misaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:1998:20602: scene=SP1
#: SP1:1998
msgctxt "text_id=20602 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The first time was longer ago."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2003:20603: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2003
msgctxt "text_id=20603 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  When Touko was fourteen years old, she studied abroad at an academy in England."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2049:20604: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2049
msgctxt "text_id=20604 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She'd spent two years there before returning to Japan."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2054:20605: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2054
msgctxt "text_id=20605 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Then, she'd enrolled in a local high school named Reien Girls' Academy, and headed back to England three years later after graduating."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2059:20606: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2059
msgctxt "text_id=20606 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That was four years ago."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2064:20607: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2064
msgctxt "text_id=20607 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Now she felt the same as she did then, when she returned to that English country town where she'd lived for two years."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2104:20608: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0024; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2104
msgctxt "text_id=20608 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Lonely? Hmm, not really. Disappointed? Not exactly. Scared doesn't sound quite right, but maybe?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2110:20609: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2110
msgctxt "text_id=20609 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She rounded her shoulders and fell deep into thought."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2115:20610: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2115
msgctxt "text_id=20610 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko felt a tingle run up her spine in a way that couldn't really be described in words."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2135:20611: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2135
msgctxt "text_id=20611 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Times were changing faster than ever. Everything was relatively inexpensive and could be replaced on a whim."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2140:20612: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2140
msgctxt "text_id=20612 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After thinking to herself for a bit, she cracked her knuckles and set forth."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2173:20613: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2173
msgctxt "text_id=20613 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was no use overthinking any of this."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2178:20614: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2178
msgctxt "text_id=20614 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This was just how things were now. That's all there was to it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2183:20615: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2183
msgctxt "text_id=20615 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was only natural for the old to make way for the new."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2197:20616: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0025; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2197
msgctxt "text_id=20616 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"This is it! My time is now!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2217:20617: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2217
msgctxt "text_id=20617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "(You can do this, Touko!)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2223:20618: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2223
msgctxt "text_id=20618 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This sudden spark of self-enlightenment gave Touko the encouragement she needed, and she set off with high spirits toward the train station."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2265:20619: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2265
msgctxt "text_id=20619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Striding down the boulevard, she exuded the confidence of a supermodel or dictator."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2270:20620: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2270
msgctxt "text_id=20620 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Although she was not about to exclaim,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2270:20621: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2270
msgctxt "text_id=20621 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"My conquest begins with Main Street! Time to tear it up!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2275:20622: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2275
msgctxt "text_id=20622 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Her enthusiasm was, of course, still there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2295:20623: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2295
msgctxt "text_id=20623 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko, however, had something she had to accomplish first..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2300:20624: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2300
msgctxt "text_id=20624 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Before she could give thought to putting an end to the town's thoughtless"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2305:20625: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2305
msgctxt "text_id=20625 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  attempts at modernization that would become outdated in just a few years."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2361:20626: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0026; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2361
msgctxt "text_id=20626 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"This machine's a winner for sure."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2367:20627: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0027; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2367
msgctxt "text_id=20627 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Did they really think they could fool anyone with the pegs set like this?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2390:20628: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2390
msgctxt "text_id=20628 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko's first destination was not one Misaki's protective sigils, but rather her old favorite pachinko parlor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2395:20629: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2395
msgctxt "text_id=20629 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Though the area around the train station had undergone a dramatic makeover, the back streets were mostly unchanged."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2400:20630: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2400
msgctxt "text_id=20630 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko had exchanged 5,000 yen for some little silver pachinko balls before going upstairs and sitting at the machine she determined was paying out the most that day."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2427:20631: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0028; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2427
msgctxt "text_id=20631 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Hmm, maybe now's a good time to stop. Let's see... I've got twelve boxes so far. Not too shabby after not playing for four years.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2433:20632: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2433
msgctxt "text_id=20632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She sounded slightly disappointed, but her lips and posture betrayed her good humor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2453:20633: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2453
msgctxt "text_id=20633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Pachinko parlors were a staple form of entertainment in Japan, but they were largely absent in other countries."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2458:20634: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2458
msgctxt "text_id=20634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  High-stakes gamers criticized it as inefficient, time-consuming, too luck-dependent, unrewarding, and so forth... basically, a child's game."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2492:20635: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2492
msgctxt "text_id=20635 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  When Touko was studying abroad, she didn't see anything that even resembled a pachinko parlor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2497:20636: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2497
msgctxt "text_id=20636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  However, she wasn't here playing pachinko because she was feeling nostalgic for it after five years."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2502:20637: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2502
msgctxt "text_id=20637 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She simply needed a war chest."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2523:20638: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0029; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2523
msgctxt "text_id=20638 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I didn't think the helicopter alone would set me over budget. Japan's so absurdly peaceful that all the black market dealers are too damned expensive."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2529:20639: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0030; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2529
msgctxt "text_id=20639 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Now I'm totally broke. I have to at least make a little coin to keep Beo fed.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2549:20640: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2549
msgctxt "text_id=20640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko had chartered a helicopter to airlift three shipping containers full of materials to remodel the old school building into a workshop."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2554:20641: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2554
msgctxt "text_id=20641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There weren't any roads a truck could take to get to the old school out deep in the mountains, so she had been forced to burn through the last of her savings."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2582:20642: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0031; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2582
msgctxt "text_id=20642 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Oh, three sevens! This game's just about done for."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2594:20643: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0032; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2594
msgctxt "text_id=20643 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Really, only these boring games are worth playing for profit these days.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2600:20644: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2600
msgctxt "text_id=20644 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Her smile remained in spite of her complaints."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2605:20645: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2605
msgctxt "text_id=20645 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was nothing more Touko-esque than her sitting cross-legged in this pachinko parlor, one hand on the machine with the other holding a cheap cigarette."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2672:20646: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0033; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2672
msgctxt "text_id=20646 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Hm?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2678:20647: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2678
msgctxt "text_id=20647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko noticed something out of the corner of her eye and put on her glasses to see better."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2683:20648: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2683
msgctxt "text_id=20648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She glanced over toward the odd sounds she heard and saw a pale-faced parlor employee."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2688:20649: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2688
msgctxt "text_id=20649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He had a baby face and looked like he was still in high school."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2743:20650: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2743
msgctxt "text_id=20650 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Upon seeing Touko, he froze for a moment, then ran off."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2748:20651: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2748
msgctxt "text_id=20651 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Or rather, he fled in a panic."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2777:20652: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0034; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2777
msgctxt "text_id=20652 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Oof... Am I that scary?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2783:20653: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2783
msgctxt "text_id=20653 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Mage though she was, Touko was still in the prime of her youth."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2788:20654: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2788
msgctxt "text_id=20654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Though she didn't like it when guys ogled her or tried to strike up a conversation, she thought a boy running full tilt away from her was a bit much."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2793:20655: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2793
msgctxt "text_id=20655 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko made a mental note to scare the crap out of that kid the next time she saw him, and returned to her game."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2839:20656: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2839
msgctxt "text_id=20656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With her winning tickets in hand, Touko left the pachinko parlor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2844:20657: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2844
msgctxt "text_id=20657 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She had won quite a bit, but it was hard for her to feel good about it after what had happened at the end of her session."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2878:20658: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2878
msgctxt "text_id=20658 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Wondering what that had been about, she looped around the back of the parlor to redeem her winnings for cash."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2885:20659: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:2885
msgctxt "text_id=20659 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Well, if it isn't Touko!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2891:20660: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2891
msgctxt "text_id=20660 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She stopped in her tracks, frozen by a familiar voice she hadn't heard in four years."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2944:20661: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2944
msgctxt "text_id=20661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo's ears perked up as he woke from his slumber."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2949:20662: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2949
msgctxt "text_id=20662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was just before sunset."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:2954:20663: scene=SP1
#: SP1:2954
msgctxt "text_id=20663 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He opened his eyes with a big yawn, sniffing at a familiar scent in the air getting closer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3002:20664: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0018; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3002
msgctxt "text_id=20664 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Mnggh...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3010:20665: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3010
msgctxt "text_id=20665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo jumped down to the floor and transformed back into his human form."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3015:20666: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3015
msgctxt "text_id=20666 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Though he and Touko didn't have a strict master-servant relationship, he felt he should at least go and greet her since he was supposed to be watching over the place in her absence."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3065:20667: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0019; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3065
msgctxt "text_id=20667 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3085:20668: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3085
msgctxt "text_id=20668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo's face scrunched into a perplexed frown as they met in the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3090:20669: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3090
msgctxt "text_id=20669 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He sensed something more to the smell he'd been so used to."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3122:20670: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0035; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3122
msgctxt "text_id=20670 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Hey Beo, I'm back."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3122:20671: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0035; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3122
msgctxt "text_id=20671 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Here's your reward for watching the place while I was out.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3129:20672: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3129
msgctxt "text_id=20672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko handed the paper bag she was holding to Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3134:20673: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3134
msgctxt "text_id=20673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo was happy to get his hands on the bag stuffed full of hamburgers, but he tilted his head at the odd lingering scent."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3170:20674: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0036; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3170
msgctxt "text_id=20674 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Why the long face? Did something happen while I was gone?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3176:20675: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0020; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3176
msgctxt "text_id=20675 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"No. I slept, it was so boring, actually. Did something happen with you, though?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3182:20676: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0021; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3182
msgctxt "text_id=20676 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  You seem a little down, weirdly tired, and stranger than anything is the fact that you bought me my favorite hamburgers.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3209:20677: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0037; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3209
msgctxt "text_id=20677 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Oh, really? Nothing happened, though.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3243:20678: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0022; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3243
msgctxt "text_id=20678 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3248:20679: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3248
msgctxt "text_id=20679 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This was all extremely suspicious."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3253:20680: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3253
msgctxt "text_id=20680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  One pain point for Beo was Touko's usual complete lack of interest in food."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3258:20681: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3258
msgctxt "text_id=20681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko thought that a hamburger was the same no matter where you ate one, so she had often just stopped at wherever was closest."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3263:20682: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3263
msgctxt "text_id=20682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Thus, Touko would only stop at a certain Asian burger chain, still rare in Japan, maybe one percent of the time. Not to mention..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3298:20683: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0038; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3298
msgctxt "text_id=20683 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"W-what's the big deal?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3298:20684: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0038; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3298
msgctxt "text_id=20684 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  So I bought you hamburgers from your favorite place, who cares?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3324:20685: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0039; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3324
msgctxt "text_id=20685 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I was just trying to say thank you for everything."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3330:20686: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0040; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3330
msgctxt "text_id=20686 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I've dragged you around all over the place, and I just hope you'll stick with me.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3336:20687: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3336
msgctxt "text_id=20687 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She had a sickly-sweet smile on her face."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3341:20688: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3341
msgctxt "text_id=20688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If any of the puppets she had let loose in Misaki heard what she was saying right now, they'd probably fall into a logic error loop and self-destruct. Touko was not one to ever consider the rights of her familiars."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3381:20689: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0023; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3381
msgctxt "text_id=20689 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"This all smells fake, false, and full of lies to me!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3387:20690: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0024; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3387
msgctxt "text_id=20690 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  You're not supposed to be nice! You're never nice!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3400:20691: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0025; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3400
msgctxt "text_id=20691 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  You hate everyone and everything around you, complain constantly, and want to ruin anyone else who's ever having a good time. You only restrain yourself because you don't have a good reason to act... What happened to the Touko that had nothing but a shred of intellect standing between herself and complete moral bankruptcy?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3434:20692: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0041; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3434
msgctxt "text_id=20692 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Well, that's awfully rude. I can be nice sometimes, you know."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3440:20693: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0042; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3440
msgctxt "text_id=20693 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  It's been four years since I've been back here. Wouldn't you feel a little relaxed if you went back to your village?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3446:20694: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0043; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3446
msgctxt "text_id=20694 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  That's how it is for me. I'm still young, cute, and innocent enough to feel a little homesick from time to time.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3467:20695: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0026; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3467
msgctxt "text_id=20695 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Wow, what a load of crap. It must be a cold day in Hell!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3473:20696: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0044; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3473
msgctxt "text_id=20696 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I'm serious!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3479:20697: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0045; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3479
msgctxt "text_id=20697 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  That's it, you've ruined the moment. Give me back those hamburgers. You don't get to eat tonight!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3528:20698: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3528
msgctxt "text_id=20698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko made a grab for the paper bag, but Beo dodged and jumped out the window."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3533:20699: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3533
msgctxt "text_id=20699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He dexterously kicked off against the wall and scampered up onto the roof of the old school building."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3554:20700: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0027; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3554
msgctxt "text_id=20700 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"I can't believe what I'm hearing!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3560:20701: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0028; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3560
msgctxt "text_id=20701 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  I never want to see you making excuses like that, Miss Touko!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3587:20702: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3587
msgctxt "text_id=20702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He pulled out a hamburger from the paper bag and took a big bite out of it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3607:20703: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3607
msgctxt "text_id=20703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That said..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3612:20704: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3612
msgctxt "text_id=20704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Though her attitude had seemed like an act to Beo, it was true that Touko was in an unusually good mood."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3617:20705: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3617
msgctxt "text_id=20705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was unclear why that was the case, but Touko seemed to be feeling something special, or at least something she hadn't ever shown Beo before."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3638:20706: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0029; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3638
msgctxt "text_id=20706 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"...What could that smell be?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3644:20707: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0030; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3644
msgctxt "text_id=20707 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  It was so light, but also annoying...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3650:20708: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3650
msgctxt "text_id=20708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo couldn't understand what exactly that feeling was."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3655:20709: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3655
msgctxt "text_id=20709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He only knew basic feelings such as like and dislike, delicious or disgusting. He wasn't able to articulate much further than that yet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3692:20710: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0031; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3692
msgctxt "text_id=20710 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Eh, whatever. It has nothing to do with me anyway. She'll be the same old Touko tomorrow, I'm sure.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3698:20711: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3698
msgctxt "text_id=20711 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo continued to eat through his hamburgers, still not completely satisfied with the day's course of events."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3703:20712: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3703
msgctxt "text_id=20712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The truth was..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3708:20713: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3708
msgctxt "text_id=20713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even if Beo didn't care enough to understand it, he was still a little upset that there was something he didn't know."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3769:20714: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3769
msgctxt "text_id=20714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A few days passed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3774:20715: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3774
msgctxt "text_id=20715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Unbeknownst to the people of Misaki, progress was being made on the remodeling of the old school building."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3779:20716: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3779
msgctxt "text_id=20716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Meanwhile, Beo was bored out of his mind knowing he had to be stuck here for at least another month."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3784:20717: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3784
msgctxt "text_id=20717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He could feel both his body and his mind dulling as he spent his days simply lounging around eating meat."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3789:20718: scene=SP1
#: SP1:3789
msgctxt "text_id=20718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  On the other hand..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3833:20719: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0046; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3833
msgctxt "text_id=20719 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I'm going shopping. Take care of the place while I'm gone!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3864:20720: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0047; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3864
msgctxt "text_id=20720 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Have fun while I was out? Here, I brought you home some roast beef!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3893:20721: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0048; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3893
msgctxt "text_id=20721 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I'm going out for a bit! Tidy up those materials on the roof while I'm out, okay?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3933:20722: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0049; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3933
msgctxt "text_id=20722 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I'm hooome! Thanks for watching over the place again today."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3933:20723: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0049; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3933
msgctxt "text_id=20723 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3965:20724: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0050; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3965
msgctxt "text_id=20724 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Off I go, my trusty vassal!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:3995:20725: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0051; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:3995
msgctxt "text_id=20725 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"'Eyyy, good work! Huh? I shmell like booze? Oh silly, I'm not drunk at all! Not one... not one bit... I can keep goin'!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4015:20726: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4015
msgctxt "text_id=20726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This is what Touko had become."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4020:20727: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4020
msgctxt "text_id=20727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The mage was constantly out and always in a good mood, in stark contrast to Beo, who spent his days doing nothing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4025:20728: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4025
msgctxt "text_id=20728 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Evidently, she was happy with how her workshop was becoming more and more fortified by the day."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4071:20729: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0032; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4071
msgctxt "text_id=20729 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"No. That's DEFINITELY not it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4077:20730: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0033; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4077
msgctxt "text_id=20730 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  That isn't enough to put Miss Touko in such a good mood."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4083:20731: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0034; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4083
msgctxt "text_id=20731 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  She's constantly complaining about the state of this place."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4089:20732: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0035; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4089
msgctxt "text_id=20732 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Plus, the silly samurai way she's been talking is so not like her.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4116:20733: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0052; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4116
msgctxt "text_id=20733 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Hm? What's wrong, Beo? You look unhappy. I bet you're ready to get out of here and go wild, huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4151:20734: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0036; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4151
msgctxt "text_id=20734 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"That's not the problem here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4157:20735: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0037; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4157
msgctxt "text_id=20735 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  ...I do want to hurry up and get this fight on, but I know it's not going to be for a while yet. I'm just waiting and doing as you ask."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4163:20736: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0038; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4163
msgctxt "text_id=20736 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  But...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4169:20737: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0053; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4169
msgctxt "text_id=20737 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"But?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4195:20738: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0039; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4195
msgctxt "text_id=20738 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Something's... weird. I know there's always nothing to do when we're preparing, but this time it doesn't feel tense the way it should."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4201:20739: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0040; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4201
msgctxt "text_id=20739 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  I'm just eating and sleeping, eating and sleeping, every day. It's going to make me fat. I don't want to be fat!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4237:20740: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0054; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4237
msgctxt "text_id=20740 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"What are you talking about? You shouldn't be worrying about that. You don't even need to use the bathroom, so don't act like you're any kind of normal creature.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4243:20741: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0041; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4243
msgctxt "text_id=20741 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Fair point. But *you* will! You're going to get as fat as a pig!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4270:20742: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0055; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4270
msgctxt "text_id=20742 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Are you serious?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4276:20743: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0056; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4276
msgctxt "text_id=20743 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I've been weighing myself and the number hasn't changed at all. Am I astrally getting fatter?! Can you tell?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4319:20744: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4319
msgctxt "text_id=20744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This is what Beo was talking about."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4324:20745: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4324
msgctxt "text_id=20745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko knew the accuracy of Beo's eye, and trusted his discerning vision over even the numbers on her scale."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4329:20746: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4329
msgctxt "text_id=20746 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Normally Touko would just remove her glasses and say something like,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4363:20747: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0057; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4363
msgctxt "text_id=20747 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I know this is out of the blue, but I want to test the utility of this suicide attack weapon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4374:20748: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0058; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4374
msgctxt "text_id=20748 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  No, no, I don't want to hear your opinion about it, Beo. Just put this collar on. It'll launch you high into the sky!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4380:20749: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4380
msgctxt "text_id=20749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But she hadn't done anything of the sort, and it was beyond weird for her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4431:20750: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0042; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4431
msgctxt "text_id=20750 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"...No, you haven't gained any weight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4437:20751: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0043; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4437
msgctxt "text_id=20751 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  There's a slight variation from yesterday, but that's normal for a human. It would be really silly for you to worry about that seriously, so please don't.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4471:20752: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0059; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4471
msgctxt "text_id=20752 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Really?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4477:20753: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0060; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4477
msgctxt "text_id=20753 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  You don't think it's just gonna show up later or anything?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4483:20754: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0044; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4483
msgctxt "text_id=20754 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"No, the nutrients you consumed yesterday have distributed nicely throughout your body. You're the same Touko as always.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4516:20755: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4516
msgctxt "text_id=20755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That last part was a lie."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4521:20756: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4521
msgctxt "text_id=20756 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She was not the same Touko that Beo had always known."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4526:20757: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4526
msgctxt "text_id=20757 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even though she was physically the same, there was something still odd about her since a few days ago."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4546:20758: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4546
msgctxt "text_id=20758 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That strange, floaty, lingering scent was still there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4551:20759: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4551
msgctxt "text_id=20759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was a change that only a wild beast like Beo could discern, but it was getting stronger with each passing day."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4556:20760: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4556
msgctxt "text_id=20760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo was annoyed because he just could not figure out what that scent was."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4587:20761: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0061; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4587
msgctxt "text_id=20761 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"What a relief!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4601:20762: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0062; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4601
msgctxt "text_id=20762 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I'm headed out. Take care of the place while I'm out!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4613:20763: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4613
msgctxt "text_id=20763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko failed to notice Beo's poor mood and left the old school building in her usual carefree mood."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4618:20764: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4618
msgctxt "text_id=20764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This was how it'd been for days now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4660:20765: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0045; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4660
msgctxt "text_id=20765 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4665:20766: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4665
msgctxt "text_id=20766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo stared at his own reflection in the window and contemplated for a while."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4670:20767: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4670
msgctxt "text_id=20767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Unfortunately, this wouldn't solve anything."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4675:20768: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4675
msgctxt "text_id=20768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It wouldn't change the fact that his employer was still acting strangely,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4680:20769: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4680
msgctxt "text_id=20769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  and it wouldn't get rid of the uncertainty he was constantly feeling in his chest."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4715:20770: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4715
msgctxt "text_id=20770 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He knew he didn't have much other choice."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4722:20771: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0046; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4722
msgctxt "text_id=20771 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"I guess I'll just tail her.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4728:20772: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4728
msgctxt "text_id=20772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He decided to let go of his principles for just this one day."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4790:20773: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4790
msgctxt "text_id=20773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"They say winter's going to be colder than usual this year.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4795:20774: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4795
msgctxt "text_id=20774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Make sure you've got sufficient food, clothing, and shelter.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4800:20775: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4800
msgctxt "text_id=20775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"We should be fine on clothing, but make sure to shore up the other two.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4806:20776: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4806
msgctxt "text_id=20776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He listened to the talk around town as he passed through Misaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4835:20777: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4835
msgctxt "text_id=20777 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was just past one in the afternoon on a weekday."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4840:20778: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4840
msgctxt "text_id=20778 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Workers had returned to the office after their lunch breaks, and the kids were all still in school."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4845:20779: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4845
msgctxt "text_id=20779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The main street was fairly calm and relaxed with mostly housewives out and about."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4878:20780: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4878
msgctxt "text_id=20780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Yet one person stood out in this calm and gentle sea of people."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4883:20781: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4883
msgctxt "text_id=20781 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko endured the stares of the housewives out shopping, salespeople in their shops, and salarymen out on business as she walked through the main street."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4888:20782: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4888
msgctxt "text_id=20782 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It wasn't just her sense of style that stood out, but also her generally powerful presence that attracted eyes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4893:20783: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4893
msgctxt "text_id=20783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  To put it simply, she walked with the confidence of a model on the runway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4934:20784: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0047; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:4934
msgctxt "text_id=20784 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(She's always telling me to try not to stand out, but look at her! It won't be only my fault if we're discovered...)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4940:20785: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4940
msgctxt "text_id=20785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo kept about ten yards behind Touko, careful not to actually mutter the words he was thinking in his head."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4963:20786: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4963
msgctxt "text_id=20786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In Touko's defense, she was fully aware of how much she stood out in a crowd."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:4968:20787: scene=SP1
#: SP1:4968
msgctxt "text_id=20787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If she was out at a busier time of day, she always wore an accessory inscribed with a rune that diverted people's attention away from her and made her stand out approximately forty percent less."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5002:20788: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5002
msgctxt "text_id=20788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko finished up her shopping and headed toward the residential part of town."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5007:20789: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5007
msgctxt "text_id=20789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She walked up to a house that looked completely normal, "
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5012:20790: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5012
msgctxt "text_id=20790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  rang the doorbell and, after stating her name, the door opened quietly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5017:20791: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5017
msgctxt "text_id=20791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It looked as though the things she had bought were for the resident of this house."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5050:20792: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5050
msgctxt "text_id=20792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The nameplate outside read \"Asagi.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5055:20793: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5055
msgctxt "text_id=20793 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Misaki was in the mountains. But, for just a moment, Beo got a whiff of sea brine."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5060:20794: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5060
msgctxt "text_id=20794 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Assuming he must have just mistaken it for some other smell, he put it out of his mind."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5094:20795: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5094
msgctxt "text_id=20795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko came out of the house after about thirty minutes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5099:20796: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5099
msgctxt "text_id=20796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She stretched her arms above her head and took a deep breath. Whatever had gone on inside seemed to have been rather serious."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5104:20797: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5104
msgctxt "text_id=20797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was as if a weight had been lifted from her shoulders."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5125:20798: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0063; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5125
msgctxt "text_id=20798 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"That takes care of those negotiations, at least."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5131:20799: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0064; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5131
msgctxt "text_id=20799 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Now all that's left is a final reminder...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5137:20800: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5137
msgctxt "text_id=20800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko murmured, exasperated."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5142:20801: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5142
msgctxt "text_id=20801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But lurking behind her words, Beo could still detect that lofty scent emanating from her mouth."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5187:20802: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5187
msgctxt "text_id=20802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Her next stop was another plain-looking apartment."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5192:20803: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5192
msgctxt "text_id=20803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It looked as though she had just happened to walk by, but Beo's nose was not so easily deceived."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5197:20804: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5197
msgctxt "text_id=20804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko made it look like she was just aimlessly killing time, but she had in fact arranged to arrive at the apartment at exactly 2:30 PM."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5217:20805: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5217
msgctxt "text_id=20805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In the parking lot of the apartment..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5234:20806: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5234
msgctxt "text_id=20806 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5239:20807: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5239
msgctxt "text_id=20807 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka Suse stepped out of a room on the first floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5272:20808: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0065; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5272
msgctxt "text_id=20808 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Hey, long time no see!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5272:20809: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0065; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5272
msgctxt "text_id=20809 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Fancy seeing you here, Ritsuka!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5290:20810: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5290
msgctxt "text_id=20810 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"No way! Is that you, Toko?! You're back in town?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5326:20811: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0066; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5326
msgctxt "text_id=20811 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Yeah, since a little bit ago. I've been hiding out and laying low."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5338:20812: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0067; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5338
msgctxt "text_id=20812 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  It goes without saying that I'm here to crush this town, of course."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5338:20813: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0067; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5338
msgctxt "text_id=20813 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I've come totally prepared to wipe the slate clean of my past this time."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5350:20814: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0068; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5350
msgctxt "text_id=20814 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  That's why I'm going to get this done before anyone from the Association or Church can stand in my way!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5377:20815: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5377
msgctxt "text_id=20815 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Well, how kind of you... Wait."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5389:20816: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5389
msgctxt "text_id=20816 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Are you talking about ME?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5389:20817: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5389
msgctxt "text_id=20817 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I'm the only one in the Association now, you know!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5400:20818: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0069; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5400
msgctxt "text_id=20818 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Oh, how strange! Or maybe that's lucky for me?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5400:20819: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0069; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5400
msgctxt "text_id=20819 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  To think I'd run into one of my targets while out here on a walk like this. I guess that saves me some trouble, huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5436:20820: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5436
msgctxt "text_id=20820 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I've got nothing to do with the Association, I swear!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5448:20821: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5448
msgctxt "text_id=20821 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I haven't done any serious work in a year or more!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5459:20822: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5459
msgctxt "text_id=20822 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Please don't tell me you're here to kill me! We were like brothers-in-training, right? Please don't!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5492:20823: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5492
msgctxt "text_id=20823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The woman was tearfully flailing her arms at this point."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5497:20824: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5497
msgctxt "text_id=20824 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She had nothing to worry about, though."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5502:20825: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5502
msgctxt "text_id=20825 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo could see even from where he was peering through the fence that Touko had no real intent to kill anyone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5507:20826: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5507
msgctxt "text_id=20826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She had a terrible habit of messing with people for her own entertainment; this time was no different."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5512:20827: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5512
msgctxt "text_id=20827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Unfortunately, the pleasure she took in it only made the target of her jokes feel doubly worse."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5556:20828: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0070; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5556
msgctxt "text_id=20828 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"...Hah. At least say we're like sisters.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5568:20829: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5568
msgctxt "text_id=20829 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Whaaat? But Toko, you don't feel like a little sister at all! I'd never dare call myself your big sister!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5580:20830: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0071; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5580
msgctxt "text_id=20830 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"True enough. You don't have the skills to claim to be my senior, to begin with. If I had to describe what you're good at, it's even worse than those dumb late-night infomercial products these days. Have you thought about a career change? I can refer you to a good place. There's this old and nearly bankrupt circus in Italy that's hiring.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5621:20831: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5621
msgctxt "text_id=20831 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I've had enough of per diem work, thank you very much!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5621:20832: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5621
msgctxt "text_id=20832 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Find me something with at least a weekly salary!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5627:20833: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0072; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5627
msgctxt "text_id=20833 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"...Wow, you aren't even denying that you're worse than a mail-order doodad.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5639:20834: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5639
msgctxt "text_id=20834 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Why would I? You're totally right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5651:20835: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5651
msgctxt "text_id=20835 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I'm completely useless!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5651:20836: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5651
msgctxt "text_id=20836 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  That's me, the Mage's Association's most worthless piece of baggage!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5691:20837: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5691
msgctxt "text_id=20837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe she was taken aback by Ritsuka's guileless smile, but Touko couldn't help but grin back at her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5696:20838: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5696
msgctxt "text_id=20838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If one didn't know better, they would seem like good friends."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5739:20839: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0011; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5739
msgctxt "text_id=20839 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I guess that clears up any suspicions you might have had about me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5751:20840: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0012; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5751
msgctxt "text_id=20840 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  And if that's the case, do you want to come in for a bit? I have some things I need to get done, but I can do them later. It's been such a long time, and I'd like to catch up.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5778:20841: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0073; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5778
msgctxt "text_id=20841 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"You're as easygoing as ever."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5784:20842: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0074; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5784
msgctxt "text_id=20842 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  You're right. You've convinced me. You clearly don't have anything going on with the Association, and you're upholding your own principles."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5790:20843: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0075; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5790
msgctxt "text_id=20843 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  ...So you're really on Aoko's side, huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5817:20844: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5817
msgctxt "text_id=20844 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Of course! She's still learning the ropes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5829:20845: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0014; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5829
msgctxt "text_id=20845 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I just watch over her from a distance. Nothing more, nothing less.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5841:20846: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0076; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5841
msgctxt "text_id=20846 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"That's fine then. She's lucky to have someone like you that understands her.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5866:20847: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5866
msgctxt "text_id=20847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko took a step back, away from Ritsuka."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5871:20848: scene=SP1
#: SP1:5871
msgctxt "text_id=20848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She looked a bit regretful as she signaled that the conversation was over."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5904:20849: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5904
msgctxt "text_id=20849 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Oh, you're not coming inside?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5910:20850: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5910
msgctxt "text_id=20850 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I pour a pretty good cup of coffee nowadays.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5928:20851: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0077; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5928
msgctxt "text_id=20851 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Thanks, but I'll have to pass. I'm still laying low, and I have a lot to do before I take over this town."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5928:20852: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0077; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5928
msgctxt "text_id=20852 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I shouldn't relax too much just yet.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5964:20853: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0017; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5964
msgctxt "text_id=20853 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Well, aren't we the hard worker?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5976:20854: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0018; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5976
msgctxt "text_id=20854 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  But you've always been like that. You always were one to focus on the process more than the goal."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:5982:20855: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0019; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:5982
msgctxt "text_id=20855 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I've no idea what kind of preparations you're up to, but I feel sorry for whoever it is you're going after.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6008:20856: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0078; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6008
msgctxt "text_id=20856 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Eh, it's just the usual. We'll have a magecraft battle, the victor will take the other's Crest, and that'll be it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6014:20857: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0079; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6014
msgctxt "text_id=20857 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I'm not an old-fashioned witch. I'm not going to put a curse on whoever I defeat in battle, you know?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6049:20858: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0020; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6049
msgctxt "text_id=20858 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"That's exactly what I'm talking about, though."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6055:20859: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0021; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6055
msgctxt "text_id=20859 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  You're more interested in collecting their Crest than their life."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6066:20860: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0022; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6066
msgctxt "text_id=20860 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I'd just feel sorry for them if that became their sole purpose in life."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6077:20861: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0023; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6077
msgctxt "text_id=20861 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  You might think you're going easy on them, but that's like living under constant torture.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6115:20862: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6115
msgctxt "text_id=20862 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko nodded to show her agreement."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6120:20863: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6120
msgctxt "text_id=20863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Her collection of Crests would appear that way on the outside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6179:20864: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6179
msgctxt "text_id=20864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko sought profit in combat."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6184:20865: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6184
msgctxt "text_id=20865 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If a mage she defeated could provide her with profitable materials, she would not take their life."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6189:20866: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6189
msgctxt "text_id=20866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She would even save their life if she knew it would be to her advantage to do so."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6194:20867: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6194
msgctxt "text_id=20867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As a result, her workshop in London had a facility specifically built for the \"comfort\" of her magical suppliers."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6199:20868: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6199
msgctxt "text_id=20868 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It housed mages who had either lost to her in battle or who had willingly agreed to contribute to her cause."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6219:20869: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6219
msgctxt "text_id=20869 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko held many magecraft patents which earned her up to 10,000 pounds a month in royalties. However, the majority of this money went to the upkeep of that facility."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6224:20870: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6224
msgctxt "text_id=20870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The demands from the residents of the place for additional facilities and special privileges increased with every passing day. It was reaching a point where Touko needed to decide whether to incorporate or just let everyone go and be done with it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6271:20871: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0080; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6271
msgctxt "text_id=20871 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I promise, it's nothing nefarious or evil like a dungeon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6277:20872: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0081; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6277
msgctxt "text_id=20872 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Torture is too much work anyway. It actually costs less to just entertain them."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6283:20873: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0082; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6283
msgctxt "text_id=20873 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  There are so many good stories out there these days. I can just steal the plot of something and recreate it to make everyone happy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6289:20874: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0083; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6289
msgctxt "text_id=20874 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Real or fake, everyone wants to be the hero of their own story.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6326:20875: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0024; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6326
msgctxt "text_id=20875 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Hmm, just out of curiosity, what's the ratio of the genres you use?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6332:20876: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0025; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6332
msgctxt "text_id=20876 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  30% romance, 30% action, 30% suspense, 10% cartoons?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6338:20877: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0084; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6338
msgctxt "text_id=20877 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Huh? Basically only horror, actually. Horror films have every element you could ever want!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6350:20878: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0026; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6350
msgctxt "text_id=20878 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"...You know, that was always the part of you that scared me the most."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6356:20879: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0027; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6356
msgctxt "text_id=20879 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  You're a girl. You should be more into romance instead of that kinda stuff!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6391:20880: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0085; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6391
msgctxt "text_id=20880 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Hmph. I guess it's something I should consider if one of my potential targets says as much."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6397:20881: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0086; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6397
msgctxt "text_id=20881 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Let's see, how does 80% horror sound for the balance of the virtual worlds I throw my prisoners into?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6415:20882: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0028; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6415
msgctxt "text_id=20882 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"90% romance! Come on, please! If not romance, do 90% mystery!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6421:20883: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6421
msgctxt "text_id=20883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This was clearly a response from someone who knew she'd lose if she had to go up against Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6455:20884: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0087; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6455
msgctxt "text_id=20884 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Very well. If that situation should ever arise, I'll try to accommodate you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6467:20885: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0029; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6467
msgctxt "text_id=20885 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Yes! Wait, what situation?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6478:20886: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0088; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6478
msgctxt "text_id=20886 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"It's fine if you're friends with you-know-who, but I'm talking about if you ever become my enemy. Also, if you tell anyone about our conversation today, I'll snap you up from below before you can even blink.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6517:20887: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0030; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6517
msgctxt "text_id=20887 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Huh? From below? Like, out of my shadow?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6530:20888: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0031; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6530
msgctxt "text_id=20888 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  But more important than that, Touko..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6538:20889: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0032; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6538
msgctxt "text_id=20889 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I can't move an inch!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6560:20890: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0089; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6560
msgctxt "text_id=20890 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Hehehe. Sorry Ritsuka, but I actually spent a week setting a trap in your place."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6566:20891: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0090; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6566
msgctxt "text_id=20891 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I made a familiar out of a shadow and put it in your doorway. It's going to be living in your shadow for a while, so try not say anything to inconvenience me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6566:20892: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0090; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6566
msgctxt "text_id=20892 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6601:20893: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0033; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6601
msgctxt "text_id=20893 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"You mean I've been in a pickle all along?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6612:20894: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0034; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6612
msgctxt "text_id=20894 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Toko, you devil! You brute! You devil-brute! You need to learn some common sense! I knew I heard something the other night! I just thought it was a thief trying to pick my lock!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6647:20895: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6647
msgctxt "text_id=20895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka hadn't noticed the shadow familiar, but she had sensed Touko as she was setting her trap late at night."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6652:20896: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6652
msgctxt "text_id=20896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko didn't think Ritsuka could speak about common sense, since she had ignored an apparent burglar trying to break into her home for a week."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6678:20897: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0091; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6678
msgctxt "text_id=20897 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Don't worry. The familiar will disintegrate at the beginning of the new year."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6684:20898: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0092; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6684
msgctxt "text_id=20898 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  See you around, Ritsuka. Hopefully we'll meet again. I'll take you up on that coffee of yours then, for sure."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6695:20899: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0093; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6695
msgctxt "text_id=20899 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Also, I didn't mean to insult you by comparing you to an infomercial product. You live a simple life. I like that.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6747:20900: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6747
msgctxt "text_id=20900 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko winked at her old friend and left the apartment behind her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6752:20901: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6752
msgctxt "text_id=20901 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Hopefully we'll meet again.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6757:20902: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6757
msgctxt "text_id=20902 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko realized those were empty words."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6777:20903: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6777
msgctxt "text_id=20903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Her plan would not spare her mortal body. Be it a success, or be it a failure, Touko Aozaki would be erased from this world."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6783:20904: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6783
msgctxt "text_id=20904 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Still, that was no reason not at least say something about meeting again."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6788:20905: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6788
msgctxt "text_id=20905 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Perhaps Touko had more affection for Ritsuka than she realized."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6818:20906: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6818
msgctxt "text_id=20906 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even so, she left that friend behind in a state of paralysis."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6823:20907: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6823
msgctxt "text_id=20907 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko had indeed returned home."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6828:20908: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6828
msgctxt "text_id=20908 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That fact alone revealed much to Ritsuka."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6833:20909: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6833
msgctxt "text_id=20909 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Two years older than Touko, Ritsuka had been contracted ten years prior to monitor Touko's grandfather, the mage who discovered the Fifth Magic."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6838:20910: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6838
msgctxt "text_id=20910 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That made her both Touko and Aoko's senior,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6843:20911: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6843
msgctxt "text_id=20911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  and she knew the sisters rather well."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6876:20912: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0035; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6876
msgctxt "text_id=20912 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Hmm, she's gotta keep a few of us from talking, then."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6882:20913: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0036; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6882
msgctxt "text_id=20913 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  The first people to be on alert upon seeing Toko would be myself and...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6888:20914: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6888
msgctxt "text_id=20914 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  One other person."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6893:20915: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6893
msgctxt "text_id=20915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Another with more seniority than the Aozaki sisters in the truest sense."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6898:20916: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6898
msgctxt "text_id=20916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was one other beautiful person, one who had taught Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6924:20917: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0037; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6924
msgctxt "text_id=20917 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I'm sure she's probably got that handled, though."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6930:20918: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0038; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6930
msgctxt "text_id=20918 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  She's not one to overlook something like that.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6957:20919: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0039; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6957
msgctxt "text_id=20919 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Toko really should learn to be colder toward her enemies, though. She's too soft on them--thinks too much of their human rights."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6964:20920: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_SP1_0040; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=SP1
#: SP1:6964
msgctxt "text_id=20920 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "I don't know how I feel about her showing her face to a person she's decided to kill.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6994:20921: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6994
msgctxt "text_id=20921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko was a researcher more than she was a mage. Generally, she wasn't a fighter."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:6999:20922: scene=SP1
#: SP1:6999
msgctxt "text_id=20922 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She was cruel, but not cold."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7004:20923: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7004
msgctxt "text_id=20923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Despite her capability for vicious, ruthless treatment of people, she also displayed a measure of compassion for others."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7009:20924: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7009
msgctxt "text_id=20924 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka sighed as if the problem were her own, and hoped that inconsistency wouldn't end up hurting Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7055:20925: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7055
msgctxt "text_id=20925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko left the neighborhood and began heading toward the largest park in the town."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7060:20926: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7060
msgctxt "text_id=20926 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was three in the afternoon on this early winter day on the boulevard."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7065:20927: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7065
msgctxt "text_id=20927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If it were autumn, the street would be lined with people out for a walk to look at the colorful trees, but now Touko was alone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7096:20928: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7096
msgctxt "text_id=20928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...Though to be accurate, she wasn't quite alone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7102:20929: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7102
msgctxt "text_id=20929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo was walking along the grass more than ten yards behind his employer when he noticed a change in her scent."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7109:20930: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0048; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7109
msgctxt "text_id=20930 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(Are you really not wearing your glasses out here, Touko?)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7141:20931: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7141
msgctxt "text_id=20931 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko's personality changed significantly depending on whether or not she was wearing her glasses."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7146:20932: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7146
msgctxt "text_id=20932 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo wasn't sure which side was her true self, but he did know that she was much more serious and cruel without her glasses."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7151:20933: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7151
msgctxt "text_id=20933 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It wasn't quite to the level of a split personality... more like a reordering of priorities. She mainly took off her glasses when she was about to fight someone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7156:20934: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7156
msgctxt "text_id=20934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Doing so made her less human. It pushed all sense of compromise, concern, and sympathy out of her brain."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7191:20935: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0049; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7191
msgctxt "text_id=20935 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(That must mean the scent getting closer is of her enemy... I think...)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7197:20936: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7197
msgctxt "text_id=20936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo furrowed his brow as he hid behind a tree."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7202:20937: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7202
msgctxt "text_id=20937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He could certainly smell hostility and anticipation emanating from Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7207:20938: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7207
msgctxt "text_id=20938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But at the same time, he couldn't help but scrunch his nose up at the strange scent that kept getting stronger."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7249:20939: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7249
msgctxt "text_id=20939 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Hello. I just happened to be out for a walk. What a coincidence meeting you out here, Touko.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7258:20940: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0095; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7258
msgctxt "text_id=20940 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Ah, yes, what a coincidence indeed. We're not the sort to stop and chat, so let's just keep this to formalities, shall we?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7291:20941: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7291
msgctxt "text_id=20941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo had no idea who was talking to Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7296:20942: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7296
msgctxt "text_id=20942 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  His name was Eiri Fumidsuka."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7301:20943: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7301
msgctxt "text_id=20943 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was a priest of Aida Church and an enemy to Beo and Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7321:20944: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7321
msgctxt "text_id=20944 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  However, it was impossible for Beo to sense this."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7326:20945: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7326
msgctxt "text_id=20945 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He had no personal hostility toward the clergy anyway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7331:20946: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7331
msgctxt "text_id=20946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As far as Beo could tell, he was just a regular person. There was no chance that Touko could be at a disadvantage here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7337:20947: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7337
msgctxt "text_id=20947 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...He would later learn a harsh lesson from someone who seemed similarly harmless, but that was a tale for another time."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7384:20948: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0096; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7384
msgctxt "text_id=20948 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"So how are things going with you? God's house must be full of hard workers. Any greedy trolls show up hungry for concessions?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7395:20949: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7395
msgctxt "text_id=20949 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"I can agree on the hard workers part, but greed is not a problem in our organization."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7406:20950: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7406
msgctxt "text_id=20950 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Any who come to us usually do so on the basis of doctrine, nothing more."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7406:20951: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7406
msgctxt "text_id=20951 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Don't people driven by duty rather than greed frighten you more?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7433:20952: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0097; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7433
msgctxt "text_id=20952 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I thought I said we weren't going to waste time on small talk."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7439:20953: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0098; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7439
msgctxt "text_id=20953 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Just cut to the chase. Is your follower going to sound the bell or not?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7465:20954: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7465
msgctxt "text_id=20954 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"My, my, my. You're one to talk."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7465:20955: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7465
msgctxt "text_id=20955 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  You're very nearly a workaholic yourself, Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7471:20956: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7471
msgctxt "text_id=20956 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  You mean to tell me you don't even have time for a little conversation? After all, this might be the last time we ever see each other again.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7483:20957: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0099; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7483
msgctxt "text_id=20957 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Please. This is the last time and you know it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7503:20958: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7503
msgctxt "text_id=20958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko curtly rejected the smiling priest's request for a chat."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7508:20959: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7508
msgctxt "text_id=20959 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She was being as blunt as she could."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7543:20960: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0100; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7543
msgctxt "text_id=20960 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"If we were ever to meet again, I'm certain it would only be in a fight to the death."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7549:20961: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0101; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7549
msgctxt "text_id=20961 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  We both know each other's intentions. One of us would be dead the moment we laid eyes on the other. There's no time for idle chitchat.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7555:20962: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7555
msgctxt "text_id=20962 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"That's just what you happen to think, Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7561:20963: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7561
msgctxt "text_id=20963 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Why is it that you people can only think of eradicating whoever stands in your way?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7581:20964: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7581
msgctxt "text_id=20964 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Eiri shrugged his shoulders in frustration."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7586:20965: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7586
msgctxt "text_id=20965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko kept her gaze fixed intently on his overcoat."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7591:20966: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7591
msgctxt "text_id=20966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  No matter how many times he said he wanted to resolve this peacefully, she would bet her pride that he didn't mean it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7627:20967: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7627
msgctxt "text_id=20967 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"See, this is what happens when one goes out, experiences the world, and returns to their home. I would have liked it if you had worked on your personal charm, instead."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7633:20968: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7633
msgctxt "text_id=20968 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Oh come on, don't glare at me like that. I'm getting to the point.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7662:20969: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7662
msgctxt "text_id=20969 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"I am entrusted with all reports to the Church. My report is now, 'The Second Owner is currently battling a heretic. I am monitoring them under my clerical authority, in accordance with the neutrality pact. The affiliation of the heretic is unknown, and I am investigating their history.'\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7683:20970: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0102; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7683
msgctxt "text_id=20970 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"So you're telling me that the Church is still unaware of the affiliation of the mage who's appeared in town?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7695:20971: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7695
msgctxt "text_id=20971 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Right. Sister Yuika reports to a different jurisdiction from my own, but she has not even seen the heretic, let alone uncovered their workshop."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7701:20972: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0012; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7701
msgctxt "text_id=20972 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  There will most likely be no interference from the Church until she is able to reveal who our enemy is."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7707:20973: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7707
msgctxt "text_id=20973 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Perhaps they are thinking it's a small turf war between mages who've just come into town?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7742:20974: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0103; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7742
msgctxt "text_id=20974 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I see. So we do have a deal."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7748:20975: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0104; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7748
msgctxt "text_id=20975 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  As long as you're the only one who knows that I'm back in town, I'll lay low. I also won't get in contact with any of my blood relatives.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7769:20976: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0014; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7769
msgctxt "text_id=20976 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Very well. I know you're not the type to sabotage things indiscriminately, and that you prefer to do things as efficiently as possible."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7776:20977: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7776
msgctxt "text_id=20977 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  You might get carried away and try to make your secret hideout in some factory or office building somewhere, right?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7782:20978: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7782
msgctxt "text_id=20978 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I won't allow the bloodshed in this parish to continue on my watch--or anything else that might sully my reputation.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7807:20979: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7807
msgctxt "text_id=20979 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko had to resist the urge to object and ask just what kind of person he thought she was."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7812:20980: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7812
msgctxt "text_id=20980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She did hate wastefulness, but she wasn't about to entirely abandon society and its norms just for the sake of doing things optimally."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7817:20981: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7817
msgctxt "text_id=20981 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Besides, criminal activities were always a pain to clean up later and thus far more inefficient."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7848:20982: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0105; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7848
msgctxt "text_id=20982 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"...I guess that's fine. We're both coming out ahead here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7854:20983: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0106; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7854
msgctxt "text_id=20983 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Just keep watch until things are settled.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7860:20984: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0017; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7860
msgctxt "text_id=20984 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Oh, you're leaving? So soon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7866:20985: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0018; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7866
msgctxt "text_id=20985 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I haven't had the chance to fully appreciate what you look like now.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7872:20986: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0107; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7872
msgctxt "text_id=20986 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I feel the opposite. I hope this is the last time I ever have to lay eyes on you again.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7878:20987: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0019; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7878
msgctxt "text_id=20987 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Ah, wait. Before you go, let me ask you one thing.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7912:20988: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7912
msgctxt "text_id=20988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Eiri spoke just as Touko was about to take a step back."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7917:20989: scene=SP1
#: SP1:7917
msgctxt "text_id=20989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He had effortlessly stopped her from leaving."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7941:20990: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0020; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7941
msgctxt "text_id=20990 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"This is the last thing I'll say."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7947:20991: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0021; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7947
msgctxt "text_id=20991 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  You look quite uneasy, Touko. Are you feeling stifled here?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7959:20992: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0108; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7959
msgctxt "text_id=20992 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"That couldn't be further from the truth. I'm feeling more fulfilled than ever."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7965:20993: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0109; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7965
msgctxt "text_id=20993 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Why do you ask, Eiri?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:7987:20994: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0022; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:7987
msgctxt "text_id=20994 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"You look like you're having fun, but also like you're not truly happy. I was just worried because it seems you don't even realize it yourself.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8025:20995: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0110; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8025
msgctxt "text_id=20995 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I remember you used to say that everyone finds happiness in different things."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8031:20996: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0111; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8031
msgctxt "text_id=20996 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  But you don't know me. So don't pretend to know what makes me happy.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8052:20997: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0023; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8052
msgctxt "text_id=20997 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Well, of course I don't know down to the fine details. Women in particular have a notoriously bizarre concept of happiness."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8058:20998: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0024; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8058
msgctxt "text_id=20998 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  But happiness can easily be categorized into two major types."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8064:20999: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0025; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8064
msgctxt "text_id=20999 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  It seems you haven't even figured that out yet, and it's hard to watch.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8100:21000: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0112; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8100
msgctxt "text_id=21000 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"...Oh? I'm greatly obliged for the concern. Still insist on playing senior apprentice, eh?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8106:21001: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0113; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8106
msgctxt "text_id=21001 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Fine, I'll listen. Let's see what you have to say.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8112:21002: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8112
msgctxt "text_id=21002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If it happened to be something worthless, she would kill him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8117:21003: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8117
msgctxt "text_id=21003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If it erased all the progress she had made on her plans over the past month, or even the two last years, she would kill him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8122:21004: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8122
msgctxt "text_id=21004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko's hostility had clearly turned to murderous rage."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8155:21005: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0026; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8155
msgctxt "text_id=21005 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"It's quite obvious, really."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8161:21006: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0027; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8161
msgctxt "text_id=21006 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  The two types of happiness are relative and absolute. It depends on whether you compare yourself to others or not."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8167:21007: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0028; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8167
msgctxt "text_id=21007 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  You're either happy because you yourself are at peace, or..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8173:21008: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0029; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8173
msgctxt "text_id=21008 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  You're the type of person who can't stand it if you have less than someone else, even if you're otherwise fulfilled.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8194:21009: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0030; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8194
msgctxt "text_id=21009 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"The definition of happiness basically comes down to that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8200:21010: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0031; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8200
msgctxt "text_id=21010 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I know it goes without me saying, but..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8200:21011: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0031; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8200
msgctxt "text_id=21011 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Most people want to be happier than those around them.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8232:21012: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8232
msgctxt "text_id=21012 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The holy man smiled calmly, wrapped in his shadowy black clothing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8237:21013: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8237
msgctxt "text_id=21013 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko remembered clearly now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8242:21014: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8242
msgctxt "text_id=21014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This was a man who actually didn't believe in the concept of true happiness."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8279:21015: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0032; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8279
msgctxt "text_id=21015 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Come now, calm yourself. If you try anything, Sister Yuika will be here in a flash."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8285:21016: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0033; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8285
msgctxt "text_id=21016 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I know that your idea of happiness is not relative. You were always the type to be satisfied as long as you stayed true to yourself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8291:21017: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0034; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8291
msgctxt "text_id=21017 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  The only Aozaki I know who has a relative definition of happiness is...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8317:21018: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8317
msgctxt "text_id=21018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He stopped himself before he could say Aoko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8322:21019: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8322
msgctxt "text_id=21019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The priest seemed to have spoken out of genuine concern for Touko, but his words had the opposite effect on her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8327:21020: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8327
msgctxt "text_id=21020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Although he was reluctant to part on such ill terms, Eiri knew it was best not to anger Touko any further."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8365:21021: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0035; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8365
msgctxt "text_id=21021 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"I've said too much. Please forgive me, puppet master."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8371:21022: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0036; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8371
msgctxt "text_id=21022 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I will take my leave now. I pray that you will see a good outcome in your endeavors.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8383:21023: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0114; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8383
msgctxt "text_id=21023 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Good. Get lost. Your gloomy act isn't helping my mood."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8389:21024: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0115; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8389
msgctxt "text_id=21024 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  ...What's up with your outfit anyway? Doesn't wearing that cloak around town make people avoid you?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8416:21025: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0037; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8416
msgctxt "text_id=21025 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Everyone is very much used to it by now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8428:21026: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0038; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8428
msgctxt "text_id=21026 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Besides, how else can I carry a weapon without people noticing?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8434:21027: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_SP1_0039; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8434
msgctxt "text_id=21027 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I'm sure it was glaringly obvious to you, but I have about three on me right now.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8480:21028: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8480
msgctxt "text_id=21028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Eiri turned and walked back in the direction he came from with a smile still on his face."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8496:21029: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0116; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8496
msgctxt "text_id=21029 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"...What a joke. I only saw one, and it was just a small dagger."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8502:21030: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0117; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8502
msgctxt "text_id=21030 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  How would he hide three anyway? He's not even a mage! Is he some kind of street magician now or something?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8535:21031: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8535
msgctxt "text_id=21031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko muttered to herself as she thought back over the man who had stood before her just moments ago."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8540:21032: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8540
msgctxt "text_id=21032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She truly hated the fact that he had the upper hand on her, but she also felt a bit relieved."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8560:21033: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8560
msgctxt "text_id=21033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If she had actually noticed how heavily armed he was during that brief conversation, it would have been enough to instantly set off a fight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8566:21034: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8566
msgctxt "text_id=21034 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko wasn't sure which one of them would have come out the victor if that had happened."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8598:21035: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8598
msgctxt "text_id=21035 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Eiri Fumidsuka had been that kind of man for as long as she had known him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8603:21036: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8603
msgctxt "text_id=21036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He didn't need a reason, or even an opponent to fight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8608:21037: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8608
msgctxt "text_id=21037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Nor did he need any kind of connection or hatred."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8613:21038: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8613
msgctxt "text_id=21038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was just a machine that simply needed an ignition."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8618:21039: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8618
msgctxt "text_id=21039 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was murder incarnate, with no qualms about cutting someone down."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8652:21040: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8652
msgctxt "text_id=21040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko had only seen that side of him once."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8658:21041: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8658
msgctxt "text_id=21041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was back when she was still a relatively happy disciple of magecraft."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8663:21042: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8663
msgctxt "text_id=21042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko had been standing quietly before her grandfather, crying. The instant her first tears fell, without warning, without hesitation, Eiri cut down their master in an instant."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8714:21043: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A21_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=A21; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8714
msgctxt "text_id=21043 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"What have you done?! Why did you just kill him like that?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8720:21044: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B41_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=B41; voice_category=8; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8720
msgctxt "text_id=21044 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Because I thought I could.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8740:21045: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8740
msgctxt "text_id=21045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Eiri could not fathom how much this curt response would affect such a young Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8746:21046: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8746
msgctxt "text_id=21046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He had not meant to say,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8746:21047: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8746
msgctxt "text_id=21047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  \"My opponent showed a moment of weakness, and I knew I could win, so I took the opportunity.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8751:21048: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8751
msgctxt "text_id=21048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  All he meant was..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8783:21049: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8783
msgctxt "text_id=21049 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  \"I felt capable of killing him, so I did.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8788:21050: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8788
msgctxt "text_id=21050 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This man had become her grandfather's disciple, forged an unrivaled friendship with him, and yet had still mercilessly cut him down when the desire arose."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8793:21051: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8793
msgctxt "text_id=21051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He possessed some sort of superhuman ability that had allowed him to destroy the mortal vessel of a mage who had been infinitely close to being a Magician."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8834:21052: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0118; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8834
msgctxt "text_id=21052 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Argh, this is all so fishy! And a pain!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8840:21053: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0119; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8840
msgctxt "text_id=21053 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I'll have to kill him since he annoys me, but that's just one more thing to do after stealing the Magic. Damn it, Eiri!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8865:21054: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8865
msgctxt "text_id=21054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko put her glasses back on and turned on her heel."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8870:21055: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8870
msgctxt "text_id=21055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She had completed all her major tasks for the day."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8875:21056: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8875
msgctxt "text_id=21056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  All that was left was to make some money to buy food for her familiar and head back to the hideout."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8909:21057: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0050; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8909
msgctxt "text_id=21057 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(Wait, what was with that sudden romantic mood?!)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8915:21058: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8915
msgctxt "text_id=21058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Setting aside Beo's mental shout of dismay for a moment..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8920:21059: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8920
msgctxt "text_id=21059 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The scent that had been bothering him for the past few days had suddenly disappeared."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8925:21060: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8925
msgctxt "text_id=21060 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  His employer was back to being the old Touko Aozaki he knew, and she was headed into the entertainment district."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8959:21061: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0051; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:8959
msgctxt "text_id=21061 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8965:21062: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8965
msgctxt "text_id=21062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo sniffed at the air."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8970:21063: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8970
msgctxt "text_id=21063 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The scent had vanished, and he no longer had a reason to continue tailing Touko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8990:21064: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8990
msgctxt "text_id=21064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But where had it gone?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:8995:21065: scene=SP1
#: SP1:8995
msgctxt "text_id=21065 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And where had it come from in the first place?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9000:21066: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9000
msgctxt "text_id=21066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo thought about it for a few moments."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9007:21067: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0052; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9007
msgctxt "text_id=21067 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(It must be that shady guy just earlier!)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9013:21068: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9013
msgctxt "text_id=21068 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo regained his composure and decided to follow the trail of the man's scent."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9033:21069: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9033
msgctxt "text_id=21069 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He had no idea that where he was going was his employer's worst nightmare."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9090:21070: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9090
msgctxt "text_id=21070 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aida Church was set up to accept visitors any time of day, any day of the year."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9095:21071: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9095
msgctxt "text_id=21071 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The church was the savior of the lost and the poor, and recently had even ventured into the wedding industry for some extra income."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9100:21072: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9100
msgctxt "text_id=21072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was closely involved with the public welfare of Misaki City and was doing fairly well for itself in that regard."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9105:21073: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9105
msgctxt "text_id=21073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  However, there was one problem."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9130:21074: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9130
msgctxt "text_id=21074 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"...Father Eiri is still not in?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9136:21075: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9136
msgctxt "text_id=21075 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  Ritsuka is boycotting the Church, and we are losing volunteers with each passing day. I'm the only one working here at this point.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9142:21076: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9142
msgctxt "text_id=21076 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even if their financial situation was stable, they seemed to be chronically understaffed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9175:21077: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9175
msgctxt "text_id=21077 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"The people of this city lack faith."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9181:21078: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9181
msgctxt "text_id=21078 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  What sort of life is spent demanding money in exchange for labor? Days spent chasing after material desires can only lead to a life of hollow wealth and mental poverty.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9206:21079: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9206
msgctxt "text_id=21079 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The nun muttered to herself quietly as she picked up the stepladder with one hand."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9211:21080: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9211
msgctxt "text_id=21080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Although it was a proper stepladder they used for cleaning the church windows and weighed too much to be carried by even two strong adults, the mass didn't seem to faze her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9245:21081: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0004; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9245
msgctxt "text_id=21081 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"The desolation of the hearts and minds of our flock is a concern, but we also mustn't forget the increasing costs of living. There are whispers of an impending sales tax, and Father Eiri must be convinced of the great results we can achieve in a single day if we hold more wedding ceremonies."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9251:21082: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0005; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9251
msgctxt "text_id=21082 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  He'll go out of his way to help anyone and everyone but won't think about the work that comes after that. What is he going to do about all those stray cats in the back garden? Ah, right, that and any other physical labor always falls to me, doesn't it?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9282:21083: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9282
msgctxt "text_id=21083 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This nun mumbling to herself at a near-constant pace was Sister Yuika Suse."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9287:21084: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9287
msgctxt "text_id=21084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was a reason for her unusual behavior."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9307:21085: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9307
msgctxt "text_id=21085 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Yuika was completely blind and had honed her other senses to keenly perceive her surroundings."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9312:21086: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9312
msgctxt "text_id=21086 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She was extremely sensitive to the presence of living creatures, particularly humans, and could detect when someone was within a radius of thirty feet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9317:21087: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9317
msgctxt "text_id=21087 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She could talk to herself so openly now because she did not sense anyone nearby."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9356:21088: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0006; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9356
msgctxt "text_id=21088 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Let's see... What leftover food do we have? Ah, there's that set of assorted jams we received as a gift."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9362:21089: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0007; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9362
msgctxt "text_id=21089 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  What shall we do, my Lord? Can a cat eat two-day-old bread that's rock hard? Ritsuka was clear about not giving them onions, if I remember correctly...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9382:21090: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9382
msgctxt "text_id=21090 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sister Yuika was busy putting away the cleaning tools while simultaneously trying to prepare dinner for the hungry animals mewing in the back garden."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9387:21091: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9387
msgctxt "text_id=21091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  When suddenly..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9399:21092: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0008; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9399
msgctxt "text_id=21092 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Oh? Do we have a new lost child among us?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9404:21093: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9404
msgctxt "text_id=21093 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sister Yuika suddenly sensed the presence of a small dog in the church."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9437:21094: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0009; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9437
msgctxt "text_id=21094 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"I'm sorry, little one, but today is for cats only. If I throw you in with that bunch, they'll be too surprised to eat."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9443:21095: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0010; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9443
msgctxt "text_id=21095 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  I'll give you some food, but you'll have to wait until next time to come inside. We can't be taking in any more animals tonight.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9463:21096: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9463
msgctxt "text_id=21096 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She put her foot in front of the small brown dog to stop him from coming any further inside the church's gate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9468:21097: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9468
msgctxt "text_id=21097 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Yuika was somewhat rougher in her treatment of non-human creatures."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9503:21098: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0053; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9503
msgctxt "text_id=21098 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(What is this irritating creature?)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9509:21099: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9509
msgctxt "text_id=21099 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo, who'd convinced himself to transform into a small dog instead of a wolf like he really wanted, only saw Sister Yuika as an obstacle in his way."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9529:21100: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9529
msgctxt "text_id=21100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He could smell the scent of the man in black ahead, further inside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9534:21101: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9534
msgctxt "text_id=21101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo thought little of humans, and in this moment Sister Yuika was simply an obstacle."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9539:21102: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9539
msgctxt "text_id=21102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  So naturally, he ignored her warnings and attempted to push through the gate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9572:21103: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0011; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9572
msgctxt "text_id=21103 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"...Hm? W-what is this color?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9578:21104: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0012; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9578
msgctxt "text_id=21104 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  This dog is a most unusual color... Perhaps it's a rare exotic breed, in which case...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9584:21105: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9584
msgctxt "text_id=21105 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He might be some wealthy person's pet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9589:21106: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9589
msgctxt "text_id=21106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Since the dog came to the church, its rich owner might also attend church services..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9594:21107: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9594
msgctxt "text_id=21107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Yuika stopped trying to push the dog away from the gate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9634:21108: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0013; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9634
msgctxt "text_id=21108 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"I'm sorry. I'm sure you're here to see Father Eiri, but he's still out at the moment. I'll give you the best food we have today if you just run on along home, okay?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9640:21109: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0054; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9640
msgctxt "text_id=21109 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(Ugh, what an annoying, irritating woman!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9640:21110: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0054; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9640
msgctxt "text_id=21110 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Perfect, nobody's around. I'll just go for her throa-)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9675:21111: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9675
msgctxt "text_id=21111 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo's front legs stopped suddenly before he could launch himself at Sister Yuika.  "
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9681:21112: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9681
msgctxt "text_id=21112 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Pop."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9687:21113: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9687
msgctxt "text_id=21113 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sister Yuika opened the lid of the bottle she held and poured out a glimmering liquid into a small dish."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=21114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " She set it down in front of the dog."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9722:21115: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0055; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9722
msgctxt "text_id=21115 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(Umm...)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9728:21116: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0014; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9728
msgctxt "text_id=21116 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Here you go. Eat up!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9752:21117: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9752
msgctxt "text_id=21117 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The mysterious, unknown liquid sat in front of Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9757:21118: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9757
msgctxt "text_id=21118 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It smelled like nothing he'd ever smelled before."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9762:21119: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9762
msgctxt "text_id=21119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo was known to let curiosity get the best of him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9767:21120: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9767
msgctxt "text_id=21120 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even if it was poisoned, no poison of the natural world could harm him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9772:21121: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9772
msgctxt "text_id=21121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He lapped up a mouthful."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9807:21122: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0056; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9807
msgctxt "text_id=21122 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(...W-what...)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9812:21123: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9812
msgctxt "text_id=21123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He lapped up a little more."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9818:21124: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0057; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9818
msgctxt "text_id=21124 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(...is this...)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9823:21125: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9823
msgctxt "text_id=21125 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He lapped up even more."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9829:21126: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0058; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9829
msgctxt "text_id=21126 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(...flavor!?)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9834:21127: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9834
msgctxt "text_id=21127 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He lapped up more and more."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9865:21128: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9865
msgctxt "text_id=21128 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"My, my! You're lapping that up like it was milk!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9865:21129: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0015; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9865
msgctxt "text_id=21129 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  I think I might actually like you, even though you are a dog.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9871:21130: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0059; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9871
msgctxt "text_id=21130 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(I want more!)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9877:21131: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9877
msgctxt "text_id=21131 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The church became filled with the echoes of Beo's boisterous barking."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9882:21132: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9882
msgctxt "text_id=21132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At this point he'd completely forgotten about the man's scent."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9909:21133: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9909
msgctxt "text_id=21133 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Hehe, it's sweet and delicious, isn't it? I'm impressed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9909:21134: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_SP1_0016; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9909
msgctxt "text_id=21134 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  I didn't know dogs could have such a sweet tooth.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9928:21135: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0060; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:9928
msgctxt "text_id=21135 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(Sweet? Is this what sweet takes like?)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9934:21136: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9934
msgctxt "text_id=21136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo looked up at Sister Yuika as she whispered to him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9939:21137: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9939
msgctxt "text_id=21137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He had the feeling that sweet was an important word he should remember."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9944:21138: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9944
msgctxt "text_id=21138 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This food sent a sensation through him that was like a flash of lightning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9986:21139: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9986
msgctxt "text_id=21139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Until this point, eating food had been nothing more than a process of refueling."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9991:21140: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9991
msgctxt "text_id=21140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He liked hamburgers, but that never amounted to more than a preference for a particular mouthfeel. He only ate because he needed the nutrition."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:9997:21141: scene=SP1
#: SP1:9997
msgctxt "text_id=21141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But this was different. This food was not necessary to his survival."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10029:21142: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10029
msgctxt "text_id=21142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And yet he knew he wanted more."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10034:21143: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10034
msgctxt "text_id=21143 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He didn't really need it, but it made him feel good."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10039:21144: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10039
msgctxt "text_id=21144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was like food for his soul rather than his body."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10060:21145: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0061; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10060
msgctxt "text_id=21145 | speaker=beo"
msgid "(Wait, isn't this smell...)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10066:21146: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10066
msgctxt "text_id=21146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He stopped wagging his tail."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10071:21147: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10071
msgctxt "text_id=21147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The golden wolf in the form of a small dog sat with the food that was the very origin of his name in front of him. Beowulf was faced with a difficult problem he was unable to solve."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10155:21148: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0062; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10155
msgctxt "text_id=21148 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"I'm home!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10174:21149: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0120; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10174
msgctxt "text_id=21149 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Welcome back, Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10180:21150: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0121; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10180
msgctxt "text_id=21150 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I was worried about you. It's late! As your trainer and master, I have to punish you for staying out so late without checking in with me. Kneel right there.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10201:21151: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10201
msgctxt "text_id=21151 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo had transformed back into human form and returned to the workshop. Touko was waiting there for him with a big, strained smile on her face."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10225:21152: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0063; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10225
msgctxt "text_id=21152 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Ah, right.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10230:21153: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10230
msgctxt "text_id=21153 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo knew he had messed up."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10235:21154: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10235
msgctxt "text_id=21154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He had failed to get back home before Touko because of Sister Yuika."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10262:21155: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0064; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10262
msgctxt "text_id=21155 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Aw, do I really have to kneel in the corner?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10268:21156: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0065; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10268
msgctxt "text_id=21156 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  I was out late, but nobody saw me! I wasn't doing anything bad!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10274:21157: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0122; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10274
msgctxt "text_id=21157 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Are you sure nobody saw you?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10280:21158: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0123; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10280
msgctxt "text_id=21158 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Were you out playing in the mountains?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10292:21159: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0066; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10292
msgctxt "text_id=21159 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"No, I was in town. But nobody noticed me, I'm sure of it. I was actually following you!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10325:21160: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10325
msgctxt "text_id=21160 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko froze at Beo's completely unexpected response."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10335:21161: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10335
msgctxt "text_id=21161 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But, she was used to him by now. She just sighed and rubbed her head, now throbbing from a terrible headache."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10356:21162: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0124; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10356
msgctxt "text_id=21162 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"...Fine. I suppose I was the one who taught you that nothing's bad, as long as you don't get caught. I also never explicitly told you that you couldn't follow me, so I'll let this one slide."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10367:21163: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0125; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10367
msgctxt "text_id=21163 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  But how did you avoid being noticed? I'm pretty sure you would've drawn attention to yourself in that form.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10402:21164: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0067; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10402
msgctxt "text_id=21164 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"That's my trade secret. If I told you, then I won't be able to see you like I did today. You looked like you were really having fun with that person.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10421:21165: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0126; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10421
msgctxt "text_id=21165 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"...!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10437:21166: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10437
msgctxt "text_id=21166 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko's response was both honest and out of character."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10442:21167: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10442
msgctxt "text_id=21167 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even Beo was surprised at how taken aback she was by his statement."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10477:21168: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0127; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10477
msgctxt "text_id=21168 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"That wasn't fun. I don't know what kind of weird idea you got from that, but it was a negotiation. I was simply holding the entire town hostage to keep him from interfering as a priest of the Church, and...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10483:21169: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0068; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10483
msgctxt "text_id=21169 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Well, I was actually talking about the girl."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10489:21170: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0069; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10489
msgctxt "text_id=21170 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  The one that you left unable to move.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10495:21171: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0128; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10495
msgctxt "text_id=21171 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Urgh...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10530:21172: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10530
msgctxt "text_id=21172 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Woman and wolf stared at each other for a silent moment."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10535:21173: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10535
msgctxt "text_id=21173 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo looked satisfied with himself and his secret information."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10547:21174: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0070; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10547
msgctxt "text_id=21174 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10559:21175: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0071; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10559
msgctxt "text_id=21175 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  But I guess that means that guy's your mate, right?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10578:21176: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0129; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10578
msgctxt "text_id=21176 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Ngh...!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10583:21177: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10583
msgctxt "text_id=21177 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko nearly choked at the utterly fearless question."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10609:21178: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10609
msgctxt "text_id=21178 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The puppet master wordlessly removed her glasses and tamped down her emotions."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10620:21179: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0130; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10620
msgctxt "text_id=21179 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Tell me, Beo, why do you even know that word?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10620:21180: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0130; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10620
msgctxt "text_id=21180 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  There's no reason for you to know about such things.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10652:21181: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0072; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10652
msgctxt "text_id=21181 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Why wouldn't I? It's a word all creatures are familiar with."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10658:21182: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0073; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10658
msgctxt "text_id=21182 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  ...Granted, I never thought of you as a normal creature, so I'm a little surprised myself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10669:21183: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0074; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10669
msgctxt "text_id=21183 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Anyway, who is that plain, potato-looking male anyway?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10689:21184: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10689
msgctxt "text_id=21184 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo was suddenly irritated."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10694:21185: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10694
msgctxt "text_id=21185 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was irritated, but he couldn't figure out why."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10736:21186: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0131; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10736
msgctxt "text_id=21186 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"He's literally nothing. To me, anyway. Your assessment is correct. He isn't worth thinking about, and he's not even good enough for you to eat.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10747:21187: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0075; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10747
msgctxt "text_id=21187 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Really? He's just an enemy? And I'm the only special person in your life?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10774:21188: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0132; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10774
msgctxt "text_id=21188 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"For the time being, yes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10780:21189: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0133; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10780
msgctxt "text_id=21189 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  ...I thought it might rekindle something, but there was absolutely nothing there. I don't think I'll ever think about him like that again.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10791:21190: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0076; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10791
msgctxt "text_id=21190 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"All right, then! If that's the case then I'll forget about it! Say, what do you mean by 'rekindle' anyway?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10826:21191: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0134; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10826
msgctxt "text_id=21191 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"It's just when you think you can make a relationship like it was in the past."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10832:21192: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0135; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10832
msgctxt "text_id=21192 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I mean, I guess there was a slight chance of that happening. He was my first love, after all.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10838:21193: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0077; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10838
msgctxt "text_id=21193 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10843:21194: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10843
msgctxt "text_id=21194 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo had no firsthand experience with love, but he at least understood the concept of first love."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10864:21195: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0078; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10864
msgctxt "text_id=21195 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"YOU had a first love?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10870:21196: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0136; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10870
msgctxt "text_id=21196 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"...I'm not sure why you think a mate is more believable than a first love."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10876:21197: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0137; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10876
msgctxt "text_id=21197 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  It was a long time ago. I was still a teenager, and he had just started studying under my grandfather. He wasn't studying magecraft. He was just training under him to hone his mind.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10905:21198: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10905
msgctxt "text_id=21198 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko spoke indifferently, and it was clear from the look on her face that there was no longer any attachment there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10910:21199: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10910
msgctxt "text_id=21199 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Yet there was still a tenderness in her words that caused Beo to furrow his brow."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10946:21200: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0079; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10946
msgctxt "text_id=21200 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Miss Touko... do you still like him?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10957:21201: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0138; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10957
msgctxt "text_id=21201 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"No. I was surprised at how little I felt for him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10963:21202: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0139; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10963
msgctxt "text_id=21202 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  There's just this remnant of my adolescence there. Just talking to people I know from that time takes me back, you know?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10969:21203: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0140; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:10969
msgctxt "text_id=21203 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I'm not attracted to him at all anymore as a person. But when I talk to him, I can remember that past version of myself so clearly it makes me want to laugh.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10989:21204: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10989
msgctxt "text_id=21204 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo grew only more confused as Touko spoke with such passion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:10994:21205: scene=SP1
#: SP1:10994
msgctxt "text_id=21205 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He couldn't wrap his head around the concept that she hated him yet somehow also still liked him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11021:21206: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0080; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11021
msgctxt "text_id=21206 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"I don't get it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11033:21207: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0141; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11033
msgctxt "text_id=21207 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"That's because you don't have likes or dislikes. Sometimes you can't use logic to understand human relationships.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11045:21208: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0081; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11045
msgctxt "text_id=21208 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"I do too have likes and dislikes!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11045:21209: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0081; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11045
msgctxt "text_id=21209 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  There are certain foods that I like more than others, you know!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11082:21210: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0142; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11082
msgctxt "text_id=21210 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"You only work on the standard of whether something is useful or not."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11088:21211: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0143; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11088
msgctxt "text_id=21211 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Wild animals only use taste as a sensor to measure how nutritious something is."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11094:21212: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0144; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11094
msgctxt "text_id=21212 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Only humans eat for reasons other than pure nutritional value."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11100:21213: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0145; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11100
msgctxt "text_id=21213 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Some of the food we like doesn't help sustain us. We eat what we eat because we enjoy it. That's also why things we like look sweet.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11131:21214: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0082; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11131
msgctxt "text_id=21214 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Things you like look sweet?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11137:21215: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0146; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11137
msgctxt "text_id=21215 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I mean, that was just an example. But we don't look at something we like and think it's bitter. Well, maybe some people do, I don't know."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11143:21216: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0147; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11143
msgctxt "text_id=21216 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  It all depends on what you're into, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11149:21217: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0148; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11149
msgctxt "text_id=21217 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  It's like 'what came first, the chicken or the egg?' Is something sweet because we like it, or do we like it because it's sweet?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11176:21218: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0083; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11176
msgctxt "text_id=21218 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Yeah, but, I don't think you look sweet.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11197:21219: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0149; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11197
msgctxt "text_id=21219 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Of course not! You're not actually 'alive!'"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11203:21220: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0150; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11203
msgctxt "text_id=21220 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  You exist, but you're not really alive. There's a difference."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11209:21221: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0151; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11209
msgctxt "text_id=21221 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  It's kind of ironic, actually. If you were to ever figure that difference out, you wouldn't be invincible anymore.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11220:21222: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0084; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11220
msgctxt "text_id=21222 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11245:21223: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_SP1_0152; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11245
msgctxt "text_id=21223 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Anyway, it's time for dinner. I won a lot today, so I bought some nice marbled beef for you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11263:21224: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11263
msgctxt "text_id=21224 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko walked into the classroom, back in her usual mood."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11268:21225: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11268
msgctxt "text_id=21225 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo lingered in the hallway looking dejected."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11273:21226: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11273
msgctxt "text_id=21226 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"You're not actually alive!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11278:21227: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11278
msgctxt "text_id=21227 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Those words pierced right through Beo's heart, but he didn't quite know why yet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11312:21228: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11312
msgctxt "text_id=21228 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Three weeks would pass before he got a hint of why that was the case."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11317:21229: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11317
msgctxt "text_id=21229 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Lugh Beowulf was perfect..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11322:21230: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11322
msgctxt "text_id=21230 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...and yet he would lose,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11322:21231: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11322
msgctxt "text_id=21231 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  at the hands of a particularly imperfect creature."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11377:21232: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11377
msgctxt "text_id=21232 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The sound of a phone ringing echoed through the empty hallways of the school."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11399:21233: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11399
msgctxt "text_id=21233 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was January, and both the mage who had remodeled the building,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11404:21234: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11404
msgctxt "text_id=21234 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  and the Magician who had expelled her from it, were long gone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11409:21235: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11409
msgctxt "text_id=21235 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The telephone that Touko had installed on a whim rang and rang without letting up, as if it knew for sure that someone was there to answer it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11438:21236: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0085; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11438
msgctxt "text_id=21236 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Argh, shut up!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11444:21237: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11444
msgctxt "text_id=21237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Something rustled inside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11449:21238: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11449
msgctxt "text_id=21238 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There were definitely no people inside the school building, but there was one non-human creature sleeping there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11498:21239: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0086; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11498
msgctxt "text_id=21239 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Hi, you've reached the Misaki branch of the Hollow Shrine."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11504:21240: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0087; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11504
msgctxt "text_id=21240 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  The owner has run away with her tail between her legs and is currently unavailable, so please leave a message after the... ah, Miss Touko?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11510:21241: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0088; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11510
msgctxt "text_id=21241 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Ah, yes, yes. That's fine. Have a good trip. Don't worry about me.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11548:21242: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11548
msgctxt "text_id=21242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The classroom was occupied by a young boy with blond hair."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11553:21243: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11553
msgctxt "text_id=21243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even before the phone rang, he was in human form."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11558:21244: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11558
msgctxt "text_id=21244 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It used to be that when he was alone, he would always doze off in his wolf form. But not anymore."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11563:21245: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11563
msgctxt "text_id=21245 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was no real need for him to stay in his human form, but he did anyway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11568:21246: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11568
msgctxt "text_id=21246 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was now his normal state of being when he was not in combat."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11594:21247: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0089; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11594
msgctxt "text_id=21247 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Just call me if you need anything. I know my contract is up, but I'm still your familiar."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11600:21248: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0090; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11600
msgctxt "text_id=21248 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  No, I'm not being sarcastic. I'm proud to be your familiar. Until I find a better employer, I'm leaving my collar with you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11635:21249: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11635
msgctxt "text_id=21249 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo couldn't help but wonder where Touko was traveling."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11640:21250: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11640
msgctxt "text_id=21250 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She had accepted her loss and ended her contract with her familiar."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11645:21251: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11645
msgctxt "text_id=21251 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She said it was because she hadn't fulfilled her promise to let him fight Magic."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11650:21252: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11650
msgctxt "text_id=21252 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  However, that was actually the fault of her familiar, and not her responsibility at all. Beo had not fulfilled his duty as her bodyguard yet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11686:21253: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0091; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11686
msgctxt "text_id=21253 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"So, where are you now?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11692:21254: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11692
msgctxt "text_id=21254 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was the name of a country he wasn't familiar with."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11697:21255: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11697
msgctxt "text_id=21255 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After the battle, she had promptly left Japan to develop a way to break the curse."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11718:21256: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0092; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11718
msgctxt "text_id=21256 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"What do you mean, accept your loss?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11724:21257: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0093; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11724
msgctxt "text_id=21257 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Does that mean you haven't given up yet?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11730:21258: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11730
msgctxt "text_id=21258 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko laughed on the other end of the line."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11735:21259: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11735
msgctxt "text_id=21259 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Somehow, Beo sensed a tropical scent coming through the phone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11740:21260: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11740
msgctxt "text_id=21260 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Whether that was a Mystical effect of Touko's handcrafted phone,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11745:21261: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11745
msgctxt "text_id=21261 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  or the werewolf's super senses, was unclear."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11777:21262: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0094; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11777
msgctxt "text_id=21262 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Well, come home soon, okay? I'll be here waiting. Bring me back something delicious, will you?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11783:21263: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11783
msgctxt "text_id=21263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko asked him why."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11788:21264: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11788
msgctxt "text_id=21264 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If he had really decided to stay on as her familiar, there was no reason for him to stay there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11822:21265: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0095; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11822
msgctxt "text_id=21265 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Hmm... I don't really know myself, actually.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11828:21266: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11828
msgctxt "text_id=21266 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As he stumbled over his words, Beo patted his chest a few times and remembered the pain he had felt."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11859:21267: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0096; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11859
msgctxt "text_id=21267 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Ehehe. How do I put this...?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11865:21268: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_SP1_0097; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=SP1
#: SP1:11865
msgctxt "text_id=21268 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  It's like... when I'm here, I think I can understand what sweet really means.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11871:21269: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11871
msgctxt "text_id=21269 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The wolf who had learned to accept being wasteful expressed his future goal, a vague hint of delight in his voice."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence SP1:11890:21270: scene=SP1
#: SP1:11890
msgctxt "text_id=21270 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Thus concluded an exceptionally rare case of first love, sweet as honey."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:47:21271: scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:47
msgctxt "text_id=21271 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki was waiting in the east wing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:53:21272: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:53
msgctxt "text_id=21272 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Sorry. Did I keep you long?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:62:21273: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:62
msgctxt "text_id=21273 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"No. Not like I have anything else to do anyway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:74:21274: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:74
msgctxt "text_id=21274 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Let's head inside. I think you know most of the guests, but we should still introduce you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:79:21275: scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:79
msgctxt "text_id=21275 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That's Aozaki for you. Always likes to do things properly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_A:84:21276: scene=WIK_B_1_A
#: WIK_B_1_A:84
msgctxt "text_id=21276 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With her characteristic sincerity on full display, she turned the doorknob."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:110:21277: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:110
msgctxt "text_id=21277 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The moment I entered, I had to stop myself from jumping out of my skin."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:115:21278: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:115
msgctxt "text_id=21278 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The parlor was cozy compared to the lobby, but I didn't have time to appreciate it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:120:21279: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:120
msgctxt "text_id=21279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was too distracted by a familiar face I hadn't expected to run into."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:167:21280: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:167
msgctxt "text_id=21280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  First was Alice Kuonji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:172:21281: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:172
msgctxt "text_id=21281 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was nervous because I'd only met her once or twice, but she wasn't the one who surprised me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:228:21282: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:228
msgctxt "text_id=21282 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Next was Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:233:21283: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:233
msgctxt "text_id=21283 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was a child who often hung around the shopping district, almost like a guardian spirit... or perhaps, a greedy little goblin. I'd spoken to him before, so he wasn't a shocker either."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:288:21284: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:288
msgctxt "text_id=21284 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Last was the student council vice president."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:293:21285: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:293
msgctxt "text_id=21285 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Come to think of it, he was acquainted with Aozaki and Sizuki, so it made sense he'd be at this birthday party."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:299:21286: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:299
msgctxt "text_id=21286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It did make sense... right?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:354:21287: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:354
msgctxt "text_id=21287 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Hey. What's Tsukiji doing here?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:365:21288: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:365
msgctxt "text_id=21288 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Oh, didn't I say he was coming?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:371:21289: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:371
msgctxt "text_id=21289 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Should I have let you know if he was going to show up?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:382:21290: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:382
msgctxt "text_id=21290 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I... don't exactly have a problem with him.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:408:21291: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:408
msgctxt "text_id=21291 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"So what's the issue? We see each other every day at the student council, don't we?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:419:21292: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:419
msgctxt "text_id=21292 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Well, we're not in school. And, well... I'm in my regular clothes.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:455:21293: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:455
msgctxt "text_id=21293 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki gave me a look that said, \"and...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:460:21294: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:460
msgctxt "text_id=21294 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Of course there was a problem."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:465:21295: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:465
msgctxt "text_id=21295 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Could you blame me for hiding it? To be frank, I had a crush on Tobimaru Tsukiji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:470:21296: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:470
msgctxt "text_id=21296 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd felt this way for three years."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:475:21297: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:475
msgctxt "text_id=21297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Three whole years, and I still hadn't said anything. I knew it was spineless of me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:507:21298: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:507
msgctxt "text_id=21298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This might not mean much coming from me, but I wasn't always a coward."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:512:21299: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:512
msgctxt "text_id=21299 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  During my freshman year, I was only vaguely aware of him as Aozaki's coworker."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:517:21300: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:517
msgctxt "text_id=21300 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I only really became aware of my feelings during my second year."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:522:21301: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:522
msgctxt "text_id=21301 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He spoke to me often, maybe because he trusted me as Aozaki's friend."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:527:21302: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:527
msgctxt "text_id=21302 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And whenever he did, I went home happy; at the time, I didn't know why."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:555:21303: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:555
msgctxt "text_id=21303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The realization hit me when we happened to be cleaning up together after a school festival in my second year."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:560:21304: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:560
msgctxt "text_id=21304 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We were just tidying things away, when bam! I realized maybe I'd liked him all along."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:566:21305: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:566
msgctxt "text_id=21305 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They say love's a poison,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:571:21306: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:571
msgctxt "text_id=21306 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  but yeesh, talk about delayed effects."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:604:21307: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:604
msgctxt "text_id=21307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Anyway, nothing really changed after that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:609:21308: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:609
msgctxt "text_id=21308 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In an act of rebellion against my simple-minded family,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:614:21309: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:614
msgctxt "text_id=21309 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I decided to never inherit the family business."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:619:21310: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:619
msgctxt "text_id=21310 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That was why I liked to believe I've been hard-working and disciplined since middle school. It's a personal point of pride."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:624:21311: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:624
msgctxt "text_id=21311 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And, it made it all the more excruciating to accept that I'd been overtaken by teenage infatuation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:629:21312: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:629
msgctxt "text_id=21312 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  You could say that I lacked courage."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:657:21313: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:657
msgctxt "text_id=21313 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Eventually, the school year passed by even as I did nothing about my feelings..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:662:21314: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:662
msgctxt "text_id=21314 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...but I never got over him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:667:21315: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:667
msgctxt "text_id=21315 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We entered the fall of my third year. Graduation was close, but I still had no idea what to do about my crush."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:697:21316: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:697
msgctxt "text_id=21316 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Then, I learned to my surprise that Tsukiji would be attending a local college. I had this on good authority, since I'd flexed my powers as a student council member to dig into it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:702:21317: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:702
msgctxt "text_id=21317 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It wasn't Mizora, but if he was going to a nearby school, that would be... unfortunate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:707:21318: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:707
msgctxt "text_id=21318 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After all, if I also went to college nearby, I wouldn't be able to cut my ties with him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:737:21319: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:737
msgctxt "text_id=21319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki told me once."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:746:21320: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:746
msgctxt "text_id=21320 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Pretty sure Tobimaru's interested in you, Kuma."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:758:21321: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:758
msgctxt "text_id=21321 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  He only makes small talk with people he likes, right?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:796:21322: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:796
msgctxt "text_id=21322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I wanted to believe it was true."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:818:21323: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:818
msgctxt "text_id=21323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I mean, he even broke his arm to save me during the craziness this summer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:823:21324: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:823
msgctxt "text_id=21324 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I didn't know if Tsukiji had a girlfriend, but I was sure I had a chance if I asked him out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:850:21325: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:850
msgctxt "text_id=21325 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But... but..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:855:21326: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:855
msgctxt "text_id=21326 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Giving in felt like throwing away everything I'd fought for so far."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:872:21327: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:872
msgctxt "text_id=21327 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ever since I was a kid, I'd planned ahead. I used to look down on classmates who were obsessed with childish dreams and romance."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:898:21328: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:898
msgctxt "text_id=21328 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And now, here I was, actually willing to give up six long years of hard work for the dumbest of reasons."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:903:21329: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:903
msgctxt "text_id=21329 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That wasn't me. That wasn't the Kojika Kumari I was trying to become."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:943:21330: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_B_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:943
msgctxt "text_id=21330 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Earth to Kuma. You okay there?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:956:21331: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0003_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:956
msgctxt "text_id=21331 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Yeah, I just needed a moment to clear my head. I'm A-OK now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:970:21332: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0003_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:970
msgctxt "text_id=21332 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "I think I'll go say hi to Miss Kuonji.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:992:21333: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:992
msgctxt "text_id=21333 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...so I said, but I couldn't shake a slight tinge of regret."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:997:21334: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:997
msgctxt "text_id=21334 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I should've listened to Aozaki, instead of laughing through my nose when she said to wear something nice to the party."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1022:21335: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1022
msgctxt "text_id=21335 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1027:21336: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1027
msgctxt "text_id=21336 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Well, it's not like I had a nice dress to wear anyway, so there isn't much I could've done to impress him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1043:21337: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1043
msgctxt "text_id=21337 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I clapped my hands on my cheeks to get my head on straight, and tried to carry myself as I always did."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1128:21338: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1128
msgctxt "text_id=21338 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After greeting the mistress of the house, I went into the adjacent sunroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1152:21339: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1152
msgctxt "text_id=21339 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I recognized the other guests here, so there was no need for introductions."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1157:21340: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1157
msgctxt "text_id=21340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The sunroom and drawing room were connected, and you could see each room from the other."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1192:21341: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1192
msgctxt "text_id=21341 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji sat on a sofa in the drawing room, elegantly sipping a cup of tea."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1204:21342: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1204
msgctxt "text_id=21342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Chatting nearby were "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=21343 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Housuke and "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=21344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Housuke and "
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1225:21345: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1225
msgctxt "text_id=21345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Mr. Yamasiro--didn't expect to see him here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1287:21346: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1287
msgctxt "text_id=21346 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Ah, so those were oak trees in the backyard. We have 'nara' trees here in Japan, but hmm... I don't remember them looking like yours."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1299:21347: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1299
msgctxt "text_id=21347 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "  It must be a unique species. Japanese and British oaks look very different, and I understand that there are some four hundred or more species of oak.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1330:21348: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1330
msgctxt "text_id=21348 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"He's just dronin' on about the stuff he likes, as if anyone else actually cares. Fair warning, Alice--he's the kind of teacher who doesn't give a damn what students think, so you're better off ignoring him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1342:21349: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1342
msgctxt "text_id=21349 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  Never mind that. Want to do anything over winter break?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1355:21350: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_B_1_B_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1355
msgctxt "text_id=21350 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  You don't seem like much of a skier. I could teach you how, if you want.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1381:21351: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1381
msgctxt "text_id=21351 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Can't either of you talk about something interesting for once?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1392:21352: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1392
msgctxt "text_id=21352 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  It's like listening to a pair of woodpeckers.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1444:21353: voice_id=BA0_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1444
msgctxt "text_id=21353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Hahaha! You're putting these front doors on the same level as those pecking, blathering, birdbrains?! Better than Sono-G, I guess, but only slightly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1475:21354: voice_id=BA0_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1475
msgctxt "text_id=21354 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Still, I'm way better than either of them! And all I do is live or die!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1514:21355: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1514
msgctxt "text_id=21355 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...What's wrong with that fat bird?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1546:21356: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1546
msgctxt "text_id=21356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was a blue robin flitting to and fro around Miss Kuonji's head, chirping adorably."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1551:21357: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1551
msgctxt "text_id=21357 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But whenever it tried to land on her shoulder, she batted it away. Is that how she raised her pets?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1587:21358: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1587
msgctxt "text_id=21358 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki was nowhere to be seen. She was probably in the kitchen or bathroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1592:21359: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1592
msgctxt "text_id=21359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With nobody to talk to, I took a seat and let my thoughts wander, until..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1616:21360: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1616
msgctxt "text_id=21360 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Hey, Kumari. Did they invite you too?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1622:21361: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1622
msgctxt "text_id=21361 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Work get out late today?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1640:21362: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1640
msgctxt "text_id=21362 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1645:21363: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1645
msgctxt "text_id=21363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji kicked off a conversation in his usual, casual way."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1650:21364: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1650
msgctxt "text_id=21364 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  His slender arms were picturesque, even while holding a glass of juice."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1676:21365: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1676
msgctxt "text_id=21365 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I'm off work today. Took three whole days off, actually. I'm on track to hit my budget, anyway.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1711:21366: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1711
msgctxt "text_id=21366 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Nice! So the countdown's ticking until liftoff from Misaki, eh?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1718:21367: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0003_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1718
msgctxt "text_id=21367 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "I guess we won't be saying good morning to each other at the corner store anymore."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1730:21368: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0003_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1730
msgctxt "text_id=21368 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Wait. Wasn't it you who dumped water on me for trying to smoke once?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1787:21369: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1787
msgctxt "text_id=21369 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That took me back."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1792:21370: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1792
msgctxt "text_id=21370 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Back in my freshman year, there was a student cocky enough to smoke in my store's parking lot."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1797:21371: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1797
msgctxt "text_id=21371 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was from a different school, but that didn't matter. I ran up to him, warned him, then hosed him down with water. Can you believe I did that to a stranger?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1802:21372: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1802
msgctxt "text_id=21372 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I got flustered and tried to apologize, but the boy was already reaching for another cigarette before I even finished."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1807:21373: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1807
msgctxt "text_id=21373 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He'd turned out to be Tobimaru Tsukiji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1841:21374: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1841
msgctxt "text_id=21374 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Man, I really didn't expect to see you again, much less in the student council room. Maybe that's my destiny? To get sprayed with water by girls I like.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1852:21375: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1852
msgctxt "text_id=21375 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Life's just like that sometimes. When did you get here, Tsukiji?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1878:21376: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1878
msgctxt "text_id=21376 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"We've been here since morning. Kinomi got a bug in his ass, so I didn't have a choice."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1889:21377: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1889
msgctxt "text_id=21377 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  The birthday party isn't 'til six, so we've still got plenty of time."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1895:21378: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1895
msgctxt "text_id=21378 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  If you're tired, why don't you go take a nap in one of the rooms? You look pretty pale.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1933:21379: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1933
msgctxt "text_id=21379 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1938:21380: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1938
msgctxt "text_id=21380 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If I had to describe the most unfair aspect of Tsukiji, it was his ability to be sensitive even while coming off as rude."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1943:21381: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1943
msgctxt "text_id=21381 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For my part, I was way too shy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1948:21382: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1948
msgctxt "text_id=21382 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It took a serious effort to talk to a lot of people in a new place, even if I already knew them."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1975:21383: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1975
msgctxt "text_id=21383 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Yeah. Good idea. I'll go take a break.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:1995:21384: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:1995
msgctxt "text_id=21384 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"That's the spirit. Which one was your room again...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2007:21385: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2007
msgctxt "text_id=21385 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Hey, Toby! Do you know where Soujyuro went?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2018:21386: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2018
msgctxt "text_id=21386 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Shopping, I think."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2024:21387: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2024
msgctxt "text_id=21387 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Said something about needing more drinks.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2050:21388: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2050
msgctxt "text_id=21388 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Well, he coulda said something! I wish he wouldn't try to do everything by himself all the time."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2061:21389: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2061
msgctxt "text_id=21389 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Not that I got anything against lone wolves!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2105:21390: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2105
msgctxt "text_id=21390 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As I mentioned earlier, the blond boy's name was Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2118:21391: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2118
msgctxt "text_id=21391 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I didn't know his full name, nor had he ever formally introduced himself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2123:21392: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2123
msgctxt "text_id=21392 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji, Aozaki, and Sizuki all called him Beo, so I just followed their lead."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2128:21393: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2128
msgctxt "text_id=21393 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He seemed to be fond of Sizuki. Whenever he had a chance, you'd hear him go,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2166:21394: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2166
msgctxt "text_id=21394 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Soujyuro, I want to go to a theme park the next time you're on break.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2177:21395: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0004; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2177
msgctxt "text_id=21395 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Soujyuro, are you hungry? Let's go out for lunch!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2188:21396: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_B_1_B_0005; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2188
msgctxt "text_id=21396 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Soujyuro, could you pat me on the head? No real reason, I just want you to.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2225:21397: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2225
msgctxt "text_id=21397 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And so on. He clung to him like a cat to a curtain."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2230:21398: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2230
msgctxt "text_id=21398 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Was Sizuki even the kind of person that was popular with kids? All the \"Soujyuro, Soujyuro\" every day was starting to grate on me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2278:21399: scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2278
msgctxt "text_id=21399 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Anyway, I went to find my guest room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2284:21400: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_B_1_B_0011; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2284
msgctxt "text_id=21400 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Kumari, do you know where your room is?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1_B:2290:21401: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_1_B_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_1_B
#: WIK_B_1_B:2290
msgctxt "text_id=21401 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I asked Aozaki earlier. She'll be back in about thirty minutes.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1:33:21402: scene=WIK_B_1
#: WIK_B_1:33
msgctxt "text_id=21402 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At the very least, I should greet the mansion's owner and the guests."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1:38:21403: scene=WIK_B_1
#: WIK_B_1:38
msgctxt "text_id=21403 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I decided to head straight to the drawing room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1:48:21404: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_1
#: WIK_B_1:48
msgctxt "text_id=21404 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Come on. Pretty much everyone's here already.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1:53:21405: scene=WIK_B_1
#: WIK_B_1:53
msgctxt "text_id=21405 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The corridor of the east wing's first floor was dimly lit."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_1:58:21406: scene=WIK_B_1
#: WIK_B_1:58
msgctxt "text_id=21406 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could hear the sound of friendly chatter from beyond the door ahead."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:24:21407: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:24
msgctxt "text_id=21407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'll check out the guest room first."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:45:21408: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:45
msgctxt "text_id=21408 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Housuke, give me back my luggage. I'm going to go look at my room. Where're the guest rooms, Aozaki?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:51:21409: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_2_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:51
msgctxt "text_id=21409 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Second floor of the east wing. Yours is the second one down."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:57:21410: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_2_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:57
msgctxt "text_id=21410 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  It's unlocked. But there's a key on the desk in there, so go ahead and use it to lock the door on your way out.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:77:21411: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:77
msgctxt "text_id=21411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I nodded before making my way to the stairs."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:104:21412: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:104
msgctxt "text_id=21412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  On the second floor, I found my room"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:109:21413: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:109
msgctxt "text_id=21413 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  as described."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:159:21414: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:159
msgctxt "text_id=21414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was unoccupied."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:164:21415: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:164
msgctxt "text_id=21415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I checked to make sure I was alone, then put down my luggage and stowed my wallet in a pocket."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:169:21416: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:169
msgctxt "text_id=21416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I considered keeping my favorite bunny-shaped commuter pass--and lucky charm--with me, but all it contained was a yearly school festival photo anyway. I left it on the table."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:174:21417: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:174
msgctxt "text_id=21417 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was going to be spending the night in an unfamiliar building. It was best to travel light."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:195:21418: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_2_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:195
msgctxt "text_id=21418 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Where's that key...? Oh, here it is.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:201:21419: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:201
msgctxt "text_id=21419 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was a brass key, with an old-fashioned and elaborate design that perfectly complemented the mansion's European theme."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:230:21420: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:230
msgctxt "text_id=21420 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I stepped back into the second-floor corridor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:265:21421: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:265
msgctxt "text_id=21421 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In the corner of my eye, I spotted an old man in the hall."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:270:21422: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:270
msgctxt "text_id=21422 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Must be one of the guests. I set off in his direction to greet him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:319:21423: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_2_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:319
msgctxt "text_id=21423 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:324:21424: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:324
msgctxt "text_id=21424 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As soon as I did,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:329:21425: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:329
msgctxt "text_id=21425 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  the old man had vanished. I checked the foyer downstairs, but he wasn't there either."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:350:21426: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_2_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:350
msgctxt "text_id=21426 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Maybe he went to the west wing.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:355:21427: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:355
msgctxt "text_id=21427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was a little concerning, but it would've been rude to wander around the house without greeting the owner first."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_2:360:21428: scene=WIK_B_2
#: WIK_B_2:360
msgctxt "text_id=21428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I headed for the east wing drawing room, where laughter was ringing from within."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:33:21429: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:33
msgctxt "text_id=21429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I decided to do something completely meaningless."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:39:21430: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:39
msgctxt "text_id=21430 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Honestly, I didn't mean anything by it. It wasn't even a sudden idea―just a whim, a flight of fancy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:63:21431: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_3_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:63
msgctxt "text_id=21431 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I think I dropped something. I'm going to go look outside, so head on to the drawing room without me.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:74:21432: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_3_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:74
msgctxt "text_id=21432 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"You're going outside? I'll come with you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:112:21433: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_B_3_0000_0; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:112
msgctxt "text_id=21433 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Aw c'mon. Kojika's the klutz, so let her deal with it herself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:123:21434: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_B_3_0000_1; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:123
msgctxt "text_id=21434 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  You should come with me, prez. I won't know what to talk with Alice about if you aren't there.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:164:21435: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_3_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:164
msgctxt "text_id=21435 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Huh? But I shouldn't let Kuma go by her―\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:192:21436: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_B_3_0000; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:192
msgctxt "text_id=21436 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Would you mind taking us to the drawing room first, Aozaki? It's a little chilly here in the foyer.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:218:21437: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_B_3_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:218
msgctxt "text_id=21437 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"But I really shouldn't leave a guest alone.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:229:21438: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_3_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:229
msgctxt "text_id=21438 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"It's fine, really. I'll be back before you know it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:241:21439: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_3_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:241
msgctxt "text_id=21439 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  Housuke, give me my luggage. I can handle it from here.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:316:21440: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:316
msgctxt "text_id=21440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I left the others behind and headed outside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:321:21441: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:321
msgctxt "text_id=21441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aimlessly, I wandered the woods near the mansion, gawking like a tourist."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:326:21442: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:326
msgctxt "text_id=21442 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  No one was around, and the sky was getting increasingly cloudy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:332:21443: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_B_3_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:332
msgctxt "text_id=21443 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Hm?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:337:21444: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:337
msgctxt "text_id=21444 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That was strange. I felt like someone was watching me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_B_3:342:21445: scene=WIK_B_3
#: WIK_B_3:342
msgctxt "text_id=21445 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_C:8:21446: scene=WIK_SELECT_C
#: WIK_SELECT_C:8
msgctxt "text_id=21446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision C-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:23:21447: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:23
msgctxt "text_id=21447 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...Time to find out who that was."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:28:21448: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:28
msgctxt "text_id=21448 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It went against my better judgment, but I decided to track down whoever had been watching me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:59:21449: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:59
msgctxt "text_id=21449 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I headed around to the rear of the mansion, where there was a small thicket."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:64:21450: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:64
msgctxt "text_id=21450 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It looked only slightly better kept than the woods surrounding the estate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:70:21451: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:70
msgctxt "text_id=21451 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:78:21452: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:78
msgctxt "text_id=21452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I saw a woman. She looked terribly out of place."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:115:21453: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0000; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:115
msgctxt "text_id=21453 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Hello, there. Are you one of today's guests?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:120:21454: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:120
msgctxt "text_id=21454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Instinctively, I backed away."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:125:21455: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:125
msgctxt "text_id=21455 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That was how overwhelming her presence was."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:162:21456: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:162
msgctxt "text_id=21456 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The leaves crinkled and crunched as my heels trampled them"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:167:21457: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:167
msgctxt "text_id=21457 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  during my hasty retreat."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:172:21458: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:172
msgctxt "text_id=21458 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The woman watched me with amusement, as if observing a small animal."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:221:21459: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0001; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:221
msgctxt "text_id=21459 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"I didn't expect much from their guests, but how mistaken I was! Here you are, a feast for my eyes!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:233:21460: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0002; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:233
msgctxt "text_id=21460 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I have to say, Aoko might actually have some taste after all. This will make things much more interesting.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:239:21461: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:239
msgctxt "text_id=21461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The way she looked at me was a little―no, *incredibly* off-putting."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:244:21462: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:244
msgctxt "text_id=21462 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Where are the police when you need them?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:272:21463: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0003; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:272
msgctxt "text_id=21463 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"No need to be alarmed. I'm a guest just like you. Let's be friends."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:285:21464: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0004; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:285
msgctxt "text_id=21464 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  To be frank, I didn't expect anyone else to be checking out the lay of the land, before things *go down*."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:297:21465: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0005; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:297
msgctxt "text_id=21465 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  Oh, I like you. I like you, and you're cute... so here's a freebie."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:309:21466: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0006; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:309
msgctxt "text_id=21466 | speaker=touko"
msgid "  I normally can't see very well. I'm in Aozaki's room. And, I'm not the culprit.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:315:21467: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_C_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:315
msgctxt "text_id=21467 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:342:21468: speaker=touko; speaker_ja=橙子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A20_WIK_C_1_0007; voice_prefix=A20; voice_category=11; scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:342
msgctxt "text_id=21468 | speaker=touko"
msgid "\"Trust me, it'll come in handy. Just keep a lid on it, okay?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:352:21469: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:352
msgctxt "text_id=21469 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And with those strange words, the woman walked off in the direction of the mansion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:358:21470: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:358
msgctxt "text_id=21470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I didn't feel like following her, so I reentered the house from the front door."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:418:21471: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:418
msgctxt "text_id=21471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Once in the foyer, I could hear laughter coming from the east wing drawing room, to my right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:423:21472: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:423
msgctxt "text_id=21472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd kept Aozaki waiting long enough."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_1:428:21473: scene=WIK_C_1
#: WIK_C_1:428
msgctxt "text_id=21473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Picking up my luggage, I made my way over."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_2:48:21474: scene=WIK_C_2
#: WIK_C_2:48
msgctxt "text_id=21474 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...Something clearly wasn't right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_2:53:21475: scene=WIK_C_2
#: WIK_C_2:53
msgctxt "text_id=21475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I recalled this place's reputation as a haunted mansion, but firmly resolved to put that out of my mind. Still, if I was going to explore, it was best not to go alone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_2:85:21476: scene=WIK_C_2
#: WIK_C_2:85
msgctxt "text_id=21476 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Returning to the foyer, I could hear laughter coming from the east wing drawing room, to my right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_C_2:90:21477: scene=WIK_C_2
#: WIK_C_2:90
msgctxt "text_id=21477 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I picked up my luggage and made my way over."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:57:21478: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:57
msgctxt "text_id=21478 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Oh, dear.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:63:21479: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:63
msgctxt "text_id=21479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We were on the third floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:68:21480: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:68
msgctxt "text_id=21480 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A hellish scene greeted us in the attic directly above the hall."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:88:21481: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:88
msgctxt "text_id=21481 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In the center of the room was Yurihiko Tokitsu..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:106:21482: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:106
msgctxt "text_id=21482 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...or so we believed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:111:21483: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:111
msgctxt "text_id=21483 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The faceless body had been burned, and most of its limbs mangled."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:116:21484: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:116
msgctxt "text_id=21484 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Only the torso remained in a vaguely recognizable shape."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:121:21485: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:121
msgctxt "text_id=21485 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A burning stench filled the air inside the soot-covered walls."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:171:21486: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:171
msgctxt "text_id=21486 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"...Can't tell whose face that is anymore, but that's definitely the old man's suitcase.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:183:21487: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:183
msgctxt "text_id=21487 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Forget it! I ain't looking!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:193:21488: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:193
msgctxt "text_id=21488 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Good old Tokie. Grandiose even in death.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:203:21489: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:203
msgctxt "text_id=21489 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"I'm in the mood for barbeque now.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:213:21490: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:213
msgctxt "text_id=21490 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Hey, was the room locked?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:223:21491: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:223
msgctxt "text_id=21491 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"No, Soujyuro's room―I mean, the attic doesn't have a lock. Anyone can come in.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:248:21492: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:248
msgctxt "text_id=21492 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Well, shit. Looks like an explosion killed him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:254:21493: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:254
msgctxt "text_id=21493 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I don't see any source of the combustion, though... did Yurihiko like playing with explosives? I wouldn't put it past an artist.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:287:21494: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:287
msgctxt "text_id=21494 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Let's all just calm down. I think this was premeditated. This is a crime scene.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:302:21495: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP2START_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:302
msgctxt "text_id=21495 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Is this flour?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:336:21496: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:336
msgctxt "text_id=21496 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Housuke remained on the second floor, trembling."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:341:21497: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:341
msgctxt "text_id=21497 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The rest of us took turns surveying the scene."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:378:21498: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:378
msgctxt "text_id=21498 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Nobody touch anything, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:399:21499: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:399
msgctxt "text_id=21499 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Look around in pairs, and make sure the other person doesn't do anything suspicious."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:420:21500: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:420
msgctxt "text_id=21500 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Allie, do you mind if I call the police? Thanks. I'll go use the phone in the foyer.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:445:21501: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:445
msgctxt "text_id=21501 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Following the orders of a now quite animated Ritsuka, we moved about in pairs."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:450:21502: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:450
msgctxt "text_id=21502 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Since Housuke ran off, I ended up paired with Tsukiji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:485:21503: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:485
msgctxt "text_id=21503 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Damn. What a way to go out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:491:21504: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:491
msgctxt "text_id=21504 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Who kills someone with an explosion?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:500:21505: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:500
msgctxt "text_id=21505 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was surprised Tsukiji already saw this as a murder."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:526:21506: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:526
msgctxt "text_id=21506 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...You don't think it was an accident?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:538:21507: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:538
msgctxt "text_id=21507 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"No, I don't. There's zero chance Tokitsu would handle explosives in the Kuonji house.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:565:21508: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:565
msgctxt "text_id=21508 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Just look at his torso. There are faint scorch marks around his waist. Could be rope burns."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:571:21509: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:571
msgctxt "text_id=21509 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  It's possible he was tied up and held prisoner.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:582:21510: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:582
msgctxt "text_id=21510 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:602:21511: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:602
msgctxt "text_id=21511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tied up and killed with a bomb without anyone noticing...?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:613:21512: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:613
msgctxt "text_id=21512 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"But, why?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:625:21513: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:625
msgctxt "text_id=21513 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Why indeed. Who would go through this much trouble?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:638:21514: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:638
msgctxt "text_id=21514 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "I suppose the advantage of using explosives is... you can detonate them remotely at a time of your choosing. Helps with creating an alibi.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:663:21515: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:663
msgctxt "text_id=21515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Wow."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:668:21516: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:668
msgctxt "text_id=21516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Dead body or not, Tsukiji didn't skip a beat."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:673:21517: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:673
msgctxt "text_id=21517 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He stayed calm and composed as he analyzed the situation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:678:21518: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:678
msgctxt "text_id=21518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At times like this, he seemed so perfect."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:683:21519: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:683
msgctxt "text_id=21519 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Actually, whenever I saw him get serious about anything, he was so damned cool."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:710:21520: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:710
msgctxt "text_id=21520 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"But now, I know what the murder weapon was: bread.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:721:21521: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:721
msgctxt "text_id=21521 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:726:21522: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:726
msgctxt "text_id=21522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A voice called out to us from below."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:747:21523: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:747
msgctxt "text_id=21523 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Down here, everyone! We've got a problem!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:753:21524: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:753
msgctxt "text_id=21524 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  The phone line is out!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:776:21525: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:776
msgctxt "text_id=21525 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji and I looked at each other."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:788:21526: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP2START_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:788
msgctxt "text_id=21526 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"We should check it out, Kumari.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:798:21527: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:798
msgctxt "text_id=21527 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I nodded, and we exited the attic together."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:820:21528: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:820
msgctxt "text_id=21528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Father Eiri closed and locked the door behind us after we returned to the second floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:868:21529: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:868
msgctxt "text_id=21529 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The sound of the rain was deafening."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:873:21530: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:873
msgctxt "text_id=21530 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We gathered around the telephone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:899:21531: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP2START_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:899
msgctxt "text_id=21531 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"The phone's disconnected. Or rather, the line itself has been cut. We can't call anyone, let alone the police.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:908:21532: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:908
msgctxt "text_id=21532 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"I'll go tell them in person.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:917:21533: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP2START_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:917
msgctxt "text_id=21533 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"No, wait. We shouldn't go off on our own for the time being. Besides, look outside.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:937:21534: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:937
msgctxt "text_id=21534 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The priest pointed toward the skylight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1000:21535: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1000
msgctxt "text_id=21535 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Raindrops struck the glass hard in a thunderous cadence."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1005:21536: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1005
msgctxt "text_id=21536 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At this point, we were in the midst of a full-blown storm."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1010:21537: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1010
msgctxt "text_id=21537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We'd all come on foot, so it would be risky to go back down the mountain in this weather."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1030:21538: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1030
msgctxt "text_id=21538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  However, Father Eiri hadn't stopped Sizuki for his own safety."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1035:21539: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1035
msgctxt "text_id=21539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If someone wandered off by themselves, those left behind would be in a precarious position."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1040:21540: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1040
msgctxt "text_id=21540 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For instance, it would be easy to destroy evidence without any witnesses around."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1066:21541: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP2START_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1066
msgctxt "text_id=21541 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"For now, let's all head to the drawing room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1072:21542: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP2START_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1072
msgctxt "text_id=21542 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  We should talk over what happened until we can call the police.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1130:21543: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1130
msgctxt "text_id=21543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone agreed with the priest."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1170:21544: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1170
msgctxt "text_id=21544 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone, except Housuke. He seemed to be waiting for someone to reveal that this was all an elaborate prank."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1220:21545: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP2START_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1220
msgctxt "text_id=21545 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1225:21546: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1225
msgctxt "text_id=21546 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Feeling a slight chill, I glanced at the front door."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1230:21547: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1230
msgctxt "text_id=21547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...Just faintly, I had the sense that something was off."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1235:21548: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1235
msgctxt "text_id=21548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Outside, the rain became a torrent."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP2START:1240:21549: scene=WIK_CHAP2START
#: WIK_CHAP2START:1240
msgctxt "text_id=21549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With my mind in a haze, I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_F:8:21550: scene=WIK_SELECT_F
#: WIK_SELECT_F:8
msgctxt "text_id=21550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision F-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:138:21551: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:138
msgctxt "text_id=21551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We began a manhunt for Mr. Yamasiro."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:152:21552: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:152
msgctxt "text_id=21552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Once we'd separated into groups to scour the mansion, Ritsuka, in charge of the second-floor guest rooms, called us together."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:177:21553: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:177
msgctxt "text_id=21553 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"This is Mr. Yamasiro's room. Is it locked?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:187:21554: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0000_0; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:187
msgctxt "text_id=21554 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"No, it's not. When he wasn't inside, I took a peek inside,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:201:21555: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0000_1; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:201
msgctxt "text_id=21555 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid " and, well...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:207:21556: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:207
msgctxt "text_id=21556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka trailed off."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:212:21557: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:212
msgctxt "text_id=21557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Was it my imagination or is she stifling a laugh?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:241:21558: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:241
msgctxt "text_id=21558 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Just take a look for yourselves. Then we can talk.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:260:21559: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:260
msgctxt "text_id=21559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Following Ritsuka's direction, we stepped into the room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:332:21560: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:332
msgctxt "text_id=21560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Inside..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:338:21561: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:338
msgctxt "text_id=21561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was a field of flowers."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:408:21562: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:408
msgctxt "text_id=21562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In its center lay the body of Mr. Yamasiro."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:461:21563: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:461
msgctxt "text_id=21563 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What's with that pose?! Is he supposed to be a pharaoh or something?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:467:21564: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:467
msgctxt "text_id=21564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki desperately tried not to laugh."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:495:21565: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:495
msgctxt "text_id=21565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It took a serious effort from me, too."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:500:21566: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:500
msgctxt "text_id=21566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Inappropriately, I couldn't help but see the image of Mr. Yamasiro lying serenely on a bed of flowers more as a Kouhaku new year's singing contestant than as a coffin viewing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:529:21567: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:529
msgctxt "text_id=21567 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Oh, dear. Mr. Yamasiro always seemed so normal."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:535:21568: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:535
msgctxt "text_id=21568 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  But this does raise some questions.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:550:21569: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:550
msgctxt "text_id=21569 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"This has to be a sick joke. How can a schoolteacher die in a more flamboyant way than I live?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:594:21570: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:594
msgctxt "text_id=21570 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Let's leave this here for now. People deserve their dignity, even in death."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:607:21571: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:607
msgctxt "text_id=21571 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  If another person passes away, I ask you all treat it with more gravity. Is that clear?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:631:21572: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:631
msgctxt "text_id=21572 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Forgive me. I shouldn't have been so facetious."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:642:21573: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:642
msgctxt "text_id=21573 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  You're so reliable at times like these, Sister.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:655:21574: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:655
msgctxt "text_id=21574 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"I'm simply being a responsible adult. You should also conduct yourself in a manner befitting a student supervisor, Father.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:690:21575: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:690
msgctxt "text_id=21575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The room felt colder after Sister Yuika's scolding."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:695:21576: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:695
msgctxt "text_id=21576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After we finished examining the room, Miss Kuonji locked it behind us, and we returned to the drawing room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:779:21577: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:779
msgctxt "text_id=21577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A somber mood settled over the parlor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:784:21578: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:784
msgctxt "text_id=21578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The gloom wasn't from any sense of grief,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:789:21579: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:789
msgctxt "text_id=21579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  but rather a certain feeling that pervaded the group after we split into pairs-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:795:21580: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:795
msgctxt "text_id=21580 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Suspicion between the teams."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:822:21581: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:822
msgctxt "text_id=21581 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"There was no evidence of a struggle in the guest room. Either Mr. Yamasiro invited them in, or they invited themselves in before he arrived."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:834:21582: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:834
msgctxt "text_id=21582 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Either way, he likely knew them and was taken by surprise."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:834:21583: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:834
msgctxt "text_id=21583 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Mr. Yamasiro probably didn't know the rules, so maybe it was easy to make him laugh...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:854:21584: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:854
msgctxt "text_id=21584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji spoke to everyone in the room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:859:21585: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:859
msgctxt "text_id=21585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Usually, Father Eiri was the one leading the discussion, but now that he was silent, maybe Tsukiji felt he had to step up."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:895:21586: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:895
msgctxt "text_id=21586 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What's gotten into you, Tobimaru? You're normally more direct than this."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:901:21587: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:901
msgctxt "text_id=21587 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Where are you going with all this?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:913:21588: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:913
msgctxt "text_id=21588 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Oh, it's just that aside from Kuonji and the people from the Church, you, Kumari, and I all knew Mr. Yamasiro well."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:925:21589: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:925
msgctxt "text_id=21589 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  That blockhead wasn't the kind of guy to give you a big belly laugh at your jokes.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:965:21590: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:965
msgctxt "text_id=21590 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:970:21591: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:970
msgctxt "text_id=21591 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Mr. Yamasiro smiled a lot and was easygoing, but he was neutral to a fault. He never responded strongly to people's opinions, almost to the point of utter indifference."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:975:21592: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:975
msgctxt "text_id=21592 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For him to laugh hard, he must've been taken by surprise, like victims on prank TV shows."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1002:21593: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1002
msgctxt "text_id=21593 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"We can figure out how they made him laugh later."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1014:21594: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1014
msgctxt "text_id=21594 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Someone's out to get us. Enough of the friendly chit-chat. Let's get to the real issue.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1023:21595: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1023
msgctxt "text_id=21595 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Agreed. Who among us is the most likely suspect?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1029:21596: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1029
msgctxt "text_id=21596 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  We should narrow it down.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1065:21597: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1065
msgctxt "text_id=21597 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I don't think anybody wanted to hear that, but we all knew it needed to happen."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1070:21598: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1070
msgctxt "text_id=21598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was no way around it anymore."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1075:21599: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1075
msgctxt "text_id=21599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Someone here intentionally made both Mr. Tokitsu and Mr. Yamasiro laugh."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1080:21600: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1080
msgctxt "text_id=21600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In Tokitsu's case, they even used explosives... wait."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1116:21601: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1116
msgctxt "text_id=21601 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Um, I know it's a little late to bring this up now, but the way Mr. Tokitsu died...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1127:21602: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1127
msgctxt "text_id=21602 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Right. Probably death by bread.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1138:21603: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1138
msgctxt "text_id=21603 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Makes sense in a way. Tokie did once say that if it wasn't for flour, he'd have saved the world with avant-garde art.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1186:21604: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1186
msgctxt "text_id=21604 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji scratched his head apologetically."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1191:21605: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1191
msgctxt "text_id=21605 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He looked frustrated with himself for thinking so much about the time of death and the identity of the killer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1196:21606: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1196
msgctxt "text_id=21606 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I guess he did have a more sensitive side."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1233:21607: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1233
msgctxt "text_id=21607 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"I don't believe we need to hunt for the culprit."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1245:21608: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1245
msgctxt "text_id=21608 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  If this is the work of a Ploy Kickshaw, that makes Alice Kuonji the prime suspect, followed by Aoko Aozaki, and May Riddell Archelot."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1257:21609: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1257
msgctxt "text_id=21609 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  Humans naturally laugh when their sides are prodded or the soles of their feet are tickled. There are ways to get the answers we seek... physically.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1306:21610: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1306
msgctxt "text_id=21610 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Calm down, Yui."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1318:21611: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1318
msgctxt "text_id=21611 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  We should try to keep cool. No fighting. The culprit's probably counting on us to argue."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1330:21612: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1330
msgctxt "text_id=21612 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Let's think of this more like a mystery novel and start by checking everyone's alibis, okay? No *physical* interrogations!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1339:21613: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1339
msgctxt "text_id=21613 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"I agree with Ritsuka. We can use your method as a last resort, Sister. Remember, we have innocent students here in attendance as well.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1388:21614: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1388
msgctxt "text_id=21614 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Could we wait a bit before we start checking alibis?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1399:21615: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1399
msgctxt "text_id=21615 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Before that... um, Sweets Hearts, was it? I'd like to hear more about that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1405:21616: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1405
msgctxt "text_id=21616 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Kuonji, tell us all you know."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1437:21617: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1437
msgctxt "text_id=21617 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  We need to understand what it is.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1477:21618: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1477
msgctxt "text_id=21618 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"I suppose you're right. I didn't explain the essentials."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1489:21619: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1489
msgctxt "text_id=21619 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Sweets Hearts is an egg-shaped pudding. It kind of looks like a hardboiled egg on top of an upside-down crown.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1640:21620: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1640
msgctxt "text_id=21620 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"That's novel. This is the first murder mystery I've heard of where the weapon was a pudding.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1678:21621: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1678
msgctxt "text_id=21621 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Am I surrounded by idiots?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1690:21622: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1690
msgctxt "text_id=21622 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  That's merely how it appears before it activates. Sweets Hearts becomes a doppelganger of the person who eats it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1717:21623: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1717
msgctxt "text_id=21623 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"To be precise, whoever eats Sweets Hearts is imprisoned inside the egg; outside, the doppelganger appears."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1723:21624: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1723
msgctxt "text_id=21624 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  So once Sweets Hearts is activated, it'll be in human form.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1781:21625: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1781
msgctxt "text_id=21625 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"So, basically you're saying a person gets swapped with an imposter, right?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1790:21626: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1790
msgctxt "text_id=21626 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Let me correct myself. Only Tobimaru isn't a complete idiot."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1801:21627: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1801
msgctxt "text_id=21627 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  That's right. Sweets Hearts is a Ploy that transforms into its user. A perfect replica―so perfect, it doesn't realize what it is.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1827:21628: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1827
msgctxt "text_id=21628 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Too perfect, you could say."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1838:21629: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0008; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1838
msgctxt "text_id=21629 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  No matter how much you question or torture the suspect, without objective, absolute proof, they won't be exposed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1850:21630: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_CHAP3START_0009; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1850
msgctxt "text_id=21630 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Once evidence is presented to them, they finally realize that they are the Sweets Hearts in question.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1909:21631: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1909
msgctxt "text_id=21631 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Oh my god! It's a classic logic puzzle!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1916:21632: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1916
msgctxt "text_id=21632 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I can't take it anymore! This is so awesome!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1927:21633: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1927
msgctxt "text_id=21633 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"It's said the best spies learn to convince themselves they're not spies, but this... is troublesome.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1940:21634: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1940
msgctxt "text_id=21634 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"That doesn't sound quite right. The culprit wants us to laugh, no? If they don't know who they are, what would be the point?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:1986:21635: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:1986
msgctxt "text_id=21635 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Sweets Hearts and its proxy human can switch on and off."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2001:21636: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2001
msgctxt "text_id=21636 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Though normally a perfect doppelganger, its own personality can emerge when certain conditions are met."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2015:21637: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2015
msgctxt "text_id=21637 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Of course, when it has the personality of its proxy, it has no memory of being activated.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2050:21638: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2050
msgctxt "text_id=21638 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  What kind of setup was this?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2055:21639: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2055
msgctxt "text_id=21639 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  So, we were dealing with a formless butcher. A murderer with no ill intent."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2060:21640: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2060
msgctxt "text_id=21640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That meant the murderer could be anyone... even me!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2065:21641: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2065
msgctxt "text_id=21641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Any one of us could be Sweets Hearts!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2095:21642: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2095
msgctxt "text_id=21642 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Everyone, relax. Just keep calm."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2110:21643: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2110
msgctxt "text_id=21643 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  If we start having too much fun, or start fighting, or get tired of this and try to go home, we're as good as dead.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2119:21644: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2119
msgctxt "text_id=21644 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"If anyone needs to calm down, it's you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2166:21645: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2166
msgctxt "text_id=21645 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"But how can I be calm in a situation like this?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2190:21646: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0011_0; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2190
msgctxt "text_id=21646 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "@o  If this is a dream, I don't want to wake up! At least half the group needs to ^die to really spice things up! And then, once I'm the last one left alive..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2251:21647: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP3START_0011_1; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2251
msgctxt "text_id=21647 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "Ack!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2293:21648: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2293
msgctxt "text_id=21648 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Wow. Talk about a crazy Ploy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2299:21649: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2299
msgctxt "text_id=21649 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I guess all we can do at this point is check everyone's alibis.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2308:21650: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0011; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2308
msgctxt "text_id=21650 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Right. We might not be able to pin Sweets Hearts, but we might be able to figure out who committed the murders.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2334:21651: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0012; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2334
msgctxt "text_id=21651 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Let's testify one by one. We should go over everything we did today. If anything seems inconsistent, don't hold back."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2345:21652: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0013; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2345
msgctxt "text_id=21652 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  I guess I'll start, then.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2379:21653: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2379
msgctxt "text_id=21653 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  No one objected to Tsukiji's initiative."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2384:21654: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2384
msgctxt "text_id=21654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If he didn't want to go first, he'd look suspicious."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2430:21655: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0014; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2430
msgctxt "text_id=21655 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Beo, Kinomi, Yurihiko, and I all came here at ten this morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2442:21656: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0015; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2442
msgctxt "text_id=21656 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  After saying hi to Kuonji, we each went to our rooms to rest, then met again at 11 o'clock in the drawing room and had lunch."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2454:21657: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0016; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2454
msgctxt "text_id=21657 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Oh, yeah. Around that time, Yurihiko went missing.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2481:21658: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0017; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2481
msgctxt "text_id=21658 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Aozaki, Mr. Yamasiro, and Kumari arrived in the afternoon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2493:21659: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0018; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2493
msgctxt "text_id=21659 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Then, in the evening, Riddell barged in uninvited."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2505:21660: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0019; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2505
msgctxt "text_id=21660 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  I went to the bathroom a few times, but besides that I was here in the drawing room and the sunroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2517:21661: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP3START_0020; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2517
msgctxt "text_id=21661 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  During that period, the only person who never left the parlor was Kuonji.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2555:21662: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2555
msgctxt "text_id=21662 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"This morning, I went shopping in town, then met Kumari straight away in the afternoon. For some reason, Mr. Yamasiro was also there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2567:21663: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2567
msgctxt "text_id=21663 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  The three of us arrived at the mansion sometime after two."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2579:21664: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2579
msgctxt "text_id=21664 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  After saying hello to Tobimaru in the drawing room, I spent the rest of the time between there and the sunroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2591:21665: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP3START_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2591
msgctxt "text_id=21665 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I left a few times for the restroom, but I didn't see Tokie once.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2629:21666: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_CHAP3START_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2629
msgctxt "text_id=21666 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Huh? Do I have to go too? Whatever, but my story's the same as everyone else's."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2641:21667: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_CHAP3START_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2641
msgctxt "text_id=21667 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Y'know, it's a long weekend, so I hit Toby up and spent the night at his house yesterday. Housuke was there, too, so it was wild."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2653:21668: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_CHAP3START_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2653
msgctxt "text_id=21668 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  In the morning, we all went to the park together to meet up with the old guy, before coming here in a sweet Rolls-Royce."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2665:21669: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_CHAP3START_0003; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2665
msgctxt "text_id=21669 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  At ten, I said what's up to Alice. Since then, I've just been here chilling the whole time!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP3START:2698:21670: scene=WIK_CHAP3START
#: WIK_CHAP3START:2698
msgctxt "text_id=21670 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_I:8:21671: scene=WIK_SELECT_I
#: WIK_SELECT_I:8
msgctxt "text_id=21671 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision I-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:95:21672: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:95
msgctxt "text_id=21672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Unable to go to the drawing room, those of us left behind were stuck standing in the foyer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:115:21673: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:115
msgctxt "text_id=21673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was surprisingly dark in here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:120:21674: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:120
msgctxt "text_id=21674 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The guest rooms were probably better lit, and I considered going there. Might look weird going by myself, though."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:125:21675: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:125
msgctxt "text_id=21675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Was Aozaki's older sister, the thirteenth guest, really here?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:130:21676: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:130
msgctxt "text_id=21676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I couldn't go back to my room yet until that mystery was solved, at least."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:163:21677: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:163
msgctxt "text_id=21677 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"For now, let's move Sister Yuika's statue to the corner."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:187:21678: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:187
msgctxt "text_id=21678 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "Huh? She's heavy. Very heavy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:199:21679: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:199
msgctxt "text_id=21679 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "Tobimaru, help me out.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:208:21680: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:208
msgctxt "text_id=21680 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Sure thing, I'll take the back."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:220:21681: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:220
msgctxt "text_id=21681 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "...Y'know. She's pretty cute."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:231:21682: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:231
msgctxt "text_id=21682 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  No wonder so many lowlifes go to the church.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:287:21683: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:287
msgctxt "text_id=21683 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even in this situation, Sizuki and Tsukiji were friendly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:294:21684: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:294
msgctxt "text_id=21684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I couldn't believe how calm they both were."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:299:21685: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:299
msgctxt "text_id=21685 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I felt like I was nearing a breaking point. If something jumped out at me, I'd die of shock before I died from laughter."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:323:21686: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:323
msgctxt "text_id=21686 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Do you want some tea, Kuma? You look pale.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:335:21687: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:335
msgctxt "text_id=21687 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Thanks, but I'm fine.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:341:21688: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:341
msgctxt "text_id=21688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The last thing I wanted was to have to use the toilet, and I was scared of venturing far into the mansion to find one."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:367:21689: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:367
msgctxt "text_id=21689 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Seems like you're doing fine, then. Just keep that spirit up until morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:378:21690: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:378
msgctxt "text_id=21690 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  It's too bad about Eiri and Yuika, but in a way, I'm actually kind of relieved. At least we're all good friends here, so we can trust each other."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:389:21691: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:389
msgctxt "text_id=21691 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  We just need to find Touko.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:395:21692: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:395
msgctxt "text_id=21692 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"No need for that. The game's over."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:401:21693: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:401
msgctxt "text_id=21693 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I'm impressed, Aoko.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:446:21694: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP4START_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:446
msgctxt "text_id=21694 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Ritsuka?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:467:21695: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:467
msgctxt "text_id=21695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The voice came from the stairs."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:473:21696: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:473
msgctxt "text_id=21696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka had returned from her search for Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:505:21697: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:505
msgctxt "text_id=21697 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What's that supposed to mean?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:517:21698: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:517
msgctxt "text_id=21698 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"It's about time you dropped the charade."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:529:21699: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:529
msgctxt "text_id=21699 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Checkmate, Ako. I haven't got the faintest idea why you went to such lengths, but the physical evidence doesn't lie."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:541:21700: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:541
msgctxt "text_id=21700 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  It's not an open and shut case quite yet, but you're the most likely Sweets Hearts suspect.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:597:21701: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:597
msgctxt "text_id=21701 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Wha... What the hell're you talking about? There's no way I'm Sweets Hearts."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:608:21702: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:608
msgctxt "text_id=21702 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I mean, um... I'm pretty sure there's no way...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:620:21703: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:620
msgctxt "text_id=21703 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Don't play dumb."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:631:21704: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:631
msgctxt "text_id=21704 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  While searching for Beo, I went into your room, and found irrefutable evidence!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:663:21705: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:663
msgctxt "text_id=21705 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What?! Y-You... How did you get into my room?! I thought I locked it!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:681:21706: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:681
msgctxt "text_id=21706 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"One of my few special skills: lockpicking!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:707:21707: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:707
msgctxt "text_id=21707 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Hey! Lockpicking's illegal!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:718:21708: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:718
msgctxt "text_id=21708 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Finding a dead body that someone desperately tried to hide is totally against the rules!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:779:21709: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:779
msgctxt "text_id=21709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki was losing it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:785:21710: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:785
msgctxt "text_id=21710 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We all stared at her, silently."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:812:21711: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0010_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:812
msgctxt "text_id=21711 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Uh, no, I mean..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:825:21712: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0010_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:825
msgctxt "text_id=21712 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "Teehee!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:836:21713: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:836
msgctxt "text_id=21713 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Soujyuro, where's Aozaki's room?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:847:21714: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_CHAP4START_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:847
msgctxt "text_id=21714 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"East wing, second floor, end of the hall.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:899:21715: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:899
msgctxt "text_id=21715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We followed Ritsuka to Aozaki's bedroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:904:21716: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:904
msgctxt "text_id=21716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Our suspect tagged along, pouting and sulking."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:914:21717: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:914
msgctxt "text_id=21717 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I'm going in.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:919:21718: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:919
msgctxt "text_id=21718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka opened the door."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:978:21719: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:978
msgctxt "text_id=21719 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We moved from the dark corridor to the equally dim bedroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:983:21720: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:983
msgctxt "text_id=21720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  When I entered, I was greeted by the sight of a"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1088:21721: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1088
msgctxt "text_id=21721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  a woman beautiful enough to make me question my sexuality,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1094:21722: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1094
msgctxt "text_id=21722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  clutching a microphone in one hand,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1100:21723: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1100
msgctxt "text_id=21723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  cradling a huge bottle of liquor in the other,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1106:21724: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1106
msgctxt "text_id=21724 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  taking a satisfied, eternal slumber."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1126:21725: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1126
msgctxt "text_id=21725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And the walls..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1168:21726: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1168
msgctxt "text_id=21726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...were plastered with bizarre posters."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1192:21727: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1192
msgctxt "text_id=21727 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"A-Alcohol poisoning?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1201:21728: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1201
msgctxt "text_id=21728 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"This is the irrefutable evidence, Ako! I know you and Toko don't get along, but how could you leave her like this?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1213:21729: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0010_0; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1213
msgctxt "text_id=21729 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Toko, you always said you liked prog rock, but really you just liked enka oldies..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1226:21730: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0010_1; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1226
msgctxt "text_id=21730 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid " You even brought your own microphone...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1253:21731: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1253
msgctxt "text_id=21731 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Gah! My family's so embarrassing... I didn't want anyone to see this!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1259:21732: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1259
msgctxt "text_id=21732 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki was squirming up a storm."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1264:21733: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1264
msgctxt "text_id=21733 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  However, this didn't change the fact that she concealed a victim."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1306:21734: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1306
msgctxt "text_id=21734 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Now that I think about it, you seemed to be working hard to make sure no one came near your room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1318:21735: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1318
msgctxt "text_id=21735 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  It wouldn't look good if anyone found the body, right?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1344:21736: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1344
msgctxt "text_id=21736 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"No, that's not how it is! I'm the victim here!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1350:21737: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1350
msgctxt "text_id=21737 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  After lunch, I came here and my sister was dead! Who wouldn't hide that fact?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1395:21738: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1395
msgctxt "text_id=21738 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Sorry, Aozaki, but it's too late for excuses."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1407:21739: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1407
msgctxt "text_id=21739 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Why didn't you tell everyone about this when we were discussing the thirteenth guest?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1433:21740: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1433
msgctxt "text_id=21740 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"B-B-Because if I'd said something, I would've been grilled about why I hadn't said anything yet! It would've been the perfect opportunity for Eiri and Yuika to accuse me!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1444:21741: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1444
msgctxt "text_id=21741 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I figured if that was the case, then I'd just find the criminal myself...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1487:21742: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0011; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1487
msgctxt "text_id=21742 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I don't buy it. You created the thirteenth guest narrative so you could operate behind the scenes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1499:21743: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0012; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1499
msgctxt "text_id=21743 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  The fact of the matter is that Beo, Eiri, and Yui all went down while searching for Toko.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1509:21744: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0016; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1509
msgctxt "text_id=21744 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"That wasn't me! They self-destructed!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1542:21745: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1542
msgctxt "text_id=21745 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Sorry, Aozaki. Kuonji said that Sweets Hearts doesn't know it's the culprit."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1554:21746: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1554
msgctxt "text_id=21746 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Until we expose its true form, we have to prioritize circumstantial evidence over motive.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1581:21747: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1581
msgctxt "text_id=21747 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Right now, the one who could easily have killed all the victims is you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1593:21748: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0013; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1593
msgctxt "text_id=21748 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Yeah. It pains me to admit it, but that's deduction...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1613:21749: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1613
msgctxt "text_id=21749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji and Ritsuka grabbed her arms."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1621:21750: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1621
msgctxt "text_id=21750 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki casually helped."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1646:21751: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1646
msgctxt "text_id=21751 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Hey, what do you think you're doing?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1660:21752: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1660
msgctxt "text_id=21752 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Y-you're just gonna kill me because you suspect me!?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1687:21753: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0014; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1687
msgctxt "text_id=21753 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Calm down. We're just putting you under quarantine."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1699:21754: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0015; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1699
msgctxt "text_id=21754 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Lock up the suspect and wait for the police. End the madness. That's how mystery stories go."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1711:21755: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_CHAP4START_0016; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1711
msgctxt "text_id=21755 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  So, um, is there a room that locks from the outside somewhere, Allie?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1753:21756: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP4START_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1753
msgctxt "text_id=21756 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Just the cellar. It's a pretty tiny room you get to via a narrow staircase."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1765:21757: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_CHAP4START_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1765
msgctxt "text_id=21757 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Aoko can spend the night there.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1789:21758: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1789
msgctxt "text_id=21758 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What is this, the South Pole?!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=21759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Don't tell me this guest house is an Antarctic research station, Alice!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1820:21760: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_CHAP4START_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1820
msgctxt "text_id=21760 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Even if you're not Sweets Hearts, Aozaki, it's safest if we lock you up. It provides us some final insurance. Think of it as taking one for the team.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1831:21761: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0020; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1831
msgctxt "text_id=21761 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Ugh... Fine. I suppose you're right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1842:21762: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0021; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1842
msgctxt "text_id=21762 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I guess I opened myself up to pesky democracy...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1877:21763: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1877
msgctxt "text_id=21763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Yeah. We should've locked her up from the start."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1882:21764: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1882
msgctxt "text_id=21764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If Aozaki really was Sweets Hearts, no one else would die from any sudden bouts of comedy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1887:21765: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1887
msgctxt "text_id=21765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And if she wasn't, then he'd survive until the game was over."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1919:21766: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1919
msgctxt "text_id=21766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Who wouldn't protest though, if they were labelled prime suspect?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1924:21767: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1924
msgctxt "text_id=21767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It felt awful to be the one handing down a verdict."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1929:21768: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1929
msgctxt "text_id=21768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  One of us had to unlucky enough to take the fall."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1961:21769: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0022; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1961
msgctxt "text_id=21769 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Just let me say this."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:1967:21770: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_CHAP4START_0023; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:1967
msgctxt "text_id=21770 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Your opponent's smart. The thirteenth person may not have a form. Don't let your guard down.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:2002:21771: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:2002
msgctxt "text_id=21771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Those were Aozaki's last words."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:2007:21772: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:2007
msgctxt "text_id=21772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After shutting her in the cellar and locking it from the outside with a padlock, we finally breathed a sigh of relief."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_CHAP4START:2013:21773: scene=WIK_CHAP4START
#: WIK_CHAP4START:2013
msgctxt "text_id=21773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_R:8:21774: scene=WIK_SELECT_R
#: WIK_SELECT_R:8
msgctxt "text_id=21774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision R-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_1:35:21775: scene=WIK_D_1
#: WIK_D_1:35
msgctxt "text_id=21775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'm sorry, Ritsuka, but it looks like the rain's only going to get worse."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_2:36:21776: scene=WIK_D_2
#: WIK_D_2:36
msgctxt "text_id=21776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'm sorry, Ritsuka, but it looks like the rain might turn to hail."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:36:21777: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:36
msgctxt "text_id=21777 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe I should just go home."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:62:21778: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_3_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:62
msgctxt "text_id=21778 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"The weather forecast said it'd be sunny..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:73:21779: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_3_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:73
msgctxt "text_id=21779 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Hmm. If this gets any worse, it might be hard to get home. Most taxis are only willing to drive halfway up the mountain.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:106:21780: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:106
msgctxt "text_id=21780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka was right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:111:21781: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:111
msgctxt "text_id=21781 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If you really wanted to go home, you'd have to be ready to be soaked to the bone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:116:21782: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:116
msgctxt "text_id=21782 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Thinking about it, I couldn't believe Aozaki stuck out the commute to and from school for over two years. I was impressed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:153:21783: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_3_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:153
msgctxt "text_id=21783 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Huh? What's up, Kojika?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:159:21784: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_3_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:159
msgctxt "text_id=21784 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Isn't everyone in the drawing room?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:170:21785: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:170
msgctxt "text_id=21785 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I just forgot something in my room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:181:21786: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:181
msgctxt "text_id=21786 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  You guys can go on ahead.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:303:21787: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:303
msgctxt "text_id=21787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I retrieved my overnight bag from the guest room and returned to the foyer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:308:21788: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:308
msgctxt "text_id=21788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could hear Ritsuka and the others laughing in the drawing room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:313:21789: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:313
msgctxt "text_id=21789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Reluctantly, I left the Kuonji Estate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:361:21790: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:361
msgctxt "text_id=21790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'm not exactly sure why I wanted to go home."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:366:21791: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:366
msgctxt "text_id=21791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe I felt overwhelmed by the mansion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:371:21792: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:371
msgctxt "text_id=21792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe it just wasn't my scene."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:376:21793: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:376
msgctxt "text_id=21793 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Or maybe... it was because Tsukiji was there. It was probably a combination of all three."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:409:21794: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:409
msgctxt "text_id=21794 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The sun was nearly below the horizon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:414:21795: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:414
msgctxt "text_id=21795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If I could just get home before dark, I could end the day without incident."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:419:21796: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:419
msgctxt "text_id=21796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I wasn't ready to face Tsukiji, with entrance exams around the corner."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:424:21797: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:424
msgctxt "text_id=21797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Walking down Shiroinuzuka, I told myself this was for the best."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:486:21798: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:486
msgctxt "text_id=21798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But then..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:491:21799: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:491
msgctxt "text_id=21799 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...I suddenly recalled another urban legend."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:515:21800: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:515
msgctxt "text_id=21800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "          \"Descend the mountain alone in the witching hour"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:520:21801: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:520
msgctxt "text_id=21801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "            and a cannibal will be waiting for you at the bottom.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:540:21802: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:540
msgctxt "text_id=21802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Long before the Kuonji Estate was built, this mountain was home to a monster who attacked and killed anyone foolish enough to stray too far from their group."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:545:21803: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:545
msgctxt "text_id=21803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The words \"attacked and killed\" make it sound more humane than \"ate.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:550:21804: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:550
msgctxt "text_id=21804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was probably someone who was cast out of their village."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:555:21805: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:555
msgctxt "text_id=21805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Wow, these are some dark thoughts I'm h―"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:605:21806: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:605
msgctxt "text_id=21806 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:611:21807: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:611
msgctxt "text_id=21807 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I must have taken a wrong turn."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:616:21808: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:616
msgctxt "text_id=21808 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was back behind the Kuonji Estate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:637:21809: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:637
msgctxt "text_id=21809 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"That's weird... I'm sure I was heading down the hill.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:643:21810: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:643
msgctxt "text_id=21810 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I thought out loud to try and ease my tension. "
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:665:21811: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:665
msgctxt "text_id=21811 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Wait, what was that?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:670:21812: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:670
msgctxt "text_id=21812 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A shadow in the shade of the trees. It looked human."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:705:21813: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:705
msgctxt "text_id=21813 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Is someone there?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:711:21814: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:711
msgctxt "text_id=21814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My voice rang out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:717:21815: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:717
msgctxt "text_id=21815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "No response."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:723:21816: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:723
msgctxt "text_id=21816 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "It was getting dark out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:729:21817: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:729
msgctxt "text_id=21817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "There wasn't even a breeze."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:734:21818: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:734
msgctxt "text_id=21818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Now I remembered why I wanted to go home."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:739:21819: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:739
msgctxt "text_id=21819 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Yeah."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:744:21820: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:744
msgctxt "text_id=21820 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I had a feeling that something bad would happening if I stayed―"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:796:21821: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_3_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:796
msgctxt "text_id=21821 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Ah...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:819:21822: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:819
msgctxt "text_id=21822 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Something... impossible unfolded before my eyes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:824:21823: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:824
msgctxt "text_id=21823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I felt a sudden shock in my stomach."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:829:21824: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:829
msgctxt "text_id=21824 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Reflexively, I brought my hand to my mouth. Too late."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:885:21825: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:885
msgctxt "text_id=21825 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I fell to the ground."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:893:21826: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:893
msgctxt "text_id=21826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Warm blood flowed out of me, along with my strength."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:898:21827: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:898
msgctxt "text_id=21827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My hands helplessly reached to the sky for help."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:903:21828: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:903
msgctxt "text_id=21828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It took the last of my strength, but I managed to catch sight of the shadow."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:934:21829: voice_id=X00_WIK_D_3_0000; voice_prefix=X00; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:934
msgctxt "text_id=21829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"NOw, tHat WoN't dO. DoN'T fiNiSh ThIs BEfoRE WE'Ve EVen STARteD.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:982:21830: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:982
msgctxt "text_id=21830 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Something axe-shaped came swinging down."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_3:987:21831: scene=WIK_D_3
#: WIK_D_3:987
msgctxt "text_id=21831 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The last words I ever heard came from someone with the face of a monster."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:41:21832: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:41
msgctxt "text_id=21832 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Brrr. It feels colder here than it does outside.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:52:21833: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:52
msgctxt "text_id=21833 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Yeah. Let's move to the drawing room.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:63:21834: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:63
msgctxt "text_id=21834 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I agree, but..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:76:21835: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:76
msgctxt "text_id=21835 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "Ah well, Soujyuro's business is Soujyuro's business. I was going to wait for him, but there's probably no need.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:102:21836: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_9000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:102
msgctxt "text_id=21836 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Sizuki was outside?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:114:21837: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:114
msgctxt "text_id=21837 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Yeah, cutting the grass near the road. He was going at it hard, like he's expecting royalty.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:140:21838: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:140
msgctxt "text_id=21838 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:145:21839: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:145
msgctxt "text_id=21839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could never figure out what made that guy tick."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:150:21840: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:150
msgctxt "text_id=21840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was too tiring to even try."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:155:21841: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:155
msgctxt "text_id=21841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We moved to the drawing room in search of warmth."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:239:21842: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:239
msgctxt "text_id=21842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The rain showed no sign of stopping."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:244:21843: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:244
msgctxt "text_id=21843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In fact, it seemed to be getting stronger. The sun hadn't set yet, but it was already as dark as night outside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:264:21844: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:264
msgctxt "text_id=21844 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The party had yet to begin."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:269:21845: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:269
msgctxt "text_id=21845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Looking over the drawing room and the sunroom,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:319:21846: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:319
msgctxt "text_id=21846 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I saw everyone engaged in conversation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:350:21847: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:350
msgctxt "text_id=21847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The card game Housuke brought had caused a stir in the drawing room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:381:21848: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:381
msgctxt "text_id=21848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was getting competitive, mainly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:401:21849: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:401
msgctxt "text_id=21849 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Apparently they were playing a fantasy-themed construction game from Germany, called Puppet Pass."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:406:21850: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:406
msgctxt "text_id=21850 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was basically the kind of game where players try to sabotage their opponents, so everyone was putting on forced smiles while they schemed against each other."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:427:21851: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:427
msgctxt "text_id=21851 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In contrast, the older people in the sunroom were drinking wine and watching the students intently."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:453:21852: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:453
msgctxt "text_id=21852 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"I'm surprised you're allowing people to roam around before the birthday party, Alice. Had a change of heart?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:474:21853: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:474
msgctxt "text_id=21853 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"...Not particularly. I made walls where I didn't want people to go. It's only for today, so no one should get lost.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:508:21854: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:508
msgctxt "text_id=21854 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"You made walls? From what?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:521:21855: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:521
msgctxt "text_id=21855 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "And what do you mean about people getting lost? I know the mansion's big, but it's not that big.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:561:21856: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:561
msgctxt "text_id=21856 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Thank you for preparing guest rooms for us, by the way. I plan to leave this evening, but I appreciate the gesture!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:572:21857: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:572
msgctxt "text_id=21857 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Since we're here, Yui, why don't you go change?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:583:21858: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_D_A_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:583
msgctxt "text_id=21858 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I'll lend you my qipao. Even a nun shouldn't attend a party in her habit.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:614:21859: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_D_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:614
msgctxt "text_id=21859 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"I'm fine, thank you. Taking off my Mystic Code in a witch's house would be tantamount to suicide. Unlike you, I'm not here for fun.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:639:21860: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:639
msgctxt "text_id=21860 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"We *are* here for fun, actually. Even I came unarmed, but Sister Yuika insisted..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:651:21861: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_D_A_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:651
msgctxt "text_id=21861 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Why do you always have to be so on edge, like you're ready to fight at a moment's notice?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:665:21862: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:665
msgctxt "text_id=21862 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Someone has to be serious out of the three of us.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:734:21863: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:734
msgctxt "text_id=21863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The clock struck six."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:739:21864: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:739
msgctxt "text_id=21864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Outside, it was completely dark."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:744:21865: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:744
msgctxt "text_id=21865 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With Mr. Yamasiro and the church staff here, it would probably be safe to go home tonight, but the rain gave me pause."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:801:21866: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_D_A_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:801
msgctxt "text_id=21866 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"...I think it's about time we got ready."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:814:21867: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_D_A_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:814
msgctxt "text_id=21867 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Has anyone seen Tokie?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:820:21868: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:820
msgctxt "text_id=21868 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji declared the end to the card games with an unexpected question."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:845:21869: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:845
msgctxt "text_id=21869 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Tokie? Who's Tokie?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:856:21870: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_D_A_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:856
msgctxt "text_id=21870 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"You mean Mr. Tokitsu? He's... huh?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:869:21871: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_D_A_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:869
msgctxt "text_id=21871 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  Wait, Kojika, you haven't spoken to the old man yet?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:881:21872: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:881
msgctxt "text_id=21872 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"What old man? Are there even more people coming? How many guests are going to be at this party, anyway?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:908:21873: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_D_A_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:908
msgctxt "text_id=21873 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Me, Aoko, Sizuki, Tsukiji, Kinomi, you, Tokie, and a few others. Thirteen in all."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:914:21874: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_D_A_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:914
msgctxt "text_id=21874 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  We haven't been able to get everyone in the same room yet, though.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:926:21875: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_D_A_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:926
msgctxt "text_id=21875 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Thirteen...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:931:21876: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:931
msgctxt "text_id=21876 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  One, two, three..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_D_A:936:21877: scene=WIK_D_A
#: WIK_D_A:936
msgctxt "text_id=21877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I counted the people in the room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_E:8:21878: scene=WIK_SELECT_E
#: WIK_SELECT_E:8
msgctxt "text_id=21878 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision E-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:38:21879: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:38
msgctxt "text_id=21879 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Just then..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:66:21880: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:66
msgctxt "text_id=21880 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:112:21881: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:112
msgctxt "text_id=21881 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I heard a strange sound outside, like something cutting through the wind."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:168:21882: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:168
msgctxt "text_id=21882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It grew into a lour roar that seemed to pound the very walls of the building."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:237:21883: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:237
msgctxt "text_id=21883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  While we were all distracted by that..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:338:21884: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:338
msgctxt "text_id=21884 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"You've got some nerve to exclude me, you little nursery rhyme girl!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:344:21885: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:344
msgctxt "text_id=21885 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  You call these dimwits to your birthday party, but not everybody's favorite English beauty, May Riddell Archelot?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:350:21886: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:350
msgctxt "text_id=21886 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The girl who arrived was several times louder than the storm."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:355:21887: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:355
msgctxt "text_id=21887 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe she *was* the storm."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:396:21888: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:396
msgctxt "text_id=21888 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Riddell?! I thought you had other plans! How the hell did you even get here?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:408:21889: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:408
msgctxt "text_id=21889 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"By helicopter, *obviously*."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:414:21890: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:414
msgctxt "text_id=21890 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Remember this well, Tobimaru: Unlike you 'extras,' *nothing* is impossible for me. With a snap of my fingers, I can send missiles flying from the other side of the Earth.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:425:21891: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:425
msgctxt "text_id=21891 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Well, don't do that.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:459:21892: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:459
msgctxt "text_id=21892 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Without so much as a glance in our direction, the girl walked right up to Miss Kuonji. She was dressed in pink from head to toe."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:464:21893: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:464
msgctxt "text_id=21893 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was more accurate to call it a strut than a walk. Her boots made an aggressive clacking sound as they struck the ground."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:505:21894: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:505
msgctxt "text_id=21894 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"The Association's crème de la crème, adored by countless admirers, the first witch star in history to pass a hundred million fans has taken time out of her busy schedule to come here for you."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:518:21895: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:518
msgctxt "text_id=21895 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  How does that feel? You must feel so *terrible*. But such a wonderful surprise beyond your wildest dreams, no doubt. Go ahead, weep with joy.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:551:21896: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:551
msgctxt "text_id=21896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Wow..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:556:21897: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:556
msgctxt "text_id=21897 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I never thought I'd see the day Miss Kuonji's stoicism replaced with pure irritation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:583:21898: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:583
msgctxt "text_id=21898 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The girl in pink nodded smugly down at Miss Kuonji, before finally noticing the rest of us."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:608:21899: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:608
msgctxt "text_id=21899 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Atrocious. Who are these nobodies? I thought this was a birthday party! You have terrible taste in company. Are you really so sick in the head as to call your parents' enemies here?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:620:21900: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0007; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:620
msgctxt "text_id=21900 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Hey you! Priest boy! Why don't you kiss our feet, strip, eat chicken, and then hang yourself?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:645:21901: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:645
msgctxt "text_id=21901 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Hahaha. You are the absolute last person I want to hear that from."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:656:21902: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:656
msgctxt "text_id=21902 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Perhaps you're the one who should be apologizing to Alice. When you steal something, it's only right to return it to the proper owner.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:683:21903: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0008; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:683
msgctxt "text_id=21903 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"I'll have you know I paid her back in full, thank you!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:696:21904: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0009_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:696
msgctxt "text_id=21904 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Alice accepted the money, so it's mine now, fair and square!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:710:21905: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0009_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:710
msgctxt "text_id=21905 | speaker=liddell"
msgid " Mind your own business!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:721:21906: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:721
msgctxt "text_id=21906 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Oh my. Alice sold one of her precious Ploys?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:746:21907: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:746
msgctxt "text_id=21907 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"...Haah. I told her over and over that it wasn't up for sale, but she's a materialistic dog, so she never returned it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:758:21908: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0010; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:758
msgctxt "text_id=21908 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Oh, sweet Alice, still playing coy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:775:21909: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0011; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:775
msgctxt "text_id=21909 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  That was just a savvy sales tactic! Everyone knows 'not for sale' is just code for increasing the price!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:826:21910: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:826
msgctxt "text_id=21910 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Hey, Your Highness. That girl's something else. I could swear I've seen her somewhere before. Is she a friend of Alice's?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:838:21911: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:838
msgctxt "text_id=21911 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"You're just imagining things. Forget about it. She's nothing but trouble. All harm, no good.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:850:21912: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:850
msgctxt "text_id=21912 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Y-Yeah, you're right. I probably couldn't handle her...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:884:21913: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:884
msgctxt "text_id=21913 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Despite whatever Tsukiji was saying, I knew the truth."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:904:21914: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:904
msgctxt "text_id=21914 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Her name was Riddell."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:909:21915: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:909
msgctxt "text_id=21915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She stayed at Tsukiji's house for a time."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:914:21916: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:914
msgctxt "text_id=21916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Apparently, their fathers were business acquaintances."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:920:21917: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:920
msgctxt "text_id=21917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Well, I say she stayed with him, but the Tsukiji estate was so large, they were basically in different houses... Or at least, I hope that was the case."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:960:21918: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:960
msgctxt "text_id=21918 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"I suppose I should ask―"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:966:21919: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:966
msgctxt "text_id=21919 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Riddell. What are you doing here?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:991:21920: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0012; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:991
msgctxt "text_id=21920 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"What do you mean, Alice? It's your birthday!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:997:21921: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0013; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:997
msgctxt "text_id=21921 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  When I called Tobimaru's house, they told me 'the young master is attending a birthday party at Miss Kuonji's house.'"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1009:21922: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0014; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1009
msgctxt "text_id=21922 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I couldn't let that slide, so I cancelled my concert at the last minute and flew here.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1030:21923: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1030
msgctxt "text_id=21923 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"...Do you even remember when my birthday is?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1042:21924: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0015; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1042
msgctxt "text_id=21924 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Of course I do! I could forget mine, but I could never forget your―"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1054:21925: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0016; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1054
msgctxt "text_id=21925 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Wait a second. It's still autumn here, isn't it?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1094:21926: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1094
msgctxt "text_id=21926 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Glad to see you haven't lost your mind completely."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1106:21927: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1106
msgctxt "text_id=21927 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  I hit your head a little too hard last time, remember?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1112:21928: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1112
msgctxt "text_id=21928 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  You had me ever so slightly worried that I might've caused you brain damage.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1142:21929: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0017; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1142
msgctxt "text_id=21929 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Tobimaru, you liar! It's not Alice's birthday at all!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1180:21930: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1180
msgctxt "text_id=21930 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Wait, the invitation definitely mentioned a birthday party at the Kuonji Estate.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1191:21931: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1191
msgctxt "text_id=21931 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Mine, too. Man, that invitation cost me a fortune. 2000 yen from the prez, can you believe it?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1203:21932: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1203
msgctxt "text_id=21932 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "Wait... I wasn't the only one who had to pay, was I?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1244:21933: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1244
msgctxt "text_id=21933 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Hahahaha. Some things are better left unsaid. Though, I do recall something about a birthday party at the Kuonji Estate.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1256:21934: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1256
msgctxt "text_id=21934 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"But it's not Allie's birthday, right?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1302:21935: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1302
msgctxt "text_id=21935 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"...Looks like there's been a misunderstanding."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1314:21936: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1314
msgctxt "text_id=21936 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Yes, we are here for a birthday party, but not mine. It's Tokie's."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1321:21937: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1321
msgctxt "text_id=21937 | speaker=alice"
msgid "He wanted me to celebrate his birthday, so I simply made this mansion the venue.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1384:21938: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1384
msgctxt "text_id=21938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I reread the invitation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1389:21939: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1389
msgctxt "text_id=21939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"You are cordially invited to a birthday party at the Kuonji Estate.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1394:21940: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1394
msgctxt "text_id=21940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Now I see."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1399:21941: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1399
msgctxt "text_id=21941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It didn't say anything about whose party it was."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1457:21942: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1457
msgctxt "text_id=21942 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Hey, everyone! What are we all getting so worked up about?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1476:21943: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1476
msgctxt "text_id=21943 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  ...Wait, Riddell Riddle?! What're you doing here?! What about your concert at Tokyo Bay?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1482:21944: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1482
msgctxt "text_id=21944 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I even set the VCR to record it!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1497:21945: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0018; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1497
msgctxt "text_id=21945 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"It's been sabotaged. The curry I had for lunch today was too spicy.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1529:21946: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_E_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1529
msgctxt "text_id=21946 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What the hell kind of a reason is that?! Apologize to the god of music, right now! What about your fans?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1555:21947: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0019; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1555
msgctxt "text_id=21947 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Ugh, it's always yap, yap, yap with you."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1566:21948: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0020; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1566
msgctxt "text_id=21948 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I don't care about music or any of that crap. Fans support me financially. That's it. I always end up feeling all emo after concerts, anyway. That's when the razor blades come out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1577:21949: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0021; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1577
msgctxt "text_id=21949 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Even when I'm in the spotlight, no one really sees the real me.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1597:21950: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1597
msgctxt "text_id=21950 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Whoa. That took a dark turn."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1646:21951: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1646
msgctxt "text_id=21951 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Chirping sweetly, a blue robin landed on the girl's shoulder."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1669:21952: voice_id=BA0_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1669
msgctxt "text_id=21952 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Hahaha! Nothing ever rifle ranges with ye, May! Yer emotions are all over the place! You come into the room like ye own the place and then complain about no one seeing the real you! Come on! You're definitely more a mangle and wringer than a mage!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1696:21953: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0022; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1696
msgctxt "text_id=21953 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"I know. Sorry. I'm just tired of never seeing my efforts pay off. I go around thinking I'm the best of the best, when really I'm the lowest of the low. Just a dumb clown."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1709:21954: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_E_0023; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1709
msgctxt "text_id=21954 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "I know already, so leave it alone, Robin. Or I'll chop you up and feed you to a dog later.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1715:21955: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1715
msgctxt "text_id=21955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Our newest guest... was talking to a bird."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1720:21956: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1720
msgctxt "text_id=21956 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She really was one of those crazy pop stars you hear about in the tabloids."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1764:21957: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1764
msgctxt "text_id=21957 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"So it's Mr. Tokitsu's birthday party."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1770:21958: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1770
msgctxt "text_id=21958 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  We wondered why we'd been invited, but now I understand."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1782:21959: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_E_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1782
msgctxt "text_id=21959 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Sister Yuika even suggested we come fully armed, because she thought it was a trap.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1809:21960: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1809
msgctxt "text_id=21960 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"...Ahem."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1821:21961: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1821
msgctxt "text_id=21961 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  So, Miss Kuonji, where is the guest of honor?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1827:21962: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1827
msgctxt "text_id=21962 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  We haven't seen him yet.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1852:21963: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1852
msgctxt "text_id=21963 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Now that you mention it..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1865:21964: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1865
msgctxt "text_id=21964 | speaker=alice"
msgid "Aoko, have you seen Tokie?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1891:21965: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_E_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1891
msgctxt "text_id=21965 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"He's not here? But he was in charge of the dinner arrangements! He told us we could take it easy, because he'd be arranging some top chefs.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1917:21966: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1917
msgctxt "text_id=21966 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"That's a bit weird, isn't it? If that was the plan, the chefs would need to arrive by four at the latest in order to make it in time for dinner."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1923:21967: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_E_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1923
msgctxt "text_id=21967 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Hasn't anybody seen Yurihiko?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1963:21968: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1963
msgctxt "text_id=21968 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"He was here until noon, but I haven't seen him since.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1988:21969: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1988
msgctxt "text_id=21969 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I haven't seen him at all."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:1988:21970: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:1988
msgctxt "text_id=21970 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I stepped out a few times, but he wasn't outside, either.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2023:21971: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_E_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2023
msgctxt "text_id=21971 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"It's been nearly five hours since noon. Has nobody seen him during that time?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2043:21972: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2043
msgctxt "text_id=21972 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The room was silent."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2048:21973: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2048
msgctxt "text_id=21973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone seemed to be waiting for someone else to say something. Even Housuke and the pink girl didn't have any banter to offer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2105:21974: voice_id=BA0_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2105
msgctxt "text_id=21974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Hmm? Why'd the place go all Simon Said? Are we about to do some karaoke? Don't you know I'm so good I'd knock your rhythm n' blues right off? I'm a rock robin, you see? Just stick a microphone under my beak and...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2111:21975: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2111
msgctxt "text_id=21975 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The only one making any noise was the robin on the table. It was bobbing its head in a strange way."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2190:21976: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2190
msgctxt "text_id=21976 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Ah, everyone's here. Is dinner ready?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2196:21977: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2196
msgctxt "text_id=21977 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The voice cut through the tension."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2201:21978: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2201
msgctxt "text_id=21978 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A young man, looking calm and composed, had arrived."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2263:21979: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2263
msgctxt "text_id=21979 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He must have picked up on the mood in the room... right?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2292:21980: scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2292
msgctxt "text_id=21980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With his staple, unreadable grin, Sizuki looked around the room at everyone gathered."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2319:21981: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2319
msgctxt "text_id=21981 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"By the way..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2325:21982: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_E_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2325
msgctxt "text_id=21982 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  ...Mr. Tokitsu's dead in the attic. What should we do?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2331:21983: voice_id=X50_WIK_E_0000; voice_prefix=X50; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2331
msgctxt "text_id=21983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Wh...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_E:2366:21984: voice_id=X50_WIK_E_0001; voice_prefix=X50; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_E
#: WIK_E:2366
msgctxt "text_id=21984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"WHAT?!?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_1:32:21985: scene=WIK_F_1
#: WIK_F_1:32
msgctxt "text_id=21985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I feel like something terrible is about to happen."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_2:32:21986: scene=WIK_F_2
#: WIK_F_2:32
msgctxt "text_id=21986 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I feel like something crazy is about to go down."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_3:24:21987: scene=WIK_F_3
#: WIK_F_3:24
msgctxt "text_id=21987 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I know this isn't the time or place, but I'm glad that Tsukiji and I were paired together."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:110:21988: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:110
msgctxt "text_id=21988 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Things sure have gotten out of hand.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:116:21989: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:116
msgctxt "text_id=21989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I silently agreed with Aozaki's muttering."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:144:21990: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:144
msgctxt "text_id=21990 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"The weather's getting worse, too."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:150:21991: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:150
msgctxt "text_id=21991 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  I wouldn't be surprised if there's a mudslide tonight. It would be like getting stranded on an island.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:173:21992: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:173
msgctxt "text_id=21992 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Seriously?! Sweet, sleepover! Oh, man. If Alice gets scared, can I be the one who comforts her?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:185:21993: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:185
msgctxt "text_id=21993 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"By all means, go ahead."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:191:21994: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:191
msgctxt "text_id=21994 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Another dead person's not going to change anything.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:211:21995: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:211
msgctxt "text_id=21995 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki, Tsukiji, Housuke, and I had grouped up."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:216:21996: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:216
msgctxt "text_id=21996 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For now, the four of us were Team School."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:257:21997: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:257
msgctxt "text_id=21997 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Father Eiri, about the body...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:268:21998: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:268
msgctxt "text_id=21998 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"I know. This is clearly a homicide."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:274:21999: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:274
msgctxt "text_id=21999 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  But given our location, we can't exactly call the police right away.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:310:22000: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:310
msgctxt "text_id=22000 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Hehe... hehehehe... Six years... Six years it's been since Ako made fun of my 'sketchy' hobbies..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:331:22001: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:331
msgctxt "text_id=22001 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "And now, we're here... a real murder scene! It's like a dream come true!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:337:22002: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:337
msgctxt "text_id=22002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Team Church was made of those three."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:342:22003: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:342
msgctxt "text_id=22003 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd expected them to be the most cohesive group, but that didn't seem to be the case."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:389:22004: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:389
msgctxt "text_id=22004 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Hey, Soujyuro, where are the tea and scones?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:395:22005: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:395
msgctxt "text_id=22005 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I'm a star, you know? I come all this way and not only do I get a slipshod welcome, but now there's been a murder! Have you people no sense of courtesy?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:404:22006: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:404
msgctxt "text_id=22006 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Well, hold on."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:410:22007: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:410
msgctxt "text_id=22007 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  Demanding tea and scones after someone's died is worse than bad manners.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:456:22008: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:456
msgctxt "text_id=22008 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"And what is *that* supposed to mean? Is the dog barking orders at his master? Don't pretend you're the one with common sense here.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:492:22009: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:492
msgctxt "text_id=22009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The girl in pink grabbed Sizuki by the collar shook him viciously."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:498:22010: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:498
msgctxt "text_id=22010 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Whoa... I see two... Aozakis...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:503:22011: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:503
msgctxt "text_id=22011 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki's eyes began to glaze over, probably because her fingers were digging into his carotid artery."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:567:22012: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:567
msgctxt "text_id=22012 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Heh-heh. Hey, pinkie. You don't look very tasty for a human, but hands off Soujyuro before I bite your head off.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:598:22013: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0003_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:598
msgctxt "text_id=22013 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Oh, really? Why don't you try it?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:611:22014: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0003_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:611
msgctxt "text_id=22014 | speaker=liddell"
msgid " I know your weakness. Want me to beat you again and shrink you down to the size of a mouse?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:648:22015: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:648
msgctxt "text_id=22015 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Oh, so you think you know me, do you? Just shows how blind you really are."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:659:22016: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:659
msgctxt "text_id=22016 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Don't forget, your ancestors were a bunch of soot witches born in the Industrial Revolution. I don't know how you've done it, but you're even dumber.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:704:22017: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0004_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:704
msgctxt "text_id=22017 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"All right, time to die. I'm happy to add another two mangy mutts to the body count right now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:717:22018: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_F_A_0004_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:717
msgctxt "text_id=22018 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "There's already one dead guy. What's another six or so corpses on top of that?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:757:22019: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:757
msgctxt "text_id=22019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Meanwhile, the disagreeable Team Mansion was centered around Miss Kuonji, who was sitting on the sofa."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:762:22020: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:762
msgctxt "text_id=22020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The pink girl, Beo, and Sizuki were bickering bitterly about something or other."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:768:22021: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:768
msgctxt "text_id=22021 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:773:22022: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:773
msgctxt "text_id=22022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji, the mistress of the house, remained silent, her expression pensive."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:778:22023: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:778
msgctxt "text_id=22023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That blue robin had gone off somewhere again."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:823:22024: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:823
msgctxt "text_id=22024 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Okay, everyone! Enough of that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:831:22025: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0003_0; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:831
msgctxt "text_id=22025 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  We're in a wonderful―"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:845:22026: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0003_1; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:845
msgctxt "text_id=22026 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "Ahem."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:858:22027: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0003_2; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:858
msgctxt "text_id=22027 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "We're in a tight situation. This is no time to fight among ourselves!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:870:22028: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:870
msgctxt "text_id=22028 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Mr. Yurihiko Tokitsu has died; the mansion's telephone line is out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:882:22029: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:882
msgctxt "text_id=22029 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  These two things can't be a coincidence."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:894:22030: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:894
msgctxt "text_id=22030 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  As such, it's logical to conclude that we are dealing with―\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:929:22031: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_F_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:929
msgctxt "text_id=22031 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Murder... So you're saying whoever killed Mr. Tokitsu made sure that we couldn't contact the police?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:941:22032: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:941
msgctxt "text_id=22032 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Yes! Precisely, Kojika!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:948:22033: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0008_0; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:948
msgctxt "text_id=22033 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  This is a perfect murder case! And the murderer is someone here!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:962:22034: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0008_1; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:962
msgctxt "text_id=22034 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "Or I hope so, anyway!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:989:22035: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:989
msgctxt "text_id=22035 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"What?! That's what's going down?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1014:22036: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1014
msgctxt "text_id=22036 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Yes, Kinomi! That is exactly what's going down!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1039:22037: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1039
msgctxt "text_id=22037 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Drop your guard, and from behind... BAM! DEAD!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1050:22038: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0011; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1050
msgctxt "text_id=22038 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Right, who wants to give their theory first?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1091:22039: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1091
msgctxt "text_id=22039 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I've never seen Ritsuka so excited."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1096:22040: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1096
msgctxt "text_id=22040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe this is how she reacts to fear."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1135:22041: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_F_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1135
msgctxt "text_id=22041 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Ritsuka.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1174:22042: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0012; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1174
msgctxt "text_id=22042 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Ack!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1264:22043: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1264
msgctxt "text_id=22043 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Allow me to apologize for Ritsuka's unsettling remarks."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1275:22044: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1275
msgctxt "text_id=22044 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  However, despite her enthusiasm, she has a point."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1275:22045: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1275
msgctxt "text_id=22045 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  While we can't be certain Mr. Tokitsu's killer is one of us, we do need to make sense of the situation.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1312:22046: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1312
msgctxt "text_id=22046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That sounded reasonable enough."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1317:22047: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1317
msgctxt "text_id=22047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Father Eiri kicked off the proceedings."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1342:22048: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1342
msgctxt "text_id=22048 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Let's start with the scene in the attic."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1348:22049: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1348
msgctxt "text_id=22049 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  As the attic isn't locked, anyone could have entered at any time."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1360:22050: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1360
msgctxt "text_id=22050 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Did anyone here see Mr. Tokitsu heading for the attic or did he say anything about going there?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1403:22051: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1403
msgctxt "text_id=22051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  No takers."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1408:22052: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1408
msgctxt "text_id=22052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Either Mr. Tokitsu entered the attic by himself without telling anyone, or he was taken there by the killer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1455:22053: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1455
msgctxt "text_id=22053 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Who saw Mr. Tokitsu last?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1467:22054: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1467
msgctxt "text_id=22054 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  The three of us entered the mansion this evening, but we didn't see him.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1476:22055: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1476
msgctxt "text_id=22055 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"We've been here since this morning; he was with us then."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1487:22056: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_F_A_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1487
msgctxt "text_id=22056 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  We fought for a seat next to Alice."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1498:22057: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_F_A_0004; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1498
msgctxt "text_id=22057 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  Then... Oh, yeah. I think he looked at the clock, said something about it being 'time,' then left the drawing room.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1518:22058: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1518
msgctxt "text_id=22058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Despite appearances, Housuke had a pretty good memory..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1523:22059: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1523
msgctxt "text_id=22059 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...when it came to anything besides studying, that is."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1528:22060: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1528
msgctxt "text_id=22060 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In the end, Housuke's statement was the last eyewitness account we had of Mr. Tokitsu."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1556:22061: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1556
msgctxt "text_id=22061 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"That means Mr. Tokitsu disappeared sometime after noon. This is troubling. None of us have a watertight alibi.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1591:22062: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1591
msgctxt "text_id=22062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Right. The time between his disappearance and discovery had been too long."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1596:22063: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1596
msgctxt "text_id=22063 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even though I arrived in the afternoon, I'd been to the bathroom a few times. The same went for Aozaki and Mr. Yamasiro."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1601:22064: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1601
msgctxt "text_id=22064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone had been alone for at least five to ten minutes at some point."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1606:22065: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1606
msgctxt "text_id=22065 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The only exception, who had stayed here with someone the entire time, was Miss Kuonji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1642:22066: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_F_A_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1642
msgctxt "text_id=22066 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Alice, you only got up once to greet Eiri and the others. That's a pretty strong alibi.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1685:22067: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1685
msgctxt "text_id=22067 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"I thought examining everyone's statements would've yielded some insight into his absence...but it appears not. We're all suspects."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1697:22068: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0008; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1697
msgctxt "text_id=22068 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I suggest we should discuss the motive and the murder weapon.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1741:22069: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1741
msgctxt "text_id=22069 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"If we look at motives, then we're all innocent."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1753:22070: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1753
msgctxt "text_id=22070 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  It has to be someone from outside who set this up. Old Yurihiko owned a massive enterprise. I can imagine a family member taking him out over rights or inheritance."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1765:22071: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1765
msgctxt "text_id=22071 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  I don't think this line of questioning is going to get us anywhere.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1798:22072: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_F_A_0013; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1798
msgctxt "text_id=22072 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Ugh... I... I wanted to say that... But Yui's body blow... it hurts...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1835:22073: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0009; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1835
msgctxt "text_id=22073 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"I see. So you're saying we should consider the weapon, or the modus operandi.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1846:22074: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1846
msgctxt "text_id=22074 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I'd think so. If we find out what weapon was used, we can figure out who carried it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1857:22075: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_F_A_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1857
msgctxt "text_id=22075 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Luckily, it's clear what the weapon was. Isn't it, Father?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1883:22076: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0010; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1883
msgctxt "text_id=22076 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"To a certain extent, yes. I still don't know why we didn't hear it from here, however."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1894:22077: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_F_A_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1894
msgctxt "text_id=22077 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Does everyone know what it was?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1928:22078: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1928
msgctxt "text_id=22078 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was a rather mean-spirited question. Father Eiri observed everyone's faces as he waited for a response."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1933:22079: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1933
msgctxt "text_id=22079 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  So, how was Yurihiko Tokitsu killed?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_F_A:1938:22080: scene=WIK_F_A
#: WIK_F_A:1938
msgctxt "text_id=22080 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_G:8:22081: scene=WIK_SELECT_G
#: WIK_SELECT_G:8
msgctxt "text_id=22081 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision G-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:83:22082: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:83
msgctxt "text_id=22082 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I woke up to find myself on a wooden floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:125:22083: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:125
msgctxt "text_id=22083 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh...? What am I doing here...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:131:22084: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:131
msgctxt "text_id=22084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I slowly picked myself up."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:136:22085: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:136
msgctxt "text_id=22085 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This was the hall of the Kuonji Estate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:178:22086: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:178
msgctxt "text_id=22086 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The grandfather clock told me it was almost seven in the morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:183:22087: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:183
msgctxt "text_id=22087 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At the edge of the foyer was a woman dressed like a nun, collapsed on the floor like me. Oh, she was just asleep."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:232:22088: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:232
msgctxt "text_id=22088 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The mansion was quiet, but I could hear several noises if I strained my ears."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:238:22089: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:238
msgctxt "text_id=22089 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was the clinking of kitchenware."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:244:22090: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:244
msgctxt "text_id=22090 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Footsteps down the corridors. Old doors creaking."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:249:22091: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:249
msgctxt "text_id=22091 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:271:22092: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:271
msgctxt "text_id=22092 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"...? Hey, what's going on here? What're we doing sleeping at Kuonji's place? Hey, wake up, Kinomi! Get your head on straight!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:277:22093: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:277
msgctxt "text_id=22093 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A familiar voice echoed from the second floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:312:22094: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:312
msgctxt "text_id=22094 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:317:22095: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:317
msgctxt "text_id=22095 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Somehow, the tightness in my chest lightened, and I stood up."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:322:22096: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:322
msgctxt "text_id=22096 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  To be honest, I was relieved."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:328:22097: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:328
msgctxt "text_id=22097 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I glanced down, and saw something like an eggshell and a note."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:344:22098: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:344
msgctxt "text_id=22098 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There were just a few words on the note, scribbled in pink crayon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:369:22099: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_FIN_0000; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:369
msgctxt "text_id=22099 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "            \"Why not just live for love?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:390:22100: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:390
msgctxt "text_id=22100 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:395:22101: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:395
msgctxt "text_id=22101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Stupid sweets-brain. Even after you're dead, you're still a pain in the ass."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:400:22102: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:400
msgctxt "text_id=22102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Besides, I was too passive to do that. It's how I fell for your trap to begin with."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:445:22103: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_FIN_0001; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:445
msgctxt "text_id=22103 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "(Well, duh!)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:450:22104: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:450
msgctxt "text_id=22104 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sweets Hearts's tone was lively, yet strangely encouraging."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:462:22105: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:462
msgctxt "text_id=22105 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Cracks began forming in the eggshell,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:467:22106: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:467
msgctxt "text_id=22106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  and then it crumbled,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:490:22107: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:490
msgctxt "text_id=22107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  taking everything, even my memories, with it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:511:22108: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:511
msgctxt "text_id=22108 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh. I feel like I was right in the middle of something.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:517:22109: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:517
msgctxt "text_id=22109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I picked up the note in front of me and frowned at it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:522:22110: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:522
msgctxt "text_id=22110 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Irritated by the presumptuous, obnoxious scribbling, I crumpled it up... and after a moment's hesitation, stowed it in my pocket."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:561:22111: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:561
msgctxt "text_id=22111 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Oh, Kumari. You're here too?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:567:22112: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:567
msgctxt "text_id=22112 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  What's going on? Did they move up the party?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:573:22113: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:573
msgctxt "text_id=22113 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was a commotion coming from the stairs,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:578:22114: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:578
msgctxt "text_id=22114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  plus the face of a guy I hadn't heard was coming."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:583:22115: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:583
msgctxt "text_id=22115 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I quickly turned away and checked myself in a nearby mirror. Good. Nothing too out of place."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:633:22116: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:633
msgctxt "text_id=22116 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"That's what I'd like to know."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:647:22117: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0005_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:647
msgctxt "text_id=22117 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  Is Miss Kuonji's birthday party really today? The date on the invitation could've been wrong..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:662:22118: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0005_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:662
msgctxt "text_id=22118 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "Wait, huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:699:22119: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:699
msgctxt "text_id=22119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Where was this déjà vu coming from?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:705:22120: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:705
msgctxt "text_id=22120 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Must have been my imagination."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:710:22121: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:710
msgctxt "text_id=22121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was awfully rare to have a birthday party out at the Kuonji Estate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:715:22122: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:715
msgctxt "text_id=22122 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Our high school days were numbered."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:720:22123: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:720
msgctxt "text_id=22123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The season would be over before we knew it. I had to make sure I finished it with no regrets."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:763:22124: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_FIN_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:763
msgctxt "text_id=22124 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Whoa, Kojika?! You were invited, too?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:769:22125: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_FIN_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:769
msgctxt "text_id=22125 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  Do you know Alice?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:782:22126: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0006_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:782
msgctxt "text_id=22126 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Anyone who's friends with Aozaki knows her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:796:22127: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0006_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:796
msgctxt "text_id=22127 | speaker=kojika"
msgid " Anyway, simmer down, Housuke. You ever thought about growing up?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:849:22128: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:849
msgctxt "text_id=22128 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Hey, it's good to see childhood friends getting along."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:862:22129: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:862
msgctxt "text_id=22129 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  You should coach him, Kumari. You'd be helping him and everyone around him, too.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:891:22130: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0007_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:891
msgctxt "text_id=22130 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"No way. No amount of money would be worth that much effort. I may as well bang my head against a wall."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:906:22131: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_FIN_0007_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:906
msgctxt "text_id=22131 | speaker=kojika"
msgid " No matter how many times you smack him, he won't change.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:919:22132: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:919
msgctxt "text_id=22132 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Haha! I guess you're right! In that case, let's leave him and go say hi to Kuonji. She's probably in the drawing room with Aozaki.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:946:22133: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_FIN_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:946
msgctxt "text_id=22133 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Hey! Wait, before you go! There's a nun on the floor over there, Your Highness!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:962:22134: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_FIN_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:962
msgctxt "text_id=22134 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  Maybe I can help her get to her feet and be her hero!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:975:22135: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_FIN_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:975
msgctxt "text_id=22135 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Go ahead. All she'll do is knock you out, at worst.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1024:22136: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1024
msgctxt "text_id=22136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji sounded like he was enjoying himself. His voice carried through the hall."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1054:22137: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1054
msgctxt "text_id=22137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Dust particles flitted in the air, appearing and disappearing in the rays coming through the skylight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1062:22138: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_FIN_0002; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1062
msgctxt "text_id=22138 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "    (Mm, I guess this could've ended worse!)"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1068:22139: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1068
msgctxt "text_id=22139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  An oddly cheerful voice summed up her honest thoughts."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1109:22140: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1109
msgctxt "text_id=22140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The mad rhapsody drew to a close."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1114:22141: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1114
msgctxt "text_id=22141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She smiled in her own way. Each to their own."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1151:22142: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1151
msgctxt "text_id=22142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone had a choice. To lament the little time one had left,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22143 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  or to gamble on it?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1159:22144: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1159
msgctxt "text_id=22144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Perhaps we find things beautiful because they don't last."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1164:22145: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1164
msgctxt "text_id=22145 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Someday, this would all end...but not just yet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1185:22146: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1185
msgctxt "text_id=22146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This jolly tale was simply another book to add to the shelf."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1192:22147: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1192
msgctxt "text_id=22147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Youth is both fleeting and never-ending."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1197:22148: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1197
msgctxt "text_id=22148 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The stories of young boys and girls are full of hardships yet unseen."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1204:22149: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1204
msgctxt "text_id=22149 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Which means, my friends,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_FIN:1209:22150: scene=WIK_FIN
#: WIK_FIN:1209
msgctxt "text_id=22150 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  we shall no doubt meet again."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_1:30:22151: scene=WIK_G_1
#: WIK_G_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=22151 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Broadly speaking, I think the weapon used was bread."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_2:30:22152: scene=WIK_G_2
#: WIK_G_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=22152 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think it was a small explosive, practically speaking."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_3:30:22153: scene=WIK_G_3
#: WIK_G_3:30
msgctxt "text_id=22153 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As crazy as it sounds, maybe he was eaten by a dog or something."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_3:35:22154: scene=WIK_G_3
#: WIK_G_3:35
msgctxt "text_id=22154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...But why?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:40:22155: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:40
msgctxt "text_id=22155 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Huh? What do you mean? Isn't it obvious?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:46:22156: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:46
msgctxt "text_id=22156 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  They probably stuck dynamite to his hands, feet, and face.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:56:22157: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:56
msgctxt "text_id=22157 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"That would be the logical conclusion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:62:22158: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:62
msgctxt "text_id=22158 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I mean, those parts of his body were totally gone.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:71:22159: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:71
msgctxt "text_id=22159 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:76:22160: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:76
msgctxt "text_id=22160 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki was a thorough realist, but she could arrive at some pretty wild conclusions sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:102:22161: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:102
msgctxt "text_id=22161 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"While that's possible, I don't think that's what happened."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:113:22162: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:113
msgctxt "text_id=22162 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  We don't know how Mr. Tokitsu ended up in the attic, but we do know what happened there. It was a dust explosion.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:160:22163: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:160
msgctxt "text_id=22163 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"By that, you mean an explosion caused by something like fireworks igniting something combustible in the air?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:198:22164: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:198
msgctxt "text_id=22164 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"You're on the right track. In a closed space like that, an explosion can occur when there's a certain amount of combustible dust, like flour."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:210:22165: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:210
msgctxt "text_id=22165 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  You can even make thermite out of aluminum foil and the rust from old pots and pans. But based on the situation, a powder seems more likely.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:244:22166: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:244
msgctxt "text_id=22166 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"But if that was the case, why was only his torso intact?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:256:22167: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:256
msgctxt "text_id=22167 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Are dust explosions even that powerful?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:265:22168: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:265
msgctxt "text_id=22168 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"That's what we need to find out. It's possible his jacket was blast-resistant."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:276:22169: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:276
msgctxt "text_id=22169 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  And we don't know if it was the explosion that killed him. The culprit could've set off the blast after they murdered him. Given that the explosion itself was small, his limbs and face could've already been burned.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:315:22170: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:315
msgctxt "text_id=22170 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"True. That would also explain why we didn't hear the explosion from the drawing room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:321:22171: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:321
msgctxt "text_id=22171 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  We can't overlook the possibility that the dust explosion traces are some sort of misdirection.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:331:22172: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:331
msgctxt "text_id=22172 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Misdirection? What would they be hiding?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:357:22173: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:357
msgctxt "text_id=22173 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"The unnatural aspects of this entire killing, of course."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:368:22174: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:368
msgctxt "text_id=22174 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  For instance, what if the corpse wasn't actually Mr. Tokitsu's, but someone else's?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:374:22175: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:374
msgctxt "text_id=22175 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  In that case, the culprit would need to obscure his face. However, burning the face alone would be too obvious.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:400:22176: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:400
msgctxt "text_id=22176 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Perhaps to make it seem 'normal' his face had been burned, they purposefully disguised their overall approach with an explosion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:411:22177: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0008; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:411
msgctxt "text_id=22177 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  A bigger deception to mask smaller lies.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:440:22178: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:440
msgctxt "text_id=22178 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Come ooon... I wanted to say that... I really wanted to say that...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:476:22179: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:476
msgctxt "text_id=22179 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone seemed impressed by Tsukiji and the priest. Heck, I sure was."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:481:22180: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:481
msgctxt "text_id=22180 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even if I'd pinned down the possibility there was a dust explosion in the room, I wouldn't have figured out why."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:518:22181: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:518
msgctxt "text_id=22181 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"A dust explosion, I see.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:523:22182: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:523
msgctxt "text_id=22182 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Housuke nodded solemnly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:535:22183: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:535
msgctxt "text_id=22183 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Um, what does that mean?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:546:22184: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:546
msgctxt "text_id=22184 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"For now, it means we can pinpoint the location of the weapon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:557:22185: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:557
msgctxt "text_id=22185 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Soujyuro, is there flour in the kitchen?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:563:22186: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:563
msgctxt "text_id=22186 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"I'm checking now... Nope, nothing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:577:22187: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:577
msgctxt "text_id=22187 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  I bought extra, but the bags are gone.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:653:22188: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:653
msgctxt "text_id=22188 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Okay... So what does that mean?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:664:22189: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:664
msgctxt "text_id=22189 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Someone took the flour from the kitchen."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:675:22190: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:675
msgctxt "text_id=22190 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  Which goes to show...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:681:22191: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:681
msgctxt "text_id=22191 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That the culprit knew their way around the kitchen... right?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:686:22192: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:686
msgctxt "text_id=22192 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Or was this another possible misdirection?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:706:22193: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:706
msgctxt "text_id=22193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Just then..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:765:22194: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:765
msgctxt "text_id=22194 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...the blue robin, which had been gone all this time, came flapping back into the drawing room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:770:22195: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:770
msgctxt "text_id=22195 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It perched on Miss Kuonji's shoulder and let out a shrill chirp."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:817:22196: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:817
msgctxt "text_id=22196 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Oh dear.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:849:22197: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:849
msgctxt "text_id=22197 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji stood up from the sofa and looked at all of us."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:874:22198: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:874
msgctxt "text_id=22198 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Sorry to interrupt the serious discussion, but I have bad news."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:886:22199: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:886
msgctxt "text_id=22199 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Before that, Sizuki, do you have a moment?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:948:22200: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:948
msgctxt "text_id=22200 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She gestured Sizuki over to her, and spoke to him in a hushed voice."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:965:22201: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:965
msgctxt "text_id=22201 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Hey, what're you getting all buddy-buddy over there for?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:971:22202: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:971
msgctxt "text_id=22202 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  If you have something to say, say it to all of us. Ugh, some people...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1023:22203: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1023
msgctxt "text_id=22203 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Sorry, Riddell. But it seems Sizuki has something to say to you."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1029:22204: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1029
msgctxt "text_id=22204 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  I'm sure it's quite wonderful, so do listen.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1055:22205: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1055
msgctxt "text_id=22205 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Yeah. This might help."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1066:22206: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1066
msgctxt "text_id=22206 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  Alice assured me you'd be interested. You've helped me time and time again, so it would mean a lot if you would hear me out.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1098:22207: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1098
msgctxt "text_id=22207 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"F-Fine. I'm listening. Spit it out already.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1181:22208: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1181
msgctxt "text_id=22208 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Je t'aime. Je t'aime, mon amour.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1274:22209: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1274
msgctxt "text_id=22209 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"What...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1303:22210: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1303
msgctxt "text_id=22210 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Why the hell would you of all people say that?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1310:22211: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0007_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1310
msgctxt "text_id=22211 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Soujyuro, Alice is messing with you. Do you even know what you just sai―"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1364:22212: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0007_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1364
msgctxt "text_id=22212 | speaker=liddell"
msgid " Whuh?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1488:22213: voice_id=X80_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=X80; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1488
msgctxt "text_id=22213 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"She vomited blood and collapsed!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1506:22214: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1506
msgctxt "text_id=22214 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I rushed over to the girl in pink."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1549:22215: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1549
msgctxt "text_id=22215 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  No pulse. She wasn't breathing, either."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1554:22216: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1554
msgctxt "text_id=22216 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Pupils unresponsive. No sign of life at all."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1563:22217: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1563
msgctxt "text_id=22217 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"She's totally dead.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1603:22218: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1603
msgctxt "text_id=22218 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The atmosphere in the drawing room turned frenzied."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1624:22219: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1624
msgctxt "text_id=22219 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Some looked shocked,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1648:22220: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1648
msgctxt "text_id=22220 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  while others looked cautious."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1667:22221: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1667
msgctxt "text_id=22221 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And a few of us were utterly dumbfounded."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1701:22222: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1701
msgctxt "text_id=22222 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Things are getting worse.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1724:22223: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1724
msgctxt "text_id=22223 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What's going on, Alice? Why'd Riddell die?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1736:22224: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1736
msgctxt "text_id=22224 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"It's simple, actually."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1742:22225: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1742
msgctxt "text_id=22225 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  I had my suspicions when we found Tokie in the attic, so I had Robin go and check the vault."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1748:22226: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0008; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1748
msgctxt "text_id=22226 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  One Ploy Kickshaw's missing.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1774:22227: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1774
msgctxt "text_id=22227 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Missing? So you're saying Mr. Tokitsu and Riddell were killed by a Ploy?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1786:22228: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0009; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1786
msgctxt "text_id=22228 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"It'd be more accurate to say they were caught by the Ploy's rules."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1798:22229: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0010; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1798
msgctxt "text_id=22229 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  No point in hiding anything now, so I'll explain."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1804:22230: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0011; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1804
msgctxt "text_id=22230 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Until tomorrow morning, laughter is strictly forbidden.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1848:22231: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1848
msgctxt "text_id=22231 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Why?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1860:22232: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0012; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1860
msgctxt "text_id=22232 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"The mansion has become a world where those who laugh... die.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1919:22233: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_G_A_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1919
msgctxt "text_id=22233 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"No way! That's crazy scary!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:1932:22234: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_G_A_0004; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:1932
msgctxt "text_id=22234 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  You got me, Alice! Great joke! Hahahaha!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2112:22235: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2112
msgctxt "text_id=22235 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"H-Housuke?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2240:22236: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2240
msgctxt "text_id=22236 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"It seems 'crazy' is right...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2252:22237: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0013; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2252
msgctxt "text_id=22237 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Thanks to Kinomi, the Ploy's rules are clear now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2258:22238: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0014; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2258
msgctxt "text_id=22238 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Laughing of your own accord doesn't count; neither does insincere laughter."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2264:22239: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0015; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2264
msgctxt "text_id=22239 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  However, laugh from the gut about another person's words, actions, or tricks, and you're out.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2274:22240: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2274
msgctxt "text_id=22240 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Uh... what?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2294:22241: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2294
msgctxt "text_id=22241 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I had no idea what was going on."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2299:22242: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2299
msgctxt "text_id=22242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Laugh and you die? Really?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2304:22243: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2304
msgctxt "text_id=22243 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I knew Miss Kuonji wasn't exactly normal, but I didn't know she was insane... Then again, two people died in front of me after bursting out laughing, so was it true after all?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2344:22244: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0009; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2344
msgctxt "text_id=22244 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"So you're saying that a Ploy Kickshaw is active."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2355:22245: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0010; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2355
msgctxt "text_id=22245 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  But, if that's so, why hasn't Sister Yuika noticed?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2368:22246: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0016_0; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2368
msgctxt "text_id=22246 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"This Ploy has perfect camouflage."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2382:22247: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0016_1; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2382
msgctxt "text_id=22247 | speaker=alice"
msgid " That and Yuika―\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2406:22248: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2406
msgctxt "text_id=22248 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Right. I couldn't even attempt to measure the amount of magical energy within the Kuonji Estate. We're inside an enormous Mystic as it is. Measuring the flow of energy became impossible the moment we stepped foot on this mountain.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2420:22249: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_G_A_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2420
msgctxt "text_id=22249 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"You're right. Do pardon me. I seem to be a bit disoriented.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2440:22250: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2440
msgctxt "text_id=22250 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Being calm in this situation would be weirder."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2445:22251: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2445
msgctxt "text_id=22251 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Father Eiri seemed cold at first glance, but maybe he's actually a more feeling person than I realized."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2450:22252: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2450
msgctxt "text_id=22252 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But what on Earth was a Ploy?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2455:22253: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2455
msgctxt "text_id=22253 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The conversation was starting to leave me in the dust."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2496:22254: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2496
msgctxt "text_id=22254 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I have a question. I get that if someone makes you laugh, you die."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2508:22255: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2508
msgctxt "text_id=22255 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  But why are people dying in different ways?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2514:22256: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2514
msgctxt "text_id=22256 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Gramps, Riddell, Kinomi―all different. You said something about rules, but is it random?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2540:22257: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0017; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2540
msgctxt "text_id=22257 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Their deaths relate to their nature.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2567:22258: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2567
msgctxt "text_id=22258 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Their nature...? Like their issues, personality, and all that?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2578:22259: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0018; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2578
msgctxt "text_id=22259 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Right. Even their hidden idiosyncrasies.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2607:22260: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2607
msgctxt "text_id=22260 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Oh, I get it now. I thought something was strange, but their deaths are also part of the design.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2633:22261: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2633
msgctxt "text_id=22261 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Wow. So Kinomi must have really wanted to be rich to die in a shower of money...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2660:22262: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2660
msgctxt "text_id=22262 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Ironically, money couldn't've saved him this time.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2697:22263: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2697
msgctxt "text_id=22263 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Riddell died a pretty normal death."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2708:22264: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2708
msgctxt "text_id=22264 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  Knowing her, I expected her to transform into an airplane or a yacht or something.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2759:22265: voice_id=BA0_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2759
msgctxt "text_id=22265 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Yeah, yeah! Riddell's all bark no bite! Vomiting claret and dying right then and there is balls! Even worse than Kinomi's death... All icing, no Sexton Blake!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2787:22266: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0008_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2787
msgctxt "text_id=22266 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22267 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "W... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22268 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Watch..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2807:22269: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0008_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2807
msgctxt "text_id=22269 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "your..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2823:22270: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0008_2; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2823
msgctxt "text_id=22270 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "beak...!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2875:22271: voice_id=X60_WIK_G_A_0000; voice_prefix=X60; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2875
msgctxt "text_id=22271 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"She's alive!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2920:22272: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0009_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2920
msgctxt "text_id=22272 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Don't... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "under―"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2933:22274: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0009_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2933
msgctxt "text_id=22274 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "ungh... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22275 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "underestimate me..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2949:22276: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0010_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2949
msgctxt "text_id=22276 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "Stopping my heart..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2960:22277: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0010_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2960
msgctxt "text_id=22277 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "unf..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2970:22278: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0011_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2970
msgctxt "text_id=22278 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "isn't... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "going to..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:2980:22280: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0011_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:2980
msgctxt "text_id=22280 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "STOP... "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22281 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ME!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3002:22282: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_G_A_0000_0; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3002
msgctxt "text_id=22282 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Whoa...! I didn't know humans could survive heart attacks just by being stubborn!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3016:22283: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_G_A_0000_1; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3016
msgctxt "text_id=22283 | speaker=beo"
msgid " Looks like you need better jokes to kill her.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3056:22284: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_G_A_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3056
msgctxt "text_id=22284 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Incredible. You'll have to teach me that trick sometime!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3068:22285: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0019; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3068
msgctxt "text_id=22285 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"I knew you'd come back from the dead, Riddell. Like a zombie.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3080:22286: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0012; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3080
msgctxt "text_id=22286 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Hey! How about an apology?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3092:22287: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0013; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3092
msgctxt "text_id=22287 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Why not test your theory on that stupid werewolf over there?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3092:22288: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0013; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3092
msgctxt "text_id=22288 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  He resurrects no matter what! Why go for me?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3119:22289: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0020; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3119
msgctxt "text_id=22289 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"What do you mean 'why?' We're rivals, aren't we?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3125:22290: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0021; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3125
msgctxt "text_id=22290 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Of course we'd try to kill each other.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3137:22291: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0014; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3137
msgctxt "text_id=22291 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Uh... um... yeah... Yeah, of course!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3149:22292: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_G_A_0015; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3149
msgctxt "text_id=22292 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  N-Not bad. You really took me by surprise. I underestimated you!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3187:22293: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0011; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3187
msgctxt "text_id=22293 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Figures she'd be the type to survive even if someone kills her. Damn.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3193:22294: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3193
msgctxt "text_id=22294 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Though clearly shocked by the girl in pink's horror show, Tsukiji was taking this way too well."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3220:22295: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3220
msgctxt "text_id=22295 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Um, Tsukiji? Don't you think this is weird? Someone just died, you know!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3232:22296: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3232
msgctxt "text_id=22296 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  And Housuke turned into confetti! Dying from laughter... I mean, what is all this? Am I dreaming?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3258:22297: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0012; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3258
msgctxt "text_id=22297 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Calm down. I don't want to believe this is happening, but it is."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3269:22298: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0013; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3269
msgctxt "text_id=22298 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Like Kuonji said, this mansion's another world now, with new rules. Riddell got caught out, but she resisted."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3280:22299: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0014; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3280
msgctxt "text_id=22299 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  I know it all sounds crazy, but Kuonji and Riddell can do some crazy things.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3306:22300: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_G_A_0015; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3306
msgctxt "text_id=22300 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I don't know exactly what they can do, but that's probably for the best. I just know from watching them, they're the real deal. Trust me on this.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3332:22301: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3332
msgctxt "text_id=22301 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Trust you?! Housuke is dead!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3341:22302: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3341
msgctxt "text_id=22302 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Miss Kumari. You shouldn't mourn Kinomi just yet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3341:22303: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0022; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3341
msgctxt "text_id=22303 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  He and Tokie simply triggered the Ploy and now they're 'out.' In reality, they're just missing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3352:22304: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0023; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3352
msgctxt "text_id=22304 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  If someone wins the game, then it will be rendered null, and everything will return to normal.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3378:22305: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_G_A_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3378
msgctxt "text_id=22305 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"They're not dead? Someone just needs to win the game?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3384:22306: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3384
msgctxt "text_id=22306 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I understood what Miss Kuonji is saying. But, for better or worse, I was a realist like Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3389:22307: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3389
msgctxt "text_id=22307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This sci-fi and fantasy nonsense was too hard for me to swallow."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3413:22308: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3413
msgctxt "text_id=22308 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Relax, Kuma. I know where you're coming from, but listen to what we're saying."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3424:22309: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3424
msgctxt "text_id=22309 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Alice, you should explain in more detail."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3430:22310: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_G_A_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3430
msgctxt "text_id=22310 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I get that this is the Ploy's doing, but what are the actual current rules? What do you mean by winning the game?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3476:22311: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0024; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3476
msgctxt "text_id=22311 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"We're dealing with a probability-shifting Ploy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3482:22312: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0025; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3482
msgctxt "text_id=22312 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Once the user's conditions are satisfied, it will activate and then operate for a full day. That's the 'game.'"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3494:22313: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0026; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3494
msgctxt "text_id=22313 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  During the game, a new rule will be added to the real world. In this case, dying when someone makes you laugh.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3521:22314: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0027; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3521
msgctxt "text_id=22314 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"And don't even bother trying to escape. It's not possible. There are only two ways to end this."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3536:22315: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0028; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3536
msgctxt "text_id=22315 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  The first is to expose the Ploy's user."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3548:22316: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0029; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3548
msgctxt "text_id=22316 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  However, we shouldn't point the finger at just anyone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3554:22317: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0030; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3554
msgctxt "text_id=22317 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  If the accuser is mistaken or lacks evidence, they'll be eliminated.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3613:22318: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0031; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3613
msgctxt "text_id=22318 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"The other way is for any player other than the Ploy―even just one person―to survive until the end of the game."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3625:22319: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_G_A_0032; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3625
msgctxt "text_id=22319 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  That's how you 'win' the game and bring all the victims back. Their memories of the game disappear, though.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3690:22320: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_G_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3690
msgctxt "text_id=22320 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"...Well, that takes the pressure off. If we wait until dawn, we'll be fine.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3696:22321: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3696
msgctxt "text_id=22321 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The sister seemed relieved, but I wasn't. Not by a long shot."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3701:22322: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3701
msgctxt "text_id=22322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe it was because I was having a hard time wrapping my head around the situation, but I felt so on edge."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_G_A:3706:22323: scene=WIK_G_A
#: WIK_G_A:3706
msgctxt "text_id=22323 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_H:8:22324: scene=WIK_SELECT_H
#: WIK_SELECT_H:8
msgctxt "text_id=22324 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision H-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_1:39:22325: scene=WIK_H_1
#: WIK_H_1:39
msgctxt "text_id=22325 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I thought about it, and concluded that Yurihiko Tokitsu's death was what we had to focus on now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_2:39:22326: scene=WIK_H_2
#: WIK_H_2:39
msgctxt "text_id=22326 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think it's easy enough to not laugh for one night."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_3:39:22327: scene=WIK_H_3
#: WIK_H_3:39
msgctxt "text_id=22327 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I felt like it was about time I pointed out that we were still missing someone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:48:22328: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:48
msgctxt "text_id=22328 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I'm not convinced things will go so smoothly, Yui.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:61:22329: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:61
msgctxt "text_id=22329 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"What do you mean, Ritsuka?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:88:22330: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:88
msgctxt "text_id=22330 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Kinomi and Miss Riddell aside, it's possible someone forced Mr. Tokitsu to laugh."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:99:22331: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:99
msgctxt "text_id=22331 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  And remember what Allie said? The user decides the rules. This Ploy didn't start by itself; someone activated it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:126:22332: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:126
msgctxt "text_id=22332 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"You mean...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:135:22333: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:135
msgctxt "text_id=22333 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"...The culprit is still at large."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:141:22334: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:141
msgctxt "text_id=22334 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  We still don't know who they are. But seeing as they created the rules, they're probably going to try to make us laugh however they can.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:167:22335: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:167
msgctxt "text_id=22335 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"They might not even need to go that far, actually."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:178:22336: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:178
msgctxt "text_id=22336 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I hate to say it, but in mystery novels the guests often end up tearing each other apart out of suspicion.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:206:22337: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:206
msgctxt "text_id=22337 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Yes! Bang on, Aoko!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:220:22338: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:220
msgctxt "text_id=22338 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  The nasty thing about this rule is that anyone can kill anyone. However, that also means we can survive without identifying the culprit."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:232:22339: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:232
msgctxt "text_id=22339 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  We only need to make sure no one else can make us laugh.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:256:22340: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:256
msgctxt "text_id=22340 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Do unto others, before they do unto you."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:262:22341: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:262
msgctxt "text_id=22341 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  You could remove everyone else to guarantee your own safety."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:268:22342: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:268
msgctxt "text_id=22342 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Is that what you're saying?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:294:22343: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:294
msgctxt "text_id=22343 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Okay, one: The mansion's now a world where you die if you laugh."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:300:22344: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:300
msgctxt "text_id=22344 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Two: Person A made this happen."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:306:22345: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:306
msgctxt "text_id=22345 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Three: We can't rest until we figure out who the Person A is; they've already murdered Mr. Tokitsu, and they could kill again."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:317:22346: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:317
msgctxt "text_id=22346 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Four: We suspect anyone but ourselves and reveal the culprit, hold out until morning, or make everyone else laugh.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:371:22347: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:371
msgctxt "text_id=22347 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Only one group can survive.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:389:22348: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:389
msgctxt "text_id=22348 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"You think you're some badass, talking like that?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:401:22349: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:401
msgctxt "text_id=22349 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Alice, what number Ploy is this?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:413:22350: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:413
msgctxt "text_id=22350 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Fifteen. It's a Ploy Kickshaw of magical reinforcement via charms, probability shifting, two minds in one body, and prayer.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:439:22351: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:439
msgctxt "text_id=22351 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Oh, bollocks... that sounds like Sweets Hearts, all right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:450:22352: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:450
msgctxt "text_id=22352 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Perfect, just perfect. How spineless do Japanese people have to be to use something like that?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:475:22353: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:475
msgctxt "text_id=22353 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"'Sweets Hearts'?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:486:22354: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:486
msgctxt "text_id=22354 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Is that this Ploy's name, Alice?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:526:22355: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:526
msgctxt "text_id=22355 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Yes. It creates rules, and boosts the survivor's magical energy; it's like a test-your-luck Ploy you use before a battle. Usually Sweets Hearts wins and everyone dies, though..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:537:22356: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:537
msgctxt "text_id=22356 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Very well, I shall be teaming up with Alice.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:548:22357: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:548
msgctxt "text_id=22357 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Excuse me? Who said we're teaming up?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:595:22358: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:595
msgctxt "text_id=22358 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"This is a fight for survival. The game is about trust and betrayal, so grouping up in pairs will give us the best chance of victory."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:601:22359: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0007; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:601
msgctxt "text_id=22359 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Instead of running around trying to find the culprit, we should just try to make each other laugh. I mean, we all want to survive, don't we?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:627:22360: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0008; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:627
msgctxt "text_id=22360 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Thus, Alice and I make the ultimate team. Alice never laughs, and I can be the joker."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:638:22361: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0009; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:638
msgctxt "text_id=22361 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Right, Alice?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:666:22362: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:666
msgctxt "text_id=22362 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Hmm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Mind if I join you, Sizuki?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:687:22364: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:687
msgctxt "text_id=22364 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Sure. Based on what I've heard, you're the safest person to be with.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:699:22365: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0010; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:699
msgctxt "text_id=22365 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Whatever happened to kindness in this cruel world?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:747:22366: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:747
msgctxt "text_id=22366 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"I see. Partner with someone you trust, someone you don't believe to be the culprit, and work together."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:758:22367: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_H_A_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:758
msgctxt "text_id=22367 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Sister Yuika, would you mind?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:769:22368: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_H_A_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:769
msgctxt "text_id=22368 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"My pleasure. While this is frightening situation, you appear to be the most trustworthy person here.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:793:22369: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:793
msgctxt "text_id=22369 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Hey, what about me?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:818:22370: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:818
msgctxt "text_id=22370 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Want to partner up, Aoko?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:854:22371: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:854
msgctxt "text_id=22371 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Riddell. Let's pair up."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:854:22372: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_H_A_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:854
msgctxt "text_id=22372 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Just for tonight, we should put everything behind us.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:865:22373: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:865
msgctxt "text_id=22373 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Oh, come on! You can make peace with me, too!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:894:22374: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0011; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:894
msgctxt "text_id=22374 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Hmph. Fine."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:905:22375: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_H_A_0012; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:905
msgctxt "text_id=22375 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  If push comes to shove, we can just demolish the mansion.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:943:22376: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_H_A_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:943
msgctxt "text_id=22376 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Makes sense so far. How about it, Kumari? Just two regular Joes with common sense.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:955:22377: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_H_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:955
msgctxt "text_id=22377 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:982:22378: scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:982
msgctxt "text_id=22378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I-I didn't see that coming!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:987:22379: scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:987
msgctxt "text_id=22379 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  All the weirdness and murder mysteries were bad enough, but now this?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1011:22380: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_H_A_0000_0; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1011
msgctxt "text_id=22380 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Hmm. Well, if I can't be with Soujyuro, then I don't need anyone else."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1023:22381: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_H_A_0000_1; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1023
msgctxt "text_id=22381 | speaker=beo"
msgid " This just playtime for me anyway.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1043:22382: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0009; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1043
msgctxt "text_id=22382 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Aww, I guess that means I'm stuck with Mr. Yamasiro, then..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1056:22383: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_H_A_0010; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1056
msgctxt "text_id=22383 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1087:22384: scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1087
msgctxt "text_id=22384 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We all looked at each other."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_H_A:1092:22385: scene=WIK_H_A
#: WIK_H_A:1092
msgctxt "text_id=22385 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd been wondering when someone would notice: Mr. Yamasiro had been missing for a while."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:38:22386: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_I_0000_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:38
msgctxt "text_id=22386 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Hmm. I've been in the mansion most of the time. Been too busy preparing for the party to really talk to anyone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:52:22387: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_I_0000_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:52
msgctxt "text_id=22387 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid " Mainly because a certain duo didn't want to help."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:64:22388: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_I_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:64
msgctxt "text_id=22388 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  Aside from that, I was mostly in the drawing room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:71:22389: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_I_0002_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:71
msgctxt "text_id=22389 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  I did go shopping and tend to the garden, but that was earlier in the afternoon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:85:22390: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_I_0002_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:85
msgctxt "text_id=22390 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "When I returned to my room in the evening, Mr. Tokitsu was already dead.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:123:22391: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_I_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:123
msgctxt "text_id=22391 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"As for me... Nobody else was on hand, so I locked the west wing myself before Tokie arrived."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:135:22392: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_I_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:135
msgctxt "text_id=22392 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  The west wing contains many rooms that are off-limits, including the Ploy vault."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:147:22393: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_I_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:147
msgctxt "text_id=22393 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  From there, I went to the drawing room to look after the guests; I couldn't tell you who left their seat or for how long.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:185:22394: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_I_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:185
msgctxt "text_id=22394 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"My story's the same as Aozaki's, but I guess I should tell you anyway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22395 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  "
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:198:22396: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_I_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:198
msgctxt "text_id=22396 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I met up with Aozaki and Mr. Yamasiro at one in the afternoon, and arrived at the Kuonji Estate sometime after two."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:210:22397: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_I_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:210
msgctxt "text_id=22397 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I took a short break in my room from 3:30 to 4:00."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:222:22398: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_I_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:222
msgctxt "text_id=22398 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I remember the priest and the sisters coming to the foyer at around four o'clock."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:235:22399: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_I_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:235
msgctxt "text_id=22399 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "Oh, also... while I was napping, I thought I heard laughter, but it might've been my imagination. Don't read into it too much. Might make things confusing.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_I:268:22400: scene=WIK_I
#: WIK_I:268
msgctxt "text_id=22400 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_J:8:22401: scene=WIK_SELECT_J
#: WIK_SELECT_J:8
msgctxt "text_id=22401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision J-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:38:22402: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_J_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:38
msgctxt "text_id=22402 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"After I finished my work in the afternoon, I made my way to the mansion, like Aoko's invitation said I should do, with no fuss."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:50:22403: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_J_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:50
msgctxt "text_id=22403 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I arrived at about 4 o'clock and had tea in the sunroom until Riddell charged in. I found out Mr. Tokitsu had been killed after that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:62:22404: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_J_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:62
msgctxt "text_id=22404 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I haven't seen him once during my time here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:74:22405: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_J_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:74
msgctxt "text_id=22405 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I recall Mr. Yamasiro disappearing just before the Mr. Tokitsu incident came to light.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:112:22406: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_J_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:112
msgctxt "text_id=22406 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"I'm the same as Father Eiri."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:125:22407: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_J_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:125
msgctxt "text_id=22407 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  I haven't left the drawing room since arriving here.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:163:22408: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_J_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:163
msgctxt "text_id=22408 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I-I, umm...I left my seat a few times, to use the restroom and explore the mansion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:175:22409: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_J_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:175
msgctxt "text_id=22409 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  I-I mean, how often does Allie invite people over? There are so many rare magical trinkets to appreciate! So I took a little self-guided tour, but everything was locked up tight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:187:22410: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_J_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:187
msgctxt "text_id=22410 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Oh, but I never went up to the second floor. That's the truth.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_J:220:22411: scene=WIK_J
#: WIK_J:220
msgctxt "text_id=22411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_K:8:22412: scene=WIK_SELECT_K
#: WIK_SELECT_K:8
msgctxt "text_id=22412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision K-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:73:22413: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:73
msgctxt "text_id=22413 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:113:22414: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:113
msgctxt "text_id=22414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The mood was a little tense, but there were no obvious contradictions between the alibis. The room grew silent."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:118:22415: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:118
msgctxt "text_id=22415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There wasn't enough evidence to pinpoint the time of Tokitsu's death."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:123:22416: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:123
msgctxt "text_id=22416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Nobody heard an explosion. And apparently, thanks to this Ploy Kickshaw nonsense, even rigor mortis wasn't a reliable indicator."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:146:22417: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:146
msgctxt "text_id=22417 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Since there was no way to deduce the exact time of death by examining the body, we could only estimate it based on the last time Tokitsu and Mr. Yamasiro were seen."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:186:22418: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:186
msgctxt "text_id=22418 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Mr. Tokitsu likely died between 1:00PM and 6:00PM;"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:194:22419: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:194
msgctxt "text_id=22419 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Mr. Yamasiro, between 4:00PM and 8:00PM."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:199:22420: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:199
msgctxt "text_id=22420 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  However, everyone was together at 7:00PM, so it had to have been sometime between 4:00PM and 7:00PM."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:246:22421: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:246
msgctxt "text_id=22421 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Only three people had solid alibis: Miss Kuonji, Father Eiri, and Sister Yuika."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:251:22422: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:251
msgctxt "text_id=22422 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji and I have alibis when it comes to Mr. Yamasiro, because we were both in the drawing room at the time."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:287:22423: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:287
msgctxt "text_id=22423 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki, Sizuki, and Beo... were unknowns."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:331:22424: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:331
msgctxt "text_id=22424 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"I think the most likely suspects are Aoko, Alice, and Ritsuka; they knew about the Ploy. The rest of us had never heard of this Sweets Hearts.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:362:22425: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:362
msgctxt "text_id=22425 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Right. We should start by considering those who've known about it for a while."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:373:22426: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:373
msgctxt "text_id=22426 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  There's a huge difference between them and the rest of us who learned about it today.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:409:22427: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:409
msgctxt "text_id=22427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was right. We needed to know when the Ploy was activated."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:423:22428: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:423
msgctxt "text_id=22428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If it was me or Mr. Yamasiro, once we arrived at the mansion, we'd have needed to find Sweets Hearts and activate it without knowing what it was."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:428:22429: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:428
msgctxt "text_id=22429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Not impossible, but not realistic."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:433:22430: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:433
msgctxt "text_id=22430 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That would classify this game as type of murder mystery involving sudden crimes―"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:438:22431: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:438
msgctxt "text_id=22431 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  the kind of scenario where unexpected tragedies occurred one after another."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:491:22432: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:491
msgctxt "text_id=22432 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  On the other hand, if someone knew about the Ploy and had access to it anytime they wanted, that would make this a premeditated crime."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:496:22433: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:496
msgctxt "text_id=22433 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was no need to figure out when the Ploy was found."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:518:22434: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:518
msgctxt "text_id=22434 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Person A would have already switched places with the Ploy and executed their plan at their leisure once everyone was gathered."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:523:22435: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:523
msgctxt "text_id=22435 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Currently, that was the most likely scenario."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:570:22436: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:570
msgctxt "text_id=22436 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"If we assume the perpetrator knew about the Ploy from the start, that makes Aozaki a suspect."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:581:22437: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:581
msgctxt "text_id=22437 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  She had enough time to kill them both."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:587:22438: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:587
msgctxt "text_id=22438 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  It would've been tough for Ritsuka to kill Yurihiko."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:598:22439: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_K_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:598
msgctxt "text_id=22439 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Kuonji... was the only person in the drawing room the entire time, so she couldn't have done it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:623:22440: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:623
msgctxt "text_id=22440 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Can't deny that. I had more than enough chances to do it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:636:22441: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:636
msgctxt "text_id=22441 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"I knew it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:663:22442: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:663
msgctxt "text_id=22442 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What's *that* supposed to mean?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:675:22443: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:675
msgctxt "text_id=22443 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I'm just saying it's possible. It's also possible somebody came to the mansion, found the Ploy, gobbled it up, and then turned into Sweets Hearts, right?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:687:22444: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:687
msgctxt "text_id=22444 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Don't be stupid. We're all suspicious to some degree here.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:714:22445: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:714
msgctxt "text_id=22445 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"...Father Eiri and I have been cleared of guilt, though.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:726:22446: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:726
msgctxt "text_id=22446 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"But how much do we really know about how you arrived at the mansion?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:738:22447: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:738
msgctxt "text_id=22447 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Alice met you in the foyer because she heard your voices, didn't she? You can't prove where you were before that.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:766:22448: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:766
msgctxt "text_id=22448 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"She's right. And it's also possible I'm conspiring with Father Eiri and Yui.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:778:22449: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_K_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:778
msgctxt "text_id=22449 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Ritsuka, whose side are you on?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:804:22450: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:804
msgctxt "text_id=22450 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I'm on logic's side! I swear on my pride as a detective (fan) to remain totally impartial!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:816:22451: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_K_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:816
msgctxt "text_id=22451 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Anyway, if we're focusing on who already knew about the Ploy, I can think of one other person that doesn't quite add up. Who wants to point her out?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:836:22452: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:836
msgctxt "text_id=22452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki and the sister glared at each other so intensely I thought I saw sparks flying."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:841:22453: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:841
msgctxt "text_id=22453 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They probably didn't get along even at the best of times."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:846:22454: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:846
msgctxt "text_id=22454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Given the situation, it's no wonder they were at each other's throats."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:888:22455: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:888
msgctxt "text_id=22455 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Aoko. I wouldn't provoke Yuika if I were you. Given the current rules, she's our best trump card.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:899:22456: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_K_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:899
msgctxt "text_id=22456 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Wha? Don't you mean our greatest foe?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:911:22457: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:911
msgctxt "text_id=22457 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"No. She's in the safest position."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:923:22458: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_K_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:923
msgctxt "text_id=22458 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Isn't that right, Yuika?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:949:22459: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_K_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:949
msgctxt "text_id=22459 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Yes. I literally do not know how to laugh."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:955:22460: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_K_0004; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:955
msgctxt "text_id=22460 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  Jokes don't work on me. I have no doubt that you'll be the first to self-destruct, Aoko.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:980:22461: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:980
msgctxt "text_id=22461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Kuonji appeared to have only meant it as a warning, but I could tell that the room was getting more tense."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:985:22462: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:985
msgctxt "text_id=22462 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Just then, the blue robin appeared in front of Miss Kuonji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1056:22463: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1056
msgctxt "text_id=22463 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It landed on the black table and started chirping."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1062:22464: voice_id=BA0_WIK_K_0000; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1062
msgctxt "text_id=22464 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"I knows the perp. Wanna hear it?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1067:22465: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1067
msgctxt "text_id=22465 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It tweeted."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1146:22466: voice_id=BA0_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=BA0; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1146
msgctxt "text_id=22466 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Bwark?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1151:22467: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1151
msgctxt "text_id=22467 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji mercilessly squashed it with a karate chop."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1164:22468: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_K_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1164
msgctxt "text_id=22468 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"...Anyway..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1176:22469: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_K_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1176
msgctxt "text_id=22469 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  One funny line could be the end of you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1200:22470: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_K_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1200
msgctxt "text_id=22470 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"True. Anyone not named Yuika might want to find a good place to hide before it's too late.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1226:22471: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1226
msgctxt "text_id=22471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That made sense to me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_K:1231:22472: scene=WIK_K
#: WIK_K:1231
msgctxt "text_id=22472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_L:8:22473: scene=WIK_SELECT_L
#: WIK_SELECT_L:8
msgctxt "text_id=22473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision L-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:30:22474: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=22474 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I felt that it was best..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:30:22475: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=22475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...for everyone to stay in different guest rooms until morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:66:22476: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:66
msgctxt "text_id=22476 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"That's all there is to say."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:77:22477: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:77
msgctxt "text_id=22477 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  There's no point in ratcheting up suspicions even further. We can resolve this, whether we know the culprit or not.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:83:22478: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:83
msgctxt "text_id=22478 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Just like that, Sister Yuika took the reins."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:130:22479: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:130
msgctxt "text_id=22479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Nobody objected to her display of authority. Well, almost nobody. Ritsuka was sulking."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:168:22480: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:168
msgctxt "text_id=22480 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Everyone, please spend the night in different guest rooms."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:174:22481: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_L_1_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:174
msgctxt "text_id=22481 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  Make sure to lock your doors and don't let anyone in until morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:180:22482: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_L_1_0004; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:180
msgctxt "text_id=22482 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  Father Eiri, Ritsuka, and I will stand guard here, so if anything unusual happens, we'll come running.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:216:22483: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:216
msgctxt "text_id=22483 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"...Good enough for me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:227:22484: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:227
msgctxt "text_id=22484 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  The suspect could be from the Church, but at least there's no chance Yuika's a Ploy.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:238:22485: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:238
msgctxt "text_id=22485 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Why is that?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:264:22486: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:264
msgctxt "text_id=22486 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"She hates witches. No way she'd ever fall for a Ploy Kickshaw's sweet talk."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:275:22487: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:275
msgctxt "text_id=22487 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Okay, we're done here. Everyone grab what you need, return to your rooms, and lock yourselves in until morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:281:22488: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:281
msgctxt "text_id=22488 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  You'll just have to postpone your toilet breaks until tomorrow.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:317:22489: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:317
msgctxt "text_id=22489 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:323:22490: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:323
msgctxt "text_id=22490 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The plan to hole up in our rooms was accepted before I could say anything."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:328:22491: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:328
msgctxt "text_id=22491 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It did seem like the safest and simplest plan."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:364:22492: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:364
msgctxt "text_id=22492 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"...I can't use my room, though."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:375:22493: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:375
msgctxt "text_id=22493 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  Tobimaru, can I stay in yours?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:386:22494: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:386
msgctxt "text_id=22494 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Yeah. Kinomi's gone, so that's fine.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:407:22495: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:407
msgctxt "text_id=22495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji took some cookies and a pitcher of water from Sizuki, before heading begrudgingly for the foyer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:447:22496: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:447
msgctxt "text_id=22496 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Hold on, Tsukiji! Are you really fine with this?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:458:22497: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:458
msgctxt "text_id=22497 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Hell no, but the majority's spoken. We're smothering the problem without solving it-gotta love democracy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:469:22498: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:469
msgctxt "text_id=22498 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Still, it's the obvious choice. If anything happens, shout for help. I'm on the second floor, so I got you covered.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:519:22499: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:519
msgctxt "text_id=22499 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Ugh. I never should've cancelled my concert."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:531:22500: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_1_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:531
msgctxt "text_id=22500 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "Alice, show me to my room. And by that, I mean *your* room, obviously; not a guest room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:542:22501: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:542
msgctxt "text_id=22501 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I know I can't expect a royal suite here, so I'll suffer the owner's room.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:588:22502: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_1_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:588
msgctxt "text_id=22502 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"I'll be in my bedroom. Nobody better come near it until morning.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:602:22503: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_L_1_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:602
msgctxt "text_id=22503 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"I'll just sleep here. Wake me if anything happens.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:636:22504: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:636
msgctxt "text_id=22504 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...Everyone went their separate ways."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:641:22505: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:641
msgctxt "text_id=22505 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Doubt still nagged at me, but I went to my assigned guest room for the time being."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:690:22506: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:690
msgctxt "text_id=22506 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:696:22507: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:696
msgctxt "text_id=22507 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I locked the door and lay on the bed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:703:22508: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:703
msgctxt "text_id=22508 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Just in case, I decided not to change into my pajamas."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:732:22509: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_1_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:732
msgctxt "text_id=22509 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Laugh and you die? Doesn't make any sense...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:738:22510: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:738
msgctxt "text_id=22510 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Someone or something was clearly trying to kill us all."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:743:22511: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:743
msgctxt "text_id=22511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I turned on my side, thoughts racing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:748:22512: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:748
msgctxt "text_id=22512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  To me, Tsukiji and Father Eiri were *too* rational. They'd overlooked something."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:768:22513: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:768
msgctxt "text_id=22513 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I wasn't fixated on the culprit's face or identity."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:773:22514: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:773
msgctxt "text_id=22514 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was more concerned with the whydunit."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_1:778:22515: scene=WIK_L_1
#: WIK_L_1:778
msgctxt "text_id=22515 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  What did the culprit have to gain by killing us all?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:33:22516: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:33
msgctxt "text_id=22516 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I felt that..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:33:22517: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:33
msgctxt "text_id=22517 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  we needed to dig more into the pink girl's alibi."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:61:22518: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:61
msgctxt "text_id=22518 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Huh? You want me to go, too?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:77:22519: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:77
msgctxt "text_id=22519 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I've got nothing to do with any of this. If you thought about it for even a second, you'd realize those two idiots died before I got here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:89:22520: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:89
msgctxt "text_id=22520 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I don't even have a reason to use Sweets Hearts. I'm a rich celebrity; I can solve most of my problems with money, not to mention petty wishes. If I wanted to call down a storm, I'd do it even if it meant sacrificing everyone around me.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:120:22521: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:120
msgctxt "text_id=22521 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Don't be a dumbass. You're as much a suspect as anyone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:131:22522: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:131
msgctxt "text_id=22522 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  You know about Ploys, you have a grudge against Aozaki and Kuonji, and you're way too over the top."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:137:22523: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:137
msgctxt "text_id=22523 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  On top of that, you showed up uninvited. In a freakin' helicopter!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:164:22524: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:164
msgctxt "text_id=22524 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"What's more, you weren't wet from the rain when you came in."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:170:22525: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:170
msgctxt "text_id=22525 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Care to explain that?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:181:22526: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:181
msgctxt "text_id=22526 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  I bet you hid somewhere in the mansion, called your helicopter in, then made it seem like you just got here!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:209:22527: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:209
msgctxt "text_id=22527 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Oh, come off it!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:221:22528: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:221
msgctxt "text_id=22528 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Of course I came here in a helicopter! I used my Goblin to keep the rain off me! You seriously think I'd come here just to murder you all?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:258:22529: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:258
msgctxt "text_id=22529 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"You've definitely thought about it before.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:264:22530: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:264
msgctxt "text_id=22530 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"She has.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:291:22531: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:291
msgctxt "text_id=22531 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"That has nothing to do with this!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:303:22532: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:303
msgctxt "text_id=22532 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Ugh, you're giving me a headache. I'm leaving. Just you wait, I'll be back with an Operation British of my own. Ground zero: this house.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:343:22533: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:343
msgctxt "text_id=22533 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Can you even leave? Remember what Alice said?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:355:22534: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:355
msgctxt "text_id=22534 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"It's highly likely that Sweets Hearts's probability shift has collapsed the roads."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:361:22535: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:361
msgctxt "text_id=22535 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  And the phone is still out.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:385:22536: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0007; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:385
msgctxt "text_id=22536 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Ha! I can still fly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:396:22537: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0008; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:396
msgctxt "text_id=22537 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I'll just call my helicopter to come pick me up."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:402:22538: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0009; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:402
msgctxt "text_id=22538 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Don't underestimate the power of my Goblin Nest!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:430:22539: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:430
msgctxt "text_id=22539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The girl in pink stormed out into the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:502:22540: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0010; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:502
msgctxt "text_id=22540 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Hello, Daddy? It's me. Can you send a helicopter to Shiroinuzuka in Misaki...? Yes, *that* Misaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:515:22541: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0011; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:515
msgctxt "text_id=22541 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "What?! What do you mean, give up?! Have you gone SENILE, you old codger?! I decided I'd keep trying until victory is mine! And I NEVER lost in the first place! That was just a draw!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:528:22542: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0012; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:528
msgctxt "text_id=22542 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  You know the coordinates. Send me a chopper now! You've got ten minutes!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:555:22543: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0013; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:555
msgctxt "text_id=22543 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Huh? What do you mean you can't send one in this storm? Do I sound like I care!?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:561:22544: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0014; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:561
msgctxt "text_id=22544 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Or are you suggesting that I fly myself out of here like a missile!?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:573:22545: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0015; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:573
msgctxt "text_id=22545 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  ...We don't have any helicopters to send? You call yourself a businessman, you dimwit? Use your brain! There's a military base nearby, remember? They're testing a prototype assault craft there. Just charter it!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:600:22546: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0016; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:600
msgctxt "text_id=22546 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Goodness, can't you do *anything* on your own?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:612:22547: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0017; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:612
msgctxt "text_id=22547 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  WHAT?! What do you mean, cash is tight because you're restructuring?! You'd have to buy the entire aircraft and crew? Go ahead, then! I can make you back that money in a day! I'll just do a private concert for some oil sheikh or a Chinese billionaire! That good enough for you?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:639:22548: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0018; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:639
msgctxt "text_id=22548 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Oh *please*, don't cry and tell me how proud you are of me. It's just for the *money*, Daddy. I couldn't care less about the music industry!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:645:22549: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0019; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:645
msgctxt "text_id=22549 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Just get me that helicopter within TEN minutes! That new, experimental, super-cool one! NOT some budget Apache or any other rubbish like that, or I'LL NEVER SPEAK TO YOU AGAIN!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:699:22550: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:699
msgctxt "text_id=22550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The pink girl's vicious berating could be heard throughout the house."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:704:22551: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:704
msgctxt "text_id=22551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She was speaking English so quickly and with so much slang mixed in that I couldn't quite catch it all."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:709:22552: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:709
msgctxt "text_id=22552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...Listening wasn't a particular strength of mine, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:737:22553: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:737
msgctxt "text_id=22553 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Did that moron really just order a military chopper?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:778:22554: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0020; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:778
msgctxt "text_id=22554 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Right, that's all settled. My guardian angel will be descending from the skies in about ten minutes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:791:22555: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0021; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:791
msgctxt "text_id=22555 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Sweets Hearts's rules only apply to this mountain. As soon as I get out of here, I'll put all this behind me. I'll just head home, have a fancy dinner, and relax.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:819:22556: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0022; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:819
msgctxt "text_id=22556 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Oh, and don't worry."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:832:22557: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0023; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:832
msgctxt "text_id=22557 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I'm not that terrible of a person. If any of you want a ride, I'd be happy to oblige. I'm sure some of you are tired of this stupid detective game.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:864:22558: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:864
msgctxt "text_id=22558 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Hold it, buddy. Where do you think you're going?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:881:22559: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:881
msgctxt "text_id=22559 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Well, she said she was our guardian angel.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:912:22560: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_L_2_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:912
msgctxt "text_id=22560 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I wouldn't if I were you, Soujyuro. If she's an angel, then that makes Aozaki a goddess of healing. Don't fall for her crazy metaphors.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:938:22561: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:938
msgctxt "text_id=22561 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Huh. What about you, Kumari?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:938:22562: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:938
msgctxt "text_id=22562 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  You heard what Tobimaru said.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:949:22563: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:949
msgctxt "text_id=22563 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I'm not going. If she wants to leave, she can go by herself.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:955:22564: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:955
msgctxt "text_id=22564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  To be honest, if rescue was coming, I really did want to leave. But I wasn't about to owe this pink princess any favors."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:980:22565: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0024; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:980
msgctxt "text_id=22565 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Hmph. You must all be a bunch of dreamers to stay all chummy at a time like this."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:993:22566: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0025; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:993
msgctxt "text_id=22566 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  You lot can do as you please. Just don't let tomorrow's headline be, 'all guests missing from the hilltop mansion.'\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1019:22567: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_2_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1019
msgctxt "text_id=22567 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Ha! Snark all you want, coward."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1030:22568: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_2_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1030
msgctxt "text_id=22568 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  Nobody's coming for you in this weather. It's like hell out there. Who's really dreaming?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1043:22569: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0026; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1043
msgctxt "text_id=22569 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"...!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1065:22570: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1065
msgctxt "text_id=22570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And then..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1070:22571: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1070
msgctxt "text_id=22571 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Before even ten minutes had gone by, there was a bizarre noise from outside that was separate from the howling storm."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1102:22572: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0027; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1102
msgctxt "text_id=22572 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Aha! Earlier than expected!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1108:22573: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0028; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1108
msgctxt "text_id=22573 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I knew Daddy would come through! He's got friends in high places, and he knows how to use them!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1212:22574: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1212
msgctxt "text_id=22574 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In the midst of the tempest, a demonic bird came bearing down on us."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1217:22575: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1217
msgctxt "text_id=22575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Bright spots that I'd thought were eyes turned out to be a powerful searchlight, its beam stretching out for miles."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1222:22576: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1222
msgctxt "text_id=22576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The steel helicopter struggled against winds in excess of 50 miles per hour, and then..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1580:22577: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_2_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1580
msgctxt "text_id=22577 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Oh. It crashed.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1593:22578: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0029; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1593
msgctxt "text_id=22578 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Ah... AaaaAAaAAAhhh...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1694:22579: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_L_2_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1694
msgctxt "text_id=22579 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"They should've known better than to fly in this weather. Even Alice has better common sense than that.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1718:22580: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_L_2_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1718
msgctxt "text_id=22580 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Right. I knew it was going to crash. None of Riddell's silly plans ever work out.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1728:22581: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0030; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1728
msgctxt "text_id=22581 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"They work perfectly every time! Just never when you're around!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1741:22582: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0031; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1741
msgctxt "text_id=22582 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Anyway, that was just a test."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1755:22583: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0032_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1755
msgctxt "text_id=22583 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  My real plan is just beginning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1769:22584: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0032_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1769
msgctxt "text_id=22584 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "Hang on, I have to take this. Time out.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1806:22585: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1806
msgctxt "text_id=22585 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The pink girl went back out into the hallway. Maybe she had a pager in her pocket."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1814:22586: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0033; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1814
msgctxt "text_id=22586 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"WHAT!? They're claiming you're responsible...?! Special forces are breaching the company office!?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1832:22587: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1832
msgctxt "text_id=22587 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Her yelling resonated through the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1872:22588: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0034; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1872
msgctxt "text_id=22588 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Calm down. Don't do anything stupid. Talk to the commanding officer. Huh? They want you to pay for the damages? They're going to kill you if you don't buy out the entire project? You're already tied up? Ugh, what's Kai doing at a time like this?! So how much do they want? Pfft! That's at least two more zeroes than it should be! We can't pay that, not right away!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1900:22589: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0035; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1900
msgctxt "text_id=22589 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "Hold on a second, um... hmm... maybe there is a way.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1921:22590: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_L_2_0036; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1921
msgctxt "text_id=22590 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"I'll extend my tour this year, sell off my stock, my island in Tahiti... That should be enough. Okay, it's a deal! Sign the papers! The defense industry is new territory for us, but your life is more important, Daddy!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1957:22591: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_L_2_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1957
msgctxt "text_id=22591 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1962:22592: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1962
msgctxt "text_id=22592 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was a little curious now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_L_2:1967:22593: scene=WIK_L_2
#: WIK_L_2:1967
msgctxt "text_id=22593 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_M:8:22594: scene=WIK_SELECT_M
#: WIK_SELECT_M:8
msgctxt "text_id=22594 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision M-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_1:30:22595: scene=WIK_M_1
#: WIK_M_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=22595 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think I'll take a peek in the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_1:72:22596: scene=WIK_M_1
#: WIK_M_1:72
msgctxt "text_id=22596 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There, I saw..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_1:85:22597: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_1_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_1
#: WIK_M_1:85
msgctxt "text_id=22597 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"...I've lost everything... Everything...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_1:90:22598: scene=WIK_M_1
#: WIK_M_1:90
msgctxt "text_id=22598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Her face was haunted, as if she'd looked upon the end of the world."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_1:95:22599: scene=WIK_M_1
#: WIK_M_1:95
msgctxt "text_id=22599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I quickly shut the door and pretended I didn't see anything. She deserved a warrior's dignity, at the very least."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:33:22600: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:33
msgctxt "text_id=22600 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A moment went by."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:38:22601: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:38
msgctxt "text_id=22601 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After about a minute..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:66:22602: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:66
msgctxt "text_id=22602 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Forget that stupid helicopter."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:77:22603: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:77
msgctxt "text_id=22603 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  Let's think more positively.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:85:22604: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:85
msgctxt "text_id=22604 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She returned, acting as if nothing had happened."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:90:22605: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:90
msgctxt "text_id=22605 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We were enemies, but I had to respect her sense of pride."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:127:22606: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:127
msgctxt "text_id=22606 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Riddell, you...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:138:22607: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:138
msgctxt "text_id=22607 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Tobimaru. I said, let's move on.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:149:22608: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:149
msgctxt "text_id=22608 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"...Fine. At least we know you're innocent. If it turns out you're Sweets Hearts after all this crap, I don't think I can look you in the eye ever again.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:175:22609: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:175
msgctxt "text_id=22609 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"I told you I had nothing to do with any of this from the start."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:186:22610: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:186
msgctxt "text_id=22610 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I'm a genius, a rare Meinster, a witch for the modern age. The great Riddell would never stoop to using silly obsolete Ploys.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:218:22611: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:218
msgctxt "text_id=22611 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"But you'd use a helicopter?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:229:22612: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0005; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:229
msgctxt "text_id=22612 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Shut up about the helicopter! This is about ME!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:235:22613: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0006; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:235
msgctxt "text_id=22613 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  I laughed, but I'm still alive, aren't I?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:246:22614: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0007; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:246
msgctxt "text_id=22614 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "  There isn't a chance in hell I'm going to laugh again. I'm going to watch you all get picked off one by one by some ancient Ploy!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:305:22615: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:305
msgctxt "text_id=22615 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She sounded aggressive, but I think the pink girl was more concerned than she let on."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:310:22616: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:310
msgctxt "text_id=22616 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With one last huff through her nose, she plopped down on the sofa."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:315:22617: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:315
msgctxt "text_id=22617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She seemed to made up her mind to work with us for tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:340:22618: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:340
msgctxt "text_id=22618 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Sorry, but I'll be back in a second. Carry on.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:349:22619: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:349
msgctxt "text_id=22619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji was... ah, the bathroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:373:22620: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:373
msgctxt "text_id=22620 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Now we know for sure that escape is impossible."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:384:22621: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:384
msgctxt "text_id=22621 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  We need to figure out who Sweets Hearts is, or survive until morning. I personally favor the latter.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:420:22622: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:420
msgctxt "text_id=22622 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Me, too. If we keep poking the hornet's nest, we might all end up dead."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:431:22623: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:431
msgctxt "text_id=22623 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  What about you, Kumari?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:457:22624: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:457
msgctxt "text_id=22624 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I'm fine with either... Tsukiji?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:475:22625: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:475
msgctxt "text_id=22625 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Me? I vote we figure out who the killer is."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:487:22626: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:487
msgctxt "text_id=22626 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  I'd like to give them a piece of my mind.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:525:22627: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:525
msgctxt "text_id=22627 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"I'm fine either way. I don't share Miss Riddell's opinion, but I'll be safe with either option.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:535:22628: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:535
msgctxt "text_id=22628 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I'm with Tsukiji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:535:22629: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:535
msgctxt "text_id=22629 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Time for a little deductive reasoning!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:572:22630: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:572
msgctxt "text_id=22630 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"As for me... Let me think. The weather's only getting worse, so maybe we should stay in our rooms, lock the doors, and go to sleep. Nobody can make us laugh, then.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:583:22631: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_M_A_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:583
msgctxt "text_id=22631 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Aww, but that's so boring!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:594:22632: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:594
msgctxt "text_id=22632 | speaker=beo"
msgid "  Come on, Soujyuro! Let's stick this out! Don't you want to watch Aoko die?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:606:22633: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0001_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:606
msgctxt "text_id=22633 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Beo, that's not funny―"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:619:22634: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0001_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:619
msgctxt "text_id=22634 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "Hm?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:679:22635: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:679
msgctxt "text_id=22635 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:684:22636: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:684
msgctxt "text_id=22636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Suddenly, the room was pitch-dark."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:710:22637: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:710
msgctxt "text_id=22637 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Everyone stay calm. It's just a power outage. If I find out who turned the lights out, I'll knock *their* lights out.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:717:22638: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:717
msgctxt "text_id=22638 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:723:22639: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:723
msgctxt "text_id=22639 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That was a close one. I heard several people almost fail to suppress a laugh."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:749:22640: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:749
msgctxt "text_id=22640 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What're you thinking, Eiri?! You could've killed us all!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:754:22641: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:754
msgctxt "text_id=22641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He would've killed *you*, maybe."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:759:22642: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:759
msgctxt "text_id=22642 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But I decided to keep that to myself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:786:22643: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:786
msgctxt "text_id=22643 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"I couldn't help it. The opportunity presented itself.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:809:22644: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:809
msgctxt "text_id=22644 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Good timing, though. Even a silly joke can be effective if the timing is right.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:820:22645: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:820
msgctxt "text_id=22645 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Something about not being able to see his face makes it funnier, too.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:831:22646: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0008; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:831
msgctxt "text_id=22646 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Good grief. Even I almost laughed. Are you sure he isn't the killer?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:866:22647: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:866
msgctxt "text_id=22647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Our conversation continued in the dark."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:871:22648: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:871
msgctxt "text_id=22648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It reminded me of telling ghost stories on a school trip; it's just fun to talk in the dark sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:876:22649: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:876
msgctxt "text_id=22649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For whatever reason, I could tell we were all tempted to make each other laugh."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:908:22650: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:908
msgctxt "text_id=22650 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Found a candle. Anyone got some matches?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:908:22651: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:908
msgctxt "text_id=22651 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Or a lighter?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:917:22652: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:917
msgctxt "text_id=22652 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"When my Italian plumber lost weight, he got-a-lighter.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:929:22653: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:929
msgctxt "text_id=22653 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Was that Father Eiri again?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:955:22654: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:955
msgctxt "text_id=22654 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Oh, man. That was so bad.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:967:22655: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:967
msgctxt "text_id=22655 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"I feel dumber for having heard it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:978:22656: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:978
msgctxt "text_id=22656 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Nah. I think the simple jokes actually work better given the primal circumstances we're in.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1021:22657: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1021
msgctxt "text_id=22657 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Hey, be quiet. I think the power's coming back on.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1075:22658: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1075
msgctxt "text_id=22658 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Did the Kuonji Estate have its own power generator?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1080:22659: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1080
msgctxt "text_id=22659 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It wasn't clear who restored the power, but the drawing room was flooded with artificial light."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1105:22660: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0009; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1105
msgctxt "text_id=22660 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Looks like this old mansion at least has some proper equipment. I was worried we were going to be stuck in the dark until morning.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1112:22661: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1112
msgctxt "text_id=22661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Riddell had moved next to me at some point. She looked up."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1117:22662: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1117
msgctxt "text_id=22662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I followed her gaze..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1273:22663: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0010; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1273
msgctxt "text_id=22663 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"Bwahahahaha―"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22664 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Hurk!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1428:22665: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1428
msgctxt "text_id=22665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The pink girl took what looked like several impacts to the chest, spun around dramatically, and collapsed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1474:22666: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1474
msgctxt "text_id=22666 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Riddell?! What happened?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1486:22667: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1486
msgctxt "text_id=22667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki rushed over to her side."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1491:22668: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1491
msgctxt "text_id=22668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd narrowly avoided the same fate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1496:22669: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1496
msgctxt "text_id=22669 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If she hadn't started laughing first, I'd have busted a gut for sure."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1554:22670: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1554
msgctxt "text_id=22670 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Riddell! Hang in there!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1560:22671: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1560
msgctxt "text_id=22671 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Before you die, tell us what you saw! Was it the killer?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1567:22672: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0011_0; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1567
msgctxt "text_id=22672 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "\"H-Heh... No, something... much more... interesting...much worse... a squishy... demon..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1577:22673: speaker=liddell; speaker_ja=リデル; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B80_WIK_M_A_0011_1; voice_prefix=B80; voice_category=13; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1577
msgctxt "text_id=22673 | speaker=liddell"
msgid "Blargh.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1608:22674: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_M_A_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1608
msgctxt "text_id=22674 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Riddell!!!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1628:22675: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1628
msgctxt "text_id=22675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki burst into tears, clutching May's lifeless body in her arms."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1633:22676: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1633
msgctxt "text_id=22676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They were probably more alike than they cared to admit."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1645:22677: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1645
msgctxt "text_id=22677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Amidst the commotion, Miss Kuonji returned, not appearing to have noticed the death."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1672:22678: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_M_A_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1672
msgctxt "text_id=22678 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"What's going on?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1682:22679: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1682
msgctxt "text_id=22679 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I don't know. She just burst out laughing for no reason and then she was gone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1682:22680: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_M_A_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1682
msgctxt "text_id=22680 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Don't think she's coming back from this one.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1716:22681: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1716
msgctxt "text_id=22681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Perhaps out of pity, Tsukiji covered her with a tablecloth and lay her to rest at the side of the room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1721:22682: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1721
msgctxt "text_id=22682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I quietly shuffled over to Miss Kuonji and whispered in her ear."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1763:22683: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1763
msgctxt "text_id=22683 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Miss Kuonji, what was *that*?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1775:22684: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_M_A_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1775
msgctxt "text_id=22684 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"I mixed up my change of clothes. Don't tell anyone, Kumari.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1787:22685: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_M_A_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1787
msgctxt "text_id=22685 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...Okay, but you're not the killer, are you?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1814:22686: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_M_A_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1814
msgctxt "text_id=22686 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Of course not. This was just a hobby of mine, don't worry."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1826:22687: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_M_A_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1826
msgctxt "text_id=22687 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  For some reason, I've always felt like bullying her, and I can't explain why.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1837:22688: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1837
msgctxt "text_id=22688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  \"It's really too bad,\" she sighed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1842:22689: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1842
msgctxt "text_id=22689 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Again, I felt a little sorry for Riddell."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1951:22690: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1951
msgctxt "text_id=22690 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That made four victims."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1956:22691: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1956
msgctxt "text_id=22691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone seemed resigned to locking ourselves in our rooms for the night."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_M_A:1962:22692: scene=WIK_M_A
#: WIK_M_A:1962
msgctxt "text_id=22692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_N:8:22693: scene=WIK_SELECT_N
#: WIK_SELECT_N:8
msgctxt "text_id=22693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision N-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:93:22694: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:93
msgctxt "text_id=22694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...I was roused by the sound of wind."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:98:22695: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:98
msgctxt "text_id=22695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The lights were out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:104:22696: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:104
msgctxt "text_id=22696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I didn't remember turning them off before I went to sleep."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " I got up and tried the light switch, but nothing happened."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:130:22698: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:130
msgctxt "text_id=22698 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:135:22699: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:135
msgctxt "text_id=22699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I wanted to check the time, but that wasn't happening in this darkness."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:140:22700: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:140
msgctxt "text_id=22700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I tried my best to go back to sleep and pretend everything was okay, but I was too on edge. I could barely even stay still."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:161:22701: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:161
msgctxt "text_id=22701 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Aozaki's room is the closest, right...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:167:22702: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:167
msgctxt "text_id=22702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I moved as quietly as possible to the door, unlocked it, and peeked into the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:219:22703: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:219
msgctxt "text_id=22703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...It seemed empty."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:225:22704: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:225
msgctxt "text_id=22704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...The only sound came from the wind and rain."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:231:22705: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:231
msgctxt "text_id=22705 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...As if led by something, I ventured into the hallway and down towards Aozaki's room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:251:22706: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:251
msgctxt "text_id=22706 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I placed my hand on her doorknob."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:274:22707: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:274
msgctxt "text_id=22707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was unlocked."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:279:22708: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:279
msgctxt "text_id=22708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Inside her room, I found..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:316:22709: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:316
msgctxt "text_id=22709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...a dead body. The corpse of a woman I've never seen before."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:337:22710: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:337
msgctxt "text_id=22710 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:342:22711: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:342
msgctxt "text_id=22711 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Did I scream? Did I manage to hold it in? I couldn't tell."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:347:22712: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:347
msgctxt "text_id=22712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The rain tonight was too intense."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:353:22713: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:353
msgctxt "text_id=22713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Creak. Creak."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:358:22714: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:358
msgctxt "text_id=22714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Oh, that wasn't the rain. It was the sound of hinges."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:363:22715: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:363
msgctxt "text_id=22715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I realized a door was swinging, and looked in its direction."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:383:22716: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:383
msgctxt "text_id=22716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was coming from the room next to Aozaki's."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:388:22717: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:388
msgctxt "text_id=22717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki told me before that it was her study."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:393:22718: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:393
msgctxt "text_id=22718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Something was on the door."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:419:22719: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:419
msgctxt "text_id=22719 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A liquid, thick... and red... like paint."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:448:22720: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:448
msgctxt "text_id=22720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Inside the study"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:479:22721: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:479
msgctxt "text_id=22721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I found"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:525:22722: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:525
msgctxt "text_id=22722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  the gruesome sight of"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:571:22723: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:571
msgctxt "text_id=22723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aoko Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:639:22724: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:639
msgctxt "text_id=22724 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:686:22725: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:686
msgctxt "text_id=22725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I ran down the hallway. I didn't care about making noise anymore. The storm was too loud to hear anything."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:696:22726: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:696
msgctxt "text_id=22726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I threw open the door to each guest room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:705:22727: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:705
msgctxt "text_id=22727 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In the third room, I find the lifeless body of the boy who'd been on my mind for three years."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:761:22728: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:761
msgctxt "text_id=22728 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Hah, hah, hah!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:767:22729: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:767
msgctxt "text_id=22729 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Panting, I nearly rolled down the stairs."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:772:22730: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:772
msgctxt "text_id=22730 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Too fast. I fell. My body bounced off the steps, and rolled into the foyer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:792:22731: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:792
msgctxt "text_id=22731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Nobody was around."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:797:22732: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:797
msgctxt "text_id=22732 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The front door's wide open, as if we had a visitor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:802:22733: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:802
msgctxt "text_id=22733 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My instincts told me that the church members were already ____."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:826:22734: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:826
msgctxt "text_id=22734 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I heard faint footsteps."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:831:22735: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:831
msgctxt "text_id=22735 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The sound of the storm faded."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:836:22736: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:836
msgctxt "text_id=22736 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  All sounds around me washed away."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:841:22737: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:841
msgctxt "text_id=22737 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In front of me..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:863:22738: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_A_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:863
msgctxt "text_id=22738 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Ahh...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:869:22739: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:869
msgctxt "text_id=22739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I felt nothing. No fear. No anger."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:874:22740: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:874
msgctxt "text_id=22740 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My heart was as calm as a lake, as I laid eyes on the stormy night killer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:954:22741: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:954
msgctxt "text_id=22741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Two eyes flashed in the darkness."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:959:22742: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:959
msgctxt "text_id=22742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Light glinted off the weapon in their hands."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:1007:22743: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:1007
msgctxt "text_id=22743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Their face was unworldly, twisted, demonic."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1_A:1012:22744: scene=WIK_N_1_A
#: WIK_N_1_A:1012
msgctxt "text_id=22744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was the last thing I ever saw."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:30:22745: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=22745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I agreed that it was the best option we had."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:60:22746: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_N_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:60
msgctxt "text_id=22746 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"We won't gain anything from grilling each other. Let's just make a decision."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:66:22747: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_N_1_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:66
msgctxt "text_id=22747 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Raise your hand if you think we should stay in our rooms until morning.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:102:22748: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:102
msgctxt "text_id=22748 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I raised my hand."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:108:22749: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:108
msgctxt "text_id=22749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In favor were... Aozaki, Sister Yuika, Sizuki, and..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22750 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Beo, who voted along with Sizuki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:142:22751: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:142
msgctxt "text_id=22751 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Those against were Ritsuka, Father Eiri, Tsukiji, and Miss Kuonji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:147:22752: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:147
msgctxt "text_id=22752 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With Beo as the tiebreaker, our side won."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:172:22753: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_N_1_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:172
msgctxt "text_id=22753 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"That settles it. Everyone go to your rooms, lock them, and don't leave until morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:184:22754: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_N_1_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:184
msgctxt "text_id=22754 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  If you need anything, get it from the kitchen now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:196:22755: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_N_1_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:196
msgctxt "text_id=22755 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  If you need to use the toilet, hold it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:233:22756: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:233
msgctxt "text_id=22756 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone had to be exhausted from a long night of deduction."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:238:22757: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:238
msgctxt "text_id=22757 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We barely spoke as we headed off to our respective rooms."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:288:22758: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:288
msgctxt "text_id=22758 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:294:22759: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:294
msgctxt "text_id=22759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I locked the door and lay down on the bed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:301:22760: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:301
msgctxt "text_id=22760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Just in case, I decided not to change into my pajamas."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:329:22761: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:329
msgctxt "text_id=22761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The day was almost over."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:334:22762: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:334
msgctxt "text_id=22762 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Once midnight passed, the first day of our three-day break would come to a close."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:339:22763: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:339
msgctxt "text_id=22763 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I never imagined spending a vacation like this in a million years."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:371:22764: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_N_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:371
msgctxt "text_id=22764 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...Oh, crap... getting... sleepy...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:377:22765: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:377
msgctxt "text_id=22765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My eyelids grew heavy the instant I lay down."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_1:382:22766: scene=WIK_N_1
#: WIK_N_1:382
msgctxt "text_id=22766 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I knew I still had things to consider, but warm slumber embraced me in moments."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_2:30:22767: scene=WIK_N_2
#: WIK_N_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=22767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think it's too dangerous to hole up in our rooms."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_N_2:35:22768: scene=WIK_N_2
#: WIK_N_2:35
msgctxt "text_id=22768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The reason being..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_O:8:22769: scene=WIK_SELECT_O
#: WIK_SELECT_O:8
msgctxt "text_id=22769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision O-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:27:22770: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_NAP_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:27
msgctxt "text_id=22770 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Whew, I'm beat.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:50:22771: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:50
msgctxt "text_id=22771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I plopped my butt down on the bed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:55:22772: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:55
msgctxt "text_id=22772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was always self-conscious around Tsukiji, but Miss Kuonji made me nervous in a different way."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:93:22773: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:93
msgctxt "text_id=22773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For some reason, I always felt a pang of guilt whenever she looked at me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:98:22774: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:98
msgctxt "text_id=22774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was like being gently interrogated, being confronted with all of my life's failures."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:124:22775: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:124
msgctxt "text_id=22775 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I doubt she meant to make me feel that way. It was just how I reacted to her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:129:22776: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:129
msgctxt "text_id=22776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Nobody was perfect, after all."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:172:22777: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_NAP_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:172
msgctxt "text_id=22777 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I don't know how Aozaki and Sizuki can live with her every day.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:178:22778: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:178
msgctxt "text_id=22778 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could only respect them for that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:186:22779: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:186
msgctxt "text_id=22779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki simply had an iron will; I bet she lived life without any regrets."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:197:22780: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:197
msgctxt "text_id=22780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki was completely different; it was clear he was just oblivious to how scary Miss Kuonji's gaze could be."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:245:22781: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_NAP_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:245
msgctxt "text_id=22781 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Anyway...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:255:22782: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:255
msgctxt "text_id=22782 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I fell backward onto the bed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:280:22783: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:280
msgctxt "text_id=22783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Outside my window, the sky was overcast."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:285:22784: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:285
msgctxt "text_id=22784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The weather forecast had said the three-day weekend was supposed to be sunny. Not so in the mountains, I suppose."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:327:22785: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:327
msgctxt "text_id=22785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At this point, I'd met six people staying here:"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:334:22786: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:334
msgctxt "text_id=22786 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:342:22787: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:342
msgctxt "text_id=22787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Miss Kuonji,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:350:22788: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:350
msgctxt "text_id=22788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Sizuki,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:359:22789: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:359
msgctxt "text_id=22789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Tsukiji"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:368:22790: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:368
msgctxt "text_id=22790 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " that idiot Housuke,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:376:22791: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:376
msgctxt "text_id=22791 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Mr. Yamasiro,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:385:22792: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:385
msgctxt "text_id=22792 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " and Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:390:22793: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:390
msgctxt "text_id=22793 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji had implied that there were other guests staying here, too."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:407:22794: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:407
msgctxt "text_id=22794 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This was a Western-style house and people didn't take their shoes off at the entrance, so I couldn't guess their number by counting shoes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:412:22795: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:412
msgctxt "text_id=22795 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For now, I had no idea how many other people were here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:456:22796: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:456
msgctxt "text_id=22796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I decided to rest my eyes and take a short nap."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:461:22797: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:461
msgctxt "text_id=22797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  One trick I'd picked up from years of part-time work was the ability to sleep in exact 15-minute intervals."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:482:22798: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:482
msgctxt "text_id=22798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:487:22799: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:487
msgctxt "text_id=22799 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ......"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:492:22800: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:492
msgctxt "text_id=22800 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ........."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NAP:497:22801: scene=WIK_NAP
#: WIK_NAP:497
msgctxt "text_id=22801 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As I drifted off, I heard a laugh. Or was it a scream?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:74:22802: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:74
msgctxt "text_id=22802 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Slinging over my shoulder the bag I'd put down in the drawing room, I headed up to the guest rooms on the second floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:79:22803: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:79
msgctxt "text_id=22803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  According to Aozaki, I would be staying in the second room of the east wing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:135:22804: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_NOROOM_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:135
msgctxt "text_id=22804 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Oh.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:140:22805: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:140
msgctxt "text_id=22805 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As I headed out into the hallway, I ran into Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:145:22806: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:145
msgctxt "text_id=22806 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She seemed to be on her way from the bedrooms to the hall."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:166:22807: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_NOROOM_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:166
msgctxt "text_id=22807 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"You taking a break too, Aozaki? Is that your room on the end there?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:178:22808: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_NOROOM_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:178
msgctxt "text_id=22808 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Um, y-yeah, but I'm not going in there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:190:22809: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_NOROOM_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:190
msgctxt "text_id=22809 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I'm just looking for something. Don't mind me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:202:22810: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_NOROOM_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:202
msgctxt "text_id=22810 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Oh, the door to your room's open. I left your key on the desk, so make sure to lock the door whenever you leave.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:214:22811: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:214
msgctxt "text_id=22811 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki took the stairs down to the first floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:265:22812: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:265
msgctxt "text_id=22812 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My room was unoccupied."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:270:22813: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:270
msgctxt "text_id=22813 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I checked to make sure I was alone, then put down my luggage and stowed my wallet in a pocket."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:275:22814: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:275
msgctxt "text_id=22814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I considered keeping my favorite bunny-shaped commuter pass-and lucky charm-with me, but all it contained was a yearly school festival photo anyway. I left it on the table."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:280:22815: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:280
msgctxt "text_id=22815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was going to be spending the night in an unfamiliar building. It was best to travel light."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:301:22816: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_NOROOM_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:301
msgctxt "text_id=22816 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Where's that key...? Oh, here it is.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_NOROOM:307:22817: scene=WIK_NOROOM
#: WIK_NOROOM:307
msgctxt "text_id=22817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was a brass key, with an old-fashioned and elaborate design that perfectly complemented the mansion's European theme."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:30:22818: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:30
msgctxt "text_id=22818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I thought it was best to tackle the problem now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:54:22819: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:54
msgctxt "text_id=22819 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Okay everyone, to your―\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:65:22820: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:65
msgctxt "text_id=22820 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Wait. Before that, I want to check something."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:77:22821: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:77
msgctxt "text_id=22821 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  Does everybody know how many guests are here today?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:86:22822: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:86
msgctxt "text_id=22822 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Thirteen, including Kuonji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:86:22823: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:86
msgctxt "text_id=22823 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  What about it?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:98:22824: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:98
msgctxt "text_id=22824 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Does that include Riddell?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:125:22825: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:125
msgctxt "text_id=22825 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"What...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:145:22826: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:145
msgctxt "text_id=22826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji's eyes went wide."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:151:22827: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:151
msgctxt "text_id=22827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was acquainted with Riddell, so her being here hadn't felt out of place to him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:156:22828: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:156
msgctxt "text_id=22828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But, to someone like me who didn't know her, she stuck out like a sore thumb."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:161:22829: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:161
msgctxt "text_id=22829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She had crashed the party without a formal invitation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:187:22830: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:187
msgctxt "text_id=22830 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Now you mention it, Riddell wasn't actually invited. So I suppose there's only twelve of us.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:199:22831: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:199
msgctxt "text_id=22831 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Do you mind explaining, Miss Kuonji?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:243:22832: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:243
msgctxt "text_id=22832 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"...I didn't realize, either. Aoko and Sizuki were in charge of sending out invitations."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:255:22833: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:255
msgctxt "text_id=22833 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  No one told me they only set out nine invitations. Tokie and I are the hosts, so including Aoko and Sizuki that should've been thirteen."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:267:22834: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:267
msgctxt "text_id=22834 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Oh, I should mention,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22835 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " I personally sent invitations to Ritsuka"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " and Beo.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:344:22837: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:344
msgctxt "text_id=22837 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"I invited "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Eiri, "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Yuika, "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Kinomi, "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "and Tobimaru.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:447:22842: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_O_0000_0; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:447
msgctxt "text_id=22842 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"I invited "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Kumari. "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22844 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I gave the leftover invitations to "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Mr. Yamasiro and "
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:479:22846: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_O_0000_1; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:479
msgctxt "text_id=22846 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "someone I really, really "
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=22847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "shouldn't mention out loud.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:539:22848: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:539
msgctxt "text_id=22848 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"So the numbers add up, then."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:550:22849: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:550
msgctxt "text_id=22849 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Soujyuro, tell me who you invited, before I yell at you."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:550:22850: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:550
msgctxt "text_id=22850 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I'm pretty sure I know already, but tell me. Who you sent. The last invitation to.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:578:22851: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:578
msgctxt "text_id=22851 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"...Oh, I, um... I mean, it's not good to leave people out, so―\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:618:22852: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:618
msgctxt "text_id=22852 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Touko. You're the one who invited Touko!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:623:22853: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:623
msgctxt "text_id=22853 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki grabbed Sizuki by his collar and shook him violently, like a bobblehead."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:629:22854: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:629
msgctxt "text_id=22854 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Ohh... Two Riddells...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:666:22855: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:666
msgctxt "text_id=22855 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"So you invited Touko. But I thought she couldn't step foot inside Misaki anymore.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:675:22856: speaker=beo; speaker_ja=ベオ; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A50_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=A50; voice_category=12; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:675
msgctxt "text_id=22856 | speaker=beo"
msgid "\"Hm? Miss Touko said she beat that curse a long time ago. Mentioned about 'thinking outside the box.' 'If my body's cursed, I'll just use a new one,' or something like that.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:699:22857: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:699
msgctxt "text_id=22857 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What kind of logic is that?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:699:22858: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:699
msgctxt "text_id=22858 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  ...Ugh. My sister's crazy as always.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:708:22859: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:708
msgctxt "text_id=22859 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"At any rate, if she was invited, she could be here.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:746:22860: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:746
msgctxt "text_id=22860 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Right. And remember the entrance when the phone line was cut?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:765:22861: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:765
msgctxt "text_id=22861 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  There was a puddle on the floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:777:22862: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:777
msgctxt "text_id=22862 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  None of us have been outside since the rain started."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:783:22863: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:783
msgctxt "text_id=22863 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I thought it hinted that Riddell might've snuck in here ahead of time, but she wasn't wet at all."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:795:22864: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:795
msgctxt "text_id=22864 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  In other words...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:829:22865: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:829
msgctxt "text_id=22865 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"It's evidence that someone other than Riddell entered the mansion, right?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:841:22866: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:841
msgctxt "text_id=22866 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  But everyone except for Mr. Tokitsu and Mr. Yamasiro was there at that time...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:850:22867: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:850
msgctxt "text_id=22867 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"So we have an unknown participant."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:856:22868: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:856
msgctxt "text_id=22868 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  A thirteenth guest, if you will.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:940:22869: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:940
msgctxt "text_id=22869 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This changed everything."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:945:22870: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:945
msgctxt "text_id=22870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd never heard that Aozaki had an older sister, but now wasn't the time to ask about that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:950:22871: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:950
msgctxt "text_id=22871 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The tension in the air was enough to tell me that there was bad blood between her and the people here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:983:22872: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_O_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:983
msgctxt "text_id=22872 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Touko Aozaki. She'd be more than capable of using Ploys, and she's familiar with the Kuonji mansion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:994:22873: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_O_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:994
msgctxt "text_id=22873 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "  Most of all, she's out to kill us-or rather, Aoko specifically. That gives her a far stronger motive than any other suspect.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1020:22874: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1020
msgctxt "text_id=22874 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Indeed. If Touko is our killer, then locking ourselves in our rooms won't do much good. She could just force her way in.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1047:22875: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1047
msgctxt "text_id=22875 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Ooh, she *would* do that! Toko's a huge horror fan, after all! ...Hmm. It would be too bad if the genre shifted to horror, but let's worry about our safety first.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1058:22876: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1058
msgctxt "text_id=22876 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Let's split up and search the mansion. We need to figure out if Touko is really here or not.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1096:22877: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1096
msgctxt "text_id=22877 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Huh? Oh, um, yeah."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1108:22878: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1108
msgctxt "text_id=22878 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  ...I'll, uh, go check the area around my room.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1123:22879: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1123
msgctxt "text_id=22879 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"I'll check the west wing and the basement, just in case."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1134:22880: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1134
msgctxt "text_id=22880 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  the rest of you should stay here, for your own safety.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1167:22881: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1167
msgctxt "text_id=22881 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  With that, they left the drawing room on a mission,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1173:22882: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1173
msgctxt "text_id=22882 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  leaving me, Tsukiji, Sizuki, and Ritsuka behind."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1219:22883: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1219
msgctxt "text_id=22883 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Time passed by slowly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1224:22884: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1224
msgctxt "text_id=22884 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My eyelids began to feel heavy from anxiety and exhaustion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1229:22885: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1229
msgctxt "text_id=22885 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The clock struck midnight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1280:22886: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1280
msgctxt "text_id=22886 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I'll go brew some tea. Soujyuro, where do you keep it?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1290:22887: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1290
msgctxt "text_id=22887 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"There's a pot on the table in the sunroom. Should still be warm.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1301:22888: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1301
msgctxt "text_id=22888 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Perfect. I'll go get it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1318:22889: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1318
msgctxt "text_id=22889 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He probably wanted to get his mind off things."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1323:22890: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1323
msgctxt "text_id=22890 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji strode off toward the sunroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1349:22891: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1349
msgctxt "text_id=22891 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Oh.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1383:22892: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1383
msgctxt "text_id=22892 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Another blackout."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1389:22893: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1389
msgctxt "text_id=22893 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I can't see a damn thi―\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1412:22894: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1412
msgctxt "text_id=22894 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was a dazzling flash of light."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1417:22895: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1417
msgctxt "text_id=22895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Through the window in the sunroom,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1422:22896: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1422
msgctxt "text_id=22896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could see lightning-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1604:22897: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1604
msgctxt "text_id=22897 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Aghhhhhhhhhhhh!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1610:22898: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1610
msgctxt "text_id=22898 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Tsukiji, get back! Now!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1635:22899: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_O_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1635
msgctxt "text_id=22899 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"W-w-what the hell was that!? Someone was there!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1646:22900: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1646
msgctxt "text_id=22900 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"You three, over here! Into the hall!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1680:22901: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1680
msgctxt "text_id=22901 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka grabbed my hand and pulled me away from the pitch-black drawing room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1685:22902: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1685
msgctxt "text_id=22902 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I definitely saw the outline of a person against the lightning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1690:22903: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1690
msgctxt "text_id=22903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Someone was outside, in the raging storm."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1695:22904: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1695
msgctxt "text_id=22904 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It could only be the thirteenth guest."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1727:22905: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1727
msgctxt "text_id=22905 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We fled to the hall."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1732:22906: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1732
msgctxt "text_id=22906 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The wall lamps here appeared to be on separate wiring, so at least it wasn't completely dark."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1756:22907: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1756
msgctxt "text_id=22907 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Kuma? What's going on?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1778:22908: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_O_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1778
msgctxt "text_id=22908 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Th-Th-There was someone outside!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1790:22909: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1790
msgctxt "text_id=22909 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"I'll go take a look. Soujyuro, Tobimaru, look after Kojika.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1862:22910: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1862
msgctxt "text_id=22910 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Jogging, Aozaki disappeared into the dark corridor connecting to the parlor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1867:22911: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1867
msgctxt "text_id=22911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Father Eiri and Sister Yuika came down the stairs, and Miss Kuonji returned from the west wing. They must have heard the commotion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1892:22912: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1892
msgctxt "text_id=22912 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Looks like the power is out again. Did something happen?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1902:22913: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_O_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1902
msgctxt "text_id=22913 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"We think we saw someone outside the sunroom, so we ran in here. Aoko went to check on it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1922:22914: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1922
msgctxt "text_id=22914 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki returned as we explained the situation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1932:22915: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1932
msgctxt "text_id=22915 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Nothing out of the ordinary for the moment. No broken windows in the sunroom, so I don't think anyone slipped inside.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1958:22916: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0006; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1958
msgctxt "text_id=22916 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"We also didn't see anything unusual. Touko doesn't seem to be inside the mansion. Which means...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1968:22917: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_O_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1968
msgctxt "text_id=22917 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"That could have been her. If we didn't find anything inside, she might be creeping around the grounds.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:1994:22918: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0007; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:1994
msgctxt "text_id=22918 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"All right, we should look outside then."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2000:22919: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0008; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2000
msgctxt "text_id=22919 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  Let's start around the sunroom. It might be dangerous, so Sister Yuika and I will go... Aoko, would you mind coming with us?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2026:22920: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_O_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2026
msgctxt "text_id=22920 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"...Unfortunately, Father, I don't think I'll be of much use in this wind. I won't be able to hear a thing.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2052:22921: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0009; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2052
msgctxt "text_id=22921 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"You're right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2063:22922: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0010; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2063
msgctxt "text_id=22922 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I just didn't want to make Aoko go alone.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2074:22923: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2074
msgctxt "text_id=22923 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Don't worry, I can defend myself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2080:22924: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_O_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2080
msgctxt "text_id=22924 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I'm more worried about you, to be honest. You're not armed.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2106:22925: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2106
msgctxt "text_id=22925 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"In that case, can I ask you, Soujyuro?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2106:22926: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_O_0011; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2106
msgctxt "text_id=22926 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  We seem to work well enough together.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2128:22927: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2128
msgctxt "text_id=22927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki nodded solemnly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_O:2133:22928: scene=WIK_O
#: WIK_O:2133
msgctxt "text_id=22928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_P:8:22929: scene=WIK_SELECT_P
#: WIK_SELECT_P:8
msgctxt "text_id=22929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision P-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:36:22930: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:36
msgctxt "text_id=22930 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think it's too dangerous to leave Aozaki alone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:68:22931: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:68
msgctxt "text_id=22931 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Wait, Aozaki. I'll go with you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:82:22932: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:82
msgctxt "text_id=22932 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Wh-What're you talking about, Kuma? It's too dangerous outside. Wait in the foyer with Tobimaru.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:93:22933: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:93
msgctxt "text_id=22933 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"But if it's dangerous, I don't want to let you go out there alone. I'm your friend.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:120:22934: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:120
msgctxt "text_id=22934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki couldn't refuse when I put it like that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:125:22935: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:125
msgctxt "text_id=22935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I wanted to watch her back, of course, but I had another reason too."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:192:22936: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:192
msgctxt "text_id=22936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki was currently the most suspicious survivor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:197:22937: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:197
msgctxt "text_id=22937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It wasn't a good idea to let her go alone, for multiple reasons."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:202:22938: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:202
msgctxt "text_id=22938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If she was the killer―or Sweets Hearts, or whatever―then our lives were in danger. If I didn't go with her, then it would cast more doubt on her later."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:222:22939: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:222
msgctxt "text_id=22939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Anyone could see how dangerous it was outside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:227:22940: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:227
msgctxt "text_id=22940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Of course, I would've liked to stay with Tsukiji,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:232:22941: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:232
msgctxt "text_id=22941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  but petty feelings like that weren't more important than my friendship with Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:288:22942: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:288
msgctxt "text_id=22942 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"...Okay. Fine."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:300:22943: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:300
msgctxt "text_id=22943 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Just promise you won't leave my side, no matter what."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:306:22944: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:306
msgctxt "text_id=22944 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Does that work for you, Eiri?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:315:22945: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_P_1_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:315
msgctxt "text_id=22945 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Yes. I wanted to send someone with you anyway. Miss Kumari would be as good as anyone.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:340:22946: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:340
msgctxt "text_id=22946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Father Eiri seemed to thinking along the same lines."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:345:22947: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:345
msgctxt "text_id=22947 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...He had a cool demeanor, but maybe he had genuine concern for Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:393:22948: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:393
msgctxt "text_id=22948 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Tobimaru, look after Yuika and Alice. If we don't find anything in twenty minutes, we'll be back."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:405:22949: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:405
msgctxt "text_id=22949 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Eiri, when we get outside, you head right; we'll go left.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:417:22950: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_P_1_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:417
msgctxt "text_id=22950 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Sounds like a plan. Let's go, Soujyuro.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:452:22951: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:452
msgctxt "text_id=22951 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Soujyuro?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:463:22952: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_P_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:463
msgctxt "text_id=22952 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Don't worry about me. Take care of Kumari."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:474:22953: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_P_1_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:474
msgctxt "text_id=22953 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  Kumari, watch out for flying branches in this weather. Aozaki is weirdly effective at times like these, so just follow her lead.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:486:22954: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:486
msgctxt "text_id=22954 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"And what is that supposed to mean?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:521:22955: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:521
msgctxt "text_id=22955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I nodded to Sizuki, and made my way outside with Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:583:22956: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:583
msgctxt "text_id=22956 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:589:22957: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:589
msgctxt "text_id=22957 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The storm was worse than I expected."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:594:22958: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:594
msgctxt "text_id=22958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could barely keep my eyes open in this wind."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:615:22959: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:615
msgctxt "text_id=22959 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Kojika! Give me your hand!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:621:22960: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:621
msgctxt "text_id=22960 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki extended her left hand toward me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:626:22961: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:626
msgctxt "text_id=22961 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I grabbed hold tightly. Her hand was so cold it sent a shiver down my spine."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:693:22962: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:693
msgctxt "text_id=22962 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As we rounded one side of the mansion, Aozaki stopped."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:699:22963: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:699
msgctxt "text_id=22963 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Kuma! Did you see that light?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:705:22964: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:705
msgctxt "text_id=22964 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"What light?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:711:22965: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:711
msgctxt "text_id=22965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I couldn't even open my eyes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:716:22966: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:716
msgctxt "text_id=22966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki paused before speaking."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:737:22967: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:737
msgctxt "text_id=22967 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Stick to the wall and head back to the entrance!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:737:22968: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:737
msgctxt "text_id=22968 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  That light had to be the killer!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:744:22969: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:744
msgctxt "text_id=22969 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"What?! No way! I can't leave you alone out here!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:765:22970: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:765
msgctxt "text_id=22970 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My words failed to reach her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:770:22971: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:770
msgctxt "text_id=22971 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki ran away from the mansion into the darkness of the woods."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:791:22972: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:791
msgctxt "text_id=22972 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Stick to the wall... But I can't even get back to the mansion, you idiot!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:796:22973: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:796
msgctxt "text_id=22973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I screamed out in frustration."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:801:22974: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:801
msgctxt "text_id=22974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Somehow, she heard me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:842:22975: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:842
msgctxt "text_id=22975 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"What?! Did you say something, Kuma?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:847:22976: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:847
msgctxt "text_id=22976 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki voice came from the tree line."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:868:22977: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:868
msgctxt "text_id=22977 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I said, I can't get back to the mansion by myself―\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:874:22978: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:874
msgctxt "text_id=22978 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Behind you! The mansion's directly behind you!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:880:22979: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0013; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:880
msgctxt "text_id=22979 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Just turn around and―Pffhahahahaha!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:886:22980: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:886
msgctxt "text_id=22980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:963:22981: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:963
msgctxt "text_id=22981 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"OH, CRAP!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1024:22982: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_1_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1024
msgctxt "text_id=22982 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Did I actually just fall for that?! KUMAAA!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1030:22983: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1030
msgctxt "text_id=22983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki's words hung in the air, as her body suddenly flew to one side. It was as if she was hit by a high-powered rifle."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1076:22984: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1076
msgctxt "text_id=22984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She lay lifelessly on the ground."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1097:22985: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1097
msgctxt "text_id=22985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I... I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1103:22986: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1103
msgctxt "text_id=22986 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...I know she looked in my direction before she burst out laughing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1124:22987: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1124
msgctxt "text_id=22987 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Behind me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1129:22988: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1129
msgctxt "text_id=22988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Footsteps. I could barely make them out in the rain."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1136:22989: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1136
msgctxt "text_id=22989 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1160:22990: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1160
msgctxt "text_id=22990 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I don't have time to look back or think."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1165:22991: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1165
msgctxt "text_id=22991 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I ran as fast as I could."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1170:22992: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1170
msgctxt "text_id=22992 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I needed to get away from whatever was behind me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1175:22993: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1175
msgctxt "text_id=22993 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I sprinted into the deep, dark forest, away from the mansion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1196:22994: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1196
msgctxt "text_id=22994 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Hah, hah, hah, hah!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1202:22995: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1202
msgctxt "text_id=22995 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My chest burned with the exertion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1207:22996: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1207
msgctxt "text_id=22996 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd never pushed myself this hard, even during P.E. class."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1212:22997: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1212
msgctxt "text_id=22997 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Wow. I was a pretty good runner."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1217:22998: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1217
msgctxt "text_id=22998 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It's amazing what humans could do when we think we're about to die."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1222:22999: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1222
msgctxt "text_id=22999 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My mind began to wander, trying to escape the reality of the situation, when..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1274:23000: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1274
msgctxt "text_id=23000 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1281:23001: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1281
msgctxt "text_id=23001 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Suddenly, I felt like I was floating."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1286:23002: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1286
msgctxt "text_id=23002 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My feet kicked wildly at the air."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1307:23003: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1307
msgctxt "text_id=23003 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Wait... what?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1373:23004: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1373
msgctxt "text_id=23004 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I seemed to be falling backward."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1378:23005: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1378
msgctxt "text_id=23005 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Every breath sent a painful spasm through my back."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1383:23006: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1383
msgctxt "text_id=23006 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I reached for my back, feeling like something was wrong, and touched something wet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1406:23007: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1406
msgctxt "text_id=23007 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...I timidly looked at my hand."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1411:23008: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1411
msgctxt "text_id=23008 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As much I hated to admit it... my hand was strawberry red."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1416:23009: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1416
msgctxt "text_id=23009 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I licked it. Yup, tastes like iron."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1421:23010: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1421
msgctxt "text_id=23010 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd lost over a liter of blood, and it only kept flowing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1442:23011: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_1_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1442
msgctxt "text_id=23011 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I can't... believe this...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1449:23012: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1449
msgctxt "text_id=23012 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Horrifying reality stopped me from finishing my sentence."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1454:23013: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1454
msgctxt "text_id=23013 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Something was coming this way."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1459:23014: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1459
msgctxt "text_id=23014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At this point, I didn't really care."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1464:23015: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1464
msgctxt "text_id=23015 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Would I sleep forever..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1469:23016: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1469
msgctxt "text_id=23016 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...or be captured by the killer?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1490:23017: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1490
msgctxt "text_id=23017 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Either way,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_1:1496:23018: scene=WIK_P_1
#: WIK_P_1:1496
msgctxt "text_id=23018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  apparently, this was how my night would end."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:30:23019: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=23019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I should wait inside the mansion for all three of them to return."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:63:23020: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:63
msgctxt "text_id=23020 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"I'm going to head out. If I don't find anything after twenty minutes, I'll be back.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:82:23021: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:82
msgctxt "text_id=23021 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Sounds like a plan. Let's go, Soujyuro.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:105:23022: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:105
msgctxt "text_id=23022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki usually kept his distance from Father Eiri, but there was nothing usual about tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:110:23023: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:110
msgctxt "text_id=23023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He kept pace at the priest's side, his head on a swivel."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:208:23024: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:208
msgctxt "text_id=23024 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I waited for what felt like an eternity."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:213:23025: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:213
msgctxt "text_id=23025 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The power still wasn't back on."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:222:23026: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:222
msgctxt "text_id=23026 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Looks like we're not going to get the lights back tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:234:23027: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_P_2_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:234
msgctxt "text_id=23027 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  The guest rooms run on a separate set of wiring, so let's hope they're still good.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:255:23028: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:255
msgctxt "text_id=23028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Those rooms must've been added at a later date."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:260:23029: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:260
msgctxt "text_id=23029 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  All the older areas of the mansion, like the drawing room, hallways, and west wing, were pitch-dark."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:285:23030: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:285
msgctxt "text_id=23030 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Wait. Where's Beo?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:295:23031: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:295
msgctxt "text_id=23031 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh?! Oh, yeah. I don't see him anywhere.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:306:23032: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:306
msgctxt "text_id=23032 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I'll go look for him. Everyone else stay here. Don't leave Yuika's side. Got it?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:315:23033: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_P_2_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:315
msgctxt "text_id=23033 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Ritsuka...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:326:23034: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_P_2_0001_B; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:326
msgctxt "text_id=23034 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I'll be fine, trust me. I'm used to dark nights like these.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:351:23035: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:351
msgctxt "text_id=23035 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka disappeared up the stairs to the second floor of the mansion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_P_2:373:23036: scene=WIK_P_2
#: WIK_P_2:373
msgctxt "text_id=23036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_Q:8:23037: scene=WIK_SELECT_Q
#: WIK_SELECT_Q:8
msgctxt "text_id=23037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision Q-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_1:30:23038: scene=WIK_Q_1
#: WIK_Q_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=23038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I feel like if this was a horror movie, this would be the part that gets us killed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_2:30:23039: scene=WIK_Q_2
#: WIK_Q_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=23039 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Thinking about it..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_2:35:23040: scene=WIK_Q_2
#: WIK_Q_2:35
msgctxt "text_id=23040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...they were away for a while, so, like Aozaki, they could've murdered Mr. Tokitsu and Mr. Yamasiro, too."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:41:23041: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:41
msgctxt "text_id=23041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After a long twenty minutes, Aozaki returned."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:46:23042: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:46
msgctxt "text_id=23042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She took off her raincoat, and dried herself off with a towel."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:70:23043: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:70
msgctxt "text_id=23043 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Whew, that's some storm out there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:81:23044: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:81
msgctxt "text_id=23044 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  The wind's like a brick wall. I'm surprised the trees are still upright... Then again, that's probably the Ploy's doing.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:101:23045: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:101
msgctxt "text_id=23045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki explained that she'd patrolled a loop of the entire mansion, starting from the left side."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:106:23046: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:106
msgctxt "text_id=23046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She didn't find anything in front of the sunroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:132:23047: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:132
msgctxt "text_id=23047 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"So where are Father Eiri and Soujyuro?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:148:23048: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:148
msgctxt "text_id=23048 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"...You didn't run into them?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:157:23049: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0003_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:157
msgctxt "text_id=23049 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Nope. Soon as we got outside, they said they wanted to check out the forest."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:170:23050: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0003_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:170
msgctxt "text_id=23050 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "There's no way they went there in this storm, is there...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:175:23051: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:175
msgctxt "text_id=23051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki and Sister Yuika exchanged concerned glances."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:180:23052: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:180
msgctxt "text_id=23052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Then..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:221:23053: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:221
msgctxt "text_id=23053 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:226:23054: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:226
msgctxt "text_id=23054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki came back inside, looking sullen and dripping wet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:231:23055: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:231
msgctxt "text_id=23055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Father Eiri wasn't with him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:257:23056: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:257
msgctxt "text_id=23056 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"...Sorry."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:257:23057: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:257
msgctxt "text_id=23057 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  I looked away for a second, and then something very funny happened to the Father.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:278:23058: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:278
msgctxt "text_id=23058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki was clearly downtrodden, but he'd made a bizarre choice of words."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:321:23059: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:321
msgctxt "text_id=23059 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Mr. Sizuki. You mean Father Eiri's...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:332:23060: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:332
msgctxt "text_id=23060 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"...Sounds that way. Who on earth could take out someone like Father Eiri...?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:353:23061: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:353
msgctxt "text_id=23061 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The foyer fell silent."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:358:23062: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:358
msgctxt "text_id=23062 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki was biting his lip, clearly ashamed of losing track of the priest and falling for the killer's trap."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:389:23063: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:389
msgctxt "text_id=23063 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Hm? Soujyuro, what are you holding?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:395:23064: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:395
msgctxt "text_id=23064 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Looking closer, I could see something long and fluffy in his hand, about eight inches in length."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:423:23065: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:423
msgctxt "text_id=23065 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"I found it at the east wing, in front of the sunroom.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:446:23066: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:446
msgctxt "text_id=23066 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He held up what looked like a golden dog plushie. There was a strange pattern on its forehead."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:476:23067: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:476
msgctxt "text_id=23067 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"The fifth victim.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:485:23068: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:485
msgctxt "text_id=23068 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Wait, is that Beo?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:485:23069: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:485
msgctxt "text_id=23069 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  So he was the one we saw in front of the sunroom?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:494:23070: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:494
msgctxt "text_id=23070 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Oh... now you mention it, it did look like Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:505:23071: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_Q_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:505
msgctxt "text_id=23071 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Wait, was he trying to ask for our help?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:541:23072: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:541
msgctxt "text_id=23072 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If he was, what did that mean?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:583:23073: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:583
msgctxt "text_id=23073 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo saw the killer outside the sunroom,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:588:23074: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:588
msgctxt "text_id=23074 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  was made to laugh somehow, remembered we were inside, and tried to get our attention?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:648:23075: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:648
msgctxt "text_id=23075 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka was the one who warned us to stay away from Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:653:23076: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:653
msgctxt "text_id=23076 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She said she was used to dark nights."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:658:23077: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:658
msgctxt "text_id=23077 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Did she know that the silhouette was Beo trying not to laugh?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:700:23078: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:700
msgctxt "text_id=23078 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Maybe Beo found something. This is bad. I was secretly counting on him the most."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:712:23079: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:712
msgctxt "text_id=23079 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Soujyuro, where was Father Eiri killed?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:734:23080: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:734
msgctxt "text_id=23080 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"On the west side of the forest."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:778:23081: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:778
msgctxt "text_id=23081 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "We thought we saw something moving, and when we went to check I heard laughter."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:818:23082: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:818
msgctxt "text_id=23082 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  Then I heard this scream like thunder, and there was a shower of blood. When I looked up, I saw...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:867:23083: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:867
msgctxt "text_id=23083 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone held their breath in anticipation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:872:23084: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:872
msgctxt "text_id=23084 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We all braced for the gruesome description of the priest's demise."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:898:23085: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:898
msgctxt "text_id=23085 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"You saw...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:945:23086: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:945
msgctxt "text_id=23086 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"A bunch of ropes tied up like a spider's web between the trees."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1143:23087: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1143
msgctxt "text_id=23087 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  His body was at the center, all twisted."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1149:23088: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1149
msgctxt "text_id=23088 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  He was completely naked."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1206:23089: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_Q_A_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1206
msgctxt "text_id=23089 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "And he had a rose in his mouth―\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1214:23090: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_Q_A_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1214
msgctxt "text_id=23090 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Ahahahahahahahaha!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1267:23091: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Q_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1267
msgctxt "text_id=23091 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1272:23092: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1272
msgctxt "text_id=23092 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Instinctively, I turned to face the laughter behind me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1289:23093: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_Q_A_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1289
msgctxt "text_id=23093 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"...Oops.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1329:23094: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1329
msgctxt "text_id=23094 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It all happened so quickly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1334:23095: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1334
msgctxt "text_id=23095 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sister Yuika had turned to stone as soon as she heard Sizuki's report."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1381:23096: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_Q_A_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1381
msgctxt "text_id=23096 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Yuika got petrified!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1408:23097: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_Q_A_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1408
msgctxt "text_id=23097 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"Poor Yuika. She must've pictured what Sizuki was talking about.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1417:23098: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_Q_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1417
msgctxt "text_id=23098 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"She and Father Eiri were two of the sternest people I've ever met, and yet... Anyway, that's seven victims now. We're dropping like flies.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1437:23099: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1437
msgctxt "text_id=23099 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Unfortunately for us, all the people who posed the greatest threat to the killer were gone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Q_A:1442:23100: scene=WIK_Q_A
#: WIK_Q_A:1442
msgctxt "text_id=23100 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The clock approached 1:00 AM."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:36:23101: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:36
msgctxt "text_id=23101 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could rest easy now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:71:23102: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:71
msgctxt "text_id=23102 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I returned to my room, alone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:76:23103: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:76
msgctxt "text_id=23103 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Even with Aozaki in confinement, we still had to stay on guard."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:82:23104: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:82
msgctxt "text_id=23104 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I locked the door to my room"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23105 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " and lay down on my bed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:90:23106: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:90
msgctxt "text_id=23106 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  All that was left to do was wait for morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:95:23107: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:95
msgctxt "text_id=23107 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  So much had happened, but at least I could finally sleep without worrying."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:130:23108: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:130
msgctxt "text_id=23108 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...Whew.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:136:23109: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:136
msgctxt "text_id=23109 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  God, if you're listening..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:141:23110: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:141
msgctxt "text_id=23110 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...make everything go back to how it was by the time I wake up..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:259:23111: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:259
msgctxt "text_id=23111 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:264:23112: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:264
msgctxt "text_id=23112 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I woke up to the sound of birds chirping outside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:271:23113: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:271
msgctxt "text_id=23113 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Ungh... It's morning...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:277:23114: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:277
msgctxt "text_id=23114 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The clock read half past five."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:282:23115: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:282
msgctxt "text_id=23115 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The sun was beginning to peek over the horizon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:304:23116: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:304
msgctxt "text_id=23116 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My ability to rise early was one of my few strong points, so I must've been really exhausted."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:309:23117: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:309
msgctxt "text_id=23117 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I foggily examined my wrinkled clothes in the mirror."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:314:23118: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:314
msgctxt "text_id=23118 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was so quiet outside, like last night's storm never happened."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:319:23119: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:319
msgctxt "text_id=23119 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A silent morning, with no sounds of movement or talking in the house."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:324:23120: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:324
msgctxt "text_id=23120 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I stepped out into the hallway, feeling a vague premonition coming on."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:370:23121: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:370
msgctxt "text_id=23121 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was quiet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:375:23122: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:375
msgctxt "text_id=23122 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The air was crisp."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:422:23123: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:422
msgctxt "text_id=23123 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji's room was clean and tidy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:427:23124: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:427
msgctxt "text_id=23124 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Father Eiri's room was clean and tidy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:432:23125: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:432
msgctxt "text_id=23125 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka's room was clean and tidy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:454:23126: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_1_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:454
msgctxt "text_id=23126 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Anyone alive out there?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:460:23127: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:460
msgctxt "text_id=23127 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I yelled into the void of the west wing, but no one responded."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:465:23128: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:465
msgctxt "text_id=23128 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My hunch was spot on. Something was wrong."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:471:23129: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:471
msgctxt "text_id=23129 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This mansion was now the cleanest, quietest place in all of Misaki. It was over."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:520:23130: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:520
msgctxt "text_id=23130 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I went down to the basement where Aozaki was confined,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:525:23131: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:525
msgctxt "text_id=23131 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  down the narrow staircase to the door."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:539:23132: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:539
msgctxt "text_id=23132 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The padlock had been broken clean off from the outside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:637:23133: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:637
msgctxt "text_id=23133 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Inside the tiny cellar, I saw... a single dead body, lying prone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:642:23134: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:642
msgctxt "text_id=23134 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The beautiful, long hair was all I needed to know who it was. Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:648:23135: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:648
msgctxt "text_id=23135 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She wasn't breathing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:668:23136: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:668
msgctxt "text_id=23136 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She hadn't been the killer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:673:23137: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:673
msgctxt "text_id=23137 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was unclear what time she was murdered."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:678:23138: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:678
msgctxt "text_id=23138 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But whoever the killer was broke the lock, made Aozaki laugh, nonchalantly went upstairs, and..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:686:23139: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:686
msgctxt "text_id=23139 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...cut off my means of escape. They were going to show up soon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:706:23140: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:706
msgctxt "text_id=23140 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They must have been hiding somewhere waiting for me to come down into the basement."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:711:23141: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:711
msgctxt "text_id=23141 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The stairs were the only way out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:716:23142: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:716
msgctxt "text_id=23142 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If the killer followed me down here, I was trapped."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:749:23143: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_1_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:749
msgctxt "text_id=23143 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...Oh, well. Doesn't matter anymore.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:755:23144: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:755
msgctxt "text_id=23144 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was at a dead end."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:760:23145: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:760
msgctxt "text_id=23145 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Game over. Victory to the real killer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_1:765:23146: scene=WIK_R_1
#: WIK_R_1:765
msgctxt "text_id=23146 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My thoughts were interrupted by the sounds of footsteps. The footsteps of Death..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:30:23147: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=23147 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I wasn't so sure about that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:69:23148: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_R_2_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:69
msgctxt "text_id=23148 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Now we can finally get some sleep."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:80:23149: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_R_2_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:80
msgctxt "text_id=23149 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Good night, everyone.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:90:23150: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:90
msgctxt "text_id=23150 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka disappeared up the west-wing stairs."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:121:23151: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_R_2_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:121
msgctxt "text_id=23151 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"...I'm going to get some rest too."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:132:23152: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_R_2_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:132
msgctxt "text_id=23152 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  Sizuki, your room's out of bounds until morning, so take the room you wanted to give to Father Eiri.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:143:23153: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_R_2_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:143
msgctxt "text_id=23153 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Right. Thanks, Alice.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:163:23154: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:163
msgctxt "text_id=23154 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji and Sizuki retired to their respective rooms."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:194:23155: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:194
msgctxt "text_id=23155 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:200:23156: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:200
msgctxt "text_id=23156 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:205:23157: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:205
msgctxt "text_id=23157 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was just us left."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:210:23158: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:210
msgctxt "text_id=23158 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I mustered up the courage to look at Tsukiji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:245:23159: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:245
msgctxt "text_id=23159 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Kumari, got a minute?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:251:23160: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:251
msgctxt "text_id=23160 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Tsukiji, can I talk to you?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:287:23161: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:287
msgctxt "text_id=23161 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We smiled at each other. We'd both had the same idea, apparently."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:413:23162: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:413
msgctxt "text_id=23162 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Things had gotten really out of hand tonight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:433:23163: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:433
msgctxt "text_id=23163 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was an ungodly hour."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:438:23164: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:438
msgctxt "text_id=23164 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The storm's raging outside seemed to portend the end of the world."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:443:23165: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:443
msgctxt "text_id=23165 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If we laugh, we die, and yet here I am with a guy I've had a crush on for three years."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:467:23166: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:467
msgctxt "text_id=23166 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I'm gonna have some tea. You want some?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:479:23167: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:479
msgctxt "text_id=23167 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I'll take a coffee. Black, no sugar.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:490:23168: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:490
msgctxt "text_id=23168 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Very badass. Sweet enough already for you?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:500:23169: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:500
msgctxt "text_id=23169 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That sounded a little sarcastic, but I know he didn't mean it that way."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:536:23170: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:536
msgctxt "text_id=23170 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Want to talk about Person A?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:542:23171: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:542
msgctxt "text_id=23171 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Yep. Still haven't got it figured out. You don't think it's 100% Aozaki, do you?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:559:23172: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:559
msgctxt "text_id=23172 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He passed me a coffee, and I slowly brought it to my mouth before taking a sip."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:564:23173: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:564
msgctxt "text_id=23173 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was right. I didn't."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:569:23174: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:569
msgctxt "text_id=23174 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We were both on the same page."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:603:23175: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:603
msgctxt "text_id=23175 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Signs point to Aozaki, but you can't rule out Ritsuka and Sizuki, either."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:615:23176: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:615
msgctxt "text_id=23176 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  The only people we can really trust are Miss Kuonji and each other. I mean, we've all been together since this started.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:636:23177: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:636
msgctxt "text_id=23177 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Hmm. I don't know about Kuonji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:648:23178: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0006; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:648
msgctxt "text_id=23178 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Feels to me more like she's on the Ploys' side.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:684:23179: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:684
msgctxt "text_id=23179 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Really? She seems neutral to me. Got anything to back that up?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:706:23180: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0007_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:706
msgctxt "text_id=23180 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"She doesn't seem interested in finding the killer, for one... Oh, I know."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:720:23181: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0007_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:720
msgctxt "text_id=23181 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid " This is just a hunch, but I feel like she's helping them somehow.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:756:23182: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:756
msgctxt "text_id=23182 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"It's possible. The Ploy belongs to her, and the killer's a Ploy in disguise. Maybe that's why she's neutral.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:792:23183: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:792
msgctxt "text_id=23183 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I don't mean she's helping the Ploy; I mean the person using it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:804:23184: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:804
msgctxt "text_id=23184 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  For a start, she didn't seem mad at all about someone using her Ploy like that.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:824:23185: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:824
msgctxt "text_id=23185 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Oh.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:844:23186: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:844
msgctxt "text_id=23186 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:849:23187: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:849
msgctxt "text_id=23187 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Does that mean Miss Kuonji knew who the killer was?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:875:23188: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0010; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:875
msgctxt "text_id=23188 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I don't think she necessarily knows. Still, she's definitely hiding something."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:886:23189: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0011; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:886
msgctxt "text_id=23189 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  About Sweets Hearts, for example. Going off what Riddell said, you need a certain something to use it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:912:23190: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0012; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:912
msgctxt "text_id=23190 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Maybe it's like a magical sword."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:918:23191: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0013; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:918
msgctxt "text_id=23191 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Y'know, not just anyone can wield it. Only 'the chosen one.'\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:951:23192: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:951
msgctxt "text_id=23192 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Could a thing really choose who uses it?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:956:23193: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:956
msgctxt "text_id=23193 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If so, did that mean Miss Kuonji was supporting―no, empathetic to it?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:977:23194: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0014; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:977
msgctxt "text_id=23194 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"That aside, I know this is a little late to ask, but are you really okay with teaming up with me?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:982:23195: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:982
msgctxt "text_id=23195 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Well, that came out of nowhere."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:987:23196: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:987
msgctxt "text_id=23196 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I tried my best to stay calm as I answered,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1023:23197: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1023
msgctxt "text_id=23197 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Yeah. I trust you, Tsukiji.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1054:23198: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0015_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1054
msgctxt "text_id=23198 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Not a good idea trusting anyone in a situation like this."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1068:23199: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0015_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1068
msgctxt "text_id=23199 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid " Feels like the person you trust the most'll stab you in the back.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1091:23200: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1091
msgctxt "text_id=23200 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...I guess you're right. We should all be wary of everyone.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1126:23201: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0016; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1126
msgctxt "text_id=23201 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Exactly. We can only trust ourselves. That's why we all need someone to keep an eye on us, objectively."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1137:23202: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0017; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1137
msgctxt "text_id=23202 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  It's probably why Riddell wanted us all to pair up, too. Two minds, one body. Kinda appropriate given we're dealing with Sweets Hearts here.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1162:23203: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1162
msgctxt "text_id=23203 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We put Riddell behind us."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1173:23204: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1173
msgctxt "text_id=23204 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"So who do you think's the most likely suspect at this point?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1199:23205: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0018; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1199
msgctxt "text_id=23205 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"I think we're all on equal ground. I still don't know if Yurihiko's body was the real deal or not."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1210:23206: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0019; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1210
msgctxt "text_id=23206 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  I think the killer tricked Aozaki into hiding whatever's in her room, too. Get rid of the biggest threat, and all that.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1236:23207: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_R_2_0012; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1236
msgctxt "text_id=23207 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"You think she was framed?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1247:23208: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0020; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1247
msgctxt "text_id=23208 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Yeah. She was too preoccupied with covering something up to think about anything else."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1259:23209: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0021_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1259
msgctxt "text_id=23209 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Plus, she was saying some weird things. When do you think"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1272:23210: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_R_2_0021_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1272
msgctxt "text_id=23210 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid " that business with Touko happened?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_R_2:1306:23211: scene=WIK_R_2
#: WIK_R_2:1306
msgctxt "text_id=23211 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_S:8:23212: scene=WIK_SELECT_S
#: WIK_SELECT_S:8
msgctxt "text_id=23212 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision S-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:36:23213: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:36
msgctxt "text_id=23213 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I spaced out, and random thoughts filled my mind."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:47:23214: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_ROBBY_0000; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:47
msgctxt "text_id=23214 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Kumari? What're you doing? Let's go.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:60:23215: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:60
msgctxt "text_id=23215 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Oh, sorry. Coming.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:85:23216: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:85
msgctxt "text_id=23216 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The other two had already set off. I picked up my things and followed them."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:128:23217: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:128
msgctxt "text_id=23217 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki was verbally sparring with Mr. Yamasiro as they walked down the tree-lined path."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:133:23218: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:133
msgctxt "text_id=23218 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I hurried after them."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:153:23219: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:153
msgctxt "text_id=23219 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Looking up at the sky, I saw ominous clouds starting to roll in."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:174:23220: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:174
msgctxt "text_id=23220 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Wait, what's the weather forecast for today?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:180:23221: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:180
msgctxt "text_id=23221 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The heavens looked like they could open up any moment."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:185:23222: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:185
msgctxt "text_id=23222 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Would I have to trek back home in the rain?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:310:23223: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:310
msgctxt "text_id=23223 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Once we were past of the woods, I could see more clearly."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:315:23224: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:315
msgctxt "text_id=23224 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In the clearing stood a large building that felt out of time."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:358:23225: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_ROBBY_0001; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:358
msgctxt "text_id=23225 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"What a magnificent European mansion! How anyone could call such a work of art a haunted house is beyond me!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:388:23226: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:388
msgctxt "text_id=23226 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Well, they kind of have a point. No smoke without fire, right? That kind of thing happens around here. You should keep an eye out for ghosts, Mr. Yamasiro.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:394:23227: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_ROBBY_0002; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:394
msgctxt "text_id=23227 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Hahaha! I find your attempts at humor scarier than any ghost, Aozaki.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:414:23228: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:414
msgctxt "text_id=23228 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I wonder if he actually believed her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:419:23229: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:419
msgctxt "text_id=23229 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I've known Aozaki for three years and I think she's never told a joke with *that* expression."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:446:23230: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:446
msgctxt "text_id=23230 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Aozaki. Were you serious about that?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:472:23231: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0001_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:472
msgctxt "text_id=23231 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Ghosts aside, strange stuff does happen here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:486:23232: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0001_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:486
msgctxt "text_id=23232 | speaker=aoko"
msgid " Nothing to worry about though. If you see anything weird, ignore it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:507:23233: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:507
msgctxt "text_id=23233 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:512:23234: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:512
msgctxt "text_id=23234 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I agreed with Mr. Yamasiro."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:517:23235: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:517
msgctxt "text_id=23235 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  \"Ignore anything weird, even ghosts\" was kind of a scary thing to say."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:605:23236: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:605
msgctxt "text_id=23236 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The foyer of the Kuonji Estate was colder than I expected."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:610:23237: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:610
msgctxt "text_id=23237 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I knew the mountains were colder, but this was something else."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:615:23238: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:615
msgctxt "text_id=23238 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It felt like winter in here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:636:23239: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_ROBBY_0003; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:636
msgctxt "text_id=23239 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Would you look at this decor! From the outside, it looks like a standard Tudor style construction, but the foyer is closer to Romanesque architecture."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:642:23240: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_ROBBY_0004; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:642
msgctxt "text_id=23240 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "  The connecting hallway and the lobby here appear to be from different time periods. It's as though another building has been tacked on―Oh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:655:23241: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0000; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:655
msgctxt "text_id=23241 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Whaaaat? Seriously? Mr. Yamasiro?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:676:23242: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:676
msgctxt "text_id=23242 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I heard a stupid, irritating voice behind me, and sure enough, there was an idiot standing in the foyer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:687:23243: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0001; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:687
msgctxt "text_id=23243 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Whoa! And Kojika, too!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:693:23244: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0002; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:693
msgctxt "text_id=23244 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  I wondered where the prez got to this morning. Guess she was picking up you two, huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:730:23245: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:730
msgctxt "text_id=23245 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Hey, what's Housuke doing here?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:741:23246: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:741
msgctxt "text_id=23246 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Soujyuro probably invited him. He said something this morning about a 'nice surprise' for everyone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:752:23247: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:752
msgctxt "text_id=23247 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Can't say I agree with his choice, but it could be worse. At least Kinomi can liven the mood.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:789:23248: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0003; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:789
msgctxt "text_id=23248 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Hell yeah I can! I've got a bunch of party tricks and jokes ready to go! Ghost stories, impressions, you name it!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:815:23249: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:815
msgctxt "text_id=23249 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"If we wanted something loud and annoying, we would've brought a cockatoo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:815:23250: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:815
msgctxt "text_id=23250 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I can never tell what that Sizuki is thinking."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:826:23251: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:826
msgctxt "text_id=23251 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  Housuke, make yourself useful and help me with my luggage.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:837:23252: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0004; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:837
msgctxt "text_id=23252 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"Come on! You know I'm funny!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:857:23253: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:857
msgctxt "text_id=23253 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I ignored him and put my overnight bag down on the floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:868:23254: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROBBY_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:868
msgctxt "text_id=23254 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Don't look inside.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:879:23255: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0005; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:879
msgctxt "text_id=23255 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "\"I know, I know. I don't wanna see your boring grandma underwear anyway!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:892:23256: speaker=kinomi; speaker_ja=木乃美; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B50_WIK_ROBBY_0006; voice_prefix=B50; voice_category=6; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:892
msgctxt "text_id=23256 | speaker=kinomi"
msgid "  ...Oof, man, this is heavy! Your granny panties made from chain mail?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:926:23257: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:926
msgctxt "text_id=23257 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Housuke picked up my bag and carried it toward the hallway to the east wing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:931:23258: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:931
msgctxt "text_id=23258 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Of course it was heavy. Couldn't come here without my trusty wok, cleaver, rice, and char siu. What if I wanted fried rice later?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:952:23259: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0004; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:952
msgctxt "text_id=23259 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"The drawing room's over there. That's where the party's going to be."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:958:23260: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROBBY_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:958
msgctxt "text_id=23260 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Alice made up guest rooms for each of you, so if you're tired, head on up. You can change in there too, if you like.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:963:23261: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:963
msgctxt "text_id=23261 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Hmm."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROBBY:968:23262: scene=WIK_ROBBY
#: WIK_ROBBY:968
msgctxt "text_id=23262 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In that case..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_B:9:23263: scene=WIK_SELECT_B
#: WIK_SELECT_B:9
msgctxt "text_id=23263 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision B-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:111:23264: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROOM_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:111
msgctxt "text_id=23264 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Oh!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:116:23265: scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:116
msgctxt "text_id=23265 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Out in the hallway, I ran into Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:121:23266: scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:121
msgctxt "text_id=23266 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She seemed to be on her way from the bedrooms to the hall."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:142:23267: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_ROOM_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:142
msgctxt "text_id=23267 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"You taking a break too, Aozaki? Is that your room at the end?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:154:23268: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROOM_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:154
msgctxt "text_id=23268 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Um, y-yeah, but I'm not going in there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:166:23269: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_ROOM_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:166
msgctxt "text_id=23269 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I'm just looking for something. Don't mind me.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:178:23270: scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:178
msgctxt "text_id=23270 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki took the stairs down to the first floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:229:23271: scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:229
msgctxt "text_id=23271 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I unlocked the door and entered my room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_ROOM:234:23272: scene=WIK_ROOM
#: WIK_ROOM:234
msgctxt "text_id=23272 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Nobody was inside, and there was no sign of any items having been disturbed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_1:30:23273: scene=WIK_S_1
#: WIK_S_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=23273 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think Touko Aozaki was the first victim."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_1:64:23274: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_1_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_1
#: WIK_S_1:64
msgctxt "text_id=23274 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Touko has to have been first, otherwise Aozaki wouldn't have acted so weird."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_1:76:23275: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_1_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_1
#: WIK_S_1:76
msgctxt "text_id=23275 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Aozaki was out shopping all morning. Her big sister must have been killed sometime after she left, but before she brought you all here and went back into her room.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_1:99:23276: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_S_1_0000_0; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_S_1
#: WIK_S_1:99
msgctxt "text_id=23276 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I passed Aozaki in the hallway on the second floor around 3:30."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_1:112:23277: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_S_1_0000_1; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_S_1
#: WIK_S_1:112
msgctxt "text_id=23277 | speaker=kojika"
msgid " Touko must've been drowning herself in oldies right around then.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_2:36:23278: scene=WIK_S_2
#: WIK_S_2:36
msgctxt "text_id=23278 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think Touko must've died sometime between 4:00PM and 6:00PM."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_3:36:23279: scene=WIK_S_3
#: WIK_S_3:36
msgctxt "text_id=23279 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think Touko must've died sometime between 6:00PM and 8:00PM."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_4:36:23280: scene=WIK_S_4
#: WIK_S_4:36
msgctxt "text_id=23280 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think Touko must've died sometime between 8:00PM and 10:00PM."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_5:36:23281: scene=WIK_S_5
#: WIK_S_5:36
msgctxt "text_id=23281 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think Touko must've died sometime between 10:00PM and midnight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:41:23282: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_A_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:41
msgctxt "text_id=23282 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Well, until we can come up with any real conclusions, this is all just speculation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:52:23283: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_A_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:52
msgctxt "text_id=23283 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  I think the real problem isn't figuring out when the murder was committed, but how.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:84:23284: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_A_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:84
msgctxt "text_id=23284 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"It takes a serious sense of humor to make someone like Mr. Yamasiro or Father Eiri to laugh out loud."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:95:23285: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_A_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:95
msgctxt "text_id=23285 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Other factors like timeframe being equal, just having a sense of humor excludes some people right off the bat, like Soujyuro, Beo, and Kinomi.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:128:23286: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:128
msgctxt "text_id=23286 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji had latched onto something big."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:133:23287: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:133
msgctxt "text_id=23287 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Why hadn't anyone else thought of that?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:138:23288: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:138
msgctxt "text_id=23288 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Housuke's jokes only made people cringe; Beo didn't even understand the concept of humor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:143:23289: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:143
msgctxt "text_id=23289 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As for Sizuki, I've met planks of wood that get jokes quicker."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:209:23290: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:209
msgctxt "text_id=23290 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Our discussion carried on until nearly 3:00 AM."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:235:23291: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_S_A_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:235
msgctxt "text_id=23291 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huah...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:240:23292: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:240
msgctxt "text_id=23292 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I yawned. I was by no means relaxed, just exhausted."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:245:23293: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:245
msgctxt "text_id=23293 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  After everything that's happened, I'd be surprised if anyone had any real energy left."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:276:23294: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_S_A_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:276
msgctxt "text_id=23294 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"It's late. We should probably get some sleep. Are you gonna rest? I can crash on the sofa just to be safe.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:319:23295: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:319
msgctxt "text_id=23295 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was clearly on guard for Sweets Hearts disguised as Aozaki, or someone else."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_S_A:325:23296: scene=WIK_S_A
#: WIK_S_A:325
msgctxt "text_id=23296 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I yawned again."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_T:8:23297: scene=WIK_SELECT_T
#: WIK_SELECT_T:8
msgctxt "text_id=23297 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision T-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:40:23298: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:40
msgctxt "text_id=23298 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It should be safe as long as the door is locked, but we still had other things to worry about."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:75:23299: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:75
msgctxt "text_id=23299 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"We've made it this far. Only a little longer to go."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:81:23300: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:81
msgctxt "text_id=23300 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  Y'know, Tsukiji, you're the one who said not to trust anybody.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:92:23301: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:92
msgctxt "text_id=23301 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Oh, yeah. I'm a suspect, too."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:103:23302: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:103
msgctxt "text_id=23302 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  Guess I didn't need to worry about you, huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:127:23303: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:127
msgctxt "text_id=23303 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji turned to the door, ready to leave."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:132:23304: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:132
msgctxt "text_id=23304 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I tried to say something."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:170:23305: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:170
msgctxt "text_id=23305 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Th-This doesn't have anything to do with anything, but..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:182:23306: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:182
msgctxt "text_id=23306 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  ...even though it's been, y'know, a rough day, you seem―I dunno―content.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:187:23307: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:187
msgctxt "text_id=23307 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  What the hell was I saying?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:192:23308: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:192
msgctxt "text_id=23308 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was just embarrassing myself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:230:23309: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0002; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:230
msgctxt "text_id=23309 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"People died and I almost joined them. 'Rough day' is putting it lightly.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:235:23310: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:235
msgctxt "text_id=23310 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Luckily, he took my question seriously."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:247:23311: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0003; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:247
msgctxt "text_id=23311 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"But, I guess, in a way... it's been kind of fun."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:259:23312: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0004; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:259
msgctxt "text_id=23312 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  You feel the same, don't you, Kumari?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:265:23313: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:265
msgctxt "text_id=23313 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  His considerate reply was so reassuring, I almost forgot my anxiety."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:303:23314: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:303
msgctxt "text_id=23314 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"That's a surprise. I thought you looked down on this sort of thing.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:323:23315: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0005; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:323
msgctxt "text_id=23315 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Well, you were wrong, then. I love this kind of chaos. I don't want to take life too seriously.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:334:23316: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:334
msgctxt "text_id=23316 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"For real? Well, you just blew my mind.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:367:23317: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:367
msgctxt "text_id=23317 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was being serious. It reminded of the time I first realized that I'd fallen for him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:372:23318: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:372
msgctxt "text_id=23318 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji was an amazing person."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:377:23319: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:377
msgctxt "text_id=23319 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But he was squandering his potential."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:382:23320: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:382
msgctxt "text_id=23320 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He didn't want glory or to move up in the world."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:402:23321: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:402
msgctxt "text_id=23321 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It felt like such a waste of human capital."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:407:23322: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:407
msgctxt "text_id=23322 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could never do that. How long had I been watching him, wanting to kick his butt into gear?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:443:23323: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:443
msgctxt "text_id=23323 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Look, I know this probably isn't the time..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:449:23324: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:449
msgctxt "text_id=23324 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  ...but you're not exactly a people-person sometimes, and yet you talk to me. Why is that?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:473:23325: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0006_0; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:473
msgctxt "text_id=23325 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Hm?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:487:23326: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0006_1; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:487
msgctxt "text_id=23326 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid " You've worked your ass off for six years, without relying once on your parents, teachers, or anyone else.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:522:23327: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:522
msgctxt "text_id=23327 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:533:23328: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0007; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:533
msgctxt "text_id=23328 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Anyway, I'll catch you in the morning down in the foyer.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:574:23329: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:574
msgctxt "text_id=23329 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And with that, the room went quiet again."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:579:23330: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:579
msgctxt "text_id=23330 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For some reason, I felt a tight squeezing sensation in my chest."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:585:23331: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0008; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:585
msgctxt "text_id=23331 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"In a way... it's been kind of fun.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:591:23332: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_1_0009; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:591
msgctxt "text_id=23332 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"You feel the same, don't you, Kumari?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:596:23333: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:596
msgctxt "text_id=23333 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji's words replayed themselves over and over in my head."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:639:23334: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:639
msgctxt "text_id=23334 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...Yeah. He was right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:644:23335: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:644
msgctxt "text_id=23335 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe it had been fun."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:760:23336: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:760
msgctxt "text_id=23336 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:767:23337: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:767
msgctxt "text_id=23337 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I woke up to the sound of birds chirping."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:773:23338: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:773
msgctxt "text_id=23338 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Ungh... It's morning...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:778:23339: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:778
msgctxt "text_id=23339 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The clock read half past five."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:783:23340: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:783
msgctxt "text_id=23340 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The sun was beginning to peek over the horizon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:804:23341: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:804
msgctxt "text_id=23341 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My ability to rise early was one of my few strong points, so I must've been really exhausted."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:809:23342: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:809
msgctxt "text_id=23342 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I foggily examined my wrinkled clothes in the mirror."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:829:23343: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:829
msgctxt "text_id=23343 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My body was still asleep."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:838:23344: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:838
msgctxt "text_id=23344 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was too tired to even make tea, so I just grabbed my wallet and card case off the table."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:843:23345: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:843
msgctxt "text_id=23345 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The case contained my commuter pass and some pictures I took each year."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:864:23346: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:864
msgctxt "text_id=23346 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I had a rare shot of Aozaki making a fool of herself at this year's school festival."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:884:23347: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:884
msgctxt "text_id=23347 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She either drank champagne thinking it was a soft drink,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:889:23348: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:889
msgctxt "text_id=23348 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  or someone slipped alcohol in the juice cocktail."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:894:23349: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:894
msgctxt "text_id=23349 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Next thing I knew, she was all hyper, yelling about wearing someone else's clothes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:937:23350: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:937
msgctxt "text_id=23350 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I got a great shot of her with my disposable camera."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:942:23351: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:942
msgctxt "text_id=23351 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I loved that photo so much I carried it with me in my card case everywhere I go."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:947:23352: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:947
msgctxt "text_id=23352 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Whenever I felt down, it always cheered me up to look at it and remember how adorable Aozaki could be. It was a side of herself that nobody who knew her would ever expect."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:952:23353: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:952
msgctxt "text_id=23353 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Especially her comedic side."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:987:23354: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:987
msgctxt "text_id=23354 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:992:23355: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:992
msgctxt "text_id=23355 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Wait a second."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:997:23356: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:997
msgctxt "text_id=23356 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Did I just think something I really shouldn't have, that would be incredibly bad to bring up now?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1018:23357: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0012; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1018
msgctxt "text_id=23357 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Oh, right... where is everyone?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1025:23358: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1025
msgctxt "text_id=23358 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I rifled through my overnight bag to see if anything might be of use."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1030:23359: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1030
msgctxt "text_id=23359 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Turns out, the stuff I brought to cook with was worth bringing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1061:23360: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1061
msgctxt "text_id=23360 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I hovered over the wok or the cleaver, ultimately deciding to take the wok with me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1111:23361: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1111
msgctxt "text_id=23361 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I went out into the hallway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1116:23362: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1116
msgctxt "text_id=23362 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The air was slightly cooler than inside the guest room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1121:23363: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1121
msgctxt "text_id=23363 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Silence had fallen over the mansion once again."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1126:23364: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1126
msgctxt "text_id=23364 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was no sound, no sign of life."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1131:23365: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1131
msgctxt "text_id=23365 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was like the storm never happened."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1178:23366: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1178
msgctxt "text_id=23366 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji's room was empty."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1183:23367: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1183
msgctxt "text_id=23367 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki wasn't in Father Eiri's room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1188:23368: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1188
msgctxt "text_id=23368 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Nobody was in Ritsuka's room, either."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1196:23369: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0013; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1196
msgctxt "text_id=23369 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Miss Kuonji!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1202:23370: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1202
msgctxt "text_id=23370 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I called out into the void of the west wing, but got no response."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1208:23371: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1208
msgctxt "text_id=23371 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was alone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1257:23372: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1257
msgctxt "text_id=23372 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I headed down to the basement where Aozaki was confined,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1262:23373: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1262
msgctxt "text_id=23373 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  down a narrow staircase to a door."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1267:23374: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1267
msgctxt "text_id=23374 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The padlock had been broken clean off from the outside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1282:23375: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0014; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1282
msgctxt "text_id=23375 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...Aozaki?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1287:23376: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1287
msgctxt "text_id=23376 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I braced myself for whatever was to come, and opened the door."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1383:23377: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1383
msgctxt "text_id=23377 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Inside the tiny cellar, I saw ...a dead body, lying face down."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1388:23378: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1388
msgctxt "text_id=23378 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The beautiful, long hair was all I needed to see to know it was Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1393:23379: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1393
msgctxt "text_id=23379 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She wasn't breathing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1398:23380: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1398
msgctxt "text_id=23380 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She'd scrawled something with her left hand in her last moments."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1403:23381: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1403
msgctxt "text_id=23381 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was dying message, written in blood."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1423:23382: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1423
msgctxt "text_id=23382 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could feel the disdain in the words."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1433:23383: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_T_1_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1433
msgctxt "text_id=23383 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Told you so.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1456:23384: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0015; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1456
msgctxt "text_id=23384 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"You sure did...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1462:23385: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1462
msgctxt "text_id=23385 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki wasn't the killer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1467:23386: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1467
msgctxt "text_id=23386 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It wasn't clear when she was murdered."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1472:23387: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1472
msgctxt "text_id=23387 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But whoever the killer was broke the lock, made her laugh, nonchalantly went upstairs, and..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1520:23388: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_1_0016; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1520
msgctxt "text_id=23388 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Hah, hah, hah!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1526:23389: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1526
msgctxt "text_id=23389 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I tried to control my breathing and my racing mind."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1531:23390: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1531
msgctxt "text_id=23390 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone was dead."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1536:23391: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1536
msgctxt "text_id=23391 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone was dead."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1541:23392: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1541
msgctxt "text_id=23392 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Probably, only the killer and I were left."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1571:23393: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1571
msgctxt "text_id=23393 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But the sun was already up."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1576:23394: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1576
msgctxt "text_id=23394 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Wait, not completely."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1581:23395: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1581
msgctxt "text_id=23395 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If the rules said it ended in the morning, then the game wasn't over yet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1586:23396: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1586
msgctxt "text_id=23396 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I had to get out of here now and figure out who the killer is."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1591:23397: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1591
msgctxt "text_id=23397 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was no winning this unless I did something."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1596:23398: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1596
msgctxt "text_id=23398 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone was dead. No turning back now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_1:1629:23399: scene=WIK_T_1
#: WIK_T_1:1629
msgctxt "text_id=23399 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_U:8:23400: scene=WIK_SELECT_U
#: WIK_SELECT_U:8
msgctxt "text_id=23400 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision U-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:41:23401: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:41
msgctxt "text_id=23401 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If that's how it has to be, then there's no helping it now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:82:23402: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:82
msgctxt "text_id=23402 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Y-Yeah, I guess it's the best option right now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:93:23403: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:93
msgctxt "text_id=23403 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I-I mean I have lots of brothers, so I'm used to sleeping in the same room as boys. It's fine. Completely fine.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:104:23404: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_2_0000; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:104
msgctxt "text_id=23404 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "\"Perfect. I'll take the sofa then."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:115:23405: speaker=tobimaru; speaker_ja=鳶丸; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B70_WIK_T_2_0001; voice_prefix=B70; voice_category=4; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:115
msgctxt "text_id=23405 | speaker=tobimaru"
msgid "  I'm pretty exhausted myself. Hopefully, I can get some rest if I know you're nearby.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:151:23406: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:151
msgctxt "text_id=23406 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji quickly fell asleep after raising his hand to wave goodnight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:156:23407: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:156
msgctxt "text_id=23407 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I looked at him all wrapped up in a blanket..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:182:23408: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:182
msgctxt "text_id=23408 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Oh, come on.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:188:23409: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:188
msgctxt "text_id=23409 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Seeing him fall asleep so quickly helped me to feel relaxed too."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:193:23410: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:193
msgctxt "text_id=23410 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...I definitely didn't want to get excited in a situation like this. Plus, I was beat."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:226:23411: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:226
msgctxt "text_id=23411 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I didn't have any pajamas, and didn't feel like changing anyway."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:235:23412: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:235
msgctxt "text_id=23412 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For comfort, I did remove my wallet and card case from my pockets and place them on a table, before sliding under a blanket fully-clothed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:284:23413: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:284
msgctxt "text_id=23413 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I couldn't fall asleep as fast as Tsukiji, but I could feel myself drifting off already."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:289:23414: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:289
msgctxt "text_id=23414 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Into a deep, deep sleep..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:294:23415: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:294
msgctxt "text_id=23415 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Did... I just hear... laughter... next to me...?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:407:23416: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:407
msgctxt "text_id=23416 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I woke up to the sound of birds chirping."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:414:23417: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:414
msgctxt "text_id=23417 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Ungh... It's morning...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:420:23418: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:420
msgctxt "text_id=23418 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The clock read half past five."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:425:23419: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:425
msgctxt "text_id=23419 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The sun was beginning to peek over the horizon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:447:23420: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:447
msgctxt "text_id=23420 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My ability to rise early was one of my few strong points, so I must've been really exhausted."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:452:23421: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:452
msgctxt "text_id=23421 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I looked around the room, my vision blurry."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:461:23422: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:461
msgctxt "text_id=23422 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Oh! Tsukiji!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:467:23423: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:467
msgctxt "text_id=23423 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I went to sleep in the same room as him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:488:23424: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:488
msgctxt "text_id=23424 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:495:23425: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:495
msgctxt "text_id=23425 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I finally realized that he wasn't where I'd last seen him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:515:23426: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:515
msgctxt "text_id=23426 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was nobody on the sofa."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:520:23427: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:520
msgctxt "text_id=23427 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Just his clothes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:525:23428: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:525
msgctxt "text_id=23428 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They were laid out neatly like they were on display."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:530:23429: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:530
msgctxt "text_id=23429 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was like he'd shrunk so small he'd disappeared, or melted away somewhere."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:535:23430: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:535
msgctxt "text_id=23430 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe he wanted to die by completely vanishing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:556:23431: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:556
msgctxt "text_id=23431 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...Tsukiji?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:563:23432: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:563
msgctxt "text_id=23432 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I tried touching his clothes."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:568:23433: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:568
msgctxt "text_id=23433 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I touched his blanket, and the sofa."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:573:23434: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:573
msgctxt "text_id=23434 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  His warmth had long since faded."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:578:23435: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:578
msgctxt "text_id=23435 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My card case had fallen around where his hand might have been."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:598:23436: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:598
msgctxt "text_id=23436 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could guess what happened."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:603:23437: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:603
msgctxt "text_id=23437 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He never really fell asleep."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:608:23438: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:608
msgctxt "text_id=23438 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He pretended to, so I'd relax. Then he stayed up to watch over me all night."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:628:23439: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:628
msgctxt "text_id=23439 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This was a locked-room murder."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:633:23440: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:633
msgctxt "text_id=23440 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was clear what the murder weapon is, and I was finally close to figuring out who the killer was, too."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:653:23441: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:653
msgctxt "text_id=23441 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I picked up my card case, and left the room feeling empty inside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:673:23442: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:673
msgctxt "text_id=23442 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...I'm so sorry, Tsukiji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:678:23443: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:678
msgctxt "text_id=23443 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As Aozaki's friend, of course you'd laugh at that photo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:721:23444: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:721
msgctxt "text_id=23444 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was quiet."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:726:23445: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:726
msgctxt "text_id=23445 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The air was crisp."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:731:23446: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:731
msgctxt "text_id=23446 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My mind was so blank I almost laughed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:778:23447: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:778
msgctxt "text_id=23447 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji's room was clean and tidy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:783:23448: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:783
msgctxt "text_id=23448 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Father Eiri's room was clean and tidy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:788:23449: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:788
msgctxt "text_id=23449 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka's room was clean and tidy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:809:23450: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:809
msgctxt "text_id=23450 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Anyone alive out there?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:815:23451: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:815
msgctxt "text_id=23451 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I yelled into the void of the west wing, but no one responded."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:820:23452: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:820
msgctxt "text_id=23452 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My hunch was spot on. Something was wrong."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:826:23453: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:826
msgctxt "text_id=23453 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This mansion was now the cleanest, quietest place in all of Misaki. It was over."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:875:23454: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:875
msgctxt "text_id=23454 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I went down to the basement where Aozaki was confined,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:880:23455: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:880
msgctxt "text_id=23455 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  down the narrow staircase to the door."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:894:23456: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:894
msgctxt "text_id=23456 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The padlock had been broken clean off from the outside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:992:23457: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:992
msgctxt "text_id=23457 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Inside the tiny cellar, I saw... a single dead body, lying prone."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:997:23458: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:997
msgctxt "text_id=23458 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The beautiful, long hair was all I needed to know who it was. Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1002:23459: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1002
msgctxt "text_id=23459 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She wasn't breathing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1022:23460: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1022
msgctxt "text_id=23460 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She hadn't been the killer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1027:23461: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1027
msgctxt "text_id=23461 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was unclear what time she was murdered."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1032:23462: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1032
msgctxt "text_id=23462 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But whoever the killer was broke the lock, made Aozaki laugh, nonchalantly went upstairs, and..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1040:23463: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1040
msgctxt "text_id=23463 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...cut off my means of escape. They were going to show up soon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1060:23464: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1060
msgctxt "text_id=23464 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They must have been hiding somewhere waiting for me to come down into the basement."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1065:23465: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1065
msgctxt "text_id=23465 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The stairs were the only way out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1070:23466: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1070
msgctxt "text_id=23466 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If the killer followed me down here, I was trapped."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1104:23467: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_T_2_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1104
msgctxt "text_id=23467 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...Oh, well. Doesn't matter anymore.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1110:23468: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1110
msgctxt "text_id=23468 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was at a dead end."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1115:23469: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1115
msgctxt "text_id=23469 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Game over. Victory to the real killer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_T_2:1120:23470: scene=WIK_T_2
#: WIK_T_2:1120
msgctxt "text_id=23470 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My thoughts were interrupted by the sounds of footsteps. The footsteps of Death..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:65:23471: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:65
msgctxt "text_id=23471 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Noon. Central Park."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:70:23472: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:70
msgctxt "text_id=23472 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I finished making extra prints at the store, and threw away the disposable camera so I didn't have to carry it around."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:112:23473: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:112
msgctxt "text_id=23473 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was a beautiful day out; the sky was clear, and the autumn air was crisp."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:117:23474: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:117
msgctxt "text_id=23474 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The troubles of the summer were gone, and it was a brand new day."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:139:23475: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:139
msgctxt "text_id=23475 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I, Kojika Kumari, was about to spend my long weekend at the strangest of events."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:194:23476: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:194
msgctxt "text_id=23476 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Thanks for waiting!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:205:23477: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0001; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:205
msgctxt "text_id=23477 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Whoa, what's with all the stuff? Damn, that's a huge overnight bag.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:225:23478: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:225
msgctxt "text_id=23478 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  An hour had passed already, and it was 1:00 PM."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:230:23479: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:230
msgctxt "text_id=23479 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aoko Aozaki arrived at our meeting place."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:235:23480: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:235
msgctxt "text_id=23480 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki was my classmate, friend, and comrade on the student council."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:272:23481: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:272
msgctxt "text_id=23481 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We'd only been friends since high school, but it oddly felt longer, like we'd always known each other."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:283:23482: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:283
msgctxt "text_id=23482 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As you can see, she was as bright and lively as ever."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:288:23483: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:288
msgctxt "text_id=23483 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If she was a drink, she'd be a soft drink, a carbonated soda. She was the kind of person who solved a tough problem by hitting it until it surrendered."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:323:23484: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0002; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:323
msgctxt "text_id=23484 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Didn't I write on the invitation that I'd have everything for the party at the Kuonji house, so don't bring anything?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:341:23485: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:341
msgctxt "text_id=23485 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:353:23486: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:353
msgctxt "text_id=23486 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  The invitation just said there's a birthday party, so come at the start of the long weekend, and bring your own food.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:379:23487: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0003; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:379
msgctxt "text_id=23487 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Seriously? Sorry. Alice is new to this kind of thing. That's probably why you called this morning and wanted me to come meet you."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:402:23488: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0004_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:402
msgctxt "text_id=23488 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Anyway, moving on..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:426:23489: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0004_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:426
msgctxt "text_id=23489 | speaker=aoko"
msgid " Is that dull guy behind you with you? He looks kinda out of place.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:476:23490: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:476
msgctxt "text_id=23490 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Oh, come on! I just got this suit yesterday. Don't I clean up pretty well?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:500:23491: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0005; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:500
msgctxt "text_id=23491 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"As always, you look about as plain as copy paper, Mr. Yamasiro."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:511:23492: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:511
msgctxt "text_id=23492 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  So what're you doing here today?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:511:23493: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0006; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:511
msgctxt "text_id=23493 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Following your students around? You know that'll be illegal one day, so I wouldn't get into a habit of doing it.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:531:23494: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:531
msgctxt "text_id=23494 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki never pulled her punches, inside or outside of school."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:536:23495: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:536
msgctxt "text_id=23495 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She was particularly harsh to Mr. Yamasiro, almost like they were related."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:573:23496: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0001_0; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:573
msgctxt "text_id=23496 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Oh, you mean stalking?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:585:23497: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0001_1; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:585
msgctxt "text_id=23497 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid " I think you're probably the expert on that, Aozaki. That's just my personal impression of you, though."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:596:23498: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0002; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:596
msgctxt "text_id=23498 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "  Don't look at me like that. Anyway, here..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:605:23499: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0003; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:605
msgctxt "text_id=23499 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "  I received an invitation this morning, so I'm participating as an advisor to the student council. I have a responsibility to chaperone you, don't I?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:644:23500: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:644
msgctxt "text_id=23500 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:649:23501: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:649
msgctxt "text_id=23501 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The invitation Mr. Yamasiro pulled out was the same as the one I got."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:654:23502: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:654
msgctxt "text_id=23502 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki looked surprised, to say the least."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:659:23503: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:659
msgctxt "text_id=23503 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That was no act."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:686:23504: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0007; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:686
msgctxt "text_id=23504 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Ugh. That's Soujyuro's handwriting... I should've known better than to ask him for help...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:711:23505: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0004; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:711
msgctxt "text_id=23505 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Hahaha! I thought it very considerate of him!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:717:23506: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0005; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:717
msgctxt "text_id=23506 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "  Why, Aozaki, I imagine Sizuki could really go places, given the right opportunities."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:723:23507: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0006; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:723
msgctxt "text_id=23507 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "  And look at what else he wrote."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:723:23508: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0006; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:723
msgctxt "text_id=23508 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "'Please watch over the party, because who knows what Aozaki might do.'"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:729:23509: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0007; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:729
msgctxt "text_id=23509 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "  He's even preparing for emergencies! Fine management skills, if you ask me.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:755:23510: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:755
msgctxt "text_id=23510 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki let out a defeated sigh."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:760:23511: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:760
msgctxt "text_id=23511 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She couldn't turn away Mr. Yamasiro, since he'd been formally invited."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:765:23512: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:765
msgctxt "text_id=23512 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  However cold-hearted she appeared, she did have a sense of etiquette."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:802:23513: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0008; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:802
msgctxt "text_id=23513 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Okay, okay. Follow me, I guess."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:813:23514: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0009; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:813
msgctxt "text_id=23514 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Is this the first time you've both visited the Kuonji Estate?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:829:23515: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0008; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:829
msgctxt "text_id=23515 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"It is. People around here don't usually go near Shiroinuzuka. Take what happened this past summer, for instance.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:840:23516: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:840
msgctxt "text_id=23516 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I've been this way a few times."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:851:23517: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:851
msgctxt "text_id=23517 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  This mountain's like sacred ground for all the kids around here.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:891:23518: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:891
msgctxt "text_id=23518 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe \"sacred ground\" was an exaggeration, but I couldn't think of a better way to describe it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:896:23519: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:896
msgctxt "text_id=23519 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  For years, there had been urban legends circulating about the hills there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:901:23520: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:901
msgctxt "text_id=23520 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Like the \"Demon Dog of the Slope.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:906:23521: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:906
msgctxt "text_id=23521 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Or the one where, if you went into the woods on a foggy day, you'd come out either as someone different or with strange powers."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:926:23522: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:926
msgctxt "text_id=23522 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Those stories were probably the reason kids came here: to test their courage."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:931:23523: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:931
msgctxt "text_id=23523 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In elementary school, if you went into the woods and touched the mailbox of the haunted house, you were officially awesome right up until graduation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:936:23524: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:936
msgctxt "text_id=23524 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I guess that's why sacred ground seemed to fit the area."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:970:23525: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0009; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:970
msgctxt "text_id=23525 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"You walked all this way to and from school for over two years, Aozaki? You must be very athletic.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:989:23526: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:989
msgctxt "text_id=23526 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Mr. Yamasiro gazed down at the city excitedly; maybe it was the first time he'd seen it from this angle."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:994:23527: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:994
msgctxt "text_id=23527 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd like to feel that excited, too, but I couldn't relax, given the situation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:999:23528: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:999
msgctxt "text_id=23528 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Because-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1024:23529: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0010; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1024
msgctxt "text_id=23529 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"How's your exam studying going, Aozaki?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1030:23530: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0011; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1030
msgctxt "text_id=23530 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "  I'm sure you've got it under control, so there's probably no need to worry about you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1048:23531: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0010; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1048
msgctxt "text_id=23531 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Of course, I have it under control."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1054:23532: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0011; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1054
msgctxt "text_id=23532 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  I wouldn't dare cause any trouble for you, Mr. Yamasiro.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1080:23533: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0012; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1080
msgctxt "text_id=23533 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Glad to hear it. You always turn down my advice, after all. Are you really that against attending a local university?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1108:23534: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0012; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1108
msgctxt "text_id=23534 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Not particularly. I just want to keep my options open. If anyone needs advice, it's Kumari.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1134:23535: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0013; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1134
msgctxt "text_id=23535 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Not at all. She's doing just fine. She's taken my recommendation for Mizora. She and her parents have already decided she'll be attending there.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1163:23536: voice_id=X40_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=X40; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1163
msgctxt "text_id=23536 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Ah.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1204:23537: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1204
msgctxt "text_id=23537 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I silently tried to tell Aozaki to ignore the topic."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1225:23538: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1225
msgctxt "text_id=23538 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Let me take a moment here to talk about my history and what was happening today."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1259:23539: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1259
msgctxt "text_id=23539 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My name is Kojika Kumari; I'm a third-year senior in high school."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1264:23540: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1264
msgctxt "text_id=23540 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  You know what students are like, struggling through exams without any hopes or dreams..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1269:23541: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1269
msgctxt "text_id=23541 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Well, I'm not a typical student. I want to attend a college in the city."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1275:23542: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1275
msgctxt "text_id=23542 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'm planning to attend a local university. Given my current academic performance, that should be a piece of cake."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1319:23543: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1319
msgctxt "text_id=23543 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My parents insist I get a job; they don't want me attending college at all."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1341:23544: voice_id=D30_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=D30; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1341
msgctxt "text_id=23544 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"You're going to help out with the family business. Why go to college?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1374:23545: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1374
msgctxt "text_id=23545 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That's my old-fashioned father for you―as big and as hard-headed as a bear."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1379:23546: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1379
msgctxt "text_id=23546 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Luckily, my older brothers managed to convince him to let me go despite his archaic ways."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1429:23547: voice_id=E80_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=E80; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1429
msgctxt "text_id=23547 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Mad Daddy, Kojika needs to experience college life, and do gymnastics there. Don't you want to see her on the pommel horse?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1461:23548: voice_id=E90_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=E90; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1461
msgctxt "text_id=23548 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Hahaha, that's why you're the oldest, brother. I think the rings are more her thing! She's too weak for horses.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1493:23549: voice_id=F10_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=F10; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1493
msgctxt "text_id=23549 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"You kidding, my double bros? The horizontal bar is where it's at! Once you get a taste of those vertical flips, you'll never go back!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1543:23550: voice_id=F20_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=F20; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1543
msgctxt "text_id=23550 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"Yeah, and she's a hit with the guys. We can use that! I bet those dumbasses at the skating club will beg us to convince her to join their team!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1677:23551: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1677
msgctxt "text_id=23551 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Honestly, my brothers are idiots."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1682:23552: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1682
msgctxt "text_id=23552 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Those gymnastics events were male-only, for goodness' sake."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1713:23553: voice_id=D30_WIK_TITLEIN_0001; voice_prefix=D30; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1713
msgctxt "text_id=23553 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"B"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23554 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "U"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23555 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "N"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23556 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "C"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23557 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "H"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23558 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "O"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23559 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "F"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23560 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "C"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23561 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "R"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23562 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "E"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23563 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "E"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23564 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "P"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23565 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "S!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1774:23566: voice_id=D30_WIK_TITLEIN_0002; voice_prefix=D30; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1774
msgctxt "text_id=23566 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I don't really want to keep any more meatheads around here, but it's the only way to protect Kojika."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1781:23567: voice_id=D30_WIK_TITLEIN_0003; voice_prefix=D30; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1781
msgctxt "text_id=23567 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Fine, but only if it's Mizora College. It's close, and she might even bring in some new regulars!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1794:23568: voice_id=D30_WIK_TITLEIN_0004; voice_prefix=D30; voice_category=0; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1794
msgctxt "text_id=23568 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Gahahaha!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1799:23569: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1799
msgctxt "text_id=23569 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That was the decision my four brothers and my father came to in their little huddle."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1850:23570: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1850
msgctxt "text_id=23570 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Just thinking about my family makes me want to die, but that's how it's been since elementary school, so I'm used to feeling like that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1867:23571: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1867
msgctxt "text_id=23571 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I did as my father asked and set my sights on Mizora Sport Science U."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1879:23572: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1879
msgctxt "text_id=23572 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That put him at ease, but I had other things in mind."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1915:23573: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1915
msgctxt "text_id=23573 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I convinced him to let me put down a college in the city as my \"safety school.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1922:23574: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1922
msgctxt "text_id=23574 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"You're supposed to write down up to three schools you're interested in for your teacher to review. Just a formality, so I don't need any extra money or anything.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1942:23575: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1942
msgctxt "text_id=23575 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My father believed every word of it."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1947:23576: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1947
msgctxt "text_id=23576 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Of course, I fully intended to go to my second choice in the city."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1968:23577: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1968
msgctxt "text_id=23577 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That's why I secretly worked a part-time job."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:1973:23578: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:1973
msgctxt "text_id=23578 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd saved enough over three years to cover living costs if I got in. I'd have to get a loan for tuition fees, but it was the only way to make the plan work."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2009:23579: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2009
msgctxt "text_id=23579 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My father was stubborn and brash, but he appreciated hard work and diligence."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2014:23580: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2014
msgctxt "text_id=23580 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If he saw that I passed my exams while saving up enough money to pay for myself, he'd probably let me go."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2019:23581: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2019
msgctxt "text_id=23581 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Not that I wouldn't even if he disapproved."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2053:23582: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2053
msgctxt "text_id=23582 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everything was going according to plan so far."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2058:23583: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2058
msgctxt "text_id=23583 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The only thing that could stop me was sudden illness preventing me from taking the entrance exam."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2064:23584: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2064
msgctxt "text_id=23584 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Oh, right. There was one other thing..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2085:23585: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0014; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2085
msgctxt "text_id=23585 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"So, do you have a boyfriend, Aozaki?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2107:23586: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2107
msgctxt "text_id=23586 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki didn't reply."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2112:23587: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2112
msgctxt "text_id=23587 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It's a beautiful day and Mr. Yamasiro had been invited to a party, so he couldn't be thinking straight."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2117:23588: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2117
msgctxt "text_id=23588 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He'd unknowingly spoken a word forbidden in Misaki High."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2164:23589: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2164
msgctxt "text_id=23589 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Strangely―then again, maybe it's not so strange―Aozaki was single."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2169:23590: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2169
msgctxt "text_id=23590 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She was undoubtedly attractive if she wasn't speaking to you,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2200:23591: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2200
msgctxt "text_id=23591 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " but she was permanently in a bad mood, and didn't bother with small talk."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2248:23592: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0013_A; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2248
msgctxt "text_id=23592 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Were you up all night, Mr. Yamasiro?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2259:23593: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0015; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2259
msgctxt "text_id=23593 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"Oh, I, um, I was just, you know, curious. You're almost free of your student council duties, and I'm simply raising a glass to your youth as your teacher...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2286:23594: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0014; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2286
msgctxt "text_id=23594 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Thank you *ever* so kindly for your concern, Mr. Yamasiro."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2292:23595: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0015; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2292
msgctxt "text_id=23595 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  If you're so concerned about me, perhaps we should date."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2305:23596: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0016_0; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2305
msgctxt "text_id=23596 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  But what would happen if people were to find out?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2335:23597: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0016_1; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2335
msgctxt "text_id=23597 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  What would happen if they found out our dark, little secret?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2341:23598: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2341
msgctxt "text_id=23598 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki beamed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2346:23599: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2346
msgctxt "text_id=23599 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If looks could kill..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2382:23600: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0016; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2382
msgctxt "text_id=23600 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "\"...I'm sorry. I was out of line. Please, don't go doing anything that would put me out of a job."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2396:23601: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0017; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2396
msgctxt "text_id=23601 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "  You've got exams coming up, so of course you don't need to worry about relationships."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2396:23602: speaker=yamashiro; speaker_ja=山城教諭; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B60_WIK_TITLEIN_0017; voice_prefix=B60; voice_category=7; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2396
msgctxt "text_id=23602 | speaker=yamashiro"
msgid "  Excellent. Yes. You study hard, Aozaki!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2401:23603: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2401
msgctxt "text_id=23603 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Mr. Yamasiro laughed uncomfortably."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2428:23604: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0017; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2428
msgctxt "text_id=23604 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"Good. Please, think before you speak in the future. Certain people at the mansion might not take kindly to slips of the tongue. Right, Kuma?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2453:23605: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2453
msgctxt "text_id=23605 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Right..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2465:23606: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2465
msgctxt "text_id=23606 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  Sure, it's a party, but it's for someone's birthday.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2499:23607: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2499
msgctxt "text_id=23607 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was starting to feel a little inadequate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2504:23608: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2504
msgctxt "text_id=23608 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I wasn't as attractive or cool as Aozaki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2509:23609: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2509
msgctxt "text_id=23609 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I mean, I wasn't even sure my college plan was really going to work. I felt more anxious every day."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2515:23610: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2515
msgctxt "text_id=23610 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Pathetic, I know."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2520:23611: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2520
msgctxt "text_id=23611 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If I didn't already have enough to worry about, there was the equally big problem of a boy at school."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2552:23612: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_TITLEIN_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2552
msgctxt "text_id=23612 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I'm surprised Miss Kuonji is holding a party at her place. Aozaki, you mentioned even her father rarely gets to visit.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2573:23613: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0018; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2573
msgctxt "text_id=23613 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "\"It came as a shock to me too, actually. I guess people really can change."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2624:23614: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_TITLEIN_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2624
msgctxt "text_id=23614 | speaker=alice"
msgid "'Sizuki's friends can come, too. I don't mind.'"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2630:23615: speaker=aoko; speaker_ja=青子; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A10_WIK_TITLEIN_0019; voice_prefix=A10; voice_category=1; scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2630
msgctxt "text_id=23615 | speaker=aoko"
msgid "  Never thought I'd hear Alice say something like that.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2681:23616: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2681
msgctxt "text_id=23616 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The gate to Shiroinuzuka stood tall, as if designed to warn off visitors."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2686:23617: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2686
msgctxt "text_id=23617 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki opened the gate; it wasn't even locked."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2691:23618: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2691
msgctxt "text_id=23618 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I felt like we were passing into a different world. Was it just me, or did the trees and mountains look different inside?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_TITLEIN:2696:23619: scene=WIK_TITLEIN
#: WIK_TITLEIN:2696
msgctxt "text_id=23619 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_A:9:23620: scene=WIK_SELECT_A
#: WIK_SELECT_A:9
msgctxt "text_id=23620 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision A-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:30:23621: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:30
msgctxt "text_id=23621 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think it would be best to run away until the morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:63:23622: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_U_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:63
msgctxt "text_id=23622 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:69:23623: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:69
msgctxt "text_id=23623 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Something felt off for a second there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:74:23624: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:74
msgctxt "text_id=23624 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was as if my decision was completely different from the words that came from my mouth."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:95:23625: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_U_1_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:95
msgctxt "text_id=23625 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"No time for that! I have to get out of here!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:171:23626: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:171
msgctxt "text_id=23626 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The game would end if I could just keep from getting caught until sunrise."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:176:23627: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:176
msgctxt "text_id=23627 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As long as I survived, Sweets Hearts wouldn't win."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:181:23628: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:181
msgctxt "text_id=23628 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The storm was over. If I could just make it to the city, everything would go back to normal...!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:234:23629: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_U_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:234
msgctxt "text_id=23629 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...No way.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:240:23630: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:240
msgctxt "text_id=23630 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd been heading downhill all this time, so how did I end up behind the mansion?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:320:23631: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:320
msgctxt "text_id=23631 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aaah..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:325:23632: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:325
msgctxt "text_id=23632 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The ground distorted."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:330:23633: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:330
msgctxt "text_id=23633 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My senses went haywire."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:335:23634: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:335
msgctxt "text_id=23634 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The world crumbled."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:341:23635: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:341
msgctxt "text_id=23635 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I must've done something wrong."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:386:23636: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:386
msgctxt "text_id=23636 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Suddenly, a voice whispered in my ear."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:396:23637: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_U_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:396
msgctxt "text_id=23637 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "          \"Con-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23638 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "gra-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23639 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "tu-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23640 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "lations"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23641 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " on"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23642 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " kill-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23643 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ing"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23644 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " ev-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23645 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ery-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23646 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "one.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:428:23647: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:428
msgctxt "text_id=23647 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was a voice of terror that I'd never heard before,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_1:433:23648: scene=WIK_U_1
#: WIK_U_1:433
msgctxt "text_id=23648 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  yet it sounded so familiar..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:30:23649: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:30
msgctxt "text_id=23649 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I thought I should try to deduce who the killer is."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:63:23650: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_U_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:63
msgctxt "text_id=23650 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Calm down. Everything should be in order.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:69:23651: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:69
msgctxt "text_id=23651 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I controlled my breathing and began to organize the facts in my head."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:74:23652: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:74
msgctxt "text_id=23652 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I didn't have a decisive answer to the killer's motive, method, or identity."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:94:23653: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:94
msgctxt "text_id=23653 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There was only one thing I knew for sure."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:99:23654: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:99
msgctxt "text_id=23654 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji had said it many times."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:104:23655: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:104
msgctxt "text_id=23655 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It's not about who committed the murders,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:109:23656: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:109
msgctxt "text_id=23656 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "but rather who *could have* committed the murders."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:138:23657: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:138
msgctxt "text_id=23657 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The first murder: Tokitsu's capture and death by explosion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:144:23658: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:144
msgctxt "text_id=23658 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We could exclude the following suspects: Me,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23659 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Miss Kuonji,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23660 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Tsukiji,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23661 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Housuke,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23662 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Father Eiri,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23663 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " and Sister Yuika."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:210:23664: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:210
msgctxt "text_id=23664 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The second murder: Mr. Yamasiro's fabulous funeral."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:215:23665: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:215
msgctxt "text_id=23665 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Impossible to rule any suspects out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:222:23666: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:222
msgctxt "text_id=23666 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At a stretch, we could maybe exclude Miss Kuonji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:227:23667: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:227
msgctxt "text_id=23667 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We don't know when Mr. Yamasiro was killed, because we were all looking around after Tokitsu's murder."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:232:23668: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:232
msgctxt "text_id=23668 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It's unlikely the murder was committed within that ten-minute gap, but we couldn't rule it out completely."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:273:23669: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:273
msgctxt "text_id=23669 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The third murder: Housuke and Riddell."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:280:23670: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:280
msgctxt "text_id=23670 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Who cares?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:334:23671: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:334
msgctxt "text_id=23671 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The fourth murder: Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:340:23672: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:340
msgctxt "text_id=23672 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It can't have been me, because I didn't search for Aozaki's sister."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23673 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Neither could it have been Tsukiji,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23674 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Sizuki,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23675 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " or Ritsuka."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:432:23676: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:432
msgctxt "text_id=23676 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The fifth murder: Father Eiri's web."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:438:23677: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:438
msgctxt "text_id=23677 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  We were in the foyer, so it couldn't have been me,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23678 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Tsukiji,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23679 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Ritsuka,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23680 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " or Miss Kuonji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:484:23681: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:484
msgctxt "text_id=23681 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The sixth murder: The Yuika statue."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:490:23682: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:490
msgctxt "text_id=23682 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This one didn't matter, either."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:514:23683: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:514
msgctxt "text_id=23683 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The seventh murder: the elder Aozaki's death by alcohol poisoning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:520:23684: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:520
msgctxt "text_id=23684 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This might actually have been the first murder in the timeline. We could exclude..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23685 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " maybe only Miss Kuonji, barely."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:559:23686: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:559
msgctxt "text_id=23686 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That's everything I knew."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:564:23687: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:564
msgctxt "text_id=23687 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Now it came down to simple process of elimination."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:569:23688: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:569
msgctxt "text_id=23688 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Who was the invisible killer who made everyone laugh?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_U_2:574:23689: scene=WIK_U_2
#: WIK_U_2:574
msgctxt "text_id=23689 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I think the killer must be..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_V:8:23690: scene=WIK_SELECT_V
#: WIK_SELECT_V:8
msgctxt "text_id=23690 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision V-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:39:23691: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:39
msgctxt "text_id=23691 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...It was Sizuki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:45:23692: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:45
msgctxt "text_id=23692 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If the facts were pointing to anyone, it was him."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:50:23693: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:50
msgctxt "text_id=23693 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He knew this mansion inside and out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:55:23694: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:55
msgctxt "text_id=23694 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He'd been helping out with the birthday party, so he could move about freely without raising suspicion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:60:23695: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:60
msgctxt "text_id=23695 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But the biggest piece of evidence..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:80:23696: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:80
msgctxt "text_id=23696 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...was the glaring discrepancy between his and Miss Kuonji's alibis."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:85:23697: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:85
msgctxt "text_id=23697 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki said he was in the mansion in the morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:90:23698: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:90
msgctxt "text_id=23698 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  However, that's not what his landlady said."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:95:23699: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:95
msgctxt "text_id=23699 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She said that \"no one was around to help,\" so she locked the place up herself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:115:23700: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:115
msgctxt "text_id=23700 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If she did that on a regular basis, she wouldn't have bothered to mention that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:120:23701: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:120
msgctxt "text_id=23701 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji wanted either Sizuki or Aozaki to lock the doors."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:125:23702: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:125
msgctxt "text_id=23702 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki said she was in town in that morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:130:23703: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:130
msgctxt "text_id=23703 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That's likely why her sister was able to enter her room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:135:23704: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:135
msgctxt "text_id=23704 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki lied about being at the mansion at that time."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:170:23705: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:170
msgctxt "text_id=23705 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Not the strongest case, I know, but that's all I have to go on...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:176:23706: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:176
msgctxt "text_id=23706 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I felt that there was more I could pin on him, but I wasn't sure what right now."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:181:23707: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:181
msgctxt "text_id=23707 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I had to find Sizuki before morning. Before..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:197:23708: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:197
msgctxt "text_id=23708 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Someone was behind me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23709 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"So you're the killer,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23710 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " Sizuki!!!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:298:23711: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_1_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:298
msgctxt "text_id=23711 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Whuh?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:318:23712: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:318
msgctxt "text_id=23712 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Eat this!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:323:23713: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:323
msgctxt "text_id=23713 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I took up my trusty wok and swing it as hard as I could, before he could lay a hand on me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:354:23714: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:354
msgctxt "text_id=23714 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It connected, hard."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:359:23715: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:359
msgctxt "text_id=23715 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Harder than it should have..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:365:23716: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:365
msgctxt "text_id=23716 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki... I only saw him briefly, but I knew it was him. He collapsed to the ground,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23717 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " and a strange item tumbled onto the floor."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:392:23718: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:392
msgctxt "text_id=23718 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...It was the kind of cheap fake glasses and nose you'd find in any bag of party favors."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:413:23719: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:413
msgctxt "text_id=23719 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"W-Who would actually laugh at this?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:419:23720: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:419
msgctxt "text_id=23720 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The only ones who would were Miss Kuonji who didn't get out much... and Aozaki, who thought so much of Sizuki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:458:23721: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:458
msgctxt "text_id=23721 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Whatever. I started running."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:463:23722: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:463
msgctxt "text_id=23722 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As long as I've guessed the killer correctly, I've beaten the game."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:468:23723: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:468
msgctxt "text_id=23723 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But maybe Sizuki would recover and come after me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:498:23724: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:498
msgctxt "text_id=23724 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I decided to escape through the foyer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:504:23725: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:504
msgctxt "text_id=23725 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If I could make it to the forest outside, I'd win."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:509:23726: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:509
msgctxt "text_id=23726 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It had to be morning by now...!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:555:23727: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:555
msgctxt "text_id=23727 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Huh...?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:561:23728: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:561
msgctxt "text_id=23728 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was still dark outside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:566:23729: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:566
msgctxt "text_id=23729 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  What?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:571:23730: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:571
msgctxt "text_id=23730 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  How?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:596:23731: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:596
msgctxt "text_id=23731 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  How was it still dark out?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:617:23732: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_V_1_0000; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:617
msgctxt "text_id=23732 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Excellent... work... I must say...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:623:23733: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:623
msgctxt "text_id=23733 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Eh?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:628:23734: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:628
msgctxt "text_id=23734 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A resentful female voice croaked from the foyer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:633:23735: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:633
msgctxt "text_id=23735 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Wait, female?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:659:23736: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:659
msgctxt "text_id=23736 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But who was it?! I thought Sizuki was the killer!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:715:23737: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:715
msgctxt "text_id=23737 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Hah, hah, hah, hah!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:721:23738: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:721
msgctxt "text_id=23738 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Run. Just run. RUN!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:726:23739: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:726
msgctxt "text_id=23739 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was confused, but I could still run."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:754:23740: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:754
msgctxt "text_id=23740 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I tripped and fell. As I stood up, I tried to take a second to think."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:774:23741: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:774
msgctxt "text_id=23741 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was mistaken."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:779:23742: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:779
msgctxt "text_id=23742 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The game was still on."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:784:23743: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:784
msgctxt "text_id=23743 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If that was true, then Sweets Hearts had won."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:815:23744: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:815
msgctxt "text_id=23744 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki was the killer. I was sure of it!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:820:23745: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:820
msgctxt "text_id=23745 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd said it out loud, and I was still alive, wasn't I?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:869:23746: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:869
msgctxt "text_id=23746 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Remember the rules:"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:874:23747: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:874
msgctxt "text_id=23747 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If you accuse someone and you're wrong, you die."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:879:23748: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:879
msgctxt "text_id=23748 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As long as I was still alive, Sizuki had to be the killer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:884:23749: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:884
msgctxt "text_id=23749 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Was I wrong? *Was I missing something?!*"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:922:23750: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:922
msgctxt "text_id=23750 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"My guess about the killer..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:928:23751: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_1_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:928
msgctxt "text_id=23751 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  It must have been a hint! Think! How did things come to this...?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:949:23752: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:949
msgctxt "text_id=23752 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I heard footsteps getting louder."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:954:23753: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:954
msgctxt "text_id=23753 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Morning was almost here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:959:23754: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:959
msgctxt "text_id=23754 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  This is my last and only chance."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_1:966:23755: scene=WIK_V_1
#: WIK_V_1:966
msgctxt "text_id=23755 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_W:8:23756: scene=WIK_SELECT_W
#: WIK_SELECT_W:8
msgctxt "text_id=23756 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision W-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:41:23757: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:41
msgctxt "text_id=23757 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"It's no use. There's not enough evidence..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:41:23758: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:41
msgctxt "text_id=23758 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  If I guess wrong, I'm done for...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:73:23759: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:73
msgctxt "text_id=23759 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I didn't know who the killer was."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:78:23760: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:78
msgctxt "text_id=23760 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But we were the only ones left in the mansion."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:83:23761: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:83
msgctxt "text_id=23761 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If I made a random guess and ended up being eliminated, I was finished."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:88:23762: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:88
msgctxt "text_id=23762 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In that case, maybe I should just make a run for it, and win the game that way...?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:128:23763: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:128
msgctxt "text_id=23763 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"You...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:134:23764: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:134
msgctxt "text_id=23764 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A shadowy figure crept up behind me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:139:23765: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:139
msgctxt "text_id=23765 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It raised its hand as if to say hello."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:188:23766: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:188
msgctxt "text_id=23766 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"I"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23767 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " aM"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23768 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " An"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23769 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " AlieN"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23770 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " FrOM"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23771 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " OuTeR"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23772 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " SpAcE,"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23773 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " EarTH"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23774 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " CREatuRE.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:240:23775: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:240
msgctxt "text_id=23775 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Pfft!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:245:23776: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:245
msgctxt "text_id=23776 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The primitive directness of his greeting caught me off guard."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:316:23777: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:316
msgctxt "text_id=23777 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Sizuki?! You're the killer?!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:324:23778: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0001; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:324
msgctxt "text_id=23778 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"YeS."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23779 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " wE dID iT."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23780 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " We DId It."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23781 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " WE DiD iT.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:338:23782: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:338
msgctxt "text_id=23782 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"You can cut that voice out now.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:386:23783: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:386
msgctxt "text_id=23783 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I struggled to inject calm into my voice, and to keep my arms and legs from shaking."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:391:23784: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:391
msgctxt "text_id=23784 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That voice really was something."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:396:23785: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:396
msgctxt "text_id=23785 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  So much that I was more concerned with making it stop than whodunits or howdunits."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:435:23786: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0002; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:435
msgctxt "text_id=23786 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23787 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " wE"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23788 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " aRe"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23789 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " MarTIAnS.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:447:23790: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:447
msgctxt "text_id=23790 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I don't care."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:454:23791: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:454
msgctxt "text_id=23791 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "Just explain what's going on already."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:460:23792: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:460
msgctxt "text_id=23792 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I already laughed, so I'm going to die. I'd at least like to know what's going on before I do.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:495:23793: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0003; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:495
msgctxt "text_id=23793 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Sorry, but I can't do that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:501:23794: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0004; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:501
msgctxt "text_id=23794 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  I can only discuss my own situation.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:507:23795: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0008; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:507
msgctxt "text_id=23795 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:512:23796: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:512
msgctxt "text_id=23796 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  What was that supposed to mean?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:517:23797: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:517
msgctxt "text_id=23797 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki could only talk about himself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:522:23798: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:522
msgctxt "text_id=23798 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Does that mean... there was someone else...?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:549:23799: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0005; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:549
msgctxt "text_id=23799 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"You've got to understand, Kumari."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:561:23800: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0006; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:561
msgctxt "text_id=23800 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  Can you imagine a whole year of being picked on again and again for having no sense of humor?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:573:23801: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0007; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:573
msgctxt "text_id=23801 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  How it feels for a man to muster up the courage to liven the party mood, only to be shot down?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:579:23802: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0009; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:579
msgctxt "text_id=23802 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I know how it feels to want to punch you right now.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:606:23803: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:606
msgctxt "text_id=23803 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I didn't even want to think about this anymore, but did he seriously do all this to prove he has a sense of humor?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:611:23804: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:611
msgctxt "text_id=23804 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd say he failed the moment he put on that ridiculous disguise, but was that any reason to help a murderer?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:632:23805: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0010; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:632
msgctxt "text_id=23805 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"The only people who'd laugh at something like that are Aozaki and Miss Kuonji."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:638:23806: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0011; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:638
msgctxt "text_id=23806 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  No one else on this planet would.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:651:23807: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0008; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:651
msgctxt "text_id=23807 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"No one but you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:657:23808: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0012; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:657
msgctxt "text_id=23808 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Oh, I'm gonna hit you.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:669:23809: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0009; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:669
msgctxt "text_id=23809 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"I'm sorry. Never mind.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:690:23810: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0013; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:690
msgctxt "text_id=23810 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"So..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:690:23811: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0013; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:690
msgctxt "text_id=23811 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  ...it was Aozaki's photo that made Tsukiji and the others laugh, wasn't it?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:702:23812: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0010; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:702
msgctxt "text_id=23812 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "\"Yeah. That was the ace up my sleeve."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:708:23813: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_V_2_0011; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:708
msgctxt "text_id=23813 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "  And a treat for me, too.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:728:23814: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:728
msgctxt "text_id=23814 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Any of the guys who knew Aozaki would laugh at that picture of her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:733:23815: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:733
msgctxt "text_id=23815 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Particularly Mr. Yamasiro, Tsukiji, and Father Eiri."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:740:23816: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_V_2_0014; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:740
msgctxt "text_id=23816 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"So that means the killer must be...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:805:23817: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:805
msgctxt "text_id=23817 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I tried to speak, but the words didn't come out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:825:23818: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:825
msgctxt "text_id=23818 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd played right into Sweets Hearts's hands."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:830:23819: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:830
msgctxt "text_id=23819 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The killer―Sizuki―was the last person left standing, while I'd failed to guess correctly and just stood here, mind blank."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:850:23820: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:850
msgctxt "text_id=23820 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was just one step away..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:855:23821: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:855
msgctxt "text_id=23821 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd almost figured it all out."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:860:23822: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:860
msgctxt "text_id=23822 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If I'd just focused more in the evening..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_V_2:865:23823: scene=WIK_V_2
#: WIK_V_2:865
msgctxt "text_id=23823 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...and thought it through a bit more..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:29:23824: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:29
msgctxt "text_id=23824 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...There had to be two."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:35:23825: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:35
msgctxt "text_id=23825 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Yeah, two."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:55:23826: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:55
msgctxt "text_id=23826 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was impossible to explain some things if there was only one method."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:60:23827: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:60
msgctxt "text_id=23827 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But what if there were two?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:80:23828: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:80
msgctxt "text_id=23828 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  First, to consider the nature of the murders."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:85:23829: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:85
msgctxt "text_id=23829 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They could be divided up into the times the killer made the victim laugh,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:90:23830: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:90
msgctxt "text_id=23830 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  and times when the victim saw a dead body and laughed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:110:23831: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:110
msgctxt "text_id=23831 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Housuke, Riddell, and Sister Yuika fell under the latter self-destructive category,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:115:23832: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:115
msgctxt "text_id=23832 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  but it might have applied to another victim, too,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:122:23833: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:122
msgctxt "text_id=23833 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...Beo."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:170:23834: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:170
msgctxt "text_id=23834 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo died outside the sunroom after he laughed,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:175:23835: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:175
msgctxt "text_id=23835 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  but there was nothing in the sunroom that could've made him laugh."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:180:23836: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:180
msgctxt "text_id=23836 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was unlikely anything had been set up in the forest,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:185:23837: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:185
msgctxt "text_id=23837 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  not when the weather was so bad."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:206:23838: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:206
msgctxt "text_id=23838 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  So, the trap must have been laid inside,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:211:23839: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:211
msgctxt "text_id=23839 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  but not in the sunroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:216:23840: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:216
msgctxt "text_id=23840 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  What about above the sunroom, on the second floor?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:256:23841: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:256
msgctxt "text_id=23841 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aozaki's bedroom was directly above the sunroom."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:261:23842: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:261
msgctxt "text_id=23842 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Maybe someone had asked Beo to look into Aozaki's room from the outside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:266:23843: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:266
msgctxt "text_id=23843 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And then, Beo had seen something:"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:271:23844: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:271
msgctxt "text_id=23844 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Touko out of her mind, dead drunk."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:317:23845: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:317
msgctxt "text_id=23845 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Beo knew Touko well."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:329:23846: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:329
msgctxt "text_id=23846 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "There was definitely a chance he'd laugh if he saw her like that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:334:23847: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:334
msgctxt "text_id=23847 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was ingenious, as traps went."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:339:23848: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:339
msgctxt "text_id=23848 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Either way, even if he didn't laugh, the person who asked him simply told him to check, so they wouldn't seem suspicious."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:344:23849: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:344
msgctxt "text_id=23849 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It would only make people suspect Aozaki sooner."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:379:23850: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:379
msgctxt "text_id=23850 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...So there are two M.O.s."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:385:23851: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:385
msgctxt "text_id=23851 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  A direct method, and a secondary method that uses the victims."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:391:23852: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:391
msgctxt "text_id=23852 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  Similarly...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:411:23853: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:411
msgctxt "text_id=23853 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There were two killers."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:416:23854: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:416
msgctxt "text_id=23854 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Riddell's suggestions."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:421:23855: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:421
msgctxt "text_id=23855 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Tsukiji's suspicions."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:447:23856: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:447
msgctxt "text_id=23856 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Teams of two. Intimate betrayal―two minds, one body."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:452:23857: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:452
msgctxt "text_id=23857 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sweets Hearts, the prayer Ploy Kickshaw."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:457:23858: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:457
msgctxt "text_id=23858 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In retrospect, it was such a revealing name."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:462:23859: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:462
msgctxt "text_id=23859 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If \"sweet\" referred to its pudding body, then what about \"heart\"?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:483:23860: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:483
msgctxt "text_id=23860 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Humans. The enemy can take on multiple forms!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:500:23861: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:500
msgctxt "text_id=23861 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That meant there were *two* Sweets Hearts."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:505:23862: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:505
msgctxt "text_id=23862 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  In this game, the killer and prime suspect had to be separate people!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:525:23863: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:525
msgctxt "text_id=23863 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The prime suspect used a Ploy,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:530:23864: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:530
msgctxt "text_id=23864 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  while their accomplice carried out the killings."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:539:23865: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:539
msgctxt "text_id=23865 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki merely played the role of the suspect."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:544:23866: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:544
msgctxt "text_id=23866 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I had guessed correctly, but I hadn't seen the full picture."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:549:23867: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:549
msgctxt "text_id=23867 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  That must be why I wasn't out of the woods yet, so to speak."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:608:23868: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:608
msgctxt "text_id=23868 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Wait. Hold on. Wait one stir-fired second!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:614:23869: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_W_35_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:614
msgctxt "text_id=23869 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  The answer is obvious, now! I just need to solve one problem!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_W_35:620:23870: scene=WIK_W_35
#: WIK_W_35:620
msgctxt "text_id=23870 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_X:8:23871: scene=WIK_SELECT_X
#: WIK_SELECT_X:8
msgctxt "text_id=23871 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision X-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:90:23872: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:90
msgctxt "text_id=23872 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"All right.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:95:23873: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:95
msgctxt "text_id=23873 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Fifteen-minute nap done! I checked myself in the mirror."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:100:23874: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:100
msgctxt "text_id=23874 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I took a hairbrush out of my bag, quickly brushed my hair, and left the room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:143:23875: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:143
msgctxt "text_id=23875 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As I locked the door behind me, I heard an unfamiliar voice coming from downstairs."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:148:23876: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:148
msgctxt "text_id=23876 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  A new guest?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:153:23877: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:153
msgctxt "text_id=23877 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I didn't hear a peep until I left the guest room... it must have had great soundproofing."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:229:23878: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_WAKEUP_0000; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:229
msgctxt "text_id=23878 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"It's really coming down out there."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:235:23879: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_WAKEUP_0001; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:235
msgctxt "text_id=23879 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "  I thought it was supposed to be clear skies all through the long weekend, but I guess we couldn't be that lucky.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:247:23880: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_WAKEUP_0000; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:247
msgctxt "text_id=23880 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Perhaps the problem lies with the people here... Then again, I can hardly disagree with you if you say there isn't a problem, Father.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:271:23881: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0000; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:271
msgctxt "text_id=23881 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Shh. You don't have to say everything you think, Yui!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:283:23882: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0001; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:283
msgctxt "text_id=23882 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "Oh, did you leave the laundry outside? Please tell me our sheets aren't getting wet as we speak.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:295:23883: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_WAKEUP_0001; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:295
msgctxt "text_id=23883 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"Don't worry, it's taken care of. I had a feeling something bad would happen today.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:316:23884: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:316
msgctxt "text_id=23884 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:322:23885: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:322
msgctxt "text_id=23885 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The guests were from Aida Church."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:327:23886: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:327
msgctxt "text_id=23886 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji appeared to have overheard them-she came out from the east wing to greet them."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:376:23887: speaker=eiri; speaker_ja=詠梨神父; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B40_WIK_WAKEUP_0002; voice_prefix=B40; voice_category=8; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:376
msgctxt "text_id=23887 | speaker=eiri"
msgid "\"Forgive our tardiness, after you personally invited us. Are you well, Alice?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:387:23888: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_WAKEUP_0000; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:387
msgctxt "text_id=23888 | speaker=alice"
msgid "\"I don't remember inviting you, but you're here now so I suppose that's fine. This way."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:398:23889: speaker=alice; speaker_ja=有珠; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A40_WIK_WAKEUP_0001; voice_prefix=A40; voice_category=2; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:398
msgctxt "text_id=23889 | speaker=alice"
msgid "  I only prepared a seat for Ritsuka, but I'll get some more chairs.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:430:23890: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_WAKEUP_0002; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:430
msgctxt "text_id=23890 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "\"No need to go out of your way. Father Eiri and I will be leaving soon."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:443:23891: speaker=yuika; speaker_ja=唯架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B20_WIK_WAKEUP_0003; voice_prefix=B20; voice_category=10; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:443
msgctxt "text_id=23891 | speaker=yuika"
msgid "Besides, if we need to sit down, we can just sit on Ritsuka.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:468:23892: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0002; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:468
msgctxt "text_id=23892 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Hey!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23893 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " That's mean, Yui! And what makes it worse is you're not even joking!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:478:23894: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0003; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:478
msgctxt "text_id=23894 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  You should be nicer to your big sister!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:522:23895: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:522
msgctxt "text_id=23895 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Let's just call these guys \"Team Church.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:543:23896: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:543
msgctxt "text_id=23896 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji led Father Eiri and Yuika into the drawing room."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:570:23897: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:570
msgctxt "text_id=23897 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Father Eiri looked like he was enjoying himself."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:575:23898: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:575
msgctxt "text_id=23898 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He was always so laid back, with a permanent smile on his face. It was hard to tell how he really felt about being here."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:611:23899: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:611
msgctxt "text_id=23899 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sister Yuika was clearly unhappy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:616:23900: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:616
msgctxt "text_id=23900 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Then again, like Father Eiri, her expression rarely changed, so who knew how she really felt?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:621:23901: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:621
msgctxt "text_id=23901 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And then there was..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:658:23902: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0004; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:658
msgctxt "text_id=23902 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Oh, Kojika! Ciao!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:663:23903: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:663
msgctxt "text_id=23903 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...Ritsuka. I wondered what manner of beast lurked beneath that cheerful veneer."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:668:23904: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:668
msgctxt "text_id=23904 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Probably not even a kitten."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:703:23905: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:703
msgctxt "text_id=23905 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Hi, Ritsuka."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:709:23906: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:709
msgctxt "text_id=23906 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I didn't know you were invited.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:720:23907: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0005; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:720
msgctxt "text_id=23907 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"Yeah! Allie told me I definitely had to come."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:731:23908: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0006; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:731
msgctxt "text_id=23908 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Father Eiri and Yuika both got a letter from Ako..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:742:23909: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0007; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:742
msgctxt "text_id=23909 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "  Wait. Does that mean different people got different invitations?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:753:23910: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:753
msgctxt "text_id=23910 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Seems like it. I was invited by Sizuki.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:773:23911: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:773
msgctxt "text_id=23911 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka was Yuika's sister, and not a real member of the clergy."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:778:23912: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:778
msgctxt "text_id=23912 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She was just a regular citizen of Misaki. I saw her every now and then in the shopping district."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:804:23913: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WAKEUP_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:804
msgctxt "text_id=23913 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Anyway, what's the deal with the weather?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:816:23914: speaker=ritsuka; speaker_ja=律架; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B30_WIK_WAKEUP_0008; voice_prefix=B30; voice_category=9; scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:816
msgctxt "text_id=23914 | speaker=ritsuka"
msgid "\"I know, right? It's started raining, but hopefully it'll clear up soon.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:834:23915: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:834
msgctxt "text_id=23915 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Ritsuka glanced outside, concerned."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WAKEUP:839:23916: scene=WIK_WAKEUP
#: WIK_WAKEUP:839
msgctxt "text_id=23916 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_D:8:23917: scene=WIK_SELECT_D
#: WIK_SELECT_D:8
msgctxt "text_id=23917 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision D-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:74:23918: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:74
msgctxt "text_id=23918 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...This wasn't working. I couldn't think straight!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:80:23919: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:80
msgctxt "text_id=23919 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At this rate, I'd never figure out who the killer was."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:85:23920: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:85
msgctxt "text_id=23920 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If I couldn't use my head, I'd have to rely on my legs and get out of here!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:135:23921: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:135
msgctxt "text_id=23921 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The game would end if I could just keep from getting caught until sunrise."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:140:23922: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:140
msgctxt "text_id=23922 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As long as I survived, Sweets Hearts wouldn't win."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:145:23923: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:145
msgctxt "text_id=23923 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The storm was over. If I could just make it to the city, everything would go back to normal...!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:209:23924: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_WXYZ_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:209
msgctxt "text_id=23924 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...No way.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:215:23925: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:215
msgctxt "text_id=23925 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I've been heading downhill all this time! How am I at the back of the mansion?!"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:235:23926: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:235
msgctxt "text_id=23926 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I'd been heading downhill all this time, so how did I end up behind the mansion?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:240:23927: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:240
msgctxt "text_id=23927 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Aaah..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:245:23928: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:245
msgctxt "text_id=23928 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The ground distorted."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:250:23929: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:250
msgctxt "text_id=23929 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  My senses went haywire."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:256:23930: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:256
msgctxt "text_id=23930 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I must've done something wrong."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:301:23931: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:301
msgctxt "text_id=23931 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Suddenly, a voice whispers in my ear."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:312:23932: speaker=soujuurou; speaker_ja=草十郎; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=A30_WIK_WXYZ_0000; voice_prefix=A30; voice_category=3; scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:312
msgctxt "text_id=23932 | speaker=soujuurou"
msgid "          \"Con-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23933 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "gra-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23934 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "tu-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23935 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "lations"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23936 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " on"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23937 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " kill-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23938 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ing"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23939 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " ev-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23940 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "ery-"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=23941 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "one.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:344:23942: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:344
msgctxt "text_id=23942 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was a voice of terror that I'd never heard before,"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_WXYZ:349:23943: scene=WIK_WXYZ
#: WIK_WXYZ:349
msgctxt "text_id=23943 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  yet it sounded so familiar..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_X_2:40:23944: scene=WIK_X_2
#: WIK_X_2:40
msgctxt "text_id=23944 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Only one of them could have caused this all to happen."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_X_2:45:23945: scene=WIK_X_2
#: WIK_X_2:45
msgctxt "text_id=23945 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I considered who could have activated the Ploys."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_X_2:299:23946: scene=WIK_X_2
#: WIK_X_2:299
msgctxt "text_id=23946 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Right."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_X_2:304:23947: scene=WIK_X_2
#: WIK_X_2:304
msgctxt "text_id=23947 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Our prime suspect was..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_Y:8:23948: scene=WIK_SELECT_Y
#: WIK_SELECT_Y:8
msgctxt "text_id=23948 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision Y-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_Z:7:23949: scene=WIK_SELECT_Z
#: WIK_SELECT_Z:7
msgctxt "text_id=23949 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Was there a simpler explanation?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_SELECT_Z:7:23950: scene=WIK_SELECT_Z
#: WIK_SELECT_Z:7
msgctxt "text_id=23950 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "-Decision Z-"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:98:23951: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0000; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:98
msgctxt "text_id=23951 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"...It's me.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:104:23952: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:104
msgctxt "text_id=23952 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It could only be."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:109:23953: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:109
msgctxt "text_id=23953 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The fact that everything had gone just the way I'd thought was proof above all that I was Sweets Hearts."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:150:23954: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:150
msgctxt "text_id=23954 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  And as Sweets Hearts, I couldn't remember anything that worked against me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:155:23955: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:155
msgctxt "text_id=23955 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I had to look at this objectively."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:160:23956: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:160
msgctxt "text_id=23956 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Who activated the Ploy Kickshaw on the day of the party?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:180:23957: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:180
msgctxt "text_id=23957 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The answer was, \"no one.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:194:23958: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:194
msgctxt "text_id=23958 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Miss Kuonji personally locked the room were she stored her Ploys."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:199:23959: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:199
msgctxt "text_id=23959 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  No one could possibly break inside."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:204:23960: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:204
msgctxt "text_id=23960 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  As long as there weren't any special tricks, we could eliminate that possibility entirely."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:209:23961: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:209
msgctxt "text_id=23961 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It was only logical―"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:229:23962: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:229
msgctxt "text_id=23962 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Therefore, if someone took the Ploy, they had to have done it *before* today."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:234:23963: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:234
msgctxt "text_id=23963 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  They would have broken in before she locked the vault."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:239:23964: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:239
msgctxt "text_id=23964 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Only someone who had accidentally come on the first day of the long weekend"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:244:23965: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:244
msgctxt "text_id=23965 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  would have had the opportunity."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:277:23966: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:277
msgctxt "text_id=23966 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  So, why did they come on the first day by mistake?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:282:23967: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:282
msgctxt "text_id=23967 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Simple: the invitation itself was wrong."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:312:23968: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:312
msgctxt "text_id=23968 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "\"A birthday party will be held at the start of the long weekend.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:317:23969: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:317
msgctxt "text_id=23969 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The blockhead who wrote that on the invitations"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:322:23970: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:322
msgctxt "text_id=23970 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  sent them out to three people total."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:372:23971: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:372
msgctxt "text_id=23971 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Of those people, Touko Aozaki probably had it all figured out. But, she laughed at something she wasn't expecting, so that took care of her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:405:23972: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:405
msgctxt "text_id=23972 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Then there was Mr. Yamasiro."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:410:23973: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:410
msgctxt "text_id=23973 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  He'd said..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:415:23974: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:415
msgctxt "text_id=23974 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  ...that he'd gotten his invitation that morning."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:420:23975: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:420
msgctxt "text_id=23975 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Everyone else had received theirs before that."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:425:23976: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:425
msgctxt "text_id=23976 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  It's highly likely it was delivered directly to his mailbox instead of being mailed."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:445:23977: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:445
msgctxt "text_id=23977 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  If Sizuki was working with the prime suspect, then they likely edited the invitation."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:450:23978: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:450
msgctxt "text_id=23978 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Sizuki became an accomplice on the first day, and then invited Mr. Yamasiro on the morning of the second day. This was to hide the fact that the prime suspect was \"accidentally\" invited on the first day."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:455:23979: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:455
msgctxt "text_id=23979 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Mr. Yamasiro wasn't just invited to be killed, but to act as an alibi for the culprit."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:488:23980: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:488
msgctxt "text_id=23980 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Then, there was me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:493:23981: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:493
msgctxt "text_id=23981 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I was sure the party would be on the first day of the long weekend."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:499:23982: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:499
msgctxt "text_id=23982 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Based on all this information, the only people who could have activated the Ploy were me and Sizuki."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:538:23983: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:538
msgctxt "text_id=23983 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I could only imagine the kind of hospitality he must have offered Kojika Kumari for suddenly showing up on the wrong day."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:552:23984: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:552
msgctxt "text_id=23984 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  But, it wasn't unreasonable that he'd put out tea and snacks for a fellow schoolmate."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:557:23985: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:557
msgctxt "text_id=23985 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  The problem is, where did Sizuki obtain those snacks from?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:597:23986: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0000; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:597
msgctxt "text_id=23986 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Ah, well. You figured it out, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:603:23987: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0001; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:603
msgctxt "text_id=23987 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I was so close to winning, too. This girl's smarter than I thought.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:613:23988: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:613
msgctxt "text_id=23988 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  Just then..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:618:23989: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:618
msgctxt "text_id=23989 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  From the mansion, another me appeared from the mansion-the one who had been Sizuki chasing me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:755:23990: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0001; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:755
msgctxt "text_id=23990 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Are you Sweets Hearts?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:760:23991: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:760
msgctxt "text_id=23991 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  I got up off my knees to face my other self."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:771:23992: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:771
msgctxt "text_id=23992 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  She nodded yes, admitting defeat."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:798:23993: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0002; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:798
msgctxt "text_id=23993 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"You're Sweets Hearts, too, though."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:810:23994: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0003; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:810
msgctxt "text_id=23994 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I was disguised as him; You were disguised as her."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:822:23995: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0004; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:822
msgctxt "text_id=23995 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  But you're exactly the same as Kojika Kumari, so I'm the only one with any memory of being Sweets Hearts.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:850:23996: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0002; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:850
msgctxt "text_id=23996 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Is that so? Well, it's time for us to go. Game over. The sun's almost up.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:894:23997: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0005; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:894
msgctxt "text_id=23997 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Are you sure you want the game to end?"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:906:23998: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0006; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:906
msgctxt "text_id=23998 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  You're about to win. Don't you want your prize?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:939:23999: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0003; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:939
msgctxt "text_id=23999 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"My what? I didn't know there was a prize involved.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:986:24000: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0007; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:986
msgctxt "text_id=24000 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"I'm talking about what Kojika Kumari wished for and was worried about when she ate me."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1008:24001: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0008; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1008
msgctxt "text_id=24001 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  You don't want it to end. You wish this half-baked, uncertain life could go on forever, don't you?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1057:24002: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0009; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1057
msgctxt "text_id=24002 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"'Why is high school only three years?'"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1075:24003: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0010; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1075
msgctxt "text_id=24003 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  'Why did I waste so much time?'"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1093:24004: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0011; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1093
msgctxt "text_id=24004 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  'Why wasn't I honest about my feelings?'"
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1153:24005: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0012; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1153
msgctxt "text_id=24005 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  All those things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24006 | speaker=unknown"
msgid " I can make all your woes go away. I'm Sweets Hearts, the Ploy Kickshaw of prayer for girls in the prime of their youth only.  Whaddya say?\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1240:24007: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0004; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1240
msgctxt "text_id=24007 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Thanks, but no thanks. I don't care what you can do, and I don't care what happened."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1261:24008: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0005; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1261
msgctxt "text_id=24008 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  I'm done talking to you. Time's up."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1267:24009: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0006; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1267
msgctxt "text_id=24009 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "  You're finished.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1362:24010: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0013; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1362
msgctxt "text_id=24010 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"W-wait! But I can only be used by someone who has unrequited―\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1367:24011: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1367
msgctxt "text_id=24011 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  At the end of the day..."
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1438:24012: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B10_WIK_Z_3_0007; voice_prefix=B10; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1438
msgctxt "text_id=24012 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"Get lost. Sizuki is the killer! I'm the user, Kojika Kumari.\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1534:24013: speaker=kojika; speaker_ja=金鹿; speaker_source=voice_category_map; speaker_confidence=probable; voice_id=B11_WIK_Z_3_0014; voice_prefix=B11; voice_category=5; scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1534
msgctxt "text_id=24013 | speaker=kojika"
msgid "\"What? Seriously?! But that's so unmaidenly!\""
msgstr ""

#. Occurrence WIK_Z_3:1566:24014: scene=WIK_Z_3
#: WIK_Z_3:1566
msgctxt "text_id=24014 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "  There wasn't anything left to wish for, now that Tsukiji was dead."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24015 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Might be an ill omen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24016 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Maybe it's always unlocked."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24017 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I could enter by myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24018 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I should head to the drawing room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24019 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I'll check out the guest room first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24020 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I'll do something random."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24021 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Something's wrong. I should go back to the mansion."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24022 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Curious. I should check it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24023 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "The rain's going to get worse."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24024 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "The rain might turn to hail."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24025 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I should just go home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24026 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "The numbers add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24027 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "The numbers are off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24028 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "...I haven't seen Sizuki, come to think of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24029 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Something horrible's about to happen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24030 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Something crazy's about to go down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24031 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I'm glad I was paired with Tsukiji."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24032 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "It was some kind of bread."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24033 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Realistically, a small explosive."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24034 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "A dog or something chewed him up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24035 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I think we should focus on Tokitsu's death."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24036 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "It's easy enough to not laugh for one night."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24037 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "...I should point out we're one person down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24038 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Tsukiji's story doesn't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24039 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Aozaki's story doesn't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24040 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Beo's annoying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24041 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Tsukiji and Aozaki's stories don't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24042 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Tsukiji and Beo's stories don't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24043 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Aozaki and Beo's stories don't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24044 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Sizuki's story doesn't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24045 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Miss Kuonji's story doesn't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24046 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I don't think what I said adds up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24047 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Sizuki and Miss Kuonji's stories don't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24048 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I don't think what Sizuki and I said adds up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24049 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I don't think what Miss Kuonji and I said adds up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24050 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Father Eiri's story doesn't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24051 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Sister Yuika's story doesn't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24052 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Ritsuka's story doesn't add up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24053 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "We should each stay in our rooms until morning."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24054 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "We should check Riddell's alibi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24055 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I'll go peek into the hallway."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24056 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I think I'll just leave it alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24057 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "I agree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "text_id=24058 | speaker=unknown"
msgid "Sounds dangerous."
